#: data\json\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Sharkboy"
msgstr "상어소년"

#: data\json\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Sharkboy"
msgstr "상어소년"

#. ~ Profession (male Sharkboy) description
#: data\json\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were always infatuated with bodies of water, ocean or lake. You spent "
"your days swimming, diving, and exploring the depths. Now, you find yourself"
" transformed into a creature of the deep. Is this what you desired?"
msgstr ""
"바다든 호수든 물에 항상 매료돼 있었습니다. 수영하고 잠수하며 깊은 곳을 탐사하는 나날을 보냈습니다. 이제 당신은 심해의 생물로 "
"변했습니다. 이것이 당신이 바란 것입니까?"

