#: data\json\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Davy Jones"
msgstr "데이비 존스"

#: data\json\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Davy Jones"
msgstr "데이비 존스"

#. ~ Profession (male Davy Jones) description
#: data\json\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were robbed, shot in the head and thrown into the sea just before the "
"Cataclysm. Now you have risen undead from the depths, with a thirst for "
"vengeance against those who wronged you, and a desire to reclaim your lost "
"treasures."
msgstr ""
"대재앙 직전에 강도를 당하고 머리에 총을 맞은 채 바다에 던져졌습니다. 이제 당신은 깊은 곳에서 언데드로 일어났습니다 — 자신을 해친 "
"자들에 대한 복수심과 잃어버린 보물을 되찾으려는 욕망을 품고."

#. ~ Profession (female Davy Jones) description
#: data\json\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
