#: data\json\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Lumberjack"
msgstr "벌목꾼"

#: data\json\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Lumberjack"
msgstr "벌목꾼"

#. ~ Profession (male Lumberjack) description
#: data\json\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a lumberjack, and you're okay.  You felled trees before the world "
"ended, but suspect the undead aren't nearly as tough."
msgstr ""
"당신은 벌목꾼이었고, 현재 무사합니다. 세상이 끝장나기 전에는 나무나 베어 넘겼습니다만, 그 덕분인지 죽지 않는 놈들이 별로 튼튼하지 "
"않다고 여겨집니다."

#. ~ Profession (female Lumberjack) description
#: data\json\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
