#: data\json\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "RV Camper"
msgstr "RV 캠핑족"

#: data\json\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "RV Camper"
msgstr "RV 캠핑족"

#. ~ Profession (male RV Camper) description
#: data\json\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You always enjoyed life on the road, driving across the country to see the "
"wonders of nature.  Now nature seems a lot more hostile, and it's a lot "
"harder to get your RV hooked up to shore power."
msgstr ""
"전국을 누비며 자연의 경이를 보는 길 위의 삶이 항상 즐거웠습니다. 이제 자연은 훨씬 적대적이고, RV를 외부 전원에 연결하기도 훨씬 "
"어려워졌습니다."

#. ~ Profession (female RV Camper) description
#: data\json\professions.json
