msgid "Van Camper"
msgstr "밴 캠핑족"

#: data\json\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Van Camper"
msgstr "밴 캠핑족"

#. ~ Profession (male Van Camper) description
#: data\json\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You decided to hit the road and never look back, living in the back of a "
"van.  Now instead of worrying about someone knocking on your window at "
"night, you have to worry about zombies mistaking your ride for canned food."
msgstr ""
"밴 뒤에서 살며 길을 나서고 뒤돌아보지 않기로 했습니다. 이제 밤에 누가 창문을 두드릴까 걱정하는 대신, 좀비가 당신의 차를 통조림으로 "
"착각할까 걱정해야 합니다."

