#. ~ Profession (male Golfer) description
#: data\json\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You decided to get away from the family for the day to do a little golfing "
"by yourself.  You were almost done playing the back nine when you called to "
"check on them and realized you couldn't get a signal."
msgstr "하루 가족을 떠나 혼자 골프를 치기로 했습니다. 백 나인을 거의 다 쳤을 때 연락하려고 전화했더니 신호가 잡히지 않았습니다."

#. ~ Profession (female Golfer) description
#: data\json\professions.json
