"괴물들의 낯선 땅…"

#: data\json\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Tank Driver"
msgstr "탱크 운전수"

#: data\json\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Tank Driver"
msgstr "탱크 운전수"

#. ~ Profession (male Tank Driver) description
#: data\json\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were in charge of driving the tank, but without a commander it's a lot "
"harder to get a clear picture of what's around you."
msgstr "탱크 운전을 담당했지만, 탱크장이 없으니 주변 상황을 명확히 파악하기가 훨씬 어렵습니다."

#. ~ Profession (female Tank Driver) description
#: data\json\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were in charge of driving the tank, but without a commander it's a lot "
"harder to get a clear picture of what's around you."
msgstr "탱크 운전을 담당했지만, 탱크장이 없으니 주변 상황을 명확히 파악하기가 훨씬 어렵습니다."

#: data\json\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Tank Gunner"
msgstr "탱크 포수"

#: data\json\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Tank Gunner"
msgstr "탱크 포수"

#. ~ Profession (male Tank Gunner) description
#: data\json\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were responsible for aiming and firing the main gun, but now you have no"
" one left to spot targets for you."
msgstr "주포의 조준과 발사를 담당했지만, 이제 표적을 알려줄 사람이 남아있지 않습니다."

