msgstr "쇼핑몰 닌자"

#. ~ Profession (male Mall Ninja) description
#: data\json\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You knew the apocalypse was coming, and you bought all the high end weapons,"
" armor, and gear the online forums said you would need to survive.  However,"
" you never actually learned how to use any of it, and now that the Cataclysm"
" is actually here, you're gonna have to figure it out quickly."
msgstr ""
"종말이 온다는 걸 알고, 온라인 포럼에서 생존에 필요하다던 고급 무기와 방어구, 장비를 전부 샀습니다. 하지만 쓰는 법을 실제로 배운 "
"적은 없고, 대재앙이 진짜 온 지금 빨리 알아내야 합니다."

