msgstr "푸드플레이스 휴게실"

#. ~ Name for scenario 'The Last Delivery' for a male character
#: data\json\scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "The Last Delivery"
msgstr "마지막 배달"

#. ~ Name for scenario 'The Last Delivery' for a female character
#: data\json\scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "The Last Delivery"
msgstr "마지막 배달"

#. ~ Description for scenario 'The Last Delivery' for a male character.
#: data\json\scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"While the world was falling apart someone called to order some of "
"Foodplace's delicious food™ and they sent you to do the delivery.  You're "
"not sure about much, but one thing is certain: that delicious food™ is going"
" to get delivered even if that's the last thing you do!"
msgstr ""
"세상이 무너지는 와중에 누군가 전화해서 푸드플레이스의 맛있는 음식™을 주문했고, 배달은 당신에게 떨어졌습니다. 확실한 건 많지 않지만 "
"하나는 확실합니다: 그 맛있는 음식™은 그게 당신이 하는 마지막 일이더라도 배달될 것입니다!"

