#: data\json\scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were participating in a mining operation when you found… something.  "
"You're not sure what, but it sure is dark down here."
msgstr "광산 작업에 참여하던 중… 무언가를 발견했습니다. 뭔지는 모르겠지만, 여기 밑은 확실히 어둡습니다."

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Bottom of a Mine' for a female character.
