msgid "Challenge - Emergency Shutdown"
msgstr "도전 - 비상 정지"

#. ~ Name for scenario 'Challenge - Emergency Shutdown' for a female character
#: data\json\scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "Challenge - Emergency Shutdown"
msgstr "도전 - 비상 정지"

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Challenge - Emergency Shutdown' for a male
#. character.
#: data\json\scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When the Cataclysm happened, you were working in a nuclear power plant.  Now"
" you're trapped inside, surrounded by the shambling bodies of what used to "
"be your coworkers.  The reactor's shut down, but you don't know if there's "
"been a radiation leak and you need to get away from here fast before you "
"find out the hard way."
msgstr ""
"대재앙이 일어났을 때 원자력 발전소에서 일하고 있었습니다. 이제 안에 갇혀 옛 동료였던 것들의 비틀거리는 몸에 둘러싸였습니다. 원자로는 "
"정지됐지만 방사능 누출이 있었는 지는 모릅니다 — 직접 겪어 확인하기 전에 빨리 여기서 벗어나야 합니다."

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Challenge - Emergency Shutdown' for a female
#. character.
#: data\json\scenarios.json
