msgid "A vehicle forge rig connected to a electrical grid."
msgstr "전력망에 연결된 차량용 단조 장비입니다."

#: data\json\furniture_and_terrain\furniture-appliances.json
#: data\json\items\fake.json
msgid "grid kiln"
msgid_plural "grid kilns"
msgstr[0] "전력망 가마"

#. ~ Description for grid kiln
#: data\json\furniture_and_terrain\furniture-appliances.json
msgid "A portable electric kiln connected to a electrical grid."
msgstr "전력망에 연결된 휴대용 전기 가마입니다."

#: data\json\furniture_and_terrain\furniture-appliances.json
#: data\json\items\fake.json
msgid "grid food dehydrator"
msgid_plural "grid food dehydrators"
msgstr[0] "전력망 식품 건조기"

#. ~ Description for grid food dehydrator
#: data\json\furniture_and_terrain\furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A portable food dehydrator connected to a electrical grid, that could be "
"useful for preserving food."
msgstr "전력망에 연결된 휴대용 식품 건조기로, 음식을 보존하는 데 유용할 수 있습니다."

#: data\json\furniture_and_terrain\furniture-appliances.json
#: data\json\items\fake.json
msgid "grid food processor"
msgid_plural "grid food processors"
msgstr[0] "전력망 식품 가공기"

#. ~ Description for grid food processor
#: data\json\furniture_and_terrain\furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A food processor connected to a electrical grid.  Capable of slicing, "
"chopping, shredding, grinding, pureeing and mixing."
msgstr "전력망에 연결된 식품 가공기입니다. 썰기, 다지기, 채썰기, 갈기, 으깨기, 섞기가 가능합니다."

#: data\json\furniture_and_terrain\furniture-appliances.json
#: data\json\items\fake.json
msgid "grid coffeemaker"
msgid_plural "grid coffeemakers"
msgstr[0] "전력망 커피메이커"

#. ~ Description for grid coffeemaker
#: data\json\furniture_and_terrain\furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A coffeemaker connected to an electrical grid, providing hot water for "
"coffee and other drinks."
msgstr "전력망에 연결된 커피메이커로, 커피와 다른 음료용 뜨거운 물을 제공합니다."

#: data\json\furniture_and_terrain\furniture-appliances.json
#: data\json\items\tool\cooking.json
msgid "soda machine"
msgid_plural "soda machines"
msgstr[0] "탄산음료 제조기"

#. ~ Description for soda machine
#: data\json\furniture_and_terrain\furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A soda machine connected to a electrical grid.  Capable of creating "
"carbonated drinks."
msgstr "전력망에 연결된 탄산음료 제조기입니다. 탄산음료를 만들 수 있습니다."

#: data\json\furniture_and_terrain\furniture-appliances.json
#: data\json\items\fake.json
msgid "grid vacuum sealer"
msgid_plural "grid vacuum sealers"
msgstr[0] "전력망 진공 포장기"

#. ~ Description for grid vacuum sealer
#: data\json\furniture_and_terrain\furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A portable heat sealer unit, connected to a electrical grid.  It could be "
"used for vacuum-packing food to preserve it."
msgstr "전력망에 연결된 휴대용 열 밀봉 장치입니다. 음식을 진공 포장해 보존하는 데 쓸 수 있습니다."

#: data\json\furniture_and_terrain\furniture-appliances.json
#: data\json\items\fake.json
msgid "grid makeshift vacuum sealer"
msgid_plural "grid makeshift vacuum sealers"
msgstr[0] "전력망 사제 진공 포장기"

#. ~ Description for grid makeshift vacuum sealer
#: data\json\furniture_and_terrain\furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A portable homemade heat sealer unit, connected to a electrical grid.  It "
"could be used for vacuum-packing food to preserve it."
msgstr "전력망에 연결된 휴대용 수제 열 밀봉 장치입니다. 음식을 진공 포장해 보존하는 데 쓸 수 있습니다."

#: data\json\furniture_and_terrain\furniture-appliances.json
msgid "grid FOODCO kitchen buddy"
msgstr "전력망 FOODCO 키친 버디"

#. ~ Description for grid FOODCO kitchen buddy
#: data\json\furniture_and_terrain\furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A multi-function crafting station, with a water purifier, food processor, "
"food dehydrator, vacuum sealer, and hand press for making ammo.  Draws power"
" from the electrical grid.  If you attempt to craft an item that needs one "
"of the kitchen buddy's functions, it will automatically be selected as a "
"tool."
msgstr ""
"정수기, 식품 가공기, 식품 건조기, 진공 포장기, 탄약 제작용 수동 프레스를 갖춘 다기능 제작대입니다. 전력망에서 전력을 끌어씁니다. "
"키친 버디의 기능 중 하나가 필요한 아이템을 제작하려고 하면 자동으로 도구로 선택됩니다."

#: data\json\furniture_and_terrain\furniture-appliances.json
