#: data\json\items\armor\power_armor.json
msgid "salvaged power armor exoskeleton"
msgid_plural "salvaged power armor exoskeletons"
msgstr[0] "인양한 강화복 외골격"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'salvaged power armor exoskeleton'}
#: data\json\items\armor\power_armor.json
msgid ""
"This used to be a powered exoskeleton with an integrated chemical resistant "
"bodyglove, its chassis, machinery, and bodyglove stripped down.  More "
"cumbersome and without the bells and whistles of a proper powered "
"exoskeleton, but less encumbering than an unpowered exoskeleton.  Stripping "
"out most of the chemical bodyglove allows wearing it over other equipment, "
"at the expense of environmental protection."
msgstr ""
"일체형 화학물질 저항성 보디글러브가 달린 동력 외골격이었으나, 프레임과 기계장치, 보디글러브가 벗겨졌습니다. 제대로 된 동력 외골격의 "
"부가기능은 없고 더 투박하지만, 무동력 외골격보다는 덜 거추장스럽습니다. 화학 보디글러브의 대부분을 벗겨내 다른 장비 위에 입을 수 "
"있지만, 환경 보호가 약해집니다."

#: data\json\items\armor\power_armor.json
msgid "salvaged power armor plating"
msgid_plural "salvaged power armor platings"
msgstr[0] "인양한 강화복 판금"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'salvaged power armor plating'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'heavy power armor plating', 'str_pl': 'sets
#. of heavy power armor plating'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'power armor plating', 'str_pl': 'sets of
