msgid "The %s feels lighter."
msgstr "%s이(가) 가벼워진 느낌이 든다."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'salvaged power armor plating'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'salvaged power armor plating (active)',
#. 'str_pl': 'sets of salvaged power armor plating (active)'}
#: data\json\items\armor\power_armor.json
msgid ""
"This used to be a set of heavy power armor plates, now stripped down, but "
"still having standard power armor attachment points.  Removing much of the "
"cumbersome plating results in a less encumbering set of plates that come at "
"the expense of ballistic resistance."
msgstr ""
"중량 강화복 판금 세트였으나 벗겨진 상태로, 여전히 표준 강화복 부착점이 있습니다. 거추장스러운 판금의 상당 부분을 제거해 덜 "
"거추장스러운 판금 세트가 되었지만 탄도 저항이 줄었습니다."

#: data\json\items\armor\power_armor.json
msgid "salvaged power armor plating (active)"
msgid_plural "sets of salvaged power armor plating (active)"
msgstr[0] "인양한 강화복 판금 (활성)"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'salvaged power armor plating (active)',
#. 'str_pl': 'sets of salvaged power armor plating (active)'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'heavy power armor plating (active)',
#. 'str_pl': 'sets of heavy power armor plating (active)'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'power armor plating (active)', 'str_pl':
