msgid "The %s feels heavier."
msgstr "%s이(가) 무거워진 느낌이 든다."

#: data\json\items\armor\power_armor.json
msgid "salvaged power armor suit"
msgid_plural "salvaged power armor suits"
msgstr[0] "인양한 강화복"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'salvaged power armor suit'}
#: data\json\items\armor\power_armor.json
msgid ""
"This used to be a powered exoskeleton with a set of heavy armor plates, its "
"chassis and bodyglove stripped down.  More cumbersome and without the bells "
"and whistles of a proper powered suit, but less encumbering than an "
"unpowered suit.  Stripping out most of the chemical bodyglove allows wearing"
" it over other equipment, at the expense of environmental protection, and "
"the stripped down plates are lighter at the expense of worse ballistic "
"resistance."
msgstr ""
"중량 갑옷 판금 세트가 달린 동력 외골격이었으나, 프레임과 보디글러브가 벗겨졌습니다. 제대로 된 강화복의 부가기능은 없고 더 투박하지만,"
" 무동력 슈트보다는 덜 거추장스럽습니다. 화학 보디글러브의 대부분을 벗겨내 다른 장비 위에 입을 수 있지만 환경 보호가 약해지고, 벗겨낸"
" 판금은 가벼워졌지만 탄도 저항이 나빠졌습니다."

#: data\json\items\armor\power_armor.json
#: data\mods\ProjectSquirrel\items\item_common\sq_armor_override.json
msgid "salvaged power armor helmet"
msgid_plural "salvaged power armor helmets"
msgstr[0] "재활용 강화복 헬멧"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'salvaged power armor helmet'}
#: data\json\items\armor\power_armor.json
msgid ""
"This used to be a military-grade full-head helmet, its advanced optics and "
"environmental filters having been stripped for parts.  While still quite "
"durable, it's harder to see out of than an active power helmet."
msgstr ""
"군용급 전면 헬멧이었으나, 첨단 광학장비와 환경 필터가 부품용으로 뜯겼습니다. 여전히 상당히 튼튼하지만, 활성 동력 헬멧보다 시야가 "
"나쁩니다."

