#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'chewy candy'}
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "A handful of colorful fruit-flavored chewy candy."
msgstr "다양한 색깔의 과일맛 씹어먹는 사탕."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "'special' chewy candy"
msgid_plural "'special' chewy candys"
msgstr[0] "'특별한' 쫀득이 사탕"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str': "'special' chewy candy"}.
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "You start scarfing down the candy.  They taste a little funny though…"
msgstr "사탕을 와구와구 먹기 시작한다. 하지만 맛이 조금 이상하다…"

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "powder candy sticks"
msgid_plural "powder candy sticks"
msgstr[0] "분말 사탕"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'powder candy sticks'}
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Thin paper tubes of sweet & sour candy powder.  Who thinks of this stuff?"
msgstr "새콤달콤한 사탕 가루가 들어있는 얇은 종이 튜브. 대체 누가 이걸 발명했을까?"

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "maple syrup candy"
msgid_plural "maple syrup candies"
msgstr[0] "메이플 시럽 사탕"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'maple syrup candy', 'str_pl': 'maple syrup
#. candies'}
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid ""
"This golden, translucent leaf candy is made with pure maple syrup and melt "
"slowly as you savor the taste of real maple."
msgstr ""
"이 황금빛 반투명한 사탕은 순수한 메이플 시럽으로 만들어졌습니다. 천천히 녹여 먹으며 진짜 메이플 시럽의 맛을 느낄 수 있습니다."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
#: data\mods\My_Sweet_Cataclysm\creatures\baked.json
#: data\mods\My_Sweet_Cataclysm\items\vanilla_extentions.json
msgid "graham cracker"
msgid_plural "graham crackers"
msgstr[0] "그레이엄 크래커"

#. ~ Description for graham cracker
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Dry and sugary, these crackers will leave you thirsty, but go good with some"
" chocolate and marshmallows."
msgstr "건조하고 달콤한 이 크래커는 갈증을 유발하지만, 초콜릿과 마시멜로를 넣으면 더욱 맛있어집니다."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
#: data\mods\My_Sweet_Cataclysm\creatures\baked.json
#: data\mods\My_Sweet_Cataclysm\creatures\sweet_species.json
#: data\mods\My_Sweet_Cataclysm\items\vanilla_extentions.json
msgid "cookie"
msgid_plural "cookies"
msgstr[0] "쿠키"

#. ~ Description for cookie
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "Sweet and delicious cookies, just like grandma used to bake."
msgstr "달콤한 쿠키. 할머니가 구워주시던 바로 그 맛입니다."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "maple syrup"
msgid_plural "maple syrup"
msgstr[0] "메이플 시럽"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'maple syrup'}
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Boiling the sap of a maple tree has concentrated it into sweet, delicious "
"maple syrup."
msgstr "단풍나무 수액을 끓이고 농축해서 만든 달콤한 메이플 시럽."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "sugar beet syrup"
msgid_plural "sugar beet syrup"
msgstr[0] "사탕무 시럽"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'sugar beet syrup'}
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A thick syrup produced from shredded sugar beets.  Useful in cooking as a "
"sweetener."
msgstr "사탕무로 만든 시럽. 요리를 달콤하게 한다."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "cake"
msgid_plural "cakes"
msgstr[0] "케이크"

#. ~ Description for cake
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Delicious sponge cake with buttercream icing, it says happy birthday on it."
msgstr "맛있어보이는 스펀지 케이크에 버터크림이 뿌려져 있습니다. 위에 '생일 축하해!'라는 글이 쓰여져 있습니다."

#. ~ Description for cake
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "Delicious chocolate cake.  It has all the icing.  All of it."
msgstr "맛있는 초콜릿 케이크입니다. 케이크 전체가 아이싱으로 장식되어 있습니다."

#. ~ Description for cake
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A cake coated in the thickest icing you've ever seen.  Someone has written "
"guff in quotation marks on it…"
msgstr "당신이 본 것 중 가장 두꺼운 아이싱으로 덮인 케이크입니다. 누군가 따옴표로 헛소리를 써놓았습니다…"

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "chocolate-covered coffee bean"
msgid_plural "chocolate-covered coffee beans"
msgstr[0] "초콜릿 커피콩"

#. ~ Description for chocolate-covered coffee bean
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Roasted coffee beans coated with dark chocolate, natural source of "
"concentrated caffeine."
msgstr "초콜릿으로 코팅한 볶은 커피콩. 카페인이 풍부합니다."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "fast-food French fries"
msgid_plural "fast-food French fries"
msgstr[0] "패스트푸드점 감자튀김"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'fast-food French fries'}
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "Fast-food fried potatoes.  Somehow, they're still edible."
msgstr "패스트 푸드인 감자 튀김입니다. 어쨌건, 아직 먹을 수 있습니다."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "French fries"
msgid_plural "French fries"
msgstr[0] "감자튀김"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'French fries'}
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "Deep-fried potatoes with a touch of salt.  Crunchy and delicious."
msgstr "소금을 살짝 뿌린 감자튀김입니다. 바삭하고 맛있습니다."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "peppermint patty"
msgid_plural "peppermint patties"
msgstr[0] "박하 초콜릿"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'peppermint patty', 'str_pl': 'peppermint
#. patties'}
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "A handful of soft chocolate-covered peppermint patties… yum!"
msgstr "초콜릿으로 덮인 부드러운 페퍼민트 패티 한 줌… 냠!"

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "Necco wafers"
msgid_plural "Necco wafers"
msgstr[0] "네코 웨이퍼"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Necco wafers'}
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A handful of candy wafers, in assorted flavors: orange, lemon, lime, clove, "
"chocolate, wintergreen, cinnamon, and licorice.  Yum!"
msgstr ""
"사탕 크기의 캔디웨이퍼 한 줌. 오렌지, 레몬, 라임, 정향, 초콜릿, 노루발풀, 계피, 감초 맛으로 이루어져 있다. 맛있네!\r\n"
"(역주: 네코웨이퍼는 사탕과 초콜릿을 만드는 외국 기업 이름.)"

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "candy cigarette"
msgid_plural "candy cigarettes"
msgstr[0] "사탕 담배"

#. ~ Description for candy cigarette
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Candy sticks.  Slightly more healthy than tobacco cigarettes, but with no "
"possibility of addiction."
msgstr "담배 모양의 막대 사탕. 담배보다는 건강에 좋고, 중독성이 없다."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "caramel"
msgid_plural "caramel"
msgstr[0] "캐러멜"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'caramel'}
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "Some caramel.  Still bad for your health."
msgstr "소량의 캐러멜. 건강에 좋지 않다."

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'potato chips'}
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "Betcha can't eat just one."
msgstr "절대로 하나만 먹고는 못 배길 겁니다."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "sugary cereal"
msgid_plural "sugary cereals"
msgstr[0] "가당 시리얼"

#. ~ Description for sugary cereal
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Sugary breakfast cereal with marshmallows.  It takes you back to your "
"childhood."
msgstr "마시멜로가 들어간 달콤한 아침식사용 시리얼. 어린 시절이 생각나게 합니다."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "corn cereal"
msgid_plural "corn cereals"
msgstr[0] "옥수수 시리얼"

#. ~ Description for corn cereal
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "Plain cornflake cereal.  They're not that good, but it beats nothing."
msgstr "콘플레이크. 맛은 그저 그렇지만, 별 수 있나요."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "tortilla chips"
msgid_plural "tortilla chips"
msgstr[0] "토르티야 칩"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'tortilla chips'}
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Salted chips made from corn tortillas, could really use some cheese, maybe "
"some beef."
msgstr "소금을 친 옥수수 토르티야로, 치즈를 약간 더할 수 있으며, 어쩌면 쇠고기와 함께 요리할 수 있을 지도 모릅니다."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "cheese nachos"
msgid_plural "cheese nachos"
msgstr[0] "치즈 나초"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'cheese nachos'}
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Salted chips made from corn tortillas, now with cheese.  Could stand to have"
" some meat."
msgstr "소금을 친 옥수수 토르티야에 치즈를 곁들인 것. 고기와 함께면 더 맛있습니다."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "meat nachos"
msgid_plural "meat nachos"
msgstr[0] "고기 나초"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str_sp': 'meat nachos'} when VITAMIN matches
#. human_flesh_vitamin
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "niño nachos"
msgid_plural "niño nachos"
msgstr[0] "인육 나쵸"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str_sp': 'meat nachos'} when COMPONENT_ID matches
#. mutant
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "nachos con chupacabra"
msgid_plural "nachos con chupacabra"
msgstr[0] "나초 콘 추파카브라"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'meat nachos'}
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Salted chips made from corn tortillas, now with meat.  Could probably use "
"some cheese, though."
msgstr "소금을 친 옥수수 토르티야에 고기를 곁들인 것. 치즈와 함께면 더 맛있습니다."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "meat nachos with cheese"
msgid_plural "meat nachos with cheese"
msgstr[0] "치즈 고기 나초"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str_sp': 'meat nachos with cheese'} when VITAMIN
#. matches human_flesh_vitamin
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "niño nachos with cheese"
msgid_plural "niño nachos with cheese"
msgstr[0] "치즈 인육 나쵸"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str_sp': 'meat nachos with cheese'} when
#. COMPONENT_ID matches mutant
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "cheese and chupacabra nachos"
msgid_plural "cheese and chupacabra nachos"
msgstr[0] "치즈 추파카브라 나초"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'meat nachos with cheese'}
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Salted chips made from corn tortillas with ground meat and smothered in "
"cheese.  Delicious."
msgstr "소금을 친 옥수수 토르티야에 고기와 치즈를 곁들인 것. 맛있습니다."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "pork stick"
msgid_plural "pork sticks"
msgstr[0] "돼지 꼬치"

#. ~ Description for pork stick
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "Salty dried pork.  Tastes good, but it will make you thirsty."
msgstr "짭짤한 건조된 돼지고기. 맛은 좋지만 먹다보면 갈증이 생긴다."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "microwave burrito"
msgid_plural "microwave burritos"
msgstr[0] "전자레인지 부리토"

#. ~ Description for microwave burrito
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A small, microwaveable steak & cheese burrito, like those found at gas "
"stations."
msgstr "주유소에서 파는 것 같은, 작은 전자레인지용 스테이크 & 치즈 부리토입니다."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "uncooked TV dinner"
msgid_plural "uncooked TV dinners"
msgstr[0] "냉동식품(요리전)"

#. ~ Description for uncooked TV dinner
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Now with ONE POUND of meat and ONE POUND of carbs!  Not as appetizing or "
"nutritious as it would be if heated up."
msgstr "450g의 고기와 450g의 탄수화물이 들어있다! 데워먹지 않으면 맛도 없고 배도 덜 부르다."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "cooked TV dinner"
msgid_plural "cooked TV dinners"
msgstr[0] "냉동식품(요리)"

#. ~ Description for cooked TV dinner
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Now with ONE POUND of meat and ONE POUND of carbs!  Nice and heated up.  "
"It's tastier and more filling, but will also spoil quickly."
msgstr ""
"450g의 고기와 450g의 탄수화물이 들어있다! 잘 데워져서 좀더 맛있고 배부르게 먹을 수 있지만, 금방 상하니 빨리 먹어야 한다."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "deep-fried chicken"
msgid_plural "deep-fried chickens"
msgstr[0] "닭고기 튀김"

#. ~ Description for deep-fried chicken
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "Chicken cooked while submerged in oil.  It's greasy and delicious."
msgstr "식용유에 넣고 튀긴 닭고기 튀김. 기름지고 맛있다."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "chili dogs"
msgid_plural "chili dogs"
msgstr[0] "칠리 도그"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'chili dogs'}
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "A hot dog, served with chili con carne as a topping.  Yum!"
msgstr ""
"칠리소스를 토핑으로 사용한 핫도그입니다. 냠냠!\n"
"칠리소스를 토핑으로 사용한 핫도그입니다. 냠냠!"

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "uncooked corn dogs"
msgid_plural "uncooked corn dogs"
msgstr[0] "콘도그 (요리전)"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'uncooked corn dogs'}
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A heavily processed sausage, dipped in batter and deep-fried.  It would "
"taste much better prepared."
msgstr "반죽을 입혀 튀긴, 고도로 가공된 소시지입니다. 조리하면 훨씬 맛있을 것입니다."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "cooked corn dog"
msgid_plural "cooked corn dogs"
msgstr[0] "콘도그(요리)"

#. ~ Description for cooked corn dog
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A heavily processed sausage, dipped in batter and deep-fried.  Cooked, this "
"corn dog now tastes much better, but will spoil."
msgstr "반죽을 입혀 튀긴, 고도로 가공된 소시지입니다. 조리돼 이제 훨씬 맛있지만 상할 것입니다."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "homemade corn dog"
msgid_plural "homemade corn dogs"
msgstr[0] "수제 콘도그"

#. ~ Description for homemade corn dog
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A homemade sausage, dipped in batter and deep fried.  Cooked, this corn dog "
"now tastes much better, but will spoil."
msgstr "반죽을 입혀 튀긴 수제 소시지입니다. 조리돼 이제 훨씬 맛있지만 상할 것입니다."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "chocolate pancake"
msgid_plural "chocolate pancakes"
msgstr[0] "초콜릿 팬케이크"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chocolate pancake'}
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Fluffy and delicious pancakes with real maple syrup, with delicious "
"chocolate baked right in."
msgstr "푹신하고 맛있는 팬케이크로 진짜 메이플 시럽이 뿌려졌으며 맛있는 초콜릿을 넣고 구웠습니다."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "chocolate waffle"
msgid_plural "chocolate waffles"
msgstr[0] "초콜릿 와플"

#. ~ Description for chocolate waffle
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Crunchy and delicious waffles with real maple syrup, with delicious "
"chocolate baked right in."
msgstr "진짜 메이플 시럽을 곁들인 바삭바삭하고 맛있는 와플로, 맛있는 초콜릿을 넣고 구웠습니다."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "cheese spread"
msgid_plural "cheese spreads"
msgstr[0] "치즈 스프레드"

#. ~ Description for cheese spread
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "Processed cheese spread."
msgstr "가공치즈 스프레드."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "cheese spread pouch"
msgid_plural "cheese spread pouchs"
msgstr[0] "치즈 스프레드 파우치"

#. ~ Description for cheese spread pouch
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Heavily processed cheese spread.  Sterilized and packed atmospherically to "
"last long."
msgstr "고도로 가공된 치즈 스프레드입니다. 오래가도록 살균되어 상압으로 포장됐습니다."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "cheese fries"
msgid_plural "cheese fries"
msgstr[0] "치즈 감자튀김"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'cheese fries'}
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "Fried potatoes with delicious cheese smothered on top."
msgstr "패스트 푸드 감자 튀김. 위쪽에는 맛있는 치즈가 듬뿍 뿌려져있습니다."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "onion ring"
msgid_plural "onion rings"
msgstr[0] "양파링"

#. ~ Description for onion ring
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "Battered and fried onions.  Crunchy and delicious."
msgstr "튀김옷을 입은 패스트 푸드 양파 튀김. 바삭바삭하고 맛있습니다."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "uncooked hot dog"
msgid_plural "uncooked hot dogs"
msgstr[0] "생 핫도그"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'uncooked hot dog'}
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A heavily processed sausage, commonplace at baseball games before the "
"Cataclysm.  It would taste much better prepared."
msgstr "대재앙 이전에 야구 경기에서 흔했던, 고도로 가공된 소시지입니다. 조리하면 훨씬 맛있을 것입니다."

#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid "campfire hot dog"
msgid_plural "campfire hot dogs"
msgstr[0] "캠프파이어 핫도그"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'campfire hot dog'}
#: data\json\items\comestibles\junkfood.json
msgid ""
"The simple hot dog, cooked over an open fire.  Would be better on a bun, but"
