#: data\json\obsoletion\npc_dialogue.json
msgid "What were you saying before?"
msgstr "아까 뭐라고 했죠?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\criminal_2.json
msgid ""
"I was <very> lucky for <the_cataclysm>.  I was squatting in a warehouse out "
"on the edge of town.  I was in a real <shitty> place, and my crew had mostly"
" just been arrested in a big drug bust, but I had skipped out.  I was scared"
" they were gonna think I ratted 'em out and come get me, but hey, no worries"
" about that now."
msgstr "<the_cataclysm> 때 정말 <very> 운이 좋았어요. 도시 외곽 창고에 쭈그리고 있었어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\criminal_2.json
msgid "Woah, lucky for you.  How did you find out about <the_cataclysm>?"
msgstr "운이 좋네요. <the_cataclysm>에 대해 어떻게 알았어요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\criminal_2.json
msgid ""
"I was just in a warehouse, not in Zambonia.  I had the internet.  Watched "
"those crazy videos on YouTube in real time, scared the shit out of me.  I "
"had it pretty good though, I'd lifted a bunch of canned food and shit, and I"
" had a pretty sweet little squat in that warehouse.  I'd been planning on "
"spending a long time there after all, while I figured out how to get in good"
" with my crew."
msgstr ""
"난 그냥 창고에 있었어, 잠보니아에 있던 게 아니라. 인터넷도 있었고. 유튜브에서 그 미친 영상들을 실시간으로 봤어, 존나 무서웠어. "
"근데 난 꽤 괜찮았어 — 통조림이랑 이것저것 좀 훔쳐놨고 그 창고에 꽤 아늑한 거처가 있었거든. 어차피 오래 있을 계획이었어, 조랑 잘 "
"지내는 법을 알아내는 동안."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\criminal_2.json
msgid "Something must have driven you out of there."
msgstr "뭔가 거기서 밀어낸 게 있겠죠."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\criminal_2.json
msgid ""
"Yeah.  <zombies>.  A bunch of them, led by this big creepy-ass jet-black "
"bastard with glowing red eyes, I shit you not.  I dunno what brought them "
"way out my way but they saw me takin' a piss outside and that was that.  I "
"took a few shots at them but that creepy-ass motherfucker waves his hands "
"and brings 'em back up, so I ran.  Once I got my shit together again I "
"realized it wasn't so bad, I was running out of stuff anyway.  Been livin' "
"on what I can loot ever since, until I fell in with you."
msgstr "네. <zombies>요. 많이, 이 크고 섬뜩한 칠흑 같은 놈 하나가 이끄는..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\criminal_2.json
msgid "Got any tips about the boss zombie?"
msgstr "보스 좀비에 대한 팁 있어요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\criminal_2.json
msgid ""
"Well, I mean, if he's surrounded by buddies like that and he can just bring "
"'em back, I think he's a scary bastard.  If I got him on his own I think "
"maybe I could have taken him.  Also when I was running I managed to get a "
"zombie on its own, and I smashed it to shit with a stick before the rest "
"showed up.  He tried to raise that one and it didn't get back up."
msgstr "뭐, 그가 그런 동료들에 둘러싸여 있고 그들을 살려낼 수 있다면..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\cyborg_1.json
msgid ""
"Oh God… *Zzzzt* I… I don't know what ha-happened.  *BEEEEEEP* They told me I"
" was going to become the very b-best!  And then I c-can only remember pain "
"and screams.  P-Please don't *Zzzt* leave me here!"
msgstr ""
"오 세상에… *즈즈트* 나… 무슨 일이 있-있었는지 몰라. *비이이이입* 내가 최-최고가 될 거라고 했어! 그리고 고-고통과 비명만 "
"기억나. 제-제발 *즈트* 여기 두지 마!"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\cyborg_1.json
msgid "You're okay it's over now."
msgstr "괜찮아 이제 다 끝났어."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\dreamer.json
msgid ""
"OK, this is gonna sound crazy but I, like, I knew this was going to happen."
"  Like, before it did.  You can even ask my psychic except, like, I think "
"she's dead now.  I told her about my dreams a week before the world ended.  "
"Serious!"
msgstr ""
"좋아, 이거 미친 소리 같겠지만 난, 그러니까, 이게 일어날 걸 알았어. 그러니까, 일어나기 전에. 내 점술가한테 물어봐도 돼 근데, "
"그러니까, 죽은 것 같아. 세상 끝나기 일주일 전에 꿈 얘길 했거든. 진짜야!"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\dreamer.json
msgid "What were your dreams?"
msgstr "어떤 꿈이요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\dreamer.json
msgid ""
"OK, so, the first dream I had every night for three weeks.  I dreamed that I"
" was running through the woods with a stick, fighting giant spiders.  For "
"reals!  Every night."
msgstr "좋아요, 3주 동안 매일 밤 꿈을 꿨어요. 내가 걷고 있는 꿈인데..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\dreamer.json
msgid "OK, that doesn't seem that unusual though."
msgstr "그게 그렇게 특별히 이상한 꿈은 아닌 것 같은데요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\dreamer.json
msgid "Wow, crazy, I can't believe you really dreamed <the_cataclysm>."
msgstr "와, 정말 <the_cataclysm>을 꿈에서 봤다니 믿기 어렵네요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\dreamer.json
msgid ""
"OK, that's just, like, the beginning though.  So, a week before it happened,"
" after the spider dream, I would get up and go pee and then go back to bed "
"'cause I was kinda freaked out, right?  And then I'd have this other dream, "
"like, where my boss died and came back from the dead!  And then, at work a "
"few days later, my boss' husband was visiting and he had a heart attack and "
"I heard the next day that he'd come back from the dead!  Just like in my "
"dream, only it was a different person!"
msgstr "좋아요, 그건 시작에 불과해요. 일어나기 일주일 전에, 거미 꿈 이후에..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\dreamer.json
msgid "That is kinda strange."
msgstr "좀 이상하네요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\dreamer.json
msgid ""
"RIGHT?!  And there's more!  So, a week before it happened, after the spider "
"dream, I would get up and go pee and then go back to bed 'cause I was kinda "
"freaked out, right?  And then I'd have this other dream, like, where my boss"
" died and came back from the dead!  And then, at work a few days later, my "
"boss' husband was visiting and he had a heart attack and I heard the next "
"day that he'd come back from the dead!  Just like in my dream, only it was a"
" different person!"
msgstr "맞죠?! 더 있어요! 일어나기 일주일 전에, 거미 꿈 이후에..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\dreamer.json
msgid ""
"RIGHT?!  Anyway, I still get weird dreams, but not of the future anymore.  "
"Like, I get a lot of creepy dreams since the world ended.  Like, every "
"couple nights, I dream about a field of black stars all around the Earth, "
"and for just a second they all stare at the Earth all at once like a billion"
" tiny black eyeballs.  And then they blink and look away, and then in my "
"dream the Earth is a black star like all the other ones, and I'm stuck on it"
" still, all alone and freakin' out.  That's the worst one.  There are a few "
"others."
msgstr "맞죠?! 어쨌든, 이상한 꿈은 계속 꾸는데, 미래 꿈은 더 이상 아니에요. 예를 들면..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\dreamer.json
msgid "Tell me some more of your weird dreams."
msgstr "이상한 꿈 더 얘기해줘요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\dreamer.json
msgid ""
"OK, so, sometimes I dream that I am a zombie.  I just don't realize it.  And"
" I just act normal to myself and I see zombies as normal people and normal "
"people as zombies.  When I wake up I know it's fake though because if it "
"were real, there would be way more normal people.  Because they'd actually "
"be zombies.  And everyone is a zombie now."
msgstr "좋아요, 가끔 내가 좀비인 꿈을 꿔요. 모르고 있는 거예요. 그냥..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\dreamer.json
msgid "I think we all have dreams like that now."
msgstr "이제 우리 모두 그런 꿈을 꾸는 것 같아요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\dreamer.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, probably.  Sometimes I also dream that I am just like, a mote of dust,"
" floating in a vast, uncaring galaxy.  That one makes me wish that my pot "
"dealer, Filthy Dan, hadn't been eaten by a giant crab monster."
msgstr "맞아요, 아마도. 때로는 그냥 먼지 한 알인 꿈도 꿔요, 그냥 떠다니는..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\dreamer.json
msgid "Poor Filthy Dan.  <done_conversation_section>"
msgstr "가여운 더러운 댄. <done_conversation_section>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\dreamer.json
msgid "Thanks for telling me that stuff.  <end_talking>"
msgstr "얘기해줘서 고마워요. <end_talking>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_1.json
msgid ""
"I made it to one of those <swear> evac shelters, but it was almost worse "
"than what I left behind.  Escaped from there, been on the run since."
msgstr "그 <swear> 대피 쉼터에 들어갔는데, 밖에 있는 것보다 거의 더 나빴어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_1.json
msgid "How did you survive on the run?"
msgstr "도망치면서 어떻게 살아남았나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_1.json
msgid ""
"I spent a lot of time rummaging for rhubarb and bits of vegetables in the "
"forest before I found the courage to start picking off some of those dead "
"monsters.  I guess I was getting desperate."
msgstr "오랫동안 숲에서 대황과 채소 조각을 뒤지면서 보냈어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_1.json
msgid "And that's it?  You spent months just living off the land?"
msgstr "그게 다예요? 몇 달을 그렇게 자급자족으로만요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_1.json
msgid ""
"Not exactly.  After a while, I got brave.  I started venturing towards the "
"outskirts of town, picking off zombies here and there.  I learned about "
"traveling in at night to avoid all but those <swear> shadow-zombies, and "
"that got me pretty far.  Eventually I cleared out a cozy little nook for "
"myself and started really feeling comfortable.  I guess I got a bit "
"complacent."
msgstr "정확히는 아니에요. 시간이 지나 용기가 생겼어요. 도시 외곽으로 조금씩 가기 시작했어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_1.json
msgid "Complacent?"
msgstr "안주요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_1.json
msgid ""
"I thought I had those damned <zombies> figured out.  I got braver, started "
"heading out by day more and more.  One of those screamer zombies spotted me "
"and called in a horde, with a giant <swear> beastie at the head of it, the "
"size of a volkswagen and all covered in bone plates.  I know when I'm "
"outclassed.  The big guy was held back by his own horde of buddies, and I "
"managed to book it back to my place.  I closed the windows, locked it down, "
"but it was too late.  The giant followed me and just started hammering right"
" through the walls.  I grabbed what I could and made for the horizon.  Last "
"I saw of my squat, it was collapsing on the bastard.  For all I know, it "
"died in the crash, but I am not going back to find out."
msgstr ""
"그 빌어먹을 <zombies>를 다 파악한 줄 알았어. 용기가 생겨서 낮에 나가는 게 점점 잦아졌지. 그 비명 좀비 하나가 날 발견하고 "
"무리를 불렀는데, 선두엔 거대한 <swear> 짐승이 있었어 — 폭스바겐 크기에 온통 뼈 판을 뒤집어쓴. 내가 상대 안 되는 건 알아. "
"큰 놈은 자기 무리 친구들한테 막혔고, 난 간신히 튀어서 거처로 돌아왔어. 창 닫고 잠갔지만 너무 늦었어. 거인이 날 따라와서 벽을 뚫고"
" 두들기기 시작했어. 닿는 대로 챙기고 지평선으로 갔지. 거처 마지막 모습은 그 자식한테 무너지는 거였어. 내가 아는 한 부서짐에서 "
"죽었겠지만, 확인하러 돌아가진 않을 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_2.json
msgid ""
"Same as most people who didn't get killed straight up during the riots.  I "
"went to one of those <dumb> <swear> evacuation death traps.  I actually "
"lived there for a while with three others.  One guy who I guess had watched "
"a lot of movies kinda ran the show, because he seemed to really know what "
"was going on.  Spoiler alert: he <swear> didn't."
msgstr "폭동 때 바로 죽지 않은 대부분의 사람들과 같아요. 피신처로 갔는데..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_2.json
msgid "What happened to your original crew?"
msgstr "원래 그룹은 어떻게 됐어요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_2.json
msgid ""
"Things went south when our fearless leader decided we had to put down one of"
" the other survivors that had been bitten.  Her husband felt a bit strongly "
"against that, and I wasn't too keen on it either; by this point, he'd "
"already been wrong about a lot.  Well, he took matters into his own hands "
"and killed her.  Then her husband decided one good turn deserves another, "
"and killed the idiot.  And then she got back up and I killed her again, and "
"pulped our former leader.  Unfortunately she'd given her husband a hell of a"
" nip during the struggle, when he couldn't get his shit together enough to "
"fight back.  Not that I fucking blame him.  We made it out of there "
"together, but it was too much for him, he clearly wasn't in it anymore…  The"
" bite got infected, but it was another <zombie> that finally killed him.  "
"And then I was alone."
msgstr ""
"우리 대쪽 리더가 물린 다른 생존자 하나를 처리해야 한다고 결정하면서 일이 나빠졌어. 그녀의 남편이 꽤 강하게 반대했고, 나도 별로 "
"내키지 않았어 — 그 시점에 그는 이미 많은 걸 틀렸거든. 뭐, 그가 손을 써서 그녀를 죽였어. 그리고 남편이 한 번은 한 번으로 "
"갚는다며 그 멍청이를 죽였지. 그리고 그녀가 다시 일어나서 내가 다시 죽였고, 전 리더를 으깨버렸어. 불행히도 몸싸움 중에 남편이 제대로"
" 반격하지 못 할 때 그녀에게 세게 물렸어. 뭐, 좆같이 그를 탓하진 않아. 우린 같이 거길 빠져나왔지만 그에겐 너무 컸어, 더는 못 "
"버티는 게 분명했거든… 물린 데가 감염됐지만, 결국 그를 죽인 건 다른 <zombie>였어. 그리고 난 혼자가 됐어."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_2.json
msgid "What do you think happened?  You see them around anywhere?"
msgstr "어떻게 된 것 같아요? 어디서 보이나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_3.json
msgid ""
"There's nothing too special about me, I'm not sure why I survived.  I got "
"evacuated with a handful of others, but we were too late to make the second "
"trip to a FEMA center.  We got attacked by the dead…  I was the only one to "
"make it out.  I never looked back."
msgstr ""
"난 특별한 게 없어, 왜 살아남았는지 모르겠어. 소수와 함께 대피했지만 FEMA 센터 2차 편에 늦었어. 망자들한테 습격당했고… 나만 "
"살아남았어. 뒤돌아보지 않았어."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_3.json
msgid "How did you survive after that?"
msgstr "그 뒤에 어떻게 살아남았나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_3.json
msgid ""
"Sheer luck I guess.  I went the absolute wrong way, into town, and wound up "
"stuck in the subway system.  I spent a few days living off vending machine "
"food.  Not the best eating, but I pulled through.  At least there weren't so"
" many zombies down there."
msgstr "순전한 운이에요. 완전히 잘못된 방향으로, 도심으로 향했고 지하철에 갇혔어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_3.json
msgid "What got you out of the subway?"
msgstr "지하철에서 뭐가 나오게 했나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_3.json
msgid ""
"Straight up hunger.  I didn't have any great light source down there, and I "
"didn't have much food.  I was slipping up and down to the station to buy "
"from the vending machines, but once I ran out of cash I had to make a break "
"for it.  I waited until dark and then skipped out."
msgstr "순전한 배고픔이에요. 아래에는 좋은 광원이 없었고 뭘 먹을지 몰랐어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_3.json
msgid ""
"Straight up hunger.  I didn't have any great light source down there, and I "
"didn't have much food.  I was slipping up and down to the station to buy "
"from the vending machines, but once I ran out of cash I had to think of "
"something else.  I started raiding the surrounding area by night, and built "
"a decent little base under there."
msgstr "순전한 배고픔이에요. 아래에는 좋은 광원이 없었고 뭘 먹을지 몰랐어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_3.json
msgid "I didn't meet you in the subway though.  You left."
msgstr "하지만 지하철에서 만난 게 아닌데요. 당신은 떠났잖아요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_3.json
msgid ""
"Yeah.  I had it pretty good there, but eventually I just started going a bit"
" nuts.  Always dark, a bit cold, living off scavenged junk food… a soul can "
"only live like that for so long.  When the weather above ground got warmer "
"and the daylight hours got longer I decided to get a bit braver.  I'd "
"learned enough about the <zombies> that I was able to live pretty well after"
" that.  I've camped a few places, scavenged berries and whatnot, lived a "
"pretty good life compared to those first few months."
msgstr ""
"응. 거기서 꽤 괜찮았는데, 결국 좀 미쳐가기 시작했어. 항상 어둡고, 좀 춥고, 주운 정크푸드로 연명하고… 영혼이 그렇게 오래 살 수 "
"없지. 지상 날씨가 따뜻해지고 낮이 길어지자 좀 용기 내기로 했어. <zombies>를 충분히 알게 돼서 그 후론 꽤 잘 살 수 있었어."
" 몇 군데 야영하고, 베리랑 이것저것 챙기고, 첫 몇 달에 비하면 꽤 좋은 삶을 살았어."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_4.json
msgid ""
"They were shipping me with a bunch of evacuees over to a refugee center, "
"when the bus got smashed in by the biggest zombie you ever saw.  It was busy"
" with the other passengers, so I did what anyone would do and fucked right "
"out of there."
msgstr "대피자들 그룹과 함께 피난민 센터로 이송되는 중에 일이 일어났어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_5.json
msgid ""
"My Evac shelter got swarmed by some of those bees, the ones the size of "
"dogs.  I took out a few with a two-by-four, but pretty quick I realized it "
"was either head for the hills or get stuck like a pig.  The rest is history."
msgstr "대피 쉼터가 강아지만 한 벌들한테 공격당했어요. 황급히 탈출했어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_5.json
msgid "Giant bees?  Tell me more."
msgstr "거대한 벌이요? 더 얘기해줘요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_5.json
msgid "But bees aren't usually aggressive…"
msgstr "근데 벌은 보통 공격적이지 않잖아…"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_5.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'm sure you've seen them, they're everywhere.  Like something out of "
"an old sci-fi movie.  Some of the others in the evac shelter got stung, it "
"was no joke.  I didn't stick around to see what the lasting effect was "
"though.  I'm not ashamed to admit I ran like a <swear> chicken."
msgstr "맞아요, 분명 봤을 거예요, 어디에나 있어요. 구식 영화 같은 거예요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_5.json
msgid "But bees aren't usually aggressive…  Do you mean wasps?"
msgstr "근데 벌은 보통 공격적이지 않잖아… 말벌 말하는 거야?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_5.json
msgid ""
"Well, excuse me if I didn't stop to <swear> ask what kind of killer bugs "
"they were."
msgstr "뭐, 어떤 종류의 살인 벌레인지 알아보려고 <swear> 멈추지 않은 걸 용서해주세요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_5.json
msgid "Sorry.  Could you tell me more about them?"
msgstr "미안해요. 더 얘기해줄 수 있어요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_5.json
msgid "Right.  Sorry."
msgstr "맞아요. 미안해요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\evacuee_6.json
msgid ""
"Well, I was at home when the cell phone alert went off and told me to get to"
" an evac shelter.  So I went to an evac shelter.  And then the shelter got "
"too crowded, and people were waiting to get taken to the refugee center, but"
" the buses never came.  You must already know about all that.  It turned "
"into panic, and then fighting.  I didn't stick around to see what happened "
"next; I headed into the woods with what tools I could snatch from the "
"lockers.  I went back a few days later, but the place was totally abandoned."
"  No idea what happened to all those people."
msgstr "핸드폰 알람이 울리면서 피신처로 가라고 했을 때 집에 있었어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\fema_evacuee_1.json
msgid ""
"That's a tall order.  I guess the short version is that I got evacuated to a"
" FEMA camp for my so-called safety, but luckily I made it out."
msgstr "요청이 많네요. 짧게 말하면 FEMA 캠프로 대피했어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\fema_evacuee_1.json
msgid "Tell me more about that FEMA camp."
msgstr "그 FEMA 캠프에 대해 더 얘기해줘요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\fema_evacuee_1.json
msgid "How did you get out?"
msgstr "어떻게 빠져나왔나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\fema_evacuee_1.json
msgid ""
"It was terrifying.  We were shipped there on a repurposed school bus, about "
"thirty of us.  You can probably see the issues right away.  A few of the "
"folks on board the bus had injuries, and some schmuck who had seen too many "
"B-movies tried to insist that anyone who 'had been bitten' was going to "
"'turn'.  Fucking idiot, right?  I've been bitten a dozen times now and the "
"worst I got was a gross infection."
msgstr "무서웠어요. 개조된 스쿨버스에 30명 정도랑 실려 갔어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\fema_evacuee_1.json
msgid "What happened after that?"
msgstr "그 다음에 어떻게 됐나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\fema_evacuee_1.json
msgid ""
"That guy started a frenzy.  People were already panicked.  There was an "
"armed guy overseeing the transport, acting like a cop but really he was just"
" some <dumb> kid they'd handed a rifle to.  He tried to calm things down, "
"and I guess it actually worked for a bit, although the 'kill the infected' "
"bunch were pretty <swear> freaked out and were clearly ready to jump the "
"moment the granny with the cut on her arm started frothing at the mouth.  "
"They started acting up again when we got to the camp.  That didn't go well "
"for them.  A few heavily armed soldiers dragged them away, and I never saw "
"them again."
msgstr "그 사람이 난리를 피웠어요. 이미 공황 상태였어요. 무장 경비가 있었는데..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\fema_evacuee_1.json
msgid ""
"That place was chaos.  I only stayed a few hours.  They had a big backhoe "
"running, digging a huge pit in a cordoned section they wouldn't let us near."
"  Well, I managed to sneak over that way, and saw them dumping load after "
"load of the dead in the pit, pouring dirt back over them even as they "
"revived and tried to climb out.  Even with all the shit I've seen since, it "
"haunts me.  I knew then I had to get out.  Luckily for me, we were attacked "
"the next morning by some giant horror, a kind I haven't really seen since "
"then.  While the guards were busy with that, I grabbed some supplies I'd "
"stocked up over the night and I fucked right out of there.  A few others "
"tried to fuck out with me, but as far as I know I was the only lucky one."
msgstr "그 곳은 아수라장이었어요. 몇 시간밖에 안 있었어요. 큰 굴착기가 있어서..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\fema_evacuee_1.json
msgid "Maybe another time.  I don't really like thinking about it."
msgstr "다음에 얘기해요. 생각하기 싫어요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\fema_evacuee_1.json
msgid "Sorry.  Tell me more about that FEMA camp."
msgstr "미안해요. 그 FEMA 캠프에 대해 더 얘기해줘요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\fema_evacuee_1.json
msgid "Sorry for asking.  <done_conversation_section>"
msgstr "묻지 않아서 미안해요. <done_conversation_section>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\fema_evacuee_1.json
msgid "Sorry for asking.  <end_talking>"
msgstr "묻지 않아서 미안해요. <end_talking>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\grad_student_1.json
msgid ""
"I'm not from around here…  You can probably tell from the accent, I'm from "
"the UK.  I was here doing my PhD at Dartmouth.  I was halfway to MIT for a "
"conference when <the_cataclysm> stopped me.  I was staying at a flea-ridden "
"little motel on the side of the road.  When I got up for whatever was going "
"to pass for breakfast, the fat bloody proprietor was sitting at his desk, "
"wearing the same grubby clothes from the night before.  I thought he had "
"just slept there, but when he looked at me…  well, you know what those Zed-"
"eyes look like.  He lunged, and I reacted without thinking.  Smacked him on "
"the head with my tablet, again and again, until he stopped coming for me.  I"
" never thought I had anything like that in me."
msgstr ""
"여기 사람이 아니야… 억양으로 알 수 있을 거야, 영국 출신이야. 다트머스에서 박사과정 하러 왔었어. 학회 가려고 MIT 가는 중간에 "
"<the_cataclysm>이 날 멈췄지. 길가의 벼룩 들끓는 조그만 모텔에 묵고 있었어. 아침이라고 불릴 만한 걸 먹으러 일어났을 때,"
" 그 지독한 뚱뚱한 주인이 전날 입던 더러운 옷 그대로 책상에 앉아 있었어. 그냥 거기서 잔 줄 알았는데, 날 쳐다봤을 때… 뭐, 그 "
"제드 눈이 어떻게 생겼는지 알잖아. 덤벼들었고, 생각 없이 반응했어. 태블릿으로 머리를 후려쳤어, 반복해서, 나한테 오는 걸 멈출 "
"때까지. 내 안에 그런 게 있을 줄은 생각 못 했어."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\grad_student_1.json
#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\wedding_1.json
msgid "What did you do next?"
msgstr "다음에 어떻게 했나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\grad_student_1.json
msgid "What were you studying?"
msgstr "뭘 공부했나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\grad_student_1.json
msgid ""
"I wandered for a little while around the grounds, letting the adrenaline "
"fade, hoping for some kind of idea what to do.  I was out in the middle of "
"nowhere, and I didn't know the area at all.  I wasn't certain if I should "
"head back to Hanover, and try to get my belongings, or stay out where I was."
"  Finally, I decided to rest a while until I knew what was going on.  The "
"internet told me most of what I needed; I'm sure you saw Twitter in those "
"days.  Even if I'd thought it wise to go back all the way to New Hampshire, "
"I was far too scared."
msgstr "대피 이후 한동안 건물 주변을 돌아다니며 아드레날린이 가라앉기를 기다렸어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\grad_student_1.json
msgid "Something must have driven you out of the motel."
msgstr "뭔가 모텔에서 몰아낸 게 있겠죠."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\grad_student_1.json
msgid ""
"Yes.  Simple hunger.  The vending machines sold only peanuts and biscuits.  "
"I wasn't about to rely on that for survival.  I stayed long enough to "
"realize no one was going to come for me, then packed up what I could and "
"drove off.  Eventually my car was caught in a downpour of acid rain that "
"stripped the tires and left me to carry on on foot, living the life of a "
"hunter gatherer.  Honestly, I think I eat better this way than I did as a "
"grad student."
msgstr "맞아요. 단순한 배고픔이에요. 자판기에는 땅콩과 비스킷밖에 없었어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\grad_student_1.json
msgid ""
"I was in biochemistry.  Specifically, if you're interested, I was studying "
"the folding of non-standard nucleic acids into enzyme-like structures.  It "
"sounds more interesting than it was; most of my time was spent cursing at "
"computer screens and wishing we had more information on threose chains at "
"unusual temperatures and pressures for modeling."
msgstr "생화학을 전공했어요. 구체적으로는, 관심 있다면, 특정 화합물 발효 과정을 연구했어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\gung_ho_1.json
msgid ""
"Nothin' special before <the_cataclysm>.  When the dead started walking, I "
"geared up and started puttin' them back down."
msgstr "<the_cataclysm> 전엔 특별한 게 없었어요. 사자들이 걷기 시작했을 때, 장비를 갖췄어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\gung_ho_1.json
msgid "How did that go?"
msgstr "어떻게 됐나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\gung_ho_1.json
msgid "Cool.  <done_conversation_section>"
msgstr "멋지네요. <done_conversation_section>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\gung_ho_1.json
msgid "Cool.  <end_talking>"
msgstr "멋지네요. <end_talking>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\gung_ho_1.json
msgid ""
"Almost got killed.  One <zombie> is easy pickins, but ten is a lot, and a "
"hundred is a death trap.  I got myself in too deep, an' barely slipped out "
"with my guts still inside me.  Holed up in an old motel for a while lickin' "
"my wounds and thinkin' about what I wanted to do next.  That's when I "
"figured it out."
msgstr "거의 죽을 뻔했어요. <zombie> 하나는 쉬운데, 열은 많고, 백은..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\gung_ho_1.json
msgid "Figured what out?"
msgstr "뭘 알아냈나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\gung_ho_1.json
msgid "Never mind.  <done_conversation_section>"
msgstr "됐어요. <done_conversation_section>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\gung_ho_1.json
msgid "Never mind.  <end_talking>"
msgstr "됐어요. <end_talking>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\gung_ho_1.json
msgid ""
"This is it.  This is what I was made for.  There in the street, smashin' "
"monster heads and prayin' I'd make it out?  I've never felt like that.  "
"Alive.  Important.  So after I got myself all stuck back together, I nutted "
"up and went back to it.  Probly killed a thousand Z since then, and I'm "
"still not tired of it."
msgstr "바로 이거예요. 이게 내가 만들어진 이유예요. 거리에서 괴물들을 박살내면서..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\gung_ho_1.json
#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\gung_ho_2.json
msgid "It's good you found your calling.  <done_conversation_section>"
msgstr "사명을 찾아서 좋네요. <done_conversation_section>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\gung_ho_1.json
#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\gung_ho_2.json
msgid "It's good you found your calling.  <end_talking>"
msgstr "사명을 찾아서 좋네요. <end_talking>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\gung_ho_2.json
msgid ""
"Oh, you know.  Blah blah blah, had a job and a life, everyone died.  Boo "
"hoo.  I gotta be straight with you though: I honestly think I like this "
"better.  Fighting for survival every day?  I've never felt so alive.  I've "
"killed hundreds of those bastards.  Sooner or later one of them will take me"
" out, but I'll go down knowing I did something actually important."
msgstr "그냥 평범하게 살았어요. 직업 있고 삶이 있었고, 모두가 죽었어요. 슬프죠. 어쨌든..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\gung_ho_3.json
msgid ""
"Well y'see, I'm not from these parts at all.  I was driving up from the "
"South to visit my son when it all happened.  I was staying at a motel when a"
" military convoy passed through and told us to evacuate to a FEMA shelter."
msgstr "알다시피, 나 여기 출신이 전혀 아니에요. 남쪽에서 올라오던 중이었어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\gung_ho_3.json
msgid "Tell me about your son."
msgstr "아들에 대해 얘기해줘요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\gung_ho_3.json
msgid "So, you went to one of the FEMA camps?"
msgstr "FEMA 캠프에 간 거예요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\gung_ho_3.json
msgid ""
"He lives up in Northern Canada, way in the middle of nowhere, with his crazy"
" wife and my three grandkids.  He's an environmental engineer for some oil "
"and gas company out there.  She's a bit of a hippy-dippy headcase.  I love "
"em both though, and as far as I'm concerned they all made it out of this "
"fucked up mess safe, out there in the boondocks.  I guess they think I'm "
"dead, so they'll steer clear of this hellhole, and that's the best as could "
"be."
msgstr "캐나다 북쪽 구석, 미친 마누라랑 아이들과 살아요. 좋은 자식이에요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\gung_ho_3.json
msgid "What was it you said before?"
msgstr "아까 뭐라고 했죠?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\gung_ho_3.json
msgid ""
"Lord no.  I'll be fucked if I let a kid in a too-big uniform tell me what "
"the hell to do.  I had my Hummer loaded out and ready to go offroading, I "
"had a ton of gas, and I even had as many rifles as the border was gonna let "
"me bring over.  I didn't know what I was supposed to be running from, but I "
"sure as shit didn't run.  "
msgstr "절대요. 너무 큰 제복 입은 꼬마한테 어떻게 하라고 지시받는 건 없어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\gung_ho_3.json
msgid "Where did you go then?"
msgstr "그럼 어디로 갔어요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\gung_ho_3.json
msgid ""
"At first, I just kept going North, but I ran into a huge military blockade."
"  They even had those giant walking robots like on TV.  I started going up "
"to check it out, and before I knew it they were opening fire!  I coulda "
"died, but I still have pretty good reactions.  I turned tail and rolled out "
"of there.  My Hummer had taken some bad hits though, and I found out the "
"hard way I was leaking gas all down the freeway.  Made it a few miles before"
" I wound up stuck in the ass-end of nowhere.  I settled in to wander.  I "
"guess I'm still kinda heading North, just by a pretty round-about way, you "
"know?"
msgstr "처음엔 그냥 북쪽으로 계속 갔는데, 거대한 군사 차단선에 부딪혔어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\gung_ho_3.json
msgid "That's quite a story.  <done_conversation_section>"
msgstr "꽤 대단한 얘기네요. <done_conversation_section>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\gung_ho_3.json
msgid "That's quite a story.  <end_talking>"
msgstr "꽤 대단한 얘기네요. <end_talking>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\high_school_1.json
msgid ""
"I was at school.  I'm a senior.  We'd heard about riots…  It started with a "
"kid showing videos of one of the big riots in Providence.  You've probably "
"seen it, the one where the woman turns to the camera and you can see her "
"whole lower lip has been ripped off, and is just flapping there?  It got so "
"bad, they went over the PA system to tell us about Chinese drugs in the "
"water supply.  Right…  Does anyone buy that explanation?"
msgstr ""
"학교에 있었어. 4학년이야. 폭동 얘길 들었지… 어떤 애가 프로비던스 대폭동 영상을 보여주면서 시작됐어. 너도 봤을 거야, 여자가 "
"카메라로 돌아서는데 아랫입술이 통째로 뜯겨 덜렁거리는 거? 너무 심해져서 상수도에 중국 약물이 들었다고 교내 방송까지 했어. 그래… 그 "
"설명을 누가 믿어?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\high_school_1.json
msgid "Where did things go from there?"
msgstr "거기서 어떻게 됐나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\high_school_1.json
msgid ""
"I guess it got worse, because the faculty decided to put us in lockdown.  "
"For hours.  And then the school buses showed up to evacuate us.  Eventually,"
" they ran out of buses.  I was one of the lucky few who didn't have a bus to"
" get on.  The soldiers weren't much older than me…  They didn't look like "
"they knew what was going on.  I lived just a few blocks away.  I snuck off."
msgstr ""
"더 나빠졌나 봐, 교직원이 우릴 봉쇄했거든. 몇 시간 동안. 그리고 스쿨버스가 우릴 대피시키러 왔어. 결국 버스가 떨어졌지. 난 탈 "
"버스가 없는 운 좋은 몇몇 중 하나였어. 군인들은 나보다 얼마 안 어려 보였고… 무슨 일인지 아는 것 같진 않았어. 난 몇 블록 거리에 "
"살았어. 몰래 빠져나왔지."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\high_school_1.json
msgid "Did you get home?"
msgstr "집에 갔어요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\high_school_1.json
msgid ""
"Yeah.  On the way there, I met some <zombies> for real.  They chased me, but"
" I did pretty well in track.  I lost them…  But I couldn't get home, there "
"were just too many.  I wound up running more.  Stole a bike and ran more "
"again.  I'm a bit better at killing those things now, but I haven't made it "
"home yet.  I guess I'm afraid of what I'll find."
msgstr ""
"응. 가는 길에 진짜 <zombies>를 만났어. 날 쫓았지만 육상을 꽤 잘해서 따돌렸어… 근데 집에 못 갔어, 너무 많았거든. 결국 더"
" 뛰었어. 자전거 훔치고 또 뛰었지. 지금은 그것들 죽이는 게 좀 더 나아졌지만 아직 집에 못 갔어. 뭘 발견할지 두려운 것 같아."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_1.json
msgid ""
"I saw it all pretty early, before it all really started.  I worked at the "
"hospital.  It started with a jump in the number of code whites - that's an "
"aggressive patient.  Wasn't my training so I didn't hear about it until "
"later…  but rumors started flying about hyperaggressive delirious patients "
"that coded and seemed to die, then started attacking staff, and wouldn't "
"respond to anything we hit them with.  Then a friend of mine was killed by "
"one of them, and I realized it wasn't just a few weird reports.  I called in"
" sick the next day."
msgstr ""
"모든 게 진짜 시작되기 전에, 꽤 일찍 다 봤어. 병원에서 일했거든. 코드 화이트 — 공격적 환자 — 수가 급증하면서 시작됐어. 내 "
"전공이 아니라 나중에야 들었지만… 초공격적 섬망 환자가 코드 나고 죽은 것 같다가 직원을 공격하고, 뭘 투여해도 반응이 없다는 소문이 "
"돌기 시작했어. 그리고 친구가 그중 하나한테 죽고, 이게 몇 건 이상한 보고가 아님을 깨달았지. 다음날 병가를 냈어."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_1.json
msgid "What happened on your sick day?"
msgstr "아픈 날에 무슨 일이 있었나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_1.json
msgid ""
"Well, <the_cataclysm>.  I lived a fair distance out of town, and I already "
"knew something was seriously wrong, but I hadn't admitted to myself what I "
"was really seeing quite yet.  When I saw the military convoys pouring into "
"the city, I put the pieces together.  At first I thought it was just my "
"hospital.  Still, I packed up my bags, locked the doors and windows, and "
"waited for the evacuation call."
msgstr "뭐, <the_cataclysm>이요. 시내에서 좀 멀리 살았고, 이미 알고 있었어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_1.json
msgid "Did you get evacuated?"
msgstr "대피했나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_1.json
msgid ""
"No.  The call came too late.  I'd already seen the clouds on the horizon.  "
"Mushroom clouds, and also those insane hell-clouds.  I've heard that "
"horrible things came out of them.  I decided it was safer in my locked up "
"house."
msgstr "아니요. 너무 늦게 연락이 왔어요. 이미 지평선의 구름을 봤어요. 버섯구름..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_1.json
msgid "Something must have happened to drive you out?"
msgstr "내몰릴 만한 일이 있었겠지?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_1.json
msgid ""
"The military happened.  They showed up and commandeered my land for some "
"kind of forward base, demanding I evacuate to a FEMA camp.  I didn't even "
"try to argue…  I had my dad's old hunting rifle, they had high tech weapons."
"  I heard one of them joking about the FEMA camp being Auschwitz, though.  I"
" gave their evac driver the slip and decided to make for my sister's place "
"up north.  In theory I guess I'm still going that way, although honestly I'm"
" just busy not dying."
msgstr ""
"군대가 왔어. 나타나서 전진 기지라며 내 땅을 징발하고 FEMA 캠프로 대피하라 했지. 반박할 생각도 안 했어… 난 아빠의 낡은 사냥총,"
" 걔넨 첨단 무기였으니. 근데 하나가 FEMA 캠프가 아우슈비츠라고 농담하는 걸 들었어. 대피 운전기사를 따돌리고 북쪽 누나네로 가기로 "
"했지. 이론상으론 아직 그쪽으로 가는 중이야 — 솔직히 그냥 안 죽기에 바쁘지만."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_2.json
msgid "I just can't talk about that right now.  I can't."
msgstr "지금 당장 그 얘기는 할 수 없어요. 할 수 없어요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_2.json
msgid ""
"I was at work at the hospital, when it all went down.  It's a bit of a blur."
"  For a while there were weird reports, stuff that sounded unbelievable "
"about patients getting back up after dying, but mostly things were business "
"as usual.  Then, towards the end, stuff just skyrocketed.  We thought it was"
" a Chinese attack, and that's what we were being told.  People coming in "
"crazed, covered in wounds from bullets and bites.  About halfway through my "
"shift I…  well, I broke."
msgstr ""
"전부 터졌을 때 병원에서 일하고 있었어. 좀 흐릿해. 한동안 이상한 보고가 있었어 — 죽은 환자가 다시 일어난다는 믿기지 않는 소리 — "
"근데 대체로 평소와 다름없었지. 그다음, 막바지에 일이 폭증했어. 우린 중국 공격이라 생각했고 그렇게 들었어. 미친 사람들이 총상과 물린"
" 상처투성이로 들어왔고. 근무 중간쯤에 난… 뭐, 무너졌어."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_2.json
msgid ""
"I was at work at the hospital, when it all went down.  It's a bit of a blur."
"  For a while there were weird reports, stuff that sounded unbelievable "
"about patients getting back up after dying, but mostly things were business "
"as usual.  Then, towards the end, stuff just skyrocketed.  We thought it was"
" a Chinese attack, and that's what we were being told.  People coming in "
"crazed, covered in wounds from bullets and bites.  About halfway through my "
"shift I…  well, I broke.  I'd seen such horrible injuries, and then I…  "
"<swear!>, I can't even talk about it."
msgstr ""
"전부 터졌을 때 병원에서 일하고 있었어. 좀 흐릿해. 한동안 이상한 보고가 있었어 — 죽은 환자가 다시 일어난다는 믿기지 않는 소리 — "
"근데 대체로 평소와 다름없었지. 그다음, 막바지에 일이 폭증했어. 우린 중국 공격이라 생각했고 그렇게 들었어. 미친 사람들이 총상과 물린"
" 상처투성이로 들어왔고. 근무 중간쯤에 난… 뭐, 무너졌어. 그렇게 끔찍한 부상들을 봤고, 그다음 난… <swear!>, 얘기도 못 "
"하겠어."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_2.json
#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_2.json
msgid "It might help to get it off your chest."
msgstr "털어놓으면 도움이 될 수도 있어요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_2.json
#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_2.json
msgid "Suck it up.  If we're going to work together I need to know you."
msgstr "털어버려요. 같이 일하려면 당신에 대해 알아야 해요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_2.json
msgid "What was it that 'broke' you?"
msgstr "당신을 '무너뜨린' 게 뭐였나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_2.json
msgid "No.  I can't.  Just, no."
msgstr "아니요. 할 수 없어요. 그냥, 아니에요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_2.json
msgid "Sorry…  I'll let you be."
msgstr "미안… 나가줄게."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_2.json
msgid ""
"A young mother.  I know she was a mother, because I delivered her baby.  "
"Sweet girl, she…  she had a good sense of humor.  She came in, spitting that"
" black goo, fighting the orderlies, dead from a bullet wound through the "
"chest.  That's when I …  I don't know if I woke up, finally, or if I finally"
" went crazy.  Either way, I broke.  I broke a lot earlier than my "
"colleagues, and that's the only reason I lived.  I skipped out, went to a "
"dead corner of the hospital I used to hide in when I was a resident.  An old"
" stairwell leading to a closed-off unit the maintenance staff were using to "
"store old equipment.  I hid there for hours, while I listened to the world "
"crumbling outside and inside."
msgstr ""
"젊은 엄마. 엄마인 걸 알아, 내가 아기를 받았거든. 착한 애였어, 그녀는… 유머 감각이 좋았어. 검은 진액을 뱉으며 들어왔고, "
"보조원들과 싸웠고, 가슴 관통 총상으로 죽어 있었어. 그때 난… 드디어 깨어난 건지, 드디어 미친 건 지 몰라. 어느 쪽이든 무너졌어. "
"동료들보다 훨씬 일찍 무너졌고, 그게 내가 산 유일한 이유야. 빠져나가 레지던트 때 숨곤 했던 병원 외진 구석으로 갔어. 관리 직원이 "
"낡은 장비 보관용으로 쓰던 폐쇄 병동으로 이어지는 오래된 계단이었지. 밖과 안의 세계가 무너지는 소릴 들으며 몇 시간을 숨었어."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_2.json
msgid "How did you get out of there?"
msgstr "거기서 어떻게 나왔어요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_2.json
msgid ""
"Somehow, I don't know how, I managed to fall asleep in there.  I think it "
"might have started with me hyperventilating and passing out.  When I woke up"
" it was night, I was starving and parched, and…  and the screaming had died "
"down.  At first I tried to go out the way I came in, but I peaked out the "
"window and saw one of the nurses stumbling around, spitting that black shit "
"up.  Her name was Becky.  She wasn't Becky anymore.  So, I went back up and "
"somehow made it into the storage area.  From there, the roof.  I drank water"
" from some nasty old puddle and I camped out there for a while, watching the"
" city around me burn."
msgstr ""
"어떻게인지 모르지만, 거기서 잠들 수 있었어. 과호흡해서 기절한 게 시작이었을지도. 깨어났을 땐 밤이었고, 굶주리고 목말랐고… 비명이 "
"잦아들었어. 처음엔 들어온 길로 나가려 했지만 창 밖을 보니 간호사 하나가 비틀거리며 그 검은 걸 뱉고 있었어. 이름은 베키였지. 더는 "
"베키가 아니었어. 그래서 다시 올라가 어떻게든 창고 구역에 들어갔고. 거기서 옥상으로. 고약한 웅덩이 물을 마시며 한동안 거기 야영했어,"
" 주변 도시가 타는 걸 보며."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_2.json
msgid "What finally brought you down?"
msgstr "결국 뭐가 널 내려오게 했어?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_2.json
msgid ""
"Well, I still didn't have any food.  Eventually I had to climb down the side"
" of the building…  so I did, as quietly as I could.  It was night, and I "
"have pretty good nightvision.  Apparently the zombies don't, because I was "
"able to slip right past them and steal a bicycle that was just laying on the"
" side of the road.  I'd kind of scouted out my route from above…  I'm not "
"from a big city, the hospital was the tallest building around.  I avoided "
"the major military blockades, and headed out of town towards a friend's old "
"cabin.  I had to fight off a couple of the <zombies>, but I managed to avoid"
" any big fuss, by some miracle.  I never made it to the cabin, but that's "
"not important now."
msgstr ""
"뭐, 아직 음식이 없었어. 결국 건물 옆면을 타고 내려가야 했지… 그래서 했어, 최대한 조용히. 밤이었고 내 야간 시야는 꽤 좋아. "
"좀비는 아닌 모양이야 — 바로 옆을 빠져나가 길가에 놓인 자전거를 훔칠 수 있었거든. 위에서 동선을 대충 정찰해뒀고… 큰 도시 출신이 "
"아니라 병원이 근처에서 제일 높은 건물이었어. 주요 군사 봉쇄를 피해 친구의 옛 오두막 쪽으로 마을을 벗어났지. <zombies> 몇이랑"
" 싸워야 했지만 기적적으로 큰 소동은 피했어. 오두막엔 못 갔지만, 지금은 중요하지 않아."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_2.json
msgid "What did you see, up there on the roof?"
msgstr "지붕 위에서 뭘 봤나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_2.json
#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\left_for_dead_2.json
#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\soldier_2.json
msgid "Thanks for telling me all that.  <done_conversation_section>"
msgstr "다 얘기해줘서 고마워요. <done_conversation_section>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_2.json
msgid ""
"My hospital was the tallest building in town, so I saw quite a bit.  The "
"military set up blockades on the roads coming in and out of the town, and "
"there was quite a lightshow going on out there when I started up.  I think "
"it was mostly automated turrets and robots, I didn't hear much shouting.  I "
"saw a few cars and trucks try to run the barricade and get blown to high "
"hell.  There were swarms of <zombies> in the streets, traveling in packs "
"towards sounds and noises.  I watched them rip a few running cars to shreds,"
" including the people inside who were trying to get away.  You know.  The "
"usual stuff.  I was pretty numb by that point."
msgstr "우리 병원이 마을에서 가장 높은 건물이라서 꽤 많이 봤어요. 군대가..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_2.json
msgid "How did you get down?"
msgstr "어떻게 내려왔어요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_3.json
msgid ""
"I was called in to work at the hospital.  I don't usually work there, I'm a "
"community doctor.  I don't really love emergency medicine at the best of "
"times, and when your patient keeps trying to rip your face off, well, it "
"takes the last bit of fun out of it.  You might think I'm a coward, but I "
"slipped out early on, and I've got no regrets.  There was nothing I could "
"have done except die like everyone else.  I couldn't get out of the "
"building, the military had blockaded us in…  so I went to the most secure, "
"quiet damned place in the building."
msgstr ""
"병원 근무로 불려 들어갔어. 평소엔 거기서 일 안 해, 동네 의사야. 최상의 때에도 응급의학을 별로 안 좋아하는데, 환자가 계속 내 "
"얼굴을 뜯어내려 하면, 뭐, 마지막 재미도 사라져. 겁쟁이라 생각할지 몰라도 일찍 빠져나왔고 후회 없어. 다른 모두처럼 죽는 것 말곤 할"
" 수 있는 게 없었어. 건물 밖으로도 못 나갔어, 군대가 우릴 봉쇄했거든… 그래서 건물에서 가장 안전하고 조용한 빌어먹을 곳으로 갔어."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_3.json
msgid "Where was that?"
msgstr "어디서요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_3.json
msgid ""
"The morgue.  Seems like a dumb place to go at the start of a zombie "
"apocalypse, right?  Thing is, nobody had made it to the morgue in quite a "
"while, the bodies were reanimating too quickly and the staff were just too "
"busy.  I was shaking and puking and I could see the world was ending…  I "
"bundled myself up, grabbed a few snacks from the pathologist's desk, and "
"crawled into one of those drawers to contemplate the end of the world.  "
"After breaking the handle to make sure it couldn't lock behind me, of "
"course.  It was <very> safe and quiet in there.  Not just my cubby, the "
"whole morgue.  At first it was because nobody was <dumb> enough to come down"
" there except me.  Later, it was because nobody was left."
msgstr ""
"영안실. 좀비 아포칼립스 시작에 가기엔 멍청한 곳 같지? 근데 있잖아, 한참 동안 아무도 영안실에 못 갔어 — 시체가 너무 빨리 "
"되살아났고 직원들은 너무 바빴거든. 난 떨고 토하고 세계가 끝나는 게 보였어… 몸을 움츠리고, 병리학자 책상에서 간식 좀 챙기고, 그 "
"서랍 중 하나로 기어 들어가 세계의 종말을 곱씹었어. 물론 뒤에서 잠기지 않게 손잡이 부순 다음에. 안은 <very> 안전하고 조용했어."
" 내 칸막이뿐 아니라 영안실 전체가. 처음엔 나 말곤 거기 내려올 만큼 <dumb>한 사람이 없어서였어. 나중엔, 남은 사람이 "
"없어서였고."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_3.json
msgid "Clearly you escaped at some point."
msgstr "분명히 어느 순간에 탈출했겠죠."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_3.json
msgid ""
"The door was good heavy steel with no window, and there was a staff room "
"with a fully stocked fridge, so when it became clear that nothing was going "
"to get any better on its own, I set up shop.  I stayed down there for a "
"couple days.  I could hear explosions and screaming for the first while, "
"then just guns and explosions, and then it got <really> quiet.  Eventually, "
"I ran out of snacks, so I worked up the nerve to climb out a window and "
"check out the city by night.  I used that place as a base for a little "
"while, but the area around the hospital was too hot to keep it up, so I made"
" my way out to greener pastures.  And here I am."
msgstr "문이 창문 없는 튼튼한 철문이었고, 직원 휴게실에 음식이 있었어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hospital_3.json
#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_2.json
#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_2.json
#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\rural_1.json
msgid "Thanks for telling me that.  <done_conversation_section>"
msgstr "얘기해줘서 고마워요. <done_conversation_section>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hunter_1.json
msgid ""
"I live way out of town.  I hear the small towns lasted a bit longer than the"
" big cities.  Doesn't matter to me, I was out on my end-of-winter hunting "
"trip, I'd been out of town for a week already.  First clue I had things were"
" going wrong was when I saw a mushroom cloud out near an old abandoned "
"military base, way out in the middle of nowhere.  I didn't think much about "
"that.  Then I was attacked by a demon."
msgstr "마을에서 멀리 살아요. 소도시가 대도시보다 조금 더 오래 버텼다는 말을 들었는데..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hunter_1.json
msgid "A demon?"
msgstr "악마요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hunter_1.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, it was like a …  like a soft shelled crab, with tentacle mouths, and "
"it kept talking in different voices.  I saw it before it saw me, and I "
"capped it with my Remington.  That just pissed it off, but I got another "
"couple shots off while it charged me.  Third or fourth shot took it down.  I"
" figured out shit had hit the fan, somehow.  Headed to my cabin and camped "
"out there for a while, but I had to skip out when a bunch of <zombies> "
"showed up and trashed the place.  I ran into you not much later."
msgstr ""
"응, 그건… 연각 게 같은 거였어, 촉수 입 달리고, 계속 다른 목소리로 얘기했어. 날 보기 전에 내가 봤고 레밍턴으로 쐈어. 그건 "
"빡치게만 했지만 덤벼오는 동안 몇 발 더 쐈어. 세 번째인지 네 번째 발이 쓰러뜨렸지. 어떻게든 똥이 선풍기에 꼈구나 하고 알았어. "
"오두막으로 가서 한동안 야영했는데, <zombies> 무리가 나타나 그곳을 박살 내서 빠져나와야 했어. 얼마 안 지나 널만났지."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hunter_2.json
msgid ""
"My brother and I were out on a hunting trip.  We saw helicopters overhead…  "
"big, military ones, loaded up with crazy high-end military stuff like you "
"only see on TV.  Laser cannons even.  They were heading in the direction of "
"our parent's ranch.  Something about it really shook us up, and we started "
"heading back that way…  we weren't that far off when we saw this huge, "
"floating eyeball appear out of <swear> nowhere.  Ha.  Hard to believe we're "
"in a time where I don't feel like I need to convince you I'm telling the "
"truth."
msgstr ""
"형이랑 사냥 여행 중이었어. 머리 위로 헬리콥터가 보였지… 큰 군용기, TV에서나 볼 법한 미친 고급 군사 장비를 잔뜩 싣고. 레이저 "
"포까지. 부모님 목장 쪽으로 향하고 있었어. 뭔가가 우릴 흔들어놨고 그쪽으로 돌아가기 시작했지… 그리 멀지 않았을 때 이 거대한 떠다니는"
" 눈알이 <swear> 허공에서 나타나는 걸 봤어. 하. 진짜라고 설득 안 해도 되는 시대에 산다는 게 믿기지 않네."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hunter_2.json
msgid ""
"We watched the eyeball just blast one of the Apache choppers with some kind "
"of ray.  The chopper fired back, but it went down.  It was coming right for "
"us…  I veered, got out of the way, but a chunk of the chopper smacked into "
"the bed and our truck did a crazy backflip right off the road.  The impact "
"knocked me out cold.  My brother …  he wasn't so lucky."
msgstr ""
"그 눈알이 일종의 광선으로 아파치 헬리콥터 하나를 그냥 날려버리는 걸 봤어. 헬리콥터가 반격했지만 추락했지. 우리한테 바로 오고 있었어…"
" 핸들 꺾어 피했는데 헬리콥터 조각이 짐칸에 박혀서 트럭이 길 밖으로 미친 듯이 뒤집혔어. 충격에 완전 기절했지. 형은… 운이 없었어."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hunter_2.json
msgid "Oh, no."
msgstr "이런."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hunter_2.json
msgid ""
"Yeah…  the…  the accident got him, but when I came to he was already coming "
"back.  Thank god for seatbelts, right?  He was screeching and flapping "
"around, hanging upside down.  I thought he was just hurt at first, but he "
"just kept coming at me while I tried to talk to him.  His arm was badly hurt"
" already and instead of unbuckling himself he started…  he was ripping it "
"right off pulling against the seatbelt.  That, and the crazy shit with the "
"chopper, was when I realized just how fucked up things had got.  I grabbed "
"my hunting knife and ran, but my brother got out and started crawling after "
"me."
msgstr ""
"응… 그… 사고가 그를 데려갔지만, 내가 깨어났을 때 이미 돌아오고 있었어. 안전벨트에 감사해야지, 응? 비명 지르고 위로 거꾸로 매달려"
" 퍼덕거렸어. 처음엔 그냥 다친 줄 알았는데, 말 걸어보는 동안 계속 나한테 왔어. 팔이 이미 심하게 다쳤는데 벨트 푸는 대신… 벨트에 "
"걸어 팔을 통째로 뜯어내기 시작했어. 그거랑 헬리콥터 미친 일로 일이 얼마나 좆 같아졌는지 깨달았지. 사냥칼 챙기고 뛰었는데 형이 나와서"
" 기어오기 시작했어."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hunter_2.json
msgid "Did you keep running?"
msgstr "그래도 도망쳤나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hunter_2.json
msgid ""
"I ran for a little bit, but then I saw soldier zombies crawling out of that "
"chopper.  They had the same look about them as my brother did, and it was "
"them on one side and him on the other.  I'm no genius but I've seen a few "
"movies: I figured out what was happening.  I didn't want to take on Kevlar "
"armor with my knife, so I turned back and faced the other zombie.  I "
"couldn't let my brother stay…  like that.  So I did what I had to, and I "
"guess I'll live with that forever."
msgstr ""
"조금 뛰다가 그 헬리콥터에서 군인 좀비들이 기어 나오는 걸 봤어. 형이랑 똑같은 눈이었고, 한쪽엔 걔네, 다른 쪽엔 형이었지. 천재는 "
"아니지만 영화 몇 편 본 적 있어: 무슨 일인지 알아챘어. 칼로 케블라 갑옷 상대하긴 싫어서 돌아가 다른 좀비와 맞섰어. 형을… 그렇게 "
"둘 수 없었거든. 그래서 해야 할 걸 했고, 평생 그걸 안고 살 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\hunter_2.json
msgid "Thanks for telling me your story.  <done_conversation_section>"
msgstr "얘기해줘서 고마워요. <done_conversation_section>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lab_1.json
msgid ""
"For me, this started a couple days before <the_cataclysm>.  I'm a "
"biochemist.  I did my postdoc work with a brilliant colleague, Pat Dionne.  "
"I hadn't talked to Pat in ages…  Word has it, the government got wind of our"
" thesis, found out Pat did most of the heavy lifting, and that was the last "
"we talked for years.  So, I was a bit surprised to see an e-mail from "
"Pat.Dionne@FreeMailNow.co.ru…  Even more surprised when it was a series of "
"nostalgic references to a D&D game we played years earlier."
msgstr ""
"나한텐 <the_cataclysm> 며칠 전부터 시작됐어. 생화학자야. 뛰어난 동료 팻 디온과 박사후 과정을 했지. 팻이랑 연락한 지 "
"오래였어… 소문으론, 정부가 우리 논문 냄새를 맡고 팻이 대부분의 무거운 작업을 한 걸 알아냈고, 그게 몇 년간 마지막 대화였어. 그래서"
" Pat.Dionne@FreeMailNow.co.ru에서 온 메일을 보고 좀 놀랐지… 그게 몇 년 전 같이 하던 D&D 게임에 대한 향수"
" 어린 인용 일련이라 더 놀랐어."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lab_1.json
msgid "I don't see where this is going."
msgstr "어디로 가는 건 지 모르겠네요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lab_1.json
msgid ""
"Well, the references weren't quite right.  Pat referred to things that we'd "
"never played.  The situations were close, but not right, and when I put it "
"all together, it told a story.  A story about a scholar whose kids were "
"being held captive by a corrupt government, forced to research dark magic "
"for them.  And there was a clincher: A warning that the magic had escaped, a"
" warning that all heroes had to leave the kingdom before it fell."
msgstr "뭐, 참조 문헌이 좀 이상했어요. 팻이 우리가 전혀 발표하지 않은 것들을 참조했어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lab_1.json
#: data\mods\Arcana_BN\npcs\TALK_CF_REP.json
#: data\mods\Arcana_BN\npcs\TALK_CF_SEEKER.json
msgid "Okay…"
msgstr "알겠어…"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lab_1.json
msgid ""
"Listen, I know it's incredibly cheesy.  That's D&D for you.  Anyway, "
"something about the tone really got to me.  I knew it was important.  I "
"wasted a little time waffling, then decided to use my outstanding vacation "
"time and skip town for a while.  I packed for the end of the world.  Turns "
"out, I packed the right stuff."
msgstr "알아요, 엄청 진부하게 들린다는 거. D&D가 원래 그래요. 어쨌든, 뭔가..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lab_1.json
msgid "Was there anything else of use in that email?"
msgstr "그 이메일에 유용한 게 더 있었나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lab_1.json
msgid ""
"There was, yeah, but it was cryptic.  If I had a copy of Pat's notes, I "
"could probably decipher it, but I'm sure those burned up in <the_cataclysm>."
"  They bombed those labs, you know."
msgstr "있었는데, 암호 같은 내용이었어요. 팻의 노트가 있다면 아마도 해독할 수 있을 거예요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\left_for_dead_1.json
msgid ""
"I was late to evacuate when the shit hit the fan.  Got stuck in town for a "
"few days, survived by hiding in basements eating girl scout cookies and "
"drinking warm root beer.  Eventually I managed to weasel my way out without "
"getting caught by the <zombies>.  I spent a few days holed up in an "
"abandoned mall, but I needed food so I headed out to fend for myself in the "
"woods.  I wasn't doing a great job of it, so I'm kinda glad you showed up."
msgstr "다 개판 됐을 때 대피가 늦었어요. 며칠 동안 마을에 갇혔었어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\left_for_dead_2.json
msgid ""
"I was home with the flu when the world went to shit, and when I recovered "
"enough to make a run to the store for groceries…  Well, I've been running "
"ever since."
msgstr "세상이 똥이 될 때 독감으로 집에 있었어, 그리고 장보러 가게까지 달릴 만큼 회복했을 때… 뭐, 그때부터 계속 달리고 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\left_for_dead_2.json
msgid "Come on, don't leave me hanging."
msgstr "어서, 끊지 말고 얘기해봐요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\left_for_dead_2.json
msgid ""
"Okay, well, I was kinda out of it those first few days.  I knew there were "
"storms, but I was having crazy fever dreams and stuff.  Honestly I probably "
"should have gone to the hospital, except then I guess I'd be dead now.  I "
"don't know what was a dream and what was the world ending.  I remember "
"heading to the fridge for a drink and noticing the light was out and the "
"water was warm, I think that was a bit before my fever broke.  I was still "
"pretty groggy when I ran out of chicken soup, so it took me a while to "
"really process how dark and dead my building was when I headed out."
msgstr "좋아요, 초반 며칠은 정신이 좀 나갔어요. 폭풍이 오는 걸 알고 있었는데..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\left_for_dead_2.json
msgid "What happened when you went out?"
msgstr "나갔을 때 무슨 일이 있었나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\left_for_dead_2.json
msgid ""
"You probably remember what the cities were like.  I think it was about day "
"four.  Once I stepped outside I realized what was going on, or realized I "
"didn't know what was going on at least.  I saw a bunch of rioters smashing a"
" car, and then I noticed one of them was bashing a woman's head in.  I "
"canceled my grocery trip, ran back to my apartment before they saw me, and "
"holed up there for as long as I could.  Things got comparatively quiet as "
"the dead started to outnumber the living, so I started looting what I could "
"from my neighbors, re-killing them when I had to.  Eventually the <zombies> "
"overran my building and I had to climb out and head for the hills on an old "
"bike."
msgstr "아마 도시가 어땠는지 기억할 거예요. 4일째였던 것 같아요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\left_for_dead_2.json
msgid "Thanks for telling me all that.  <end_talking>"
msgstr "다 얘기해줘서 고마워요. <end_talking>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_1.json
msgid ""
"My husband made it out with me, but got eaten by one of those <swear> plant "
"monsters a few days before I met you.  This hasn't been a great year for me."
msgstr "남편이 같이 나왔는데, 그 <swear> 식물 괴물한테 잡아먹혔어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_1.json
msgid ""
"My wife made it out with me, but got eaten by one of those <swear> plant "
"monsters a few days before I met you.  This hasn't been a great year for me."
msgstr "아내가 같이 나왔는데, 그 <swear> 식물 괴물한테 잡아먹혔어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_1.json
msgid "I'm sorry to hear it."
msgstr "안 됐네요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_1.json
msgid "Tell me about those plant monsters."
msgstr "그 식물 괴물들에 대해 얘기해줘요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_1.json
msgid ""
"That's how it goes, you know?  These are the end times.  I don't really want"
" to talk about it more than that.  And honestly, I never really felt like I "
"belonged, in the old world.  In a weird way, I actually feel like I have a "
"purpose now.  Do you ever get that?"
msgstr "다 이렇게 흘러가는 거잖아요, 알죠? 말세예요. 진짜 얘기하기 싫어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_1.json
msgid "No, that's messed up."
msgstr "아니요, 너무 끔찍해요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_1.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, I get that.  Sometimes I feel like my existence began shortly after "
"the Cataclysm."
msgstr "응, 알아. 가끔 내 존재가 대재앙 직후에 시작된 것 같아."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_1.json
msgid ""
"I guess those of us who made it this far have to have made it for a reason, "
"or something.  I don't mean like a religious reason, just…  we're survivors."
msgstr "여기까지 온 우린 이유가 있어서 온 거겠지, 뭐랄까. 종교적 이유란 건 아니고, 그냥… 우린 생존자니까."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_1.json
msgid ""
"Haha, yeah, I can see why you'd think that.  I don't mean it's a good "
"apocalypse.  I just mean that at least now I know what I'm doing every day."
"  I'd still kill a hundred zombies for an internet connection and a night "
"watching crappy movies with…  sorry.  Let's change the subject."
msgstr ""
"하하, 응, 왜 그렇게 생각하는지 알겠어. 좋은 아포칼립스란 뜻이 아니야. 적어도 이제 매일 뭘 하는지 안다는 거야. 그래도 인터넷과 "
"형편없는 영화 보는 밤을 위해 좀비 백 마리는 죽일 수 있어… 미안. 화제 바꾸자."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_1.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, have you seen them yet?  They're these <shitty> walking flowers with a"
" big <swear> stinger in the middle.  They travel in packs.  They hate the "
"zombies, and we were using them for cover to clear a horde of the dead.  "
"Unfortunately, turns out the plants are better trackers than the <zombies>."
"  They almost seemed intelligent…  I barely made it out, only because they "
"were, uh, distracted."
msgstr ""
"응, 본 적 있어? 걸어다니는 <shitty> 꽃들인데 가운데 큰 <swear> 침이 있어. 무리 지어 다녀. 좀비를 미워해서 망자 무리"
" 정리에 엄폐로 썼지. 불행히도, 식물이 <zombies>보다 추적을 더 잘하는 거로 밝혀졌어. 거의 지능 있어 보였지… 겨우 탈출했어,"
" 어, 정신팔린 덕분에."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_1.json
msgid "I'm sorry you lost someone."
msgstr "누군가를 잃어서 미안해요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_2.json
msgid ""
"I said, I don't wanna talk about it.  How are you not understanding this?"
msgstr "그러니까, 하기 싫다고요. 왜 이해를 못 해요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_2.json
msgid ""
"Like I said, it's a <shitty> story, but I guess it won't kill me to tell it "
"one more time."
msgstr "말했듯이, <shitty> 얘기이지만 한 번 더 하는 게 죽지는 않겠죠..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_2.json
msgid "Just another <shitty> tale of love and loss.  Not one I like to tell."
msgstr "그냥 또 하나의 <shitty> 사랑과 상실의 이야기예요. 말하기 좋아하는 얘기가 아니에요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_2.json
msgid "You said you lost someone."
msgstr "누군가를 잃었다고 했잖아요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_2.json
msgid "Never mind.  Sorry I brought it up."
msgstr "아무것도 아니에요. 꺼낸 것에 대해 미안해요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_2.json
msgid "I appreciate the sentiment, but I don't think it would.  Drop it."
msgstr "감사하지만, 그럴 것 같지 않아요. 그냥 덮어둬요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_2.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
msgid "OK."
msgstr "알겠어요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_2.json
msgid ""
"Oh, <fuck_you>.  This doesn't have anything to do with you, or with us."
msgstr "어, <fuck_you>. 이건 당신과도, 우리 사이와도 관계없어요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_2.json
msgid "All right, fine.  I had someone.  I lost him."
msgstr "알겠어요, 좋아요. 누군가 있었어요. 잃었어요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_2.json
msgid "All right, fine.  I had someone.  I lost her."
msgstr "알겠어요, 좋아요. 누군가 있었어요. 잃었어요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_2.json
msgid ""
"He was at home when the bombs started dropping and the world went to hell.  "
"I was at work.  I tried to make it to our house, but the city was a war "
"zone.  Things I can't describe lurching through the streets, crushing people"
" and cars.  Soldiers trying to stop them, but hitting people in the "
"crossfire as much as anything.  And then the collateral damage would get "
"right back up and join the enemy.  If it hadn't been for my husband, I would"
" have just left, but I did what I could and I slipped through.  I actually "
"<swear> made it alive."
msgstr "폭탄이 떨어지고 세상이 지옥이 됐을 때 그는 집에 있었어요. 나는..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_2.json
msgid ""
"She was at home when the bombs started dropping and the world went to hell."
"  I was at work.  I tried to make it to our house, but the city was a war "
"zone.  Things I can't describe lurching through the streets, crushing people"
" and cars.  Soldiers trying to stop them, but hitting people in the "
"crossfire as much as anything.  And then the collateral damage would get "
"right back up and join the enemy.  If it hadn't been for my wife, I would "
"have just left, but I did what I could and I slipped through.  I actually "
"<swear> made it alive."
msgstr "폭탄이 떨어지고 세상이 지옥이 됐을 때 그녀는 집에 있었어요. 나는..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_2.json
msgid "You must have seen some shit."
msgstr "꽤 많은 걸 봤겠네요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_2.json
msgid "I take it home was bad."
msgstr "집이 안 좋았던 것 같네요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_2.json
msgid ""
"Yeah.  I really did.  It took me two days to make it across the city on "
"foot, camping out in dumpsters and places like that.  I started moving more "
"by night, and I learned right away to avoid the military.  They were a "
"magnet for the <zombies>, and they were usually stationed where the monsters"
" were coming.  Some parts of the city were pretty tame at first.  There were"
" a few chunks where people had been evacuated or cleared out, and the "
"<zombies> didn't really go there.  Later on, others like me started moving "
"into those neighborhoods, so I switched and started running through the "
"blasted out downtown.  I had to anyway, to get home.  By the time I made the"
" switch though, the fighting was starting to die off, and I was mostly just "
"avoiding attention from zombies and other things."
msgstr "맞아요. 정말요. 이틀이 걸렸어요, 도시 반대편을 도보로, 이것저것 피하면서..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_2.json
msgid ""
"The first warning was that I had to move from the preserved parts of the "
"city to the burnt out ones to get home.  It only got worse.  There was a "
"police barricade right outside my house, with a totally useless pair of "
"automated turrets sitting in front just idly watching the zombies lurch by."
"  That was before someone switched them to kill everybody, back when it only"
" killed trespassing humans.  Good times, you can always trust bureaucracy to"
" fuck things up in the most spectacular way possible.  Anyway, the house "
"itself was half collapsed, a SWAT van had plowed into it.  I think I knew "
"what I was going to see in there, but I had made it that far and I wasn't "
"going to turn back."
msgstr "처음 경고는 도시의 보존된 부분에서 나가야 한다는 거였어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_2.json
msgid "You must have seen some shit on the way there."
msgstr "가는 길에 꽤 많은 걸 봤겠네요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_2.json
msgid "Did you make it into the house?"
msgstr "집에 들어갔나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_2.json
msgid ""
"I did.  Took a few hours to get an opening.  And you wanna know the fucked "
"up part?  Like, out of all this?  My husband was still alive.  He'd been in "
"the basement the whole time, pinned under a collapsed piece of floor.  And "
"he'd lost a ton of blood, he was delirious by the time I found him.  I "
"couldn't get him out, so I gave him food and water and just stayed with him "
"and held his hand until he passed.  And then…  well, then I did what you "
"have to do to the dead now.  And then I packed up the last few fragments of "
"my life, and I try to never look back."
msgstr ""
"그랬어. 빠져나갈 틈 찾는 데 몇 시간 걸렸어. 그리고 이 모든 것 중 제일 좆 같은 부분 알아? 남편이 아직 살아있었어. 내내 지하실에"
" 있었고, 무너진 바닥 조각 밑에 깔려 있었지. 피를 엄청 흘려서 찾았을 땐 섬망 상태였어. 꺼내줄 수 없어서 음식과 물을 주고, 죽을 "
"때까지 곁에서 손잡아줬어. 그리고… 뭐, 이제 망자에게 해야 할 걸 했어. 그리고 인생의 마지막 조각 몇 개를 챙기고, 뒤돌아보지 않으려"
" 해."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\lost_partner_2.json
msgid ""
"I did.  Took a few hours to get an opening.  And you wanna know the fucked "
"up part?  Like, out of all this?  My wife was still alive.  She'd been in "
"the basement the whole time, pinned under a collapsed piece of floor.  And "
"she'd lost a ton of blood, she was delirious by the time I found her.  I "
"couldn't get her out, so I gave her food and water and just stayed with her "
"and held her hand until she passed.  And then…  well, then I did what you "
"have to do to the dead now.  And then I packed up the last few fragments of "
"my life, and I try to never look back."
msgstr ""
"그랬어. 빠져나갈 틈 찾는 데 몇 시간 걸렸어. 그리고 이 모든 것 중 제일 좆 같은 부분 알아? 아내가 아직 살아있었어. 내내 지하실에"
" 있었고, 무너진 바닥 조각 밑에 깔려 있었지. 피를 엄청 흘려서 찾았을 땐 섬망 상태였어. 꺼내줄 수 없어서 음식과 물을 주고, 죽을 "
"때까지 곁에서 손잡아줬어. 그리고… 뭐, 이제 망자에게 해야 할 걸 했어. 그리고 인생의 마지막 조각 몇 개를 챙기고, 뒤돌아보지 않으려"
" 해."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\nerd_1.json
msgid ""
"I was at school for <the_cataclysm>.  Funny thing, actually: I was gearing "
"up to run a zombie survival RPG with my friends on the weekend.  Ha, I "
"didn't think it'd turn into a LARP!  Okay…  No, that wasn't funny."
msgstr ""
"<the_cataclysm> 때 학교에 있었어. 사실 웃긴 건: 주말에 친구들이랑 좀비 서바이벌 RPG 하려고 준비 중이었어. 하, "
"라프가 될 줄은 몰랐지! 알겠어… 아니, 안 웃겼다."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\nerd_1.json
msgid "How did you survive school?"
msgstr "학교에서 어떻게 살아남았나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\nerd_1.json
msgid ""
"Well, I may be a huge <swear> nerd, but I'm not an idiot.  Plus I'm genre "
"savvy.  We'd already heard about people coming back from the dead, actually "
"that's why I was doing the RPG.  When the cops came to put the school on "
"lockdown I managed to slip out the back.  I live a long way out of town, but"
" there was no way I was going to take a bus home, so I walked.  Two hours.  "
"Heard a lot of sirens, and I even saw jets overhead.  It was getting late "
"when I got back, but my mom and dad weren't back from work yet.  I stayed "
"there, hoping they'd come.  I sent texts but got no reply.  After a few "
"days, well…  The news got worse and worse, then it stopped completely."
msgstr ""
"뭐, 거대한 <swear> 덕후일지 몰라도 멍청이는 아니야. 게다가 장르 감각이 있지. 죽은 사람이 돌아온다는 얘길 이미 들었거든, 사실"
" 그래서 RPG 하던 거야. 경찰이 와서 학교 봉쇄할 때 뒤로 빠져나왔어. 마을에서 멀리 사는데 집에 버스 탈 방법이 없어서 걸었지. 두"
" 시간. 사이렌 많이 들었고 제트기도 봤어. 돌아왔을 땐 늦었지만 부모님이 아직 퇴근 안 했어. 오길 바라며 기다렸지. 문자 보냈지만 "
"답이 없었어. 며칠 후엔, 뭐… 뉴스가 점점 나빠지더니 완전히 멈췄어."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\nerd_1.json
msgid "What about your parents?"
msgstr "부모님은요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\nerd_1.json
msgid "What got you out of there?"
msgstr "거기서 뭐가 나오게 했나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\nerd_1.json
msgid ""
"I'm not stupid.  I know they're gone.  Who knows where…  Maybe in an evac "
"shelter, maybe in a FEMA camp.  Most of everyone is dead."
msgstr "멍청이 아니야. 간 건 알아. 어디 있는진 누가 알아… 대피소일 수도, FEMA 캠프일 수도. 대부분은 죽었어."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\nerd_1.json
msgid "What got you out of the house?"
msgstr "집에서 뭐가 나오게 했나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\nerd_1.json
msgid ""
"Eventually the zombies came.  I figured they would.  Before the net cut out,"
" there were plenty of videos online making it clear enough what was going "
"on.  I'd picked out some good gear and loaded my bag up with supplies…  When"
" they started knocking at the door, I slipped out the back and took to the "
"street.  And here I am."
msgstr ""
"결국 좀비가 왔어. 올 줄 알았지. 네트워크 끊기기 전에 무슨 일인지 충분히 보여주는 영상이 온라인에 많았거든. 좋은 장비 골라 가방에 "
"보급품 챙겨뒀고… 놈들이 문 두드리기 시작하자 뒤로 빠져나가 길로 나섰어. 그리고 여기 있지."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\no_past_1.json
msgid ""
"Before <the_cataclysm>?  Who cares about that?  This is a new world, and "
"yeah, it's pretty <shitty>.  It's the one we've got though, so let's not "
"dwell in the past when we should be making the best of what little we have "
"left."
msgstr "<the_cataclysm> 전에요? 누가 신경 써요? 이게 새로운 세상이고, 그래요, 최악이지만..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\no_past_1.json
msgid "I can respect that."
msgstr "그 말이 이해가 돼요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\no_past_2.json
msgid ""
"To be honest…  I don't really remember.  I remember vague details of my life"
" before the world was like this, but <the_cataclysm> itself?  It's all a "
"blur.  I don't know how I got where I am now, or how any of this happened.  "
"I think something pretty bad must have happened to me.  Or maybe I was just "
"hit in the head really hard.  Or both.  Both seems likely."
msgstr ""
"솔직히… 잘 기억 안 나. 세계가 이렇게 되기 전 인생의 희릿한 디테일은 기억하는데 <the_cataclysm> 자체는? 전부 흐릿해. "
"어떻게 지금 여기 왔는지, 이 모든 게 어떻게 일어났는지 몰라. 꽤 나쁜 일이 있었던 것 같아. 아니면 그냥 머리를 세게 맞았거나. 둘 "
"다일 수도. 둘 다가 그럴듯해."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\no_past_3.json
msgid ""
"This is gonna sound crazy, but I woke up in the forest in the middle of "
"nowhere, freezing cold, about a week before I met you.  I had my clothes, a "
"splitting headache, and absolutely no memory of anything.  Like, I know "
"stuff.  I can talk, I have skills and understanding… but I don't remember "
"where any of it comes from.  I had a driver's license in my pocket and "
"that's the only way I even know my name."
msgstr ""
"미친 소리 같겠지만, 널 만나기 일주일쯤 전에 외딴 숲에서 꽁꽁 얼며 깨어났어. 옷, 깨질 듯한 두통, 그리고 아무것도 없는 기억이 "
"있었어. 그러니까, 난 아는 게 있어. 말할 수 있고, 기술과 이해도 있어… 근데 그게 다 어디서 왔는지 기억 안 나. 주머니에 "
"운전면허증이 있었고 그게 유일하게 내 이름을 아는 방법이야."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\no_past_3.json
msgid "What do you think happened?"
msgstr "어떻게 된 것 같아요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\no_past_3.json
msgid "That does sound a little crazy…"
msgstr "그건 좀 미친 소리 같네…"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\no_past_3.json
msgid ""
"There were some clues.  Like, I had a nasty headache that lasted a few days,"
" but no cuts or bruises.  And there were scorch marks on the trees in weird "
"slashing patterns around me.  Whatever happened to me, I think it was some "
"weird shit."
msgstr "단서가 좀 있었어요. 며칠 간 두통이 지독했는데..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\no_past_3.json
msgid "Are you trying to get your memory back then?"
msgstr "기억을 되찾으려는 건가요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\no_past_3.json
msgid ""
"Well, not having a memory is weird as heck, but I'll be honest: I think it "
"might be better?  With what's going on, I bet you my memories weren't happy "
"ones.  Besides my driver's license, there were pictures of kids in my "
"wallet… not that that sparked any reaction from me.  I didn't see any kids "
"around.  Maybe losing my mind is a mercy.  Hell, maybe it's some kind of "
"psychotic break and my brain did this to itself.  To be honest with you I "
"think I'd rather focus on surviving, and not worry about it."
msgstr ""
"뭐, 기억 없는 건 이상하긴 한데, 솔직히 말하면: 나을지도? 지금 상황으로 봐선 내 기억이 행복한 건 아니었을 거야. 운전면허증 말고 "
"지갑에 애들 사진이 있었어… 뭐, 그게 내 반응을 일으키진 않았지만. 주변에 애들은 안 보였어. 정신 나간 게 자비일지도. 젠장, 어쩌면"
" 일종의 정신병적 붕괴로 뇌가 스스로 이런 걸지도. 솔직히 말하면 생존에 집중하고 걱정 안 하는 게 나을 것 같아."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\no_past_3.json
msgid ""
"I know it's nuts.  It sounds like fake amnesia from a Bugs Bunny cartoon.  "
"See?  How can I know that, but not remember how I know it?  Like, I remember"
" Bugs Bunny but I don't remember any time I sat down and watched a Bugs "
"Bunny show."
msgstr "미친 소리인 거 알아요. 버그스 버니 만화 같은 가짜 기억 상실처럼 들리죠. 맞아요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\no_past_4.json
msgid ""
"Who I was is gone.  All that stuff burned away in <the_cataclysm>.  Got it?"
"  Who I am now started two days into it.  I was on the run from a big-ass "
"hell zombie, running like I'd always been doing, when I found a steel "
"baseball bat just laying on the ground.  I took it as a sign and beat that "
"gooey bastard to a pulp… and that's when I became me.  I still run, because "
"who doesn't, but I stand my ground now."
msgstr ""
"예전의 난 갔어. 그 모든 게 <the_cataclysm>에서 타버렸어. 알겠어? 지금의 난 그것 이틀째에 시작됐어. 존나 큰 지옥 "
"좀비한테 도망치고 있었어, 항상 하던 대로, 그러다 땅에 놓인 철제 야구방망이를 발견했어. 징조로 받아들이고 그 끈적한 자식을 걸레로 "
"만들었지… 그때 내가 나가 됐어. 아직도 뛰긴 해, 안 하는 사람 있냐만, 이제 자리를 지켜."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\no_past_4.json
msgid "What happened to you after that?"
msgstr "그 뒤에 어떻게 됐나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\no_past_4.json
msgid "It can't be healthy to abandon your past like that…"
msgstr "그렇게 과거를 버리는 건 건강하지 않아…"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\no_past_4.json
msgid ""
"I went on, running when I had to and fighting when I could, like the rest of"
" us.  Started learning who I am now.  Lost the bat in a fight against some "
"crazy electric lightning shooting zombie.  It was arcing electricity through"
" my bat so I dropped it and used a nearby two-by-four, but I wound up having"
" to run and leave the ol' slugger behind.  I nearly died that day."
msgstr "계속 나아갔어요, 필요할 때 뛰고 할 수 있을 때 싸우면서, 우리 모두처럼요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\no_past_4.json
msgid ""
"Listen.  I said it clearly, and if you keep picking at it I'm gonna get mad."
"  Who I was is gone.  Dead.  I don't give a shit about your 'healthy', don't"
" <swear> ask again."
msgstr "분명히 말했는데, 계속 건드리면 화낼 거예요. 이건 왜..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\no_past_5.json
msgid ""
"Let's not talk about it, ok?  It just hurts to think about.  I've lost so "
"many people… and I'm sure you have too.  Let's focus on the here and now."
msgstr "얘기하지 말자, 응? 생각만 해도 아파. 많은 사람을 잃었어… 너도 그랬을 거야. 지금 여기에 집중하자."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\no_past_5.json
msgid "I can respect that.  <done_conversation_section>"
msgstr "이해해요. <done_conversation_section>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\no_past_5.json
msgid "Fair enough.  <end_talking>"
msgstr "알겠어요. <end_talking>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\out_of_town_1.json
msgid ""
"I didn't even know about <the_cataclysm> right away.  I was way out, away "
"from the worst of it.  My car broke down out on the highway, and I was "
"waiting for a tow for hours.  I finally wound up camping in the bushes off "
"the side of the road; good thing, too, because a semi truck whipped by - "
"dead driver, you know - and turned my car into a skid mark.  I feel bad for "
"the bastards that were in the cities when it hit."
msgstr "<the_cataclysm>에 대해 바로 알지 못 했어요. 멀리, 도시에서 떨어진 곳에 있었어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\out_of_town_1.json
msgid "How did you survive outside?"
msgstr "어떻게 밖에서 살아남았나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\out_of_town_1.json
msgid "What did you see in those first few days?"
msgstr "첫 며칠에 뭘 봤나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\out_of_town_1.json
msgid ""
"Ha, I don't fully understand it myself.  Those first few days were a tough "
"time to be outside, that's for sure.  I got caught in one of those hellish "
"rainstorms, it started to burn my skin right off.  I managed to take shelter"
" under a car, lying on top of my tent.  Wrecked the damn thing, but better "
"it than me.  From what I hear, though, I got lucky.  That was pretty much "
"the worst I saw.  I didn't run into any of those demon-monsters that I hear "
"attacked the cities, so I guess I got off lucky."
msgstr "하, 나도 완전히 이해 못 해요. 처음 며칠이 힘든 시간이었어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\out_of_town_1.json
msgid ""
"Besides the acid rain, I mostly saw people fleeing the cities.  I tried to "
"stay away from the roads, but I didn't want to get lost in the woods either,"
" so I stuck to the deep margins.  I saw cars, buses, trucks loaded down with"
" evacuees.  Plenty went right on, but a lot stalled out of gas and other "
"stuff.  Some were so full of gear and people there were folks hanging off "
"them.  Stalling out was a death sentence, because the dead were coming along"
" the roads picking off the survivors."
msgstr "산성비 말고는, 주로 도시를 탈출하는 사람들을 봤어요. 거리를 두려 했는데..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\out_of_town_2.json
msgid ""
"I was out on a fishing trip with my friend when it happened.  I don't know "
"exactly how the days line up…  our first clue that Armageddon had come was "
"when we got blasted by some kind of poison wind, with a sort of acid mist in"
" it that burnt our eyes and skin.  We weren't sure what to make of it so we "
"went inside to rest up, and while we were in there a weird dust settled over"
" everything."
msgstr ""
"친구랑 낚시 여행 중에 일어났어. 날짜가 어떻게 맞는지 정확히 몰라… 아마겟돈이 온 첫 단서는 일종의 산성 안개를 섞은 독풍에 맞았을 "
"때였어 — 눈과 피부가 탔지. 뭔지 몰라서 안에 들어가 쉬었는데, 있는 동안 이상한 먼지가 모든 걸 덮었어."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\out_of_town_2.json
msgid "What happened after the acid mist?"
msgstr "산성 안개 이후에 어떻게 됐나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\out_of_town_2.json
msgid ""
"By morning, the area around the lake was covered in a pinkish mold, and "
"there were walking mushrooms around shooting clouds of the dust in the air."
"  We didn't know what was going on, but neither of us wanted to stay and "
"find out.  We packed up our shit, scraped off the boat, and took off "
"upriver."
msgstr "아침이 되자, 호수 주변이 분홍 곰팡이로 덮이고, 사람들이..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\out_of_town_2.json
msgid "What happened to your friend?"
msgstr "친구에게 무슨 일이 있었나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\out_of_town_2.json
msgid ""
"She took sick a few hours after we left the lake.  Puking, complaining about"
" her joints hurting.  I took us to a little shop I knew about on the "
"riverside, hoping they might have something to help or at least know what "
"was going on."
msgstr "호수를 떠난 지 몇 시간 후에 아프기 시작했어요. 토하고, 두통 호소하고..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\out_of_town_2.json
msgid "I guess they didn't know."
msgstr "그들이 몰랐겠죠."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\out_of_town_2.json
msgid ""
"The shop was empty, actually.  She was desperate though, so I broke in.  I "
"found out more about the chaos in towns from the store radio.  Got my friend"
" some painkillers and gravol, but when I came out to the boat, well…  it was"
" too late for her."
msgstr ""
"가게는 사실 비어 있었어. 그녀가 다급해서 침입했지. 가게 라디오로 마을 혼란을 더 알게 됐어. 친구한테 진통제랑 그래볼을 구해줬는데, "
"배로 나왔을 때, 뭐… 그녀에겐 너무 늦었어."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\out_of_town_2.json
msgid "She was dead?"
msgstr "죽어 있었나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\out_of_town_2.json
msgid ""
"I wish.  That would have been a mercy.  She was letting out an awful, "
"choking scream, and her body was shredding itself apart.  Mushrooms were "
"busting out of every part of her.  I…  I ran.  Now I wish that I'd put her "
"out of her misery, but going back there now would be suicide."
msgstr ""
"그랬으면 좋겠어. 그게 자비였을 텐데. 그녀가 끔찍하고 숨막히는 비명을 내고, 몸이 스스로 찢기고 있었어. 버섯이 몸 구석구석에서 터져 "
"나왔지. 난… 난 도망쳤어. 이제 고통에서 보내줬으면 좋았을 걸 하지만, 지금 돌아가는 건 자살이야."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\out_of_town_2.json
msgid "That's awful.  <done_conversation_section>"
msgstr "끔찍하네요. <done_conversation_section>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\out_of_town_2.json
msgid "That's awful.  <end_talking>"
msgstr "끔찍하네요. <end_talking>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"Ooooh, boy.  I was ready for this.  The winds were blowing this way for "
"years.  I had a full last man on earth shelter set up just out of town.  So,"
" of course, just my luck: I was miles out of town for a work conference when"
" China attacked and the world ended."
msgstr "오오오, 이건 준비가 됐어요. 이런 바람이 몇 년 전부터 불었으니까요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_1.json
msgid "What happened to you?"
msgstr "무슨 일이 있었나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_1.json
msgid "What about your shelter?"
msgstr "피신처는요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"Our conference was at a retreat by a lake.  We all got the emergency "
"broadcast on our cells, but I was the only one to read between the lines and"
" see it for what it was: large scale bio-terrorism.  I wasn't about to stay "
"and find out who of my coworkers was a sleeper agent.  Although I'd bet "
"fifty bucks it was Lee.  Anyway, I stole the co-ordinator's pickup and "
"headed straight for my shelter."
msgstr "회의가 호숫가 휴양지에서 있었어요. 모두 긴급 방송을 받았어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_1.json
msgid "Did you get there?"
msgstr "거기 갔나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"No, I barely got two miles.  I crashed into some kind of hell-spawn chink "
"bio-weapon, a crazy screeching <monster> made of arms and legs and heads "
"from all sorts of creatures, humans too.  I think I killed it, but I know "
"for sure I killed the truck.  Grabbed my duffel bag and ran, after putting a"
" couple bullets into it for good measure.  I hope I never see something like"
" that again."
msgstr "아니요, 2마일도 못 가서 사고를 쳤어요. 지옥에서 나온 생체 무기에..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"I still haven't made it there.  Every time I've tried I've been headed off "
"by the <zombies>.  Who knows, maybe someday."
msgstr "아직도 거기 못 갔어요. 갈 때마다 그 지역 방어선에 막혀서..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_1.json
msgid "Could you tell me that story again?"
msgstr "그 얘기 다시 해줄 수 있어요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_2.json
msgid ""
"Oh, man.  I thought I was ready.  I had it all planned out.  Bug out bags.  "
"Loaded guns.  Maps of escape routes.  Bunker in the back yard."
msgstr "어, 맞아요. 준비가 됐다고 생각했어요. 다 계획해놨었어요. 비상 배낭, 장전된..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_2.json
msgid "Sounds like it didn't work out."
msgstr "잘 안 됐나봐요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_2.json
msgid "Hey, I'd really be interested in seeing those maps."
msgstr "이봐요, 그 지도 정말 보고 싶어요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_2.json
msgid ""
"Depends on your definition.  I'm alive, aren't I?  When Hell itself came "
"down from the skies and monsters started attacking the cities, I grabbed my "
"stuff and crammed into the bunker.  My surface cameras stayed online for "
"days; I could see everything happening up there.  I watched those things "
"stride past.  I still have nightmares about the way their bodies moved, like"
" they broke the world just to be here.  I had nothing better to do.  I "
"watched them rip up the cops and the military, watched the dead rise back up"
" and start fighting the living.  I watched the nice old lady down the street"
" rip the head off my neighbor's dog.  I saw a soldier's body twitch and grow"
" into some kind of electrified hulk beast.  I watched it all happen."
msgstr "정의 나름이죠. 살아있잖아요, 그렇죠? 지옥 자체가 내려왔을 때..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_2.json
msgid "Why did you leave your bunker?"
msgstr "왜 벙커를 떠났나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_2.json
msgid ""
"Honestly?  I was planning to die.  After what I'd seen, I went a little "
"crazy.  I thought it was over for sure, I figured there was no point in "
"fighting it.  I thought I wouldn't last a minute out here, but I couldn't "
"bring myself to end it down there.  I headed out, planning to let the "
"<zombies> finish me off, but what can I say?  Survival instinct is a funny "
"thing, and I killed the ones outside the bunker.  I guess the adrenaline was"
" what I needed.  It's kept me going since then."
msgstr "솔직히요? 죽으려 했어요. 본 것들로 인해 조금 미쳤었어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_2.json
msgid "Thanks for telling me that.  <end_talking>"
msgstr "얘기해줘서 고마워요. <end_talking>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_2.json
msgid "And I'd really be interested if you'd <swear> drop it already."
msgstr "그리고 이제 <swear> 그만두면 정말 관심 있을 것 같은데."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_2.json
msgid ""
"No offense, but there's no guarantee you won't be ripped apart by <zombies> "
"tomorrow, and I'd rather have the map on me when that happends."
msgstr ""
"무례하게 듣지 마, 근데 내일 <zombies>한테 찢기지 않을 보장이 없잖아, 그 일이 생기면 지도는 내가 갖고 있는 게 낫고."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_2.json
msgid ""
"That's what you said last time, and it's already been a week.  We're "
"parners, are we not?  Partners help each other."
msgstr "지난번에도 그렇게 말했잖아, 벌써 일주일이야. 우린 파트너지, 안 그래? 파트너는 서로 도와."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_2.json
msgid "Whatever's in that map benefits both of us."
msgstr "그 지도에 있는 건 우리 둘 다에게 이득이에요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_2.json
msgid "How 'bout you <swear> hand it over and I don't get <swear> pissed off?"
msgstr "<swear> 건네지 않으면 화낼 거예요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_2.json
msgid "Sorry for changing the subject.  What was it you were saying?"
msgstr "주제를 바꿔서 미안해요. 아까 뭐라고 했죠?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_2.json
msgid "You're right.  Here they are."
msgstr "맞아. 여기 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_2.json
msgid "Thanks!  <done_conversation_section>"
msgstr "감사해요! <done_conversation_section>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_2.json
msgid "Thanks!  <end_talking>"
msgstr "감사해요! <end_talking>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_2.json
msgid ""
"Nice try.  But tell you what: if you're capable enough to stay alive through"
" the week, I'll consider it."
msgstr "잘한 시도야. 근데 이렇게 하자: 이번 주를 살아남을 만큼 유능하면 고려해볼게."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_2.json
msgid "I'll hold you to this."
msgstr "이 말 책임지게 할게."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_2.json
msgid "Nice try.  You want the maps, you'll have to make your own."
msgstr "잘한 시도야. 지도 원하면 네가 만들어."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prepper_2.json
msgid "Alright, alright, take it.  Fuck..."
msgstr "알았어, 알았어, 가져. 젠장…"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prisoner_1.json
msgid "I was in jail for <the_cataclysm>, but I escaped.  Hell of a story."
msgstr "재앙 때 감옥에 있었는데 탈출했어요. 대단한 얘기예요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prisoner_1.json
msgid "So tell me this 'hell of a story'"
msgstr "그 '대단한 얘기' 해봐요"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prisoner_1.json
msgid "What were you in for?"
msgstr "무슨 죄로요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prisoner_1.json
msgid ""
"That's a story in itself, my friend.  I had one of the largest grow-ops on "
"the Eastern seaboard.  Hah, the stories I could tell you… but I won't.  "
"That's all way behind me."
msgstr ""
"그것 자체가 이야기야, 친구. 동부 해안 최대급 재배업 중 하나였어. 하, 해줄 수 있는 얘기들… 근데 안 해. 전부 지나간 일이야."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prisoner_1.json
msgid ""
"It's a bit of a … it's a thing.  It started out as a dare.  I wound up "
"making a bioweapon.  It didn't get used or anything, but, well, it got out "
"of hand."
msgstr "좀… 그런 거야. 내기로 시작했어. 결국 생물병기를 만들었지. 쓰이진 않았지만, 뭐, 걷잡을 수 없게 됐어."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prisoner_1.json
msgid ""
"Tax evasion.  I was an accountant, and I helped my boss move a hell of a lot"
" of money in some very clever ways.  Not clever enough, it turns out..."
msgstr "탈세요. 회계사였는데, 상사가 엄청난 돈을 이동하는 걸 도왔어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prisoner_1.json
msgid ""
"This sounds a lot cooler than it is: possession of an unlicensed nuclear "
"accelerator."
msgstr "이게 이것보다 훨씬 멋있게 들리는데: 무허가 핵 가속기 소지요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prisoner_1.json
msgid ""
"I got a little bit into black market organ trading.  It sounds worse than it"
" was… but it was pretty bad."
msgstr "암시장 장기 거래에 좀 발 담갰어. 들리는 것보다 안 나빴어… 근데 꽤 나빴어."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prisoner_1.json
msgid "Multiple counts of possession.  I used to be really hung up on meth."
msgstr "마약 소지 여러 건. 필로폰에 엄청 빠져 있었어요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prisoner_1.json
msgid ""
"Assault charges.  I really don't want to get into it, let's just say that "
"you don't want to talk during a movie around me okay?"
msgstr "폭행죄요. 자세히 말하기 싫어요, 그냥 아는 사람은 주먹 맞아도 된다고 알아두세요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prisoner_1.json
msgid ""
"You know, I don't really want to say anymore.  It's all behind me, and I'd "
"like to keep it that way."
msgstr "그냥 더 이상 말하기 싫어요. 다 옛날 얘기고, 지나간 일로 두고 싶어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prisoner_1.json
msgid ""
"Okay, well, I was in the wrong place at the wrong time.  There was a big "
"fight, I didn't stay clear of it, and me and a bunch of others got tossed in"
" solitary while a few more landed in the infirmary.  Some looked pretty bad,"
" now I kinda wonder if any of them were our first <zombies>."
msgstr "뭐, 엉뚱한 때에 엉뚱한 장소에 있었어요. 큰 싸움이 있었는데..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prisoner_1.json
msgid "How did you get out of lockup?"
msgstr "어떻게 독방에서 나왔나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prisoner_1.json
msgid ""
"I heard gunshots, even from down in lockup.  Didn't hear much screaming or "
"anything.  That was my first clue something was up.  Food stopped showing "
"up, next.  Then, the lights went out.  I was down there for maybe hours, "
"maybe days, when finally a flashlight in the bars blinded me.  It was a "
"guard.  He let me out, filled me in on what was going on.  I wanted to think"
" he was crazy, but something in his eyes… I believed him."
msgstr ""
"유치장 아래에서도 총소리가 들렸어. 비명이나 뭔가는 별로 못 들었어. 뭔가 있다는 첫 단서였지. 다음엔 음식이 안 나왔어. 그다음, 불이"
" 나갔고. 몇 시간인지 며칠인지 아래 있다가, 마침내 철창 너머 손전등에 눈이 멀었어. 간수였지. 날 풀어주고 무슨 일인지 얘기해줬어. "
"미쳤다고 생각하고 싶었는데, 눈빛 속 뭔가가… 믿었어."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prisoner_1.json
msgid "What did you do from there?"
msgstr "그 다음에 어떻게 했나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prisoner_1.json
msgid ""
"We let out the others in solitary.  We were stuck in, the guard bots had "
"gone haywire and wouldn't let anyone out, and the rest of the people except "
"this one guard had turned.  We spent a few days pulping <zombies> and trying"
" to figure a safe way past the bots.  Food was running short.  Finally we "
"picked the worst, only plan we could think of: we dragged some storage "
"lockers to the entry hall, used them as shields, and pushed them until we "
"were close enough to take out the bots' sensors with our weapons."
msgstr "독방의 다른 사람들을 풀어줬어요. 경비 봇들이 잠겨 버렸는데..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prisoner_1.json
msgid "Did that actually work?"
msgstr "그게 실제로 먹혔나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prisoner_1.json
msgid ""
"It worked better than I'd imagined, honestly.  We thought the bots would "
"shoot the lockers but I guess they mistook us for family.  There were six of"
" us and four of them, and four of us made it out."
msgstr "상상보다 잘 됐어요, 솔직히. 봇들이 우리를 쏠 거라 생각했는데..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prisoner_1.json
msgid "What happened to the others that made it?"
msgstr "살아남은 다른 사람들은 어떻게 됐나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\prisoner_1.json
msgid ""
"The guard took off on his own.  Didn't trust us, and I don't blame him.  The"
" other two wanted to set up a bandit gig.  Didn't sit right with me, so I "
"split on pretty good terms.  I ran into the guard a couple more times.  "
"Thought of seeing if he'd travel with me, but I dunno.  I don't think he'd "
"take the offer, I'll always be a con to him.  If you want to try, I can tell"
" you where I saw him last.  Wasn't long before I met you, and he had a good "
"thing going, might still be there."
msgstr "경비는 혼자 떠났어요. 우리를 믿지 않았고, 탓할 수 없어요. 나머지..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\professor_1.json
msgid ""
"I'm actually a chemistry professor at Harvard.  I'd been on sabbatical for "
"the last six months.  I can't imagine the university was a good place to be,"
" given what I've heard about Boston…  I'm not sure anyone made it out.  I "
"was out at my cabin near Chatham, ostensibly working on the finishing "
"touches for a paper, but mostly just sipping whisky and thanking my lucky "
"stars for tenure.  Those were good days.  Then came <the_cataclysm>, the "
"military convoys, the <zombies>.  My cabin was crushed by a <monster>, just "
"collateral damage after it got blasted off Orleans by a tank.  I was already"
" busy running frantically by then."
msgstr ""
"사실 하버드 화학 교수야. 지난 반 년간 안식년이었어. 보스턴 얘길 들으니 대학이 좋은 곳이었을 것 같진 않아… 빠져나간 사람이 있을지 "
"모르겠어. 채텀 근처 오두막에 있었어, 겉으론 논문 마무리 작업이지만 사실 위스키나 홀짝이며 종신직 운에 감사하고 있었지. 좋은 "
"날들이었어. 그리고 <the_cataclysm>이 오고, 군사 행렬, <zombies>. 내 오두막은 <monster>한테 짓눌렸어 — "
"탱크에 맞아 올리언스에서 날아온 부수적 피해였지. 그때 이미 미친 듯이 뛰는 중이었어."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\professor_1.json
#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scientist_2.json
msgid ""
"Do you think there's some way your knowledge could help us understand all "
"this?"
msgstr "당신 지식으로 이 모든 걸 이해하는 데 도움이 될 것 같아요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\professor_1.json
msgid ""
"Hard to say.  I'm not really an organic chemist, I did geological chemistry."
"  I'm at a loss to how that relates, but if you come across something where "
"my knowledge would help I'll gladly offer it."
msgstr "말하기 어렵네요. 유기화학자가 아니라 지질화학을 했어요. 그래도..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\professor_1.json
#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scientist_1.json
#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scientist_2.json
msgid "Cool.  What did you say before that?"
msgstr "멋지네요. 아까 뭐라고 했죠?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\religious_1.json
msgid ""
"My story.  Huh.  It's nothing special.  I had people, but they've risen to "
"be with the Lord.  I don't understand why He didn't take me too, but I "
"suppose it'll all be clear in time."
msgstr "제 얘기요. 흠. 특별한 거 없어요. 사람들이 있었는데, 그들이 일어나서 지금 적이에요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\religious_1.json
msgid "Do you mean in a religious sense, or…?"
msgstr "종교적 의미로, 아니면…?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\religious_1.json
msgid ""
"Of course.  It's clear enough, isn't it?  That…  that end, was the Rapture."
"  I'm still here, and I still don't understand why, but I will keep Jesus in"
" my heart through the Tribulations to come.  When they're past, I'm sure He "
"will welcome me into the Kingdom of Heaven.  Or…  or something along those "
"lines.  It's not going exactly like I thought it would, but that's prophecy "
"for you."
msgstr ""
"물론이지. 분명하잖아? 그… 그 종말이 휴거였어. 난 아직 여기 있고, 왜인진 아직 모르겠지만, 다가올 환난 동안 예수를 마음에 품을 "
"거야. 지나면 분명 그분이 천국으로 맞아주실 거야. 아니면… 그런 비슷한 거. 생각한 대로 정확히 가진 않지만, 예언이란 게 그렇지."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\religious_1.json
msgid "What if you're wrong?"
msgstr "틀렸으면 어떡해요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\religious_1.json
msgid "What will you do then?"
msgstr "그럼 어떻게 할 건가요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\religious_1.json
msgid "Religious Offense"
msgstr "종교적 모욕"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Religious Offense'.
#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\religious_1.json
msgid ""
"AI tag used when you offended an NPC with a specific conversation option.  "
"This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI 태그: 특정 대화 옵션으로 NPC를 모욕했을 때 사용됩니다. 이 태그가 있다면 버그입니다."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\religious_1.json
msgid ""
"What?  How could you say something like that?  I can't believe you'd look at"
" all this and think it could be anything but the end-times.  The dead are "
"walking, the gates of Hell itself have opened, the Beasts of the Devil walk "
"the Earth, and the Righteous have all be drawn up into the Lord's Kingdom.  "
"What more proof could you possibly ask for?"
msgstr "뭐요? 어떻게 그런 말을 할 수 있어요? 이 모든 걸 보고도..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\religious_1.json
msgid "What will you do, then?"
msgstr "그러면 어떻게 할 건가요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\religious_1.json
msgid ""
"I will keep the faith, and keep praying, and strike down the agents of Hell "
"where I see them.  That's all we few can do, isn't it?  I suppose perhaps "
"we're the meek that shall inherit the Earth.  Although I don't love our "
"odds."
msgstr "믿음을 지키고, 기도하며, 지옥의 앞잡이들을 닥치는 대로 쓰러뜨릴 거예요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\religious_2.json
msgid ""
"Same as anyone.  I turned away from God, and now I'm paying the price.  The "
"Rapture has come, and I was left behind.  So now, I guess I wander through "
"Hell on Earth.  I wish I'd paid more attention in Sunday School."
msgstr "다들 마찬가지죠. 신에게서 돌아섰고, 이제 대가를 치르고 있어요. 휴거가..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\rural_1.json
msgid ""
"I lived alone, on the old family property way out of town.  My husband "
"passed away a bit over a month before this started…  cancer.  If anything "
"good has come out of all this, it's that I finally see a positive to losing "
"him so young.  I'd been shut in for a while anyway.  When the news started "
"talking about Chinese bio weapons and sleeper agents, and showing the "
"rioting in Boston and such, I curled up with my canned soup and changed the "
"channel."
msgstr ""
"혼자 살았어, 마을에서 멀리 떨어진 옛 가족 땅에서. 남편이 이게 시작되기 한 달 좀 넘게 전에 돌아가셨어… 암으로. 이 모든 것에서 "
"좋은 게 있다면, 일찍 그를 잃은 게 드디어 긍정적으로 보인다는 거야. 어차피 한동안 갇혀 지냈고. 뉴스가 중국 생물병기랑 잠복 요원 "
"얘길 하고 보스턴 폭동을 보여줄 때, 통조림 수프 먹으며 웅크리고 채널을 돌렸어."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\rural_1.json
msgid ""
"I lived alone, on the old family property way out of town.  My wife passed "
"away a bit over a month before this started…  cancer.  If anything good has "
"come out of all this, it's that I finally see a positive to losing her so "
"young.  I'd been shut in for a while anyway.  When the news started talking "
"about Chinese bio weapons and sleeper agents, and showing the rioting in "
"Boston and such, I curled up with my canned soup and changed the channel."
msgstr ""
"혼자 살았어, 마을에서 멀리 떨어진 옛 가족 땅에서. 아내가 이게 시작되기 한 달 좀 넘게 전에 돌아가셨어… 암으로. 이 모든 것에서 "
"좋은 게 있다면, 일찍 그녀를 잃은 게 드디어 긍정적으로 보인다는 거야. 어차피 한동안 갇혀 지냈고. 뉴스가 중국 생물병기랑 잠복 요원 "
"얘길 하고 보스턴 폭동을 보여줄 때, 통조림 수프 먹으며 웅크리고 채널을 돌렸어."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\rural_1.json
msgid ""
"Well, it built up a bit.  There was that acid rain, it burnt up one of my "
"tractors.  Not that I'd been working the fields since…  well, it'd been a "
"<shitty> year and I hadn't done much worth doing.  There were explosions and"
" things, and choppers overhead.  I was scared, kept the curtains drawn, kept"
" changing the channels.  Then, one day, there were no channels to change to."
"  Just the emergency broadcast, over and over."
msgstr ""
"뭐, 조금씩 쌓였어. 그 산성비가 있었지, 내 트랙터 하나를 태웠어. 그 후로 밭일을 한 건 아니지만… 뭐, <shitty> 한 해였고 "
"할 만한 일도 별로 안 했어. 폭발이랑 이것저것, 머리 위로 헬리콥터도. 무서워서 커튼 치고 계속 채널 돌렸어. 그리고 어느 날, 돌릴 "
"채널이 없었지. 비상 방송만, 반복해서."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\rural_1.json
msgid ""
"That was the first thing to really shake me out of it.  I didn't really have"
" any very close friends, but there were people back in town I cared about a "
"bit.  I had sent some texts, but I hadn't really twigged that they hadn't "
"replied for days.  I got in my truck and tried to get back to town.  Didn't "
"get far before I hit a <zombie> infested pileup blocking the highway, and "
"that's when I started to put it all together.  Never did get to town.  "
"Unfortunately I led the <zombies> back to my farm, and had to bug out of "
"there.  Might go back and clear it out, someday."
msgstr "그게 처음으로 진짜 흔들리게 한 거예요. 실제로 뭔가 없었어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\rural_2.json
msgid ""
"Well, I lived on the edge of a small town.  Corner store and a gas station "
"and not much else.  We heard about the shit goin' down in the city, but we "
"didn't see much of it until the military came blazing through and tried to "
"set up a camp there.  They wanted to bottle us all up in town, and I wasn't "
"having with that, so my dog Buck and I, we headed out while they were all "
"sniffin' their own farts."
msgstr "작은 마을 가장자리에 살았어요. 구멍가게와 주유소가 전부였어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\rural_2.json
msgid ""
"Buck and I slipped out and went East, headin' for my friend's ranch.  Cute "
"little dope thought we were just goin' for a real long walk.  I couldn't "
"take the truck without the army boys catchin' wind of it.  We made it out to"
" the forest, camped out in a lean to.  Packed up and kept heading out.  At "
"first we walked along the highway a little, but saw too many army trucks and"
" buses full of evacuees, and that's when we found out about the <zombies>."
msgstr "벅이랑 동쪽으로 슬며시 빠져나가서 친구 목장으로 향했어요. 귀여운 작은..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\rural_2.json
msgid "Where's Buck now?"
msgstr "벅은 지금 어디에 있어요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\rural_2.json
msgid "I see where this is headed.  <done_conversation_section>"
msgstr "어떻게 끝날지 알겠어요. <done_conversation_section>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\rural_2.json
msgid "I see where this is headed.  <end_talking>"
msgstr "어떻게 끝날지 알겠어요. <end_talking>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\rural_2.json
msgid ""
"We got to my buddy's ranch, but the <swear> g-men had been there first.  It "
"was all boarded up and there was a police barricade out front.  One of those"
" <swear> turrets…  <swear> shot Buck.  Almost got me too.  I managed to get "
"my pup…  get him outta there, that…  it wasn't easy, had to use a police car"
" door as a shield, had to kill a cop-zombie first.  And then, well, while I "
"was still cryin', Buck came back.  I had to …  <swear!>.  I…  I can't say "
"it.  You know."
msgstr ""
"친구 목장에 갔는데 <swear> G맨들이 먼저 다녀갔어. 전부 판자로 막혀 있고 앞에 경찰 바리케이드가 있었지. 그 <swear> 터렛"
" 중 하나가… <swear> 벅을 쐈어. 나도 거의 맞을 뻔했고. 강아지를… 거기서 데리고 나왔어, 그게… 쉽지 않았어, 경찰차 문을 "
"방패로 써야 했고 경찰 좀비도 먼저 죽여야 했지. 그리고, 뭐, 아직 울고 있을 때 벅이 돌아왔어. 난 … <swear!>. 나… 못 "
"말하겠어. 알잖아."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\rural_2.json
msgid "I'm sorry about Buck.  <done_conversation_section>"
msgstr "벅 일이 안 됐네요. <done_conversation_section>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\rural_2.json
msgid "I'm sorry about Buck.  <end_talking>"
msgstr "벅 일이 안 됐네요. <end_talking>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scavenger_merc_1.json
msgid ""
"Like I said, you want me to tell you a story, you gotta pony up the whisky."
"  A full bottle, mind you."
msgstr "말했듯이, 얘기 듣고 싶으면 위스키 내놔야 해요. 몇 잔은요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scavenger_merc_1.json
msgid ""
"Listen.  I'm gonna cut this off short.  I work for you, okay?  I'm not "
"interested in getting attached.  You didn't pay me to be your friend."
msgstr "들어봐요. 이건 짧게 끊을게요. 당신을 위해 일하는 거잖아요? 친구 찾는 거 관심 없어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scavenger_merc_1.json
msgid ""
"I'm not looking for a friend, but I've paid my dues and earned my way.  You "
"gotta pony up too.  We're stuck with each other for a bit."
msgstr "친구 찾는 거 관심 없지만, 빚 지고 내 길 헤쳐왔어요. 인정받아야 해요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scavenger_merc_1.json
msgid ""
"Don't mouth off to me.  I know where everyone else working for me comes "
"from.  If I'm going to let you stand behind me with a loaded gun, you're "
"going to toe the <swear> line too."
msgstr "함부로 말하지 말아요. 나를 위해 일하는 사람들 다 어디서 왔는지 알아요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scavenger_merc_1.json
msgid "Is this enough whisky for you?"
msgstr "위스키 충분해요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scavenger_merc_1.json
msgid "Fine.  Let's talk business, then."
msgstr "좋아요. 사업 얘기 해봐요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scavenger_merc_1.json
msgid "Fine, have it your way."
msgstr "좋아요, 알아서 해요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scavenger_merc_1.json
msgid ""
"No dice.  You asked me to come along.  This is what you get.  If you don't "
"like it, I'll take my fee and go back to the center.  Ain't hard to find "
"contracts."
msgstr "안 돼요. 같이 와달라고 부탁한 거잖아요. 이게 결과예요. 싫으면..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scavenger_merc_1.json
msgid "Fine, then.  Let's talk about something else."
msgstr "좋아요, 다른 얘기 해봐요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scavenger_merc_1.json
msgid "Have it your way."
msgstr "알아서 해요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scavenger_merc_1.json
msgid ""
"I respect where you're coming from, but no.  Not interested.  If you don't "
"like it, I can find another boss easy enough."
msgstr "어디서 오는지 이해하지만, 아니요. 관심 없어요. 싫으면..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scavenger_merc_1.json
msgid ""
"<swear!>, you're just gonna keep badgering me about this forever, aintcha.  "
"Fine.  Bring me a bottle of single malt, we share a drink, I tell you the "
"story."
msgstr "<swear!>, 이걸 영원히 조를 건가요. 좋아요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scavenger_merc_1.json
msgid ""
"I'll get looking for that.  In the meantime there was something else I "
"wanted to talk about."
msgstr "알아볼게요. 그러는 동안 다른 얘기가 있었어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scavenger_merc_1.json
msgid "I'll get back to you on that."
msgstr "나중에 알려줄게요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scavenger_merc_1.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, okay.  I can respect that.  How about this: bring me a bottle of "
"single malt, we share a drink, I tell you the story."
msgstr "네, 알겠어요. 이건 어때요: 싱글몰트 위스키 한 병 가져다주면..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scavenger_merc_1.json
msgid ""
"Oh, yeah, this is a good choice.  Hold on to it for me, let's have a drink "
"later.  Right now we're practically swimming in good whisky, but some day "
"the last bottle will get drunk.  It's gonna be a long time before any of us "
"is brewing nice scotch, and we ain't never gettin' peat from Islay ever "
"again.  Makes me shed a tear just thinking about it."
msgstr "오, 좋은 선택이에요. 잘 보관해줘요, 나중에 같이 마셔요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scavenger_merc_1.json
msgid "You owe me a story."
msgstr "얘기 빚지고 있잖아요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scavenger_merc_1.json
msgid ""
"Mostly I just wanted to get some scotch out of you.  There really ain't much"
" of a story.  I was in the marines, years ago.  After that, did security "
"contract work.  I was out guarding some dump of a warehouse when the "
"apocalypse rolled through town.  I was out on the edge of town, armed, and "
"know when to not pick a fight, so I didn't get killed.  Wound up recruited "
"by the Free Merchants early on, and then the Old Guard for a bit, but I was "
"getting itchy feet when you came by with an offer.  Here I am."
msgstr "주로 위스키 짜내려고 했어요. 딱히 특별한 얘기가 없어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scavenger_merc_1.json
msgid ""
"Why was a guy with your skillset guarding a warehouse?  Must've been some "
"warehouse."
msgstr "당신 같은 실력자가 왜 창고를 지키고 있었어요? 엄청난 창고였겠죠..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scavenger_merc_1.json
msgid "What was working for the Free Merchants like?"
msgstr "자유 상인들을 위해 일하는 건 어땠어요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scavenger_merc_1.json
msgid "What was working for the Old Guard like?"
msgstr "구연방군을 위해 일하는 건 어땠어요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scavenger_merc_1.json
msgid "Thanks for that."
msgstr "감사해요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scavenger_merc_1.json
msgid "Thanks for that.  Let's get going."
msgstr "감사해요. 출발하죠."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scavenger_merc_1.json
msgid ""
"Huh.  Hadn't thought about it in ages, but now that you mention it, that was"
" a weird job.  It was just a boarded up warehouse in the middle of nowhere, "
"and I was not a cheap contractor in those days.  Coulda got any fat rent-a-"
"cop to watch it.  I had only just started working there when the shit hit "
"the fan, and I kinda forgot about that to be honest."
msgstr "흠. 오래전 생각은 안 했는데, 이제 말하니 그건 꽤 특이한 창고였어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scavenger_merc_1.json
msgid ""
"Fucking dull.  Caravan patrols were a bit more fun, for a while, but a guy "
"can only eat so much road dust.  Guarding that pile of bricks full of sad-"
"sack pussies who can't even justify surviving <the_cataclysm>?  Well, I "
"dunno.  They're not a bad bunch but I'm fine not working for them now."
msgstr "엄청 지루했어요. 카라반 순찰은 한동안 좀 재미있었지만, 한 남자가..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scavenger_merc_1.json
msgid ""
"Why was someone with your skillset guarding a warehouse?  Must've been some "
"warehouse."
msgstr "당신 같은 실력자가 왜 창고를 지키고 있었어요? 엄청난 창고였겠죠..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scavenger_merc_1.json
msgid ""
"Good work, and some fun stuff, but risky.  Without a few hands at my side "
"that I trust, I wouldn't take more of their work.  If I had a solid team, "
"though, I'd happily work for Uncle Sam again."
msgstr "일도 좋고 재미있는 것도 있었는데, 위험했어요. 믿을 수 있는 사람들 없이는..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scientist_1.json
msgid ""
"Before <the_cataclysm> I worked in a lab.  Don't look at me like that, it "
"had nothing to do with this stuff…  I was studying protein-protein "
"interactions in smooth muscle in mice, using NMR.  Nothing even vaguely "
"related to zombies.  Anyway, I was at last year's Experimental Biology "
"conference in San Francisco, and an old friend of mine was talking about "
"some really weird shit she'd heard of coming out of government labs.  Really"
" hush hush stuff.  Normally I wouldn't put much cred into that sort of "
"thing, but from her, it actually had me worried.  I packed a bug-out bag "
"just in case."
msgstr ""
"<the_cataclysm> 전엔 연구실에서 일했어. 그렇게 쳐다보지 마, 이 일이랑 무관했어… NMR로 생쥐 평활근 단백질 간 "
"상호작용을 연구했지. 좀비랑 아득히도 무관해. 어쨌든, 작년 샌프란시스코 실험생물학 학회에 있었는데, 오랜 친구가 정부 연구소에서 "
"나왔다는 진짜 이상한 것들 얘길 했어. 완전 비밀인 것들. 평소엔 그런 걸 크게 안 믿었을 텐데, 그녀한테서 들으니 실제로 걱정됐지. "
"만약을 위해 탈출용 가방을 쌌어."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scientist_1.json
msgid "What came of it?"
msgstr "어떻게 됐나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scientist_1.json
msgid ""
"If I got you the right stuff, do you think you'd be able to like… do science"
" to it?"
msgstr "맞는 재료 구해주면, 과학을… 해볼 수 있을 것 같아?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scientist_1.json
msgid ""
"The evacuation order sounded, so I evacuated, comparatively quickly.  That "
"got me out before the worst part.  Our evacuation center was useless…  me, a"
" couple other evacuees, a few tins of food, and a few emergency blankets.  "
"Not even close to enough to go around.  The evacuees split down the middle "
"into a few camps, and infighting started.  I ran into the woods nearby with "
"a few others.  We got away, had a little camp going.  They tried to make me "
"their leader, thought I knew more about things than I did because I'd come "
"so prepared.  Like I said, I'm not that kind of scientist, but they didn't "
"seem to understand.  I…  I did my best."
msgstr ""
"대피 명령이 울려서 대피했어, 비교적 빨리. 덕분에 최악 전에 빠져나왔지. 우리 대피소는 쓸모없었어… 나, 다른 대피자 몇 명, 통조림 "
"몇 개, 비상 담요 몇 개. 돌릴 만큼에 근처도 못 가. 대피자들이 반으로 갈라 몇 진영으로 나뉘고 내분이 시작됐어. 다른 몇 명과 근처"
" 숲으로 도망쳤지. 도망쳤고, 작은 야영지를 꾸렸어. 날 리더로 삼으려 했어, 그렇게 준비된 채 왔으니 내가 아는 것보다 더 안다고 "
"생각한 거야. 말했듯 그런 과학자가 아닌데, 이해 못 하는 것 같았어. 나… 최선을 다했어."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scientist_1.json
msgid "What happened with your leadership run?"
msgstr "지도자 활동은 어떻게 됐나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scientist_1.json
msgid ""
"I thought that us leaving, letting the others have the evac center to "
"themselves, would be enough, but it wasn't.  They tracked us down in the "
"night, a few days later.  They…  well…  I made it out, along with one other "
"survivor.  The attackers, they were like animals.  We tried to travel "
"together for a while.  I blamed myself, for what had happened, and couldn't "
"really get past it.  We parted ways on good terms not long before I met you."
"  I just couldn't face the reminder of what had happened."
msgstr ""
"우리가 떠나서 다른 사람들한테 대피소를 양보하면 충분할 줄 알았는데, 아니었어. 며칠 후 밤에 우릴 추적해왔어. 걔네… 뭐… 난 "
"빠져나왔어, 다른 생존자 하나와 함께. 습격자들은 짐승 같았어. 한동안 같이 다니려 했지. 일어난 일에 날 탓했고, 정말 극복하지 못 "
"했어. 널 만나기 얼마 전 좋게 갈라섰어. 일어난 일을 상기시키는 걸 마주할 수가 없었거든."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scientist_1.json
msgid "I'm sorry to hear that.  <done_conversation_section>"
msgstr "안 됐네요. <done_conversation_section>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scientist_1.json
msgid ""
"I mean, if you find anything related to all this that boils down to "
"analytical biochemistry, I could probably help you decipher it and maybe "
"explain it a bit.  To do more, like analyze samples and such, I'd need a "
"safe lab of my own, with quite a lot of fancy gear, and a reliable power "
"grid.  I think that's a long way down the road."
msgstr "뭐, 분석적인 생화학에 해당하는 걸 찾으면, 전달해줄 수 있어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scientist_2.json
msgid ""
"I've got a memory blank for about three days before and after "
"<the_cataclysm> actually.  I worked at a lab - nothing to do with any of "
"this; physics stuff.  I think I was working there when things happened.  My "
"first clear memory is running through the underbrush a few miles from town."
"  I was bandaged up, I had a messenger bag loaded with gear, and I'd taken a"
" hard hit to the side of my head.  I have no idea what happened to me, but "
"clearly I had already been on the run for a bit."
msgstr "재앙 전후로 3일 정도 기억이 없어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\scientist_2.json
msgid ""
"I mean, if you find anything related to all this that falls under the "
"theoretical physics banner, I could probably help you decipher it and maybe "
"explain it a bit.  To do more, like construct functioning models and such, "
"I'd need a safe lab of my own, with quite a lot of fancy gear, and a "
"reliable power grid.  I think that's a long way down the road."
msgstr "뭐, 이론 물리학에 해당하는 걸 찾으면, 전달해줄 수 있어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\soldier_1.json
msgid ""
"Listen, I don't want to get too into it.  I was in the reserves, OK?  I "
"didn't sign on for some glory loaded shit about protecting my nation, I "
"wanted to get some exercise, make some friends, and it looks good on my "
"resume.  I never thought I'd get called to active duty to fight <swear> "
"zombies.  Maybe I'm a deserter, or a chickenshit, but I can tell you one "
"other thing I am that the other grunts ain't: alive.  You can figure the "
"rest out."
msgstr "들어봐요, 너무 깊이 들어가고 싶지 않아요. 예비군이었어요, 알겠죠? 최전선에 나간 게 아니라..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\soldier_1.json
msgid "Fair enough, thanks.  <done_conversation_section>"
msgstr "알겠어요, 고마워요. <done_conversation_section>"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\soldier_2.json
msgid ""
"I was in the army.  Just a new recruit.  I wasn't even done basic training, "
"they actually called me out of boot camp to serve once the shit hit the fan."
"  I barely knew which end of the gun the bullets came out of, and they "
"jammed me into a truck and drove me to Newport to 'assist in the evacuation "
"efforts'.  Our orders barely made sense, our officers were as confused as we"
" were."
msgstr "군인이었어요. 신병이었어요. 기초 훈련도 안 끝났는데 파견됐어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\soldier_2.json
msgid "What happened in Newport?"
msgstr "뉴포트에서 무슨 일이 있었나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\soldier_2.json
msgid ""
"We never even made it to Newport.  The truck got stomped by something "
"gigantic.  I didn't even see it, just saw this huge black-and-green spiny "
"leg jam through the ceiling, through the el-tee.  Heard the tires grinding, "
"felt the truck lift up.  We were kicked off the leg like dog shit off a "
"sneaker.  I don't know how I survived.  The thing rolled over, killed most "
"of us right there.  I musta blacked out for a bit.  Came to, and while I was"
" getting myself out, the others started getting back up.  Long story short, "
"I lived, they didn't, and I ran."
msgstr "뉴포트까지 못 갔어요. 트럭이 거대한 뭔가에 밟혔어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\wedding_1.json
msgid ""
"Oh, that's quite the story.  <the_cataclysm> happened on my wedding day."
msgstr "오, 꽤 이야기가 있어요. <the_cataclysm>이 내 결혼식 날 일어났어요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\wedding_1.json
msgid "Oh, I'm sorry…"
msgstr "오, 미안해…"

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\wedding_1.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, in hindsight it maybe wasn't the best choice of dates, huh?  I admit I"
" had cold feet though.  Anyway we were getting hitched at the church.  Lucky"
" for me I was late to the ceremony…  I guess some of the fresher corpses in "
"the graveyard had gotten up and started harassing the party."
msgstr ""
"응, 돌이켜보면 날짜 선택이 최고는 아니었나 봐, 응? 인정할게 발은 좀 빼고 싶었어. 어쨌든 교회에서 결혼할 예정이었어. 운 좋게 난 "
"예식에 늦었지… 묘지의 비교적 신선한 시체들이 일어나서 파티를 괴롭히기 시작한 모양이야."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\wedding_1.json
msgid "You seem surprisingly calm about all this."
msgstr "이 모든 것에 놀랍도록 침착해 보이네요."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\wedding_1.json
msgid ""
"After I saw what was going on, I turned around and headed out in the "
"opposite direction.  I've seen zombie movies before.  I picked up some stuff"
" from home and I managed to get out of town before things went really bad.  "
"At the time I thought I was being a coward, but now I know if I'd stayed to "
"help, I'd just be another dripping corpse."
msgstr "어떻게 돌아가는지 보고 나서, 반대 방향으로 향했어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\wedding_1.json
msgid ""
"Well, I have this weird hope.  It's probably stupid, but I saw my fiancé "
"peel out of there with his sister - my maid of honor - in her pickup truck "
"as things went bad.  So, until I run into them again one way or another, I'm"
" just gonna keep on believing they're out there, doing well.  That's more "
"than most of us have."
msgstr "뭐, 이상한 희망이 있어요. 아마 바보 같은 소리겠지만, 약혼자가 차를 몰고 떠나는 걸 봤어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\wedding_1.json
msgid ""
"Well, I have this weird hope.  It's probably stupid, but I saw my fiancée "
"peel out of there with her brother - my best man - in his pickup truck as "
"things went bad.  So, until I run into them again one way or another, I'm "
"just gonna keep on believing they're out there, doing well.  That's more "
"than most of us have."
msgstr "뭐, 이상한 희망이 있어요. 아마 바보 같은 소리겠지만, 약혼녀가 차를 몰고 떠나는 걸 봤어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\Backgrounds\wedding_1.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_staff\NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "What were you saying before that?"
msgstr "아까 뭐라고 했죠?"

#: data\json\npcs\apartment_survivor\TALK_NPC_apartment_survivor.json
#: data\json\npcs\camper\TALK_NPC_camper.json
#: data\json\npcs\moonshiner\TALK_NPC_moonshiner.json
#: data\json\npcs\prepper\TALK_NPC_prepper.json
msgid "<greet>"
msgstr "<greet>"

#: data\json\npcs\apartment_survivor\TALK_NPC_apartment_survivor.json
#: data\json\npcs\prepper\TALK_NPC_prepper.json
msgid "Freeze you <swear> <zombies>!"
msgstr "꼼짝 마 <swear> <zombies>!"

#: data\json\npcs\apartment_survivor\TALK_NPC_apartment_survivor.json
#: data\json\npcs\prepper\TALK_NPC_prepper.json
msgid "&Hold up your hands.  \"Don't worry, I'm not going to hurt you\""
msgstr "&손 들어. \"걱정 마, 다치게 안 해\""

#: data\json\npcs\apartment_survivor\TALK_NPC_apartment_survivor.json
#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
#: data\json\npcs\prepper\TALK_NPC_prepper.json
msgid "Hand over your stuff!  Don't make any sudden moves, or you die!"
msgstr "물건 내놔! 급하게 움직이면, 죽어!"

#: data\json\npcs\apartment_survivor\TALK_NPC_apartment_survivor.json
#: data\json\npcs\prepper\TALK_NPC_prepper.json
msgid ""
"Oh, you're not one of the <zombies>.  Come on in, just don't cause any "
"trouble."
msgstr "오, <zombies> 중 하나가 아니네. 들어와, 문제만 안 일으키면."

#: data\json\npcs\apartment_survivor\TALK_NPC_apartment_survivor.json
#: data\json\npcs\prepper\TALK_NPC_prepper.json
msgid "Alright, let's chat."
msgstr "좋아, 얘기하자."

#: data\json\npcs\apartment_survivor\TALK_NPC_apartment_survivor.json
#: data\json\npcs\prepper\TALK_NPC_prepper.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
#: data\mods\Arcana_BN\npcs\TALK_CF_GM.json
#: data\mods\Arcana_BN\npcs\TALK_CF_PURIFIER.json
#: data\mods\Arcana_BN\npcs\TALK_HERMIT.json
msgid "I'll be back later."
msgstr "아니, 나중에 다시 올게."

#: data\json\npcs\apartment_survivor\TALK_NPC_apartment_survivor.json
#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\cabin_chemist.json
#: data\json\npcs\camper\TALK_NPC_camper.json
#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\TALK_lumbermill_merchant.json
msgid "So, what's up?"
msgstr "그래, 무슨 일이야?"

#: data\json\npcs\apartment_survivor\TALK_NPC_apartment_survivor.json
msgid "What are you doing in this deathtrap?"
msgstr "이 죽음의 함정에서 뭐 하는 거야?"

#: data\json\npcs\apartment_survivor\TALK_NPC_apartment_survivor.json
#: data\json\npcs\camper\TALK_NPC_camper.json
#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#: data\json\npcs\prepper\TALK_NPC_prepper.json
msgid "Why don't you come with me?"
msgstr "나랑 같이 가는 건 어때?"

#: data\json\npcs\apartment_survivor\TALK_NPC_apartment_survivor.json
#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\cabin_chemist.json
#: data\json\npcs\camper\TALK_NPC_camper.json
#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\TALK_lumbermill_merchant.json
#: data\json\npcs\prepper\TALK_NPC_prepper.json
#: data\json\npcs\robofac\NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
#: data\json\npcs\scrap_trader\scrap_trader.json
msgid "Any jobs you need done?"
msgstr "해줄 일 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\apartment_survivor\TALK_NPC_apartment_survivor.json
msgid ""
"I used to live here before <the_cataclysm>.  I was asleep when a horde of "
"<zombies> busted through the front, and in the chaos I wound up here.  When "
"the screaming stopped, I peaked out the door to find my neighbor stumbling "
"about with his face half-eaten, and I haven't left since."
msgstr ""
"<the_cataclysm> 전에 여기 살았어. <zombies> 무리가 정면을 뚫었을 때 자고 있었고, 혼란 속에 여기 오게 됐어. "
"비명이 멈췄을 때 문 밖을 보니 이웃이 얼굴 반쯤 뜯긴 채 비틀거리고 있었고, 그 후로 안 나갔어."

#: data\json\npcs\apartment_survivor\TALK_NPC_apartment_survivor.json
#: data\json\npcs\camper\TALK_NPC_camper.json
msgid "Wow."
msgstr "와."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\cabin_chemist.json
msgid "chemist"
msgstr "화학자"

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\cabin_chemist.json
msgid "Chemist"
msgstr "화학자"

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\cabin_chemist.json
msgid "I make and sell chemicals"
msgstr "화학물질을 만들고 팝니다"

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\cabin_chemist.json
#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Stan_Borichenko.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_staff\NPC_free_merchant_guard2.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\cyrus_whately.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\whately_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Hello."
msgstr "안녕."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\cabin_chemist.json
#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_staff\NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\cyrus_whately.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\whately_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\Arcana_BN\npcs\TALK_CF_REP.json
#: data\mods\Arcana_BN\npcs\TALK_MAGE_HUNTER.json
msgid "What is this place?"
msgstr "여기는 뭐하는 곳이지?"

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\cabin_chemist.json
msgid "Brewed anything new lately?"
msgstr "최근에 뭐 새로 조제했어?"

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\cabin_chemist.json
msgid "I'd like to buy in bulk."
msgstr "대량으로 사고 싶어."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\cabin_chemist.json
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, I'm still gathering resources and cooking new stuff.  Maybe "
"ask again after <interval>."
msgstr "아쉽지만 아직 자원 모으고 새 물건 조제 중이야. <interval> 후에 다시 물어봐."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\cabin_chemist.json
msgid "Alright.  thanks nonetheless."
msgstr "알았어. 그래도 고마워."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\cabin_chemist.json
msgid ""
"I used to be a chemist.  Well, I am a chemist.  I've been living out here in"
" the wilderness for a little while now since <the_cataclysm>.  Even brought "
"some of my equipment, though unfortunately missing some of the more "
"sensitive and expensive stuff.  I found a couple useful things here in the "
"cupboards, but other than that, entirely empty.  So, I moved in."
msgstr ""
"화학자였어. 뭐, 지금도 화학자야. <the_cataclysm> 이후로 이 황야에 한동안 살고 있어. 장비도 좀 가져왔지만 아쉽게도 더 "
"민감하고 비싼 것들은 못 챙겼어. 여기 찬장에서 유용한 것 좀 발견했는데, 그것 말곤 완전히 비었더라고. 그래서 입주했지."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\cabin_chemist.json
#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
#: data\json\npcs\scrap_trader\scrap_trader.json
msgid "Hmm."
msgstr "흠."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\cabin_chemist.json
msgid ""
"Not my place, just somewhere I ended up.  Some old shack, maybe a hunting "
"cabin or something more… criminal, at least judging by some of what I found "
"on the shelves.  You certainly wouldn't attract much attention synthesizing "
"illegal substances all the way out here, that's all I'm saying.  I found it "
"while I was trying to escape all the <zombies> in the city, and I decided to"
" stay."
msgstr ""
"내 집이 아니야, 그냥 도착한 곳이야. 낡은 오두막, 어쩌면 사냥 오두막이거나 더… 범죄적인 곳이었을 지도 — 선반에서 발견한 것들로 "
"봐선. 이렇게 먼 외곽에서 불법 물질 합성하면 확실히 눈에 안 띄겠지, 그 얘기야. 도시의 <zombies>를 피하려다 찾았고, 머물기로"
" 했어."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\cabin_chemist.json
msgid ""
"I'm out of some things, <name_g>.  It takes a while to source the good stuff"
" - days usually - but I'm working hard to replace it.  What can I get you in"
" the meantime?"
msgstr ""
"몇몇이 떨어졌어, <name_g>. 좋은 재료 구하는 데 시간이 걸려 — 보통 며칠 — 근데 대체하려고 열심히 하는 중이야. 그 동안 뭘"
" 해줄까?"

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\cabin_chemist.json
msgid ""
"I'll see what I've got around here for you.  I've gotta warn you: it's gonna"
" be expensive.  Hard to stay supplied in the apocalypse, you know.  What do "
"you need?"
msgstr "여기서 뭘 줄 수 있는지 볼게. 경고할게: 비쌀 거야. 묵시록에서 물자 유지가 힘들거든, 알잖아. 뭐 필요해?"

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\cabin_chemist.json
msgid "[10$]  I'll buy some bandages."
msgstr "[10$] 붕대 좀 살게."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\cabin_chemist.json
msgid "[40$]  I'll buy some aspirin."
msgstr "[40$] 아스피린 좀 살게."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\cabin_chemist.json
msgid "[50$]  I'll buy some sprayable fungicide."
msgstr "[50$] 살포용 살균제 좀 살게."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\cabin_chemist.json
msgid "[50$]  I'll buy some powder fungicide."
msgstr "[50$] 분말 살균제 좀 살게."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\cabin_chemist.json
msgid "[50$]  I'll buy some disinfectant."
msgstr "[50$] 소독약 좀 살게."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\cabin_chemist.json
msgid "[120$]  I'll buy some antibiotics."
msgstr "[120$] 항생제 좀 살게."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\cabin_chemist.json
msgid "[140$]  I'll buy some antifungal drugs."
msgstr "[140$] 항진균제 좀 살게."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\cabin_chemist.json
msgid "[200$]  I'll buy some black gunpowder."
msgstr "[200$] 흑색 화약 좀 살게."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\cabin_chemist.json
msgid "[300$]  I'll buy some napalm."
msgstr "[300$] 네이팜 좀 살게."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\cabin_chemist.json
msgid "Is there anything else you need?"
msgstr "또 필요한 거 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\cabin_chemist.json
#: data\json\npcs\scrap_trader\scrap_trader.json
msgid "No, that's all."
msgstr "아니, 다 됐어."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
msgid "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
msgstr "기초 분석 키트 찾기"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Find A Basic Analysis Kit'
#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
msgid "Obtain a basic laboratory analysis kit for the chemist."
msgstr "화학자를 위해 기초 실험실 분석 키트를 구하세요."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
msgid "I need a basic laboratory analysis kit."
msgstr "기초 실험실 분석 키트가 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've checked the stock here at this house, and it turns out there's a few "
"pieces of equipment I need.  Firstly, I need a reliable way to take "
"measurements and verify results.  If you could get me a basic laboratory "
"analysis kit just to get started, I'd be grateful.  That's the first step "
"towards making everything I brought with me useful."
msgstr ""
"이 집의 재고를 확인해보니 필요한 장비가 몇 개 있더라고. 우선, 측정하고 결과를 검증할 확실한 방법이 필요해. 시작용으로 기초 실험실 "
"분석 키트를 구해줄 수 있으면 고맙겠어. 가져온 모든 걸 유용하게 만드는 첫걸음이거든."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
#: data\json\npcs\scrap_trader\scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "I'll be here when you get back.  Good luck!"
msgstr "돌아올 때 여기 있을게. 행운을 빌어!"

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Well, someone's got to do it."
msgstr "뭐, 누군가는 해야지."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
msgid "One of those old labs might have one."
msgstr "옛 연구소 중 하나에 있을지도."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
#: data\mods\Arcana_BN\npcs\missiondef.json
msgid "Do you have it?"
msgstr "구했어?"

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
msgid "Thank you!  I can't wait to get started!"
msgstr "고마워! 빨리 시작하고 싶어!"

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
msgid "Thanks for trying… I guess."
msgstr "해봐줘서 고마워… 뭐."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
msgid "That's unfortunate.  I guess I'll have to find it myself."
msgstr "아쉽네. 직접 찾아야겠어."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
msgid "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
msgstr "염산 좀 찾아오기"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Find Some Hydrochloric Acid'
#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 15 liters of hydrochloric acid for the chemist."
msgstr "화학자를 위해 염산 15리터를 구하세요."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
msgid "I need 15 liters of hydrochloric acid."
msgstr "염산 15리터가 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
msgid ""
"The last thing I really need to get going is hydrochloric acid.  It's one of"
" those chemicals that's just perfect for so many things.  An acidifying "
"reagent, and one of the best.  With a large supply of hydrochloric acid, you"
" and I are only a few steps removed from a stable source of antiseptic, "
"fungicide, and even some light explosives!  As the only apparent health "
"authority left, I do have to warn you not to get it on your skin, though.  "
"Find this for me and I'll sell you whatever I can make."
msgstr ""
"정말 필요한 마지막 게 염산이야. 수많은 것에 딱 맞는 화학물질 중 하나야. 산화 시약 중 최고지. 염산 대량 확보로 너와 난 소독약, "
"살균제, 심지어 가벼운 폭약의 안정 공급원까지 몇 단계밖에 안 남았어! 남은 유일한 보건 당국으로서 피부에 닿지 말라고 경고해야겠지만. "
"찾아오면 만들 수 있는 건 뭐든 팔게."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
msgid ""
"You might find large quantities in a warehouse somewhere, but it often got "
"sold as a household cleaner, did you know that?"
msgstr "창고 어딘가에서 대량으로 찾을 지도 몰라, 근데 가정용 세제로도 팔렸다는 거 알아?"

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the hydrochloric acid?"
msgstr "염산 구했어?"

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
msgid "Wonderful!  I'm sure this will be quite helpful."
msgstr "훌륭해! 꽤 도움이 될 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
msgid "Find Some Gasoline"
msgstr "휘발유 좀 찾아오기"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Find Some Gasoline'
#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 100 liters of gasoline for the chemist."
msgstr "화학자를 위해 휘발유 100리터를 구하세요."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
msgid "I need 100 liters of gas."
msgstr "휘발유 100리터가 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'm in a bit of a spot.  I keep a generator around here to power all my "
"scientific equipment.  It has a bit of gas in it, but I've burned through "
"that and I can't use most of my tools without power.  This may seem like a "
"lot, but if you could get me 100 liters of gas, I'll pay you back any way I "
"can."
msgstr ""
"곤란한 처지야. 과학 장비 전원용으로 발전기를 여기 두는데, 기름이 좀 있었지만 다 썼고 전원 없이는 대부분 도구를 못 써. 많아 "
"보이겠지만 휘발유 100리터만 구해주면 가능한 방법으로 갚을게."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
msgid ""
"I bet the best place to find that much gas is still a gas station.  Bringing"
" it all here is another problem.  You might want one of those big steel "
"drums we used to use to haul off hazardous waste before <the_cataclysm>."
msgstr ""
"그만큼 기름 찾기 제일 좋은 곳은 아직도 주유소일 거야. 전부 가져오는 게 또 문제고. <the_cataclysm> 전에 유해 폐기물 "
"나르던 큰 철 드럼이 있으면 좋을 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
msgid ""
"Wonderful!  Thank you so much!  This will keep me running for a long, long "
"time."
msgstr "훌륭해! 정말 고마워! 이걸로 아주 아주 오래 돌릴 수 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
#: data\json\npcs\scrap_trader\scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Establish A Trade Route"
msgstr "교역로 구축"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Establish A Trade Route'
#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
msgid ""
"Establish trade relations between the chemist and a refugee center, and "
"bring back a writ of the agreement."
msgstr "화학자와 피난민 센터 사이의 교역 관계를 수립하고 협정 문서를 가져오세요."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
#: data\json\npcs\scrap_trader\scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Go negotiate a trade agreement."
msgstr "가서 교역 협상을 해와."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
msgid ""
"I was out scavenging recently, and I found one of those old evac shelters.  "
"Turns out the computer was still on and it had an address for a refugee "
"center.  I think my skills might be useful to them, for helping maintain "
"medical supplies and whatnot, so I want you to head over there and see if "
"they're interested.  I'd do it myself, but I need to look after this place."
msgstr ""
"최근에 수색하다가 옛 대피소를 찾았어. 컴퓨터가 아직 켜져 있고 피난민 센터 주소가 있더라고. 의료품 유지 같은 데 내 기술이 유용할 것"
" 같아서, 네가 가서 관심 있는지 봐줬으면 해. 내가 하고 싶지만 이곳을 봐야 해서."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
#: data\json\npcs\scrap_trader\scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Please?  This is really important to me."
msgstr "부탁이야? 나한테 정말 중요해."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
#: data\json\npcs\scrap_trader\scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid ""
"It should be pretty simple making the deal, but I'd recommend taking a car "
"over there myself."
msgstr "거래 자체는 꽤 간단할 거야, 근데 차 타고 가는 걸 추천해."

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
#: data\json\npcs\scrap_trader\scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "What did they say about it?"
msgstr "뭐라고 하던?"

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
msgid "How does this help me?"
msgstr "그게 나한테 어떻게 도움이 돼?"

#: data\json\npcs\cabin_chemist\chemist_missions.json
msgid "That's unfortunate.  I guess I'll have to find other customers."
msgstr "아쉽네. 다른 고객을 찾아야겠어."

#: data\json\npcs\camper\TALK_NPC_camper.json
msgid "<greet>."
msgstr "<greet>."

#: data\json\npcs\camper\TALK_NPC_camper.json
msgid "Hey, stranger.  Glad to see a new face around here."
msgstr "야, 낯선 이. 새 얼굴 보니 반갑네."

#: data\json\npcs\camper\TALK_NPC_camper.json
msgid "Glad to see you too.  Now, hand over your things."
msgstr "나도 반가워. 자, 물건 내놔."

#: data\json\npcs\camper\TALK_NPC_camper.json
msgid ""
"I was out here camping when <the_cataclysm> disturbed me.  I didn't know "
"anything was wrong until two <zombies> stumbled up here, and tried to kill "
"me.  I figured staying here would be my best bet, away from the cities."
msgstr ""
"<the_cataclysm>이 날 방해할 때 여기서 야영 중이었어. <zombies> 둘이 여기 비틀거리며 올라와 날 죽이려 할 때까지 "
"아무것도 잘못된 줄 몰랐어. 도시에서 먼 여기가 최선이라 생각했지."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid "cook"
msgstr "요리사"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid "Simon Weaver"
msgstr "사이먼 위버"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid "I cook for my community."
msgstr "공동체를 위해 요리합니다."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Guneet_Singh.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Hey there."
msgstr "안녕하세요."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\cyrus_whately.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\whately_dialogue.json
msgid "How are you?"
msgstr "어떻게 지내?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\cyrus_whately.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Welcome!"
msgstr "환영해!"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "How's the weather?"
msgstr "날씨 어때?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid "Welcome!  You seem new, how can I help you?"
msgstr "환영해! 새 얼굴인 것 같은데, 뭘 도와줄까?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Guneet_Singh.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_John_Clemens.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Mandeep_Singh.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_staff\NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_staff\NPC_scientistquestgiver_docmission.json
#: data\json\npcs\scrap_trader\scrap_trader.json
#: data\json\obsoletion\npc_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "What's your story?"
msgstr "사연이 뭐야?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Guneet_Singh.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_John_Clemens.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Mandeep_Singh.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Stan_Borichenko.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
#: data\json\obsoletion\npc_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\cyrus_whately.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\whately_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\DinoMod\NPC\NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "How are things here?"
msgstr "여긴 어때?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid ""
"Shouldn't I be the one to ask that question?  I am Simon, I work here as a "
"cook.  Who are you?"
msgstr "그걸 물어볼 사람은 내가 아닐까? 난 사이먼이야, 여기서 요리사로 일해. 넌 누구야?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid "I am an unfortunate who really needs something to eat."
msgstr "먹을 게 정말 필요한 불운한 사람이야."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "I am just a fellow survivor."
msgstr "그냥 같은 생존자야."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid ""
"This is New England Church Community.  A self-sufficient group formed by "
"churchgoers.  We try to help fellow survivors as much as we can.  Enjoy your"
" stay here!"
msgstr ""
"여긴 뉴잉글랜드 교회 공동체야. 교회 신도들이 만든 자급자족 집단이지. 같은 생존자를 최대한 도우려 해. 여기 있는 동안 즐기라고!"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\whately_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Can you give me something to eat then?"
msgstr "그럼 먹을 거 좀 줄래?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "What can I buy here?"
msgstr "여기서 뭘 살 수 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid ""
"Sorry, it has been a very long time since we offered free meals.  You should"
" try joining our community if you want rations.  I wish you luck."
msgstr "미안, 무료 식사를 제공한 지 아주 오래됐어. 배급 원하면 우리 공동체에 들어오는 게 좋을 거야. 행운을 빌어."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "I can pay."
msgstr "돈 낼 수 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid "Please, I need the food for my family."
msgstr "제발, 가족 먹일 음식이 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid "How do I join the community?"
msgstr "공동체에 어떻게 들어가?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid ""
"You can't buy edibles here.  We currently have a shortage of them, and we "
"can't afford to give away any more.  Your money is worthless anyway."
msgstr "여기선 먹을 걸 못 사. 지금 부족해서 더 나눠줄 여유가 없어. 네 돈은 어차피 가치 없고."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "It was worth a try."
msgstr "해볼 만했어."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid "Why is my money worthless?"
msgstr "내 돈이 왜 가치 없어?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid ""
"Look, I have a family too.  I know how hard it is for you, but I've already "
"told you, rules are rules."
msgstr "봐, 나도 가족 있어. 네가 얼마나 힘든지 알아, 근데 이미 말했잖아, 규칙은 규칙이야."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid "At least I tried."
msgstr "적어도 해봤지."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid ""
"You have to ask our leader, Helena, first.  She's the one who makes those "
"decisions.  But as I said, your chances are low, like everyone else's.  The "
"newest member joined just a long time ago."
msgstr ""
"우리 리더 헬레나한테 먼저 물어봐야 해. 그런 결정을 내리는 사람이거든. 근데 말했듯 다른 사람들처럼 가능성은 낮아. 최신 멤버도 꽤 "
"오래전에 들어왔어."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid ""
"You have to ask our leader, Helena, first.  She's the one who makes those "
"decisions.  But as I said, your chances are low, like everyone else's.  If "
"you had found our community earlier, you could have had a higher chance to "
"join.  The newest member joined just a few days ago."
msgstr ""
"우리 리더 헬레나한테 먼저 물어봐야 해. 그런 결정을 내리는 사람이거든. 근데 말했듯 다른 사람들처럼 가능성은 낮아. 우리 공동체를 더 "
"일찍 찾았다면 들어올 가능성이 더 높았을 거야. 최신 멤버도 며칠 전에 들어왔어."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid ""
"From me?  Nothing.  But we have a tailor, herbalist and a hunter.  Go see "
"their products yourself, maybe you find something you need.  Keep in mind "
"that we don't use regular dollars here."
msgstr ""
"나한테선? 없어. 근데 재봉사, 약초사, 사냥꾼이 있어. 직접 물건 보러 가봐, 필요한 게 있을지도. 여기선 일반 달러 안 쓰는 거 "
"명심하고."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid "I'll take a look."
msgstr "한 번 볼게."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid "What do you use as money?"
msgstr "돈으로 뭘 써?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid ""
"You know, I used to work as a cook in a homeless shelter.  Coincidentally, "
"that's how I met the community.  They used to go there many times to help "
"the residents and preach from the Bible.  I am sure this is why my family "
"and I could join.  Also, working in the shelter taught me to cook on a very "
"low budget.  It's an even more useful skill today."
msgstr ""
"있잖아, 노숙자 쉼터 요리사로 일했어. 우연이지만 공동체를 거기서 만났지. 거기 자주 와서 주민들 돕고 성경 설교했어. 우리 가족이랑 "
"내가 들어올 수 있던 이유가 이거라 확신해. 게다가 쉼터에서 일하면서 아주 적은 예산으로 요리하는 법을 배웠어. 오늘날엔 더 유용한 "
"기술이지."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid ""
"Could be better, could be worse.  But I'm not complaining.  I have "
"everything I need here: my family, a nice job and roof over my head.  I wish"
" God was as forgiving to others as to me."
msgstr ""
"더 좋을 수도, 더 나쁠 수도. 근데 불평 안 해. 필요한 게 다 있거든: 가족, 좋은 일, 머리 위 지붕. 신이 나한테처럼 다른 "
"이들에게도 관대하길 바라."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid "It's good to hear that."
msgstr "듣기 좋네."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid ""
"We use religious icons as our currency.  These were made before "
"<the_cataclysm>, and the name of our community is written on the back.  It's"
" a lot more handy than old-world dollars, those are basicly just "
"firestarters here."
msgstr ""
"화폐로 종교 성상을 써. <the_cataclysm> 전에 만들어진 거고 뒷면에 우리 공동체 이름이 쓰여 있어. 구세계 달러보다 훨씬 "
"쓸모 있어 — 걔넨 여기선 기본적으로 불쏘시개야."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid "Picky Meals"
msgstr "까다로운 식사"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Picky Meals'}'
#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid "Find 100 salt."
msgstr "소금 100개를 찾으세요."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid "I need a supply of salt."
msgstr "소금 비축분이 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid ""
"I know this doesn't sound important, but I am running low on salt.  We don't"
" just need it as a seasoning, it's also vital for food preservation.  Could "
"you find about 20 pounds of salt for me?"
msgstr ""
"중요하게 안 들리는 건 알지만 소금이 떨어져가. 조미료로만 필요한 게 아니라 식품 보존에도 필수야. 소금 20파운드쯤 찾아줄 수 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\cyrus_whately.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Don't forget to tell me when you have them."
msgstr "구하면 잊지 말고 말해줘."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "It's okay, I can do without them.  Just let me know if you reconsider."
msgstr "괜찮아, 없어도 돼. 마음 바뀌면 알려줘."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid ""
"There's a lot of places to look.  They are common in house kitchens, "
"restaurants or grocery stores."
msgstr "찾을 곳은 많아. 가정집 부엌, 식당, 식료품점에 흔해."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid "How is the search going?  Have you found 'em?"
msgstr "수색은 어때? 찾았어?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"I really apreciate your help.  Don't worry, you won't leave empty-handed."
msgstr "도와줘서 정말 고마워. 걱정 마, 빈손으론 안 보낼게."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Don't worry about it, it's not that important."
msgstr "걱정 마, 그렇게 중요하진 않아."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid "Pickled Meals"
msgstr "절인 식사"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Pickled Meals'}'
#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid "Find 5 glass jars."
msgstr "유리병 5개를 찾으세요."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid "I need several glass jars."
msgstr "유리병 몇 개가 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid ""
"This task is bit more serious.  I don't have enough jars to preserve "
"perishables for the future, and we can't just store everything in salt.  We "
"could do our own canning if we had some more glass jars.  I could get by "
"with 5 for now."
msgstr ""
"이 일은 좀 더 심각해. 미래를 위해 부패성 식품 보존할 병이 부족해, 전부 소금에만 보관할 수도 없고. 유리병이 좀 더 있으면 직접 "
"통조림 할 수 있어. 당분간은 5개면 돼."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid ""
"Thanks for accepting this task.  It'll take a load off my shoulders.  I "
"finally won't have to worry about this problem anymore."
msgstr "이 일 받아줘서 고마워. 어깨 짐을 덜었어. 드디어 이 문제 걱정 안 해도 되겠네."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Just let me know if you change your mind."
msgstr "마음 바뀌면 알려줘."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid ""
"Glass jars are not that hard to find.  I'd look for them in residental "
"areas."
msgstr "유리병은 그렇게 찾기 어렵지 않아. 주거 지역에서 찾아볼 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid "Have you found the jars?"
msgstr "병 찾았어?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid ""
"Thank you for your help.  Here's your reward.  I have one more task to do."
msgstr "도와줘서 고마워. 여기 보상이야. 할 일 하나 더 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "It's not a big deal, it isn't that urgent."
msgstr "대단한 일 아니야, 그렇게 급하진 않아."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid "Prickled Meals"
msgstr "찔리는 식사"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Prickled Meals'}'
#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid "Find a butcher knife."
msgstr "정육칼을 찾으세요."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid "I need something sharper."
msgstr "더 날카로운 게 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid ""
"I don't have any butcher knives in here.  It's difficult to cut anything "
"hard without it.  It's good to have one, even though I won't use it that "
"often.  Could you get me one?"
msgstr "여기 정육칼이 없어. 단단한 건 그거 없이 자르기 어려워. 자주 안 쓰더라도 하나 있으면 좋아. 하나 구해줄 수 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid "Thank you for accepting.  I can't cut anything with this dull knife."
msgstr "받아줘서 고마워. 이 무딘 칼로는 아무것도 못 자르겠어."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid "I guess I have to cut them with my steak knife."
msgstr "스테이크 나이프로 잘라야겠네."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid ""
"Butcher knives are not that rare to find.  They are commonly found in "
"kitchens."
msgstr "정육칼은 그렇게 찾기 희귀하진 않아. 부엌에서 흔히 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid "Do you have that knife now?"
msgstr ""
">\n"
"그 칼 이제 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\cook.json
msgid "I am grateful for the help you've done."
msgstr "해준 도움에 감사해."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "food guard"
msgstr "식량 경비"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "I'm guarding the food."
msgstr "식량을 지키고 있습니다."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "You're back."
msgstr "돌아왔네."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "So…?"
msgstr "그래서…?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "Hey!  What are you doing up here?  You are not allowed to come here."
msgstr "야! 여기서 뭐 해? 여기 오면 안 돼."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "How much food do you have in storage?"
msgstr "저장된 음식이 얼마나 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "Can I borrow something from the stash?"
msgstr "비축분에서 좀 빌릴 수 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "I am sorry, I didn't know.  I'll be going."
msgstr "미안, 몰랐어. 갈게."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "I have to go now."
msgstr "이제 가야 해."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid ""
"Me?  I am the food guard.  I've been tasked to watch over this storage."
msgstr "나? 식량 경비야. 이 저장고를 지키라는 임무를 받았어."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "Can I borrow something from the stockpile?"
msgstr "비축 더미에서 좀 빌릴 수 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "Has anyone stolen from here?"
msgstr "여기서 훔쳐간 사람 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid ""
"I am afraid you can't.  Look, we are running low on our rations, and we "
"don't want to waste even more.  Even if you just want to 'borrow' it.  Too "
"bad, we could've helped you if you had come here earlier."
msgstr ""
"안 될 것 같은데. 봐, 우리 배급이 떨어져가서 더 낭비하고 싶지 않아. 그냥 '빌리고' 싶은 거라도. 아쉽네, 더 일찍 왔으면 도와줄 "
"수 있었는데."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid ""
"I am sorry, but nobody is allowed to take anything from here.  We would like"
" to help you, but we already have enough mouths to feed."
msgstr "미안하지만 누구도 여기서 아무것도 가져갈 수 없어. 돕고 싶지만 이미 먹일 입이 충분히 많아."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "I have money."
msgstr "돈 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "Please, my family is starving."
msgstr "제발, 우리 가족이 굶어."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "How much food do you have here?"
msgstr "여기 음식이 얼마나 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "Alright, but just this once.  Don't tell anyone."
msgstr "알았어, 근데 이번 한 번만. 아무한테도 말하지 마."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "I promise I won't tell anybody."
msgstr "아무한테도 안 말할게 약속해."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "Are you trying to bribe me?"
msgstr "나한테 뇌물 주려는 거야?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "I'd better leave."
msgstr "가는 게 좋겠네."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid ""
"I am sorry, but I can't help you or your family.  This is not my food, you "
"need to ask permission from someone else."
msgstr "미안하지만 너랑 네 가족을 도와줄 수 없어. 이건 내 음식이 아니야, 다른 사람한테 허락받아야 해."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "I think I'll be going."
msgstr "가야겠네."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid ""
"I don't know anymore.  You see, we used to have 20 crates full of non-"
"perishables.  That was months ago.  We are running out."
msgstr "이젠 잘 모르겠어. 있잖아, 예전엔 부패 안 하는 음식 가득 든 상자 20개가 있었어. 몇 달 전 얘기야. 바닥나고 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid ""
"That information is a bit private, but you can see for yourself.  We have "
"about 20 crates full of non-perishables."
msgstr ""
">\n"
"그 정보는 좀 사적인데, 직접 봐도 돼. 부패 안 하는 음식 가득 든 상자가 약 20개 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "Where did all this food come from?"
msgstr "이 모든 음식은 어디서 왔어?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid ""
"Well, most things you see here were brought by the original members.  You "
"know, they knew <the_cataclysm> was coming and bought everything they could."
"  They were prepared and thanks to them, so are we."
msgstr ""
"뭐, 여기 보이는 대부분은 원년 멤버들이 가져온 거야. 있잖아, 걔넨 <the_cataclysm>이 올 걸 알고 살 수 있는 건 다 "
"샀어. 걔네가 준비됐고 덕분에 우리도 그래."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "I'd like to talk about something else."
msgstr "다른 얘기하고 싶어."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid ""
"You sure like asking personal questions, eh?  My story is nothing special, "
"really.  The important thing now is that I am alive and well."
msgstr "사적인 질문 좋아하네, 응? 내 얘긴 특별할 거 없어, 정말. 지금 중요한 건 살아서 건강하다는 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "How did you become a food guard?"
msgstr "식량 경비가 어떻게 됐어?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "I don't have a great appetite."
msgstr "식욕이 별로 없어서."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "Reasonable."
msgstr "납득 가네."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid ""
"Eh, being a food guard is not mentally stimulating.  It gets a bit lonely up"
" here, you know, staying here almost 24/7.  This job makes almost anyone "
"bored.  That's why I have books with me, they keep me busy for a while."
msgstr ""
"어, 식량 경비는 정신적 자극이 안 돼. 여기 좀 외로워, 알잖아, 거의 하루 종일 여기 있으니까. 이 일은 거의 누구든 지루하게 해. "
"그래서 책을 갖고 다녀, 한동안 바쁘게 해주거든."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "What are you reading nowadays?"
msgstr "요즘 뭘 읽어?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid ""
"It doesn't matter, I can read anything.  But mystery books were almost my "
"favorite.  I wish I had more of them."
msgstr "상관없어, 뭐든 읽을 수 있어. 근데 미스터리 책이 거의 최애였어. 더 있으면 좋겠는데."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "I can get you some mystery novels."
msgstr "미스터리 소설 좀 구해줄 수 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid ""
"Not that I know of.  I haven't seen any suspicious drops in our food supply."
"  I guess I'm doing a great at my job… or nobody is rotten enough to steal "
"from our community."
msgstr ""
"내가 아는 한 없어. 식량 보급에 수상한 감소는 못 봤어. 내 일을 잘하고 있거나… 아니면 우리 공동체에서 훔칠 만큼 썩은 사람이 "
"없거나."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
#: data\mods\Arcana_BN\npcs\TALK_CF_REP.json
msgid "That's good to hear."
msgstr "듣기 좋네."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "Busy While Work"
msgstr "일하는 동안 바쁘게"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Busy While Work'}'
#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "Find 3 mystery novels."
msgstr "미스터리 소설 3권을 찾으세요."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "I'd like to read some mystery novels."
msgstr "미스터리 소설 좀 읽고 싶어."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid ""
"Hmm, that would be great!  But if you do, please bring more than just one.  "
"I could read a single novel in a day.  Could you get me… 3 mystery novels?"
msgstr "흠, 좋겠네! 근데 하려면 한 권만 말고 더 가져와줘. 소설 한 권은 하루면 읽어. 미스터리 소설… 3권 구해줄 수 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "Just bring it to me when you have it."
msgstr "구하면 나한테 가져와."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "Nevermind then.  I hope you'll change your mind."
msgstr "그럼 됐어. 마음 바뀌길 바라."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "I'd loot libraries and bookstores."
msgstr "도서관이랑 서점을 털어볼 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "So, have you found the books?"
msgstr "그래서, 책 찾았어?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid ""
"Thank you.  This will keep me busy for a while.  Please take this as a token"
" of my gratitude."
msgstr "고마워. 이걸로 한동안 바쁠 거야. 감사의 표시로 이걸 받아."

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "Could you give them to me?"
msgstr "나한테 줄래?"

#: data\json\npcs\godco\foodguard.json
msgid "Fine.  I can read something else."
msgstr "알았어. 다른 걸 읽으면 돼."

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Warrener"
msgstr "토끼 사육사"

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Mr Lapin"
msgstr "래핀 씨"

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "I raise rabbits."
msgstr "토끼를 키웁니다."

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Are you here to protect us?"
msgstr "우릴 지키러 왔어?"

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Pleased to meet you."
msgstr "만나서 반가워."

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "I'm just trying to get by."
msgstr "그냥 살아가려는 중이야."

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_staff\NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_staff\NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_visitors\NPC_arsonist.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_visitors\NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Heard anything about the outside world?"
msgstr "바깥소식 좀 들은 거 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "You look different?"
msgstr "다르게 보이는데?"

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
#: data\mods\Arcana_BN\npcs\TALK_HERMIT.json
#: data\mods\Arcana_BN\npcs\TALK_MAGE_HUNTER.json
msgid "Anything I can help with?"
msgstr "내가 뭐 도울 것 없을까?"

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Getting by will do for now."
msgstr "살아가는 건 당분간 될 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "I guess it has to."
msgstr "그래야겠지."

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "I raise my rabbits, I seem to have more in common with them every day."
msgstr "토끼를 키워, 날마다 걔네랑 공통점이 더 많아지는 것 같아."

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_visitors\NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "Well, then…"
msgstr "음, 그럼…"

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid ""
"People come to me to learn how to keep rabbits.  They learn and they go.  I "
"like to think I'm making the world better."
msgstr "사람들이 토끼 기르는 법 배우러 나한테 와. 배우고 떠나지. 세상을 더 좋게 만들고 있다고 생각해."

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "That sounds optimistic?"
msgstr "낙관적으로 들리는데?"

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid ""
"If I teach one hundred people how to raise rabbits, that's potentially a "
"hundred communities given food and fur before those people teach anyone "
"else."
msgstr ""
"백 명한테 토끼 기르는 법을 가르치면, 그 사람들이 다른 사람 가르치기 전에 잠재적으로 백 개 공동체에 음식과 모피를 주는 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "That's the most hopeful thing I've heard so far."
msgstr "여태 들은 것 중 제일 희망적이야."

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Same way you got yours, I bet."
msgstr "네가 네 걸 얻은 것과 같은 방식이겠지."

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "CRISPR?  Radiation?  Something in the water?  Maybe it was bunnies."
msgstr "크리스퍼? 방사선? 물에 뭔가? 어쩌면 토끼였을지도."

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "So it goes."
msgstr "그런 거지."

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_visitors\NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "You're disgusting."
msgstr "역겹군."

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "I'm very sorry to tell you this, but you should look in a mirror."
msgstr "이렇게 말해 유감이지만 거울을 봐야 해."

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Insulting people who could help you is unlikely to aid survival."
msgstr "도와줄 수 있는 사람을 모욕하는 건 생존에 도움 안 돼."

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Timber!"
msgstr "목재다!"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Timber!'}'
#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Bring five logs."
msgstr "통나무 5개를 가져오세요."

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "I need 5 logs for fences."
msgstr "울타리용 통나무 5개가 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid ""
"I need to build fences and ditches around my rabbits.  Could you find about…"
" five logs for me?"
msgstr "토끼 주변에 울타리랑 도랑을 지어야 해. 통나무… 다섯 개쯤 찾아줄 수 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "There's a lot of places to look.  Trees are pretty common."
msgstr "찾을 곳은 많아. 나무는 꽤 흔해."

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "How is the search going?  Have you found'em?"
msgstr "수색은 어때? 찾았어?"

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid ""
"I really appreciate your help.  Don't worry, you won't leave empty-handed."
msgstr "도와줘서 정말 고마워. 걱정 마, 빈손으론 안 보낼게."

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Sweets"
msgstr "단 것"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Sweets'}'
#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Find 25 blackberries."
msgstr "블랙베리 25개를 찾으세요."

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "I need 25 blackberries."
msgstr "블랙베리 25개가 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Fruits would let me break the monotony of grains and meats."
msgstr "과일이 있으면 곡물과 고기의 단조로움을 깰 수 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid ""
"Thanks for accepting this task.  Otherwise I might kill a stranger for some "
"oranges.  Just kidding."
msgstr "이 일 받아줘서 고마워. 아니었으면 오렌지 몇 개 때문에 낯선 사람을 죽였을지도. 농담이야."

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Find someone growing berries or an orchard."
msgstr "베리를 기르는 사람이나 과수원을 찾아보세요."

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Have you found the fruit?"
msgstr "과일 찾았어?"

#: data\json\npcs\holdouts\Mr_Lapin.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Thank you for your help.  Here's your reward."
msgstr "도와줘서 고마워. 여기 보상이야."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\TALK_lumbermill_merchant.json
msgid "Hello there.  Nice to see you again."
msgstr "안녕. 또 보니 반가워."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "Who are you?  Would you like to trade?"
msgstr "누구야? 거래할래?"

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\TALK_lumbermill_merchant.json
#: data\json\npcs\scrap_trader\scrap_trader.json
msgid "Nice to meet you."
msgstr "만나서 반가워."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\TALK_lumbermill_merchant.json
msgid "Pleasure to see you again."
msgstr "또 보니 기뻐."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\TALK_lumbermill_merchant.json
#: data\json\npcs\scrap_trader\scrap_trader.json
msgid "See ya."
msgstr "나중에 봐."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Where might your friends be?"
msgstr "네 친구들은 어디 있을까?"

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Can I stay here?"
msgstr "여기 있어도 돼?"

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "Can I purchase some of your wares?"
msgstr "네 물건 좀 살 수 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "How's that smoker coming along?"
msgstr "그 훈제기는 잘돼가?"

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid ""
"I was homeless for a while before <the_cataclysm>.  I met some buddies out "
"on the road and we were camping out here.  Now we're just scraping by on "
"what we can find, mostly.  We're willing to trade, though.  Who knows, you "
"might find yourself a good deal."
msgstr ""
"<the_cataclysm> 전에 한동안 노숙했어. 길 위에서 친구 몇을 만나서 여기서 야영하고 있었지. 지금은 대부분 찾을 수 있는 "
"걸로 근근이 살아. 그래도 거래는 해. 모르지, 좋은 거래를 찾을지도."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid ""
"Making ends meet, even in the worst circumstances.  We've been camping out "
"here now, trading with whoever passes by.  If something catches your eye, "
"let me know."
msgstr "최악의 상황에서도 생계 유지 중이야. 지금 여기서 야영하면서 지나가는 사람 누구랑도 거래해. 눈에 드는 게 있으면 말해."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid ""
"We got tired of being out on the road and decided to stay here for a bit.  "
"We've found a lot of useful stuff out and about, so if you see anything you "
"need I'll make you a deal."
msgstr "길 위 생활에 질려서 한동안 여기 머물기로 했어. 돌아다니며 유용한 걸 많이 찾았으니, 필요한 게 보이면 거래해줄게."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\TALK_lumbermill_merchant.json
msgid "Hm."
msgstr "흠."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid ""
"They should be around here somewhere.  We usually go out in teams to "
"scavenge, and they haven't told me about anything yet.  They might have "
"something for you to do."
msgstr "근처 어딘가에 있을 거야. 보통 팀으로 나가 수색하는데, 아직 뭐라고 한 건 없어. 네가 할 일이 있을지도."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid ""
"Well, I don't see anything wrong with it.  We should have a spare bed in "
"that tent you could sleep on.  Just don't cause any trouble."
msgstr "음, 뭐 잘못될 건 없겠네. 저 텐트에 여분 침대가 있을 거야, 거기서 잘 수 있어. 문제만 안 일으키면."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid ""
"Sure!  It turned out well enough for us, and it's one of the few fresh meats"
" we can find.  I'll pay fairly for it."
msgstr "물론이지! 우리한텐 충분히 잘됐고, 찾을 수 있는 몇 안 되는 신선육 중 하나야. 공정하게 값 쳐줄게."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "I have nothing."
msgstr "아무것도 없어."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "I have nothing.  I'd best get going."
msgstr "아무것도 없어. 가는 게 좋겠네."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid ""
"It's wonderful!  We've been preserving a lot more of what we manage to "
"scavenge so we won't have to worry about our food going bad for a while.  "
"We'd be willing to sell some of the excess, if you want."
msgstr "훌륭해! 수색한 걸 훨씬 많이 보존하고 있어서 한동안 음식 상할 걱정 안 해도 돼. 원하면 남는 거 좀 팔 수 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "I think I'll buy 10 slices.  [$20]"
msgstr "10조각 살게. [$20]"

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "You think 20 slices would be alright?  [$40]"
msgstr "20조각이면 될까? [$40]"

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "I'll take 50 slices of the stuff.  [$100]"
msgstr "50조각 살게. [$100]"

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "I'll keep that in mind."
msgstr "기억하도록 하지."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Who are you, and what are you doing here?"
msgstr "누구야, 여기서 뭐 하는 거야?"

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Nice to meet you.  I mean no harm."
msgstr "만나서 반가워. 해칠 뜻 없어."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "What's with that guy in the tent?"
msgstr "저 텐트에 있는 놈은 뭐야?"

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Want to trade?"
msgstr "거래할래?"

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid ""
"Oh, they're right over there, and one of us is in that tent over there.  "
"They handle any stuff we manage to scavenge, so feel free to trade for what "
"you want."
msgstr ""
"아, 저기 바로 있어, 그리고 우리 중 하나가 저 텐트에 있어. 우리가 수색한 물건을 걔네가 관리하니까 원하는 건 편하게 거래해."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid ""
"Thanks for the offer, but I don't have anything to spare right now.  One of "
"my buddies over in that tent handles stuff like this, though.  You might "
"find something."
msgstr "제안은 고맙지만 지금 나눠줄 게 없어. 근데 저 텐트의 친구가 이런 걸 관리해. 뭔가 찾을지도."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid ""
"Well, they were the brightest of us when all hell broke loose.  They managed"
" to get us some food and weapons early on.  I guess that just kinda made "
"them the leader."
msgstr ""
"뭐, 지옥이 풀렸을 때 걔네가 우리 중 제일 똑똑했어. 초반에 음식이랑 무기를 구해줬지. 그게 자연스럽게 걔넬 리더로 만든 것 같아."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_survivor.json
msgid ""
"I was homeless before everything went down, just camping out here for a "
"while.  Stuck up <name_b>s shunned me for my condition, but they're all dead"
" now.  I guess I'm better off than they are."
msgstr ""
"전부 무너지기 전엔 노숙자였어, 그냥 한동안 여기서 야영했지. 거만한 <name_b> 놈들이 내 처지를 보고 외면했지만, 지금은 다 "
"죽었어. 걔네보단 내가 낫네."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_survivor.json
msgid ""
"I guess you probably wouldn't have noticed this place before shit hit the "
"fan, but I've been down here for quite a while."
msgstr "똥이 선풍기에 끼기 전엔 이곳을 못 알아봤을 거야, 근데 난 여기 꽤 오래 있었어."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_survivor.json
msgid ""
"Nothing to it.  Before <the_cataclysm>, it didn't take much to find yourself"
" here.  And I guess it just made sense to stay.  We seem to be doing better "
"than most, anyway."
msgstr ""
"별 거 아니야. <the_cataclysm> 전엔, 여기 오는 건 별로 안 어려웠어. 그리고 머무는 게 타당했지. 어쨌든 우린 대부분보다"
" 잘하는 것 같아."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_survivor.json
msgid "Surviving, as I always have.  Is that what you mean?"
msgstr "항상 그래왔듯 생존 중이야. 그걸 물어본 거야?"

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\TALK_homeless_survivor.json
msgid ""
"It's hard to say exactly what I'm doing out here, but I guess one thing just"
" leads to another and… well, you're just being nice when you ask, aren't "
"you?  It doesn't matter now anyway.  I'm here and I'm still alive."
msgstr ""
"여기서 정확히 뭘 하는지 말하긴 어렵지만, 하나가 다른 하나로 이어지고… 뭐, 물어볼 땐 그냥 친절한 거지? 어차피 이젠 상관없어. 난 "
"여기 있고 아직 살아있어."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Sticky Situation"
msgstr "끈적한 상황"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Sticky Situation'
#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Kill some slimes in exchange for credit with some of the traders and bring "
"back six of their slime scraps."
msgstr "슬라임 몇 마리를 죽여 상인들에게 공로를 인정받고 슬라임 조각 6개를 가져오세요."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "I need some help."
msgstr "도움이 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"We've had some trouble with slimes not far from us.  It's been hard going "
"through there with all them around, so I want you to go take care of it."
msgstr "근처에서 슬라임 문제가 있었어. 그 수많은 놈들이 있어서 거기 지나가기 힘들어, 가서 처리해줬으면 해."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "I'll be here when you get back."
msgstr "돌아올 때 여기 있을게."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "No problem.  I'm sure one of us will get to it anyway."
msgstr "괜찮아. 어차피 우리 중 누군가는 할 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Sure, they can be cut, but I'd say it's better to splatter them with "
"something large and heavy."
msgstr "그래, 자를 수는 있는데, 크고 무거운 걸로 흩뿌리는 게 낫다고 봐."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Are those slimes dead yet?"
msgstr "그 슬라임들 죽였어?"

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Nice.  I'll just take those off your hands.  Might be good for greasing the "
"bike chains and door hinges around here even though it is a bit… abnormal."
msgstr "좋아. 그냥 넘겨줘. 좀… 비정상적이긴 해도 자전거 체인이랑 문 경첩 기름칠에 좋을 수 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"You don't look nearly as sticky as you're supposed to.  Get back to it."
msgstr "예상만큼 끈적해 보이지 않네. 돌아가서 해."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Did they give you the slip?  It's worse than I thought, then."
msgstr "따돌린 거야? 생각보다 나쁘네."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Arthropod Hunting"
msgstr "절지동물 사냥"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Arthropod Hunting'
#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Kill some ants and bring back ten slices of their meat in exchange for "
"credit with some of the traders."
msgstr "개미 몇 마리를 죽이고 고기 10조각을 가져와 상인들에게 공로를 인정받으세요."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"The last time we went out scouting we found some gargantuan ants crawling "
"around.  We thought we might see how they taste, if they could be cooked and"
" whatnot.  I want you to go kill one and bring back some of its meat."
msgstr ""
"지난번 정찰 나갔을 때 기가 막힌 거대 개미들이 기어다니는 걸 봤어. 맛이 어떨지, 요리할 수 있는지 봐볼까 했지. 가서 하나 죽이고 "
"고기 좀 가져다줬으면 해."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Alright, I can understand that."
msgstr "알았어, 이해해."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "A shotgun of some sort might work well."
msgstr "산탄총 같은 게 잘 맞을 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the meat?"
msgstr "고기 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Nice.  I'll get these cooked up.  Who knows, we might want some more in the "
"future."
msgstr "좋아. 요리해볼게. 모르지, 나중에 더 원할지도."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "You sure?  I don't see my meat anywhere."
msgstr "정말? 내 고기가 어디에도 안 보이는데."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Ah, well.  It's no big deal."
msgstr "아, 뭐. 대단한 건 아니야."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Refurbishments"
msgstr "수선"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Refurbishments'
#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 100 planks."
msgstr "목재 판자 100개를 구하세요."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"My buddies and I have decided to stay here for a while.  This is about the "
"only safe place out here, and it's kinda become our home.  Anyway, we're "
"going to build a wall.  Our old logs have provided a bunch of the wood, but "
"we still need quite a few planks.  About 100 of them.  If you could get it "
"for us, I'd be grateful."
msgstr ""
"친구들이랑 한동안 여기 머물기로 했어. 여기가 이 근처 유일하게 안전한 곳이라, 일종의 집이 됐지. 어쨌든, 벽을 지을 거야. 오래된 "
"통나무가 목재 많이 줬는데 아직 판자가 꽤 필요해. 약 100개. 구해줄 수 있으면 고맙겠어."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  We'll be sure to compensate your efforts."
msgstr "고마워. 노력은 꼭 보상할게."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Alright, I can understand that.  I guess I'll have to get it myself."
msgstr "알았어, 이해해. 직접 구해야겠네."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Any nearby forest should have all you need.  Otherwise, you might try "
"breaking down some furniture in town."
msgstr "근처 숲이면 필요한 건 다 있을 거야. 아니면 마을에서 가구 좀 부숴봐."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Do you have my lumber?"
msgstr "내 목재 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  We'll start right away."
msgstr "고마워. 바로 시작할게."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "I can tell you're lying.  I don't see shit."
msgstr "거짓말인 거 알아. 아무것도 안 보여."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Refurbishments Pt. II"
msgstr "수선 2부"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Refurbishments Pt. II'
#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 150 planks."
msgstr "목재 판자 150개를 구하세요."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Now that we've got the wall done, we decided to move out of these old tents."
"  We still have some leftover nails but we need more wood.  So, if you could"
" get us 150 planks, we'd be grateful."
msgstr ""
"벽이 다 됐으니 이 낡은 텐트에서 나가기로 했어. 남은 못은 좀 있는데 목재가 더 필요해. 그래서, 판자 150개 구해줄 수 있으면 "
"고맙겠어."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Refurbishments Pt. III"
msgstr "수선 3부"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Refurbishments Pt. III'
#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 6 ropes."
msgstr "밧줄 6개를 구하세요."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Our entrance is wide open so we're building a gate over it.  Problem is we "
"don't have any ropes.  If you could find some for us, we'll pay you."
msgstr "입구가 활짝 열려 있어서 문을 지으려 해. 문제는 밧줄이 없다는 거야. 찾아줄 수 있으면 값을 치를게."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"If you can't find any rope around, one of our books should have something on"
" rope-making.  Most plants can be woven into a halfway decent rope."
msgstr "주변에 밧줄이 없으면 우리 책 중 하나에 밧줄만드는 법이 있을 거야. 대부분 식물로 그럴듯한 밧줄을 짤 수 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Do you have my ropes?"
msgstr "내 밧줄 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Refurbishments Pt. IV"
msgstr "수선 4부"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Refurbishments Pt. IV'
#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Obtain a wood saw."
msgstr "목공 톱 하나를 구하세요."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"We appreciate all of your help but we can't rely on everyone else to do "
"things for us.  I'd be willing to buy a wood saw of some kind from you so we"
" can cut our own wood as needed."
msgstr "도와준 건 감사하지만 모든 걸 남한테 맡길 수는 없어. 목공 톱 같은 걸 너한테 사고 싶어, 필요할 때 직접 자르게."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "A hardware store or lumbermill should have one"
msgstr "철물점이나 제재소에 하나쯤 있을 거야"

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Do you have my saw?"
msgstr "내 톱 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  Pick what you want from our stash."
msgstr "고마워. 비축분에서 원하는 걸 골라."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Refurbishments Pt. V"
msgstr "수선 5부"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Refurbishments Pt. V'
#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Obtain a shovel."
msgstr "삽 하나를 구하세요."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Our sanitation here has become… problematic.  We've mostly just been going "
"outside the walls to piss.  Not only is it kinda unhealthy, but the last "
"time I wandered out I almost got eaten!  So, if you'd get us a shovel, we "
"could make a latrine for ourselves.  We'll pay you fairly, as usual."
msgstr ""
"여기 위생이… 문제가 됐어. 대부분 벽 밖에 나가서 소변 봤거든. 좀 비위생적인 것도 문제지만, 지난번 밖에 나갔다 먹힐 뻔했어! "
"그래서, 삽을 구해주면 화장실을 만들 수 있어. 평소처럼 공정하게 값 치를게."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "A hardware store should have one lying around."
msgstr "철물점에 하나쯤 굴러다닐 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the shovel?"
msgstr "삽 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  We're eternally grateful to you."
msgstr "고마워. 영원히 감사할게."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "I'll do it myself, then."
msgstr "그럼 직접 할게."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Refurbishments Pt. VI"
msgstr "수선 6부"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Refurbishments Pt. VI'
#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Obtain a charcoal smoker."
msgstr "숯 훈제기 하나를 구하세요."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Turns out that ant meat you got us wasn't actually too bad.  A little tough,"
" sure, but perfectly edible.  The problem now is we need a way of preserving"
" it.  One of those portable charcoal smokers would be really great.  Heck, "
"you might even wanna buy some."
msgstr ""
"네가 가져다준 개미 고기, 사실 나쁘지 않더라. 좀 질기긴 해도 먹을 만해. 문제는 보존할 방법이 필요해. 휴대용 숯 훈제기 같은 게 "
"있으면 정말 좋겠어. 너도 살 마음이 들지도."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Maybe try a farm?  I bet those rural folks were pretty invested in "
"preserving their food."
msgstr "농장을 봐볼래? 시골 사람들은 음식 보존에 꽤 진심이었을 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the charcoal smoker?"
msgstr "숯 훈제기 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  We'll get started right away."
msgstr "고마워. 바로 시작할게."

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\shelter_survivors.json
msgid "camper"
msgstr "야영자"

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\shelter_survivors.json
msgid "scavenger"
msgstr "스캐빈저"

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\shelter_survivors.json
msgid "prepper"
msgstr "프레퍼"

#: data\json\npcs\homeless\shelter_survivors.json
msgid "moonshiner"
msgstr "밀주 제조자"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Barry Isherwood"
msgstr "배리 이셔우드"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Missing member of the Isherwood family."
msgstr "실종된 이셔우드 가족의 일원."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hey, <name_g>."
msgstr "안녕, <name_g>."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "I can't believe my eyes.  Please get me outta here…"
msgstr "내 눈을 못 믿겠어. 여기서 나가게 해줘…"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "I've come to take you home, lets go."
msgstr "집에 데려가러 왔어, 가자."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hey buddy, feel like talking about what you saw in that tower?"
msgstr "이봐, 그 탑에서 본 거 얘기할 마음 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Guneet_Singh.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_John_Clemens.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Mandeep_Singh.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
#: data\json\obsoletion\npc_dialogue.json
msgid "I'd better get going."
msgstr "가봐야겠어요."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, I think we need to talk about it, but I'm not ready yet.  Let me "
"reclaim my life for a while. "
msgstr "그래, 얘기해야 할 것 같긴 한데 아직 준비가 안 됐어. 한동안 내 삶을 되찾게 해줘."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Sounds good, Barry."
msgstr "알았어, 배리."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Return Barry to Eddie at the dairy."
msgstr "배리를 낙농장의 에디에게 데려가세요."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "I just want to go home."
msgstr "그냥 집에 가고 싶어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "I can't believe you are here, please take me back to the ranch."
msgstr "여기 와줬다니 믿기지 않아, 목장으로 데려가줘."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thank you, I thought I was dead."
msgstr "고마워, 죽은 줄 알았어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Please god no!"
msgstr "제발 신이시여 안 돼!"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "We shouldn't stay here too long, more might show up."
msgstr "여기 너무 오래 있지 마, 더 나타날 수 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Thanks, we'll never be able to repay you, Here's a token of my gratitude, I "
"made these suits for my family and always keep a few extra around."
msgstr "고마워, 은혜는 다 못 갚을 거야. 감사의 표시로, 가족 위해 만든 옷이야 — 여분을 항상 두고 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "I don't feel saved…"
msgstr "구해진 기분이 아니야…"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Tell my family that I love them…"
msgstr "가족에게 사랑한다고 전해줘…"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Carlos Isherwood"
msgstr "카를로스 이셔우드"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm Jesse's husband, part of the Isherwood family"
msgstr "난 제시의 남편이야, 이셔우드 가족의 일원이지."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I see that badge, I think you need to keep on walking, straight off this "
"property."
msgstr "그 배지가 보이네. 계속 걸어서 이 땅 바깥으로 나가는 게 좋겠어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hello Sir, what brings you here?"
msgstr "안녕하세요 선생님, 무슨 일로 오셨나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hello Ma'am, what brings you here?"
msgstr "안녕하세요 부인, 무슨 일로 오셨나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Yeah, I'm a Marshal, what are you going to do about it?"
msgstr "그래, 나 보안관이야, 어쩔 건데?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, looks like you are building a forge setup."
msgstr "안녕, 대장간 설비를 만들고 있는 것 같네."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, Jack and Claire suggested I come talk to you about a job."
msgstr "안녕, 잭과 클레어가 일 관련해 너랑 얘기하래."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"It is coming together.  I want to make our own tools, repair our items and "
"even create some weapons and ammunition reloading."
msgstr "형태가 갖춰지고 있어. 도구 직접 만들고, 물건 고치고, 무기랑 장탄 재장전까지 하고 싶어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "What do you need?"
msgstr "뭐가 필요해?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "I heard about Barry, can you tell me what captured him?"
msgstr "배리 얘기 들었어, 뭘 잡아갔는지 말해줄 수 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"It was pink and really fast, it had lots of limbs, definitely not human.  It"
" easily kept up with us when we tried to escape, horrifying stuff.  Barry "
"just dropped to the ground, and the thing swept him away."
msgstr ""
"분홍색이고 엄청 빨랐어. 팔다리가 많았고 절대 인간이 아니었지. 도망쳐도 가볍게 따라왔어, 끔찍했어. 배리가 그냥 바닥에 쓰러졌고, 그게"
" 배릴 휩쓸어 갔어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "You all just gonna leave him out there to his fate?"
msgstr "걍 걔를 저기서 운명에 맡길 거야?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We tracked it for a while, but lost the trail.  Right now we don't have the "
"resources to try to rescue him.  Chris has been trying to pick up the trail "
"again and figure out a rescue plan."
msgstr "한동안 추적했는데 흔적을 놓쳤어. 지금은 구조할 여력이 없어. 크리스가 흔적을 다시 찾고 구조 계획을 세우려 하고 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"The big item I need is an anvil, once I have that I can get a lot of repairs"
" done."
msgstr "필요한 큰 물건은 모루야, 그것만 있으면 수리를 많이 할 수 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Chris is hiking the perimeter of our land, planning some defense options."
msgstr "크리스는 우리 땅 외곽을 돌며 방어 방안을 계획 중이야."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "You should get off my farm, I won't deal with a government stooge."
msgstr "내 농장에서 나가, 정부 주구랑은 거래 안 해."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Go on..."
msgstr "계속해…"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Is your forge operational?"
msgstr "대장간 작동해?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Where can I find Chris?"
msgstr "크리스를 어디서 찾을 수 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find an anvil or bronze anvil"
msgstr "모루나 청동 모루를 찾으세요"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "I need an anvil to do advanced metal work."
msgstr "고급 금속 작업에 모루가 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "I could really use an anvil."
msgstr "모루가 정말 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "You might be able to find one in a hardware store or similar."
msgstr "철물점 같은 데서 찾을 수 있을 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks anyway, we'll find the time to make it ourselves."
msgstr "어쨌든 고마워, 시간 내서 직접 만들게."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"If you can't find one, you might be able to find the raw steel or try your "
"hand at bronze casting to make one."
msgstr "못 찾으면 원재강을 찾거나 청동 주조로 직접 만들어봐."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Do you have the anvil?"
msgstr "모루 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I appreciate it, this will really make a difference, here's some horse armor"
" I've been working on.  Eventually I'll have the whole herd outfitted."
msgstr "정말 고마워, 이게 큰 차이를 만들 거야. 작업 중이던 말 갑옷이야. 결국엔 말떼 전부 갖출 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "What good does this do me?"
msgstr "이게 나한테 뭐 도움돼?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find Chris Isherwood"
msgstr "크리스 이셔우드를 찾으세요"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Chris hasn't come back from his latest search for Barry, I'm getting "
"concerned."
msgstr "크리스가 지난번 배리 수색에서 안 돌아왔어, 걱정돼."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Can you go find my son and tell him to check in with us."
msgstr "내 아들 좀 찾아서 우리한테 연락하라고 전해줄래?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh well.  I hope he turns up soon."
msgstr "어쨌든. 곧 나타나길 바라."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"He might be on the property somewhere, maybe by that old cabin near the "
"entrance, sometimes he camps there."
msgstr "우리 땅 어딘가에 있을 거야, 입구 근처 낡은 오두막 쪽일지도 — 가끔 거기서 야영하거든."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_staff\NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_staff\NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_visitors\NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\DinoMod\NPC\NC_Red.json
msgid "How is the search going?"
msgstr "수색은 어떻게 되어가?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Thanks, I was getting ready to go look myself.  Now that I have the anvil, "
"I've been working on new armor for the horses, take this prototype I made."
msgstr "고마워, 직접 찾으러 가려던 참이었어. 모루가 있으니 말용 새 갑옷을 만들고 있었지 — 만든 시제품을 가져가."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "I hope he didn't meet Barry's fate…"
msgstr "배리의 운명은 안 겪었길 바라…"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Chris Isherwood"
msgstr "크리스 이셔우드"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm Jesse and Carlos' son, part of the Isherwood family"
msgstr "난 제시와 카를로스의 아들이야, 이셔우드 가족의 일원이지."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I see that badge.  You need to leave our land, my relatives have no fondness"
" for Marshals."
msgstr "그 배지가 보이네. 우리 땅에서 나가야 해, 우리 친척들은 보안관을 안 좋아해."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, what's up?"
msgstr "안녕, 무슨 일이야?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Hi, Your dad asked me to come find you, said you've been looking for your "
"uncle."
msgstr "안녕, 네 아빠가 찾아오라고 했어, 삼촌을 찾고 있다며."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I was talking to Luke earlier, said you had some interesting ideas about the"
" world ending.  Is it tied to Barry's abduction?"
msgstr "아까 루크랑 얘기했어, 세상의 종말에 대한 재밌는 생각이 있대. 배리 납치랑 관련 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, they are always worried about us, I prefer to survey the land and try "
"to track the changes.  I'm thinking about fixing up this cabin for some "
"peace and quiet…"
msgstr "그래, 항상 우릴 걱정하지. 난 땅을 살피고 변화를 추적하는 게 좋아. 평온을 찾으려고 이 오두막을 고칠까 생각 중이야…"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Sounds like you are restless, why not leave?"
msgstr "불안해 보이네, 떠나지 그래?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "What sort of changes have you seen?"
msgstr "어떤 변화를 봤는데?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I was talking to Luke earlier, said you had some interesting ideas about the"
" world ending."
msgstr "아까 루크랑 얘기했어, 세상의 종말에 대한 재밌는 생각이 있대."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"My family is convinced that if we stay here, we'll be able to weather this "
"catastrophe.  Since technology has failed, they've doubled down on older "
"traditions.  I think we need to get out there and find some answers before "
"settling on a path."
msgstr ""
"우리 가족은 여기 있으면 이 재앙을 버틸 수 있다고 믿어. 기술이 실패한 이후 옛 방식을 더 고수해. 난 길을 정하기 전에 밖에 나가 "
"답을 찾아야 한다고 봐."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"In one of my longer trips looking for Barry, I saw something out in a field."
"  I didn't get close but I swear unbelievable monsters were coming out of "
"it.  It kinda shimmered, almost like it wasn't quite there.  I've been "
"tracking those monsters for a while…"
msgstr ""
"배리 찾는 긴 여정 중에 들판에서 뭘 봤어. 가까이 가진 않았지만 믿을 수 없는 괴물들이 거기서 나오는 게 분명해. 아른거렸지, 거기 "
"없는 것처럼. 한동안 그 괴물들을 추적해왔어…"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "What did you find?"
msgstr "뭘 찾았는데?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"They made their way to this weird spire like structure, I've never seen "
"anything like it, it glistened in the sun like something organic.  I think "
"they could be holding Barry there, I've seen them arrive and leave with "
"other humans."
msgstr ""
"놈들이 이상한 첨탑 같은 구조물로 갔어, 그런 건 처음 봐 — 햇빛에 유기물처럼 반짝였어. 배리를 거기 잡아뒀을 수도 있어, 다른 "
"인간들이랑 들어갔다 나오는 걸 봤거든."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"If you join up with me, we can go check it out, I want to see what they are "
"doing."
msgstr "나랑 같이 가면 확인하러 갈 수 있어, 놈들이 뭘 하는지 보고 싶어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Well, wildlife is more hostile and I've seen gigantic insects around, never "
"mind all these monsters.  I've also found mysterious dead spots and mutated "
"vegetation.  I don't think staying on a farm is sustainable forever, there "
"are big planet wide changes occurring."
msgstr ""
"뭐, 야생동물이 더 적대적이고 거대 곤충도 봤어, 괴물들은 말할 것도 없지. 수수께끼의 고사 지대랑 변이 식물도 발견했어. 농장에 머무는"
" 게 영원히 지속 가능하다고 안 봐, 행성 전체 규모의 변화가 일어나고 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "You should leave before my family sees you."
msgstr "우리 가족이 보기 전에 떠나는 게 좋을 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Your dad asked me to come find you, said you've been looking for your uncle."
msgstr "네 아빠가 찾아오라고 했어, 삼촌을 찾고 있다며."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I was talking to Luke earlier, he said you had some interesting ideas about "
"the world ending."
msgstr "아까 루크랑 얘기했어, 세상의 종말에 대한 재밌는 생각이 있대."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Free Barry from the mysterious structure"
msgstr "수수께끼의 구조물에서 배리를 구출하세요"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We need to investigate the alien encampment and try to find out what "
"happened to Barry."
msgstr "외계인 야영지를 조사하고 배리에게 무슨 일이 있었는지 알아내야 해."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "I can take you to the structure, I tracked them to it."
msgstr "구조물까지 안내할 수 있어, 추적해서 찾았거든."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Awesome, I want some answers!"
msgstr "좋아, 답을 찾고 싶어!"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks anyway, I'll keep my eye on it, maybe I'll find a way one day."
msgstr "어쨌든 고마워, 계속 지켜볼게, 언젠가 방법을 찾을지도."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I feel like we are underprepared if they see us, I marked the location for "
"you."
msgstr "놈들이 보면 우리 준비가 부족할 것 같아, 위치는 표시해뒀어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "You ready?"
msgstr "준비됐어?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"It's taller then I remember, we should look for prisoners.  I left a note "
"for my family before we left.  If we survive, the cabin should be fixed up "
"and ready for you to move in if you want to stay."
msgstr "기억보다 높네, 포로를 찾아봐야 해. 오기 전에 가족에게 쪽질 남겼어. 살아남으면 오두막도 고쳐둘 테니 원하면 들어와 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Well it was here…"
msgstr "여기 있었는데…"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Claire Isherwood"
msgstr "클레어 이셔우드"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm the matriarch of the Isherwood family"
msgstr "난 이셔우드 가족의 가주야."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Is that a U.S. Marshal's badge you're wearing?"
msgstr "그거 연방보안관 배지니?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hello, what brings you here?"
msgstr "안녕, 무슨 일로 왔니?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, what brings you here?"
msgstr "안녕, 무슨 일이니?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Yes, I'm a marshal."
msgstr "그래, 나 보안관이야."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hey, when would more of this stuff be ready?"
msgstr "저기, 이거 언제 더 나와?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, nice farm you have here."
msgstr "안녕, 농장이 좋네."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, Jack suggested I stop by and say hello."
msgstr "안녕, 잭이 들러서 인사하래."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\robofac\ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Let's trade."
msgstr "거래하자."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_visitors\NPC_arsonist.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_visitors\NPC_exterminator.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_visitors\NPC_hunter.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Around <interval>."
msgstr "<interval>쯤에."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_visitors\NPC_arsonist.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Alright then, bye."
msgstr "알았어, 안녕."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I live here with my husband, Jack.  He is working out in his shop."
msgstr "남편 잭이랑 여기 살아. 남편은 작업장에서 일하고 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "You are lucky to have your family still together."
msgstr "가족이 아직 함께 있는 게 행운이네."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Must be nice, to have the quiet place amid so much madness."
msgstr "이 미친 세상에서 조용한 곳이 있다니 좋겠어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"You don't need as much luck if you are prepared and work together.  We've "
"had our losses, my brother in law, Barry, was our best hunter but things are"
" so different now…"
msgstr "준비하고 함께 일하면 운이 덜 필요해. 손실도 있었지, 남편의 형 배리는 최고의 사냥꾼이었는데 지금은 너무 달라졌어…"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "What happened to Barry?"
msgstr "배리한테 무슨 일 있었는데?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "A farm must be a pretty safe place these days."
msgstr "요즘 농장이 꽤 안전한 곳이겠네."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Well, nice to meet you.  I imagine Jack was boasting about my herbal "
"remedies, he's proud of what we've put together here."
msgstr "뭐, 만나서 반가워. 잭이 내 약초 치료약 자랑했겠네, 우리가 여기 이룬 걸 자랑스러워하거든."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "He did mention you make remedies, are they effective?"
msgstr "치료약 만든다고 하더라, 효과 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'd like to ask you something else…"
msgstr "다른 걸 물어보고 싶은데…"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I have always studied and made some natural remedies, but now they are more "
"essential than ever.  Who knows the next time we'll see a trained doctor.  "
"These remedies aren't always as effective, but they can do the job in a "
"pinch."
msgstr ""
"항상 자연 치료약을 공부하고 만들었는데, 지금은 어느 때보다 필수적이야. 훈련된 의사를 언제 다시 볼지 누가 알아. 항상 효과적이진 "
"않지만 급할 땐 제 몫을 해."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Some of their cows were killed before we realized what was happening, Barry "
"and Carlos went into the forest to find the predator but it was like nothing"
" they'd ever seen.  Carlos may be willing to tell you more."
msgstr ""
"우리가 눈치채기 전에 소 몇 마리가 죽었어, 배리랑 카를로스가 포식자를 찾으러 숲에 갔지만 들어본 적 없는 놈이었대. 카를로스가 더 "
"알려줄지도."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We've always tried to live a quiet life out here, I suppose we are doing "
"better than most."
msgstr "항상 여기서 조용한 삶을 살려 했어, 대부분보다 잘하고 있겠지."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Jack and I have been together for 40 years.  He's been my anchor through all"
" of this chaos."
msgstr "잭이랑 40년을 함께했어. 이 혼돈 속에서 나를 지탱해줬지."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Jesse and her family live up at the horse farm.  They may have some jobs for"
" you."
msgstr "제시랑 가족이 말농장 위쪽에 살아. 일거리가 있을지도."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Eddie's dairy is at the end of the road.  He's may have some jobs for you if"
" you are interested."
msgstr "에디의 낙농장이 길 끝에 있어. 관심 있으면 일거리가 있을 수도."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "You should get off our land, you have no business here."
msgstr "우리 땅에서 나가, 네가 여기 올 일이 아니야."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Ask away."
msgstr "물어봐."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Tell me about your husband, is he around?"
msgstr "남편 얘기 좀 해줘, 근처에 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Your daughter lives down the road?"
msgstr "딸은 길 아래에 살아?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Where is your brother's place?"
msgstr "오빠 집은 어디야?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Gather 50 dandelions"
msgstr "민들레 50개를 모으세요"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I could use some help foraging ingredients."
msgstr "재료 채집 도움이 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I could use some fresh dandelions for the next batch of wine.  Can you bring"
" me 50 dandelions?"
msgstr "다음 와인을 위해 신선한 민들레가 필요해. 민들레 50개 가져다줄래?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thank you, I'll put these to good use."
msgstr "고마워, 잘 쓸게."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh well.  Maybe some other time, thanks."
msgstr "어쨌든. 다른 때 다시, 고마워."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "You can find them in the fields during the spring and summer months."
msgstr "봄여름철 들판에서 찾을 수 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks.  Here's a small reward to show my appreciation for your help."
msgstr "고마워. 도움에 대한 작은 보답이야."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I wonder if the wildlife ate all the greens…"
msgstr "야생동물이 풀을 다 먹었나…"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find 20 bee balm seeds"
msgstr "벌새 향유 씨앗 20개를 찾으세요"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I could use some seeds from the forest."
msgstr "숲에서 씨앗 좀 구해야 해."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We could use some seeds for the next planting season.  Can you bring me 20 "
"bee balm seeds?"
msgstr "다음 파종기용 씨앗이 필요해. 벌새 향유 씨앗 20개 가져다줄래?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Thank you.  It's important to have a good stock before the flu season hits."
msgstr "고마워. 독감철 전에 충분히 비축하는 게 중요해."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"You should search through the forest, make sure to check in the underbrush "
"for beebalm and then harvest its seeds."
msgstr "숲을 찾아봐, 잡풀 속에서 벌새 향유를 확인하고 씨앗을 수확해."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Wow, perfect.  Here are some of my own remedies and if those don't work try "
"my other gift."
msgstr "와, 완벽해. 내 치료약이야 — 안 들으면 내 다른 선물을 써봐."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'll have to find someone more at home in the forest…"
msgstr "숲에 더 익숙한 사람을 찾아야겠네…"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find and capture a cat"
msgstr "고양이를 찾아서 잡으세요"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I could use a barn cat to keep the mice down."
msgstr "쥐를 잡아줄 헛간 고양이가 있으면 좋겠어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I saw some feral cats out by the old cabin.  Can you capture one for me?"
msgstr "낡은 오두막 근처에서 야생 고양이를 봤어. 한 마리 잡아줄래?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Thank you!  Please hurry back!  Take this cage so you have a chance of "
"capturing one."
msgstr "고마워! 빨리 돌아와! 이 케이지를 가져가면 잡을 수 있을 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I didn't want to use chemicals on these rats."
msgstr "이 쥐들한테 약품은 쓰고 싶지 않았어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Take this pet carrier; if you can get close to a cat, you can put it inside."
"  If you're having problems, try befriending it with cat food."
msgstr "이 이동장을 가져가; 고양이한테 가까이 가면 안에 넣을 수 있어. 안 되면 고양이 사료로 길들여봐."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Have you found a cat?"
msgstr "고양이 찾았어?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Thank you so much, I want you to have this copy of my natural remedy "
"journal.  I'll name this handsome fellow Joshua."
msgstr "정말 고마워, 내 자연 치료약 일지 사본을 줄게. 이 잘생긴 녀석 이름은 조슈아로 지을래."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "What?!  You're lying, I can tell!  Did you even bring back my cage?"
msgstr "뭐?! 거짓말이지, 다 알아! 내 케이지는 가져왔어?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh no!  I guess they are too nimble for you…"
msgstr "안 돼! 너한텐 너무 날렵한가봐…"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Eddie Isherwood"
msgstr "에디 이셔우드"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm a dairy farmer, part of the Isherwood family"
msgstr "난 낙농장 주인이야, 이셔우드 가족의 일원이지."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Nice dairy, must be tough keeping it running."
msgstr "낙농장이 좋네, 돌리기 힘들겠어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, Jack and Claire suggested I come down here and meet you."
msgstr "안녕, 잭과 클레어가 여기 와서 널만나보래."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "When will your cows produce again?"
msgstr "소들 언제 다시 젖 나와?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "If the cows don't get anything nasty it should be around <interval>."
msgstr "소들이 이상한 걸 안 먹으면 <interval>쯤에 나올 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Cheers, bye."
msgstr "잘 있어, 안녕."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I run this dairy with my son, Luke.  It's been a tough job keeping the herd "
"together, hasn't left a lot of time for other projects."
msgstr "아들 루크랑 이 낙농장을 운영해. 소떼 관리가 힘들어서 다른 일 할 시간이 별로 없어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I heard about Barry, such a tragedy.  Can you tell me more about what "
"happened?"
msgstr "배리 얘기 들었어, 비극이야. 무슨 일 있었는지 더 알려줄래?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Barry and Carlos went to hunt down something that killed our livestock, they"
" tracked it into the forest.  It grabbed Barry and ran off, Carlos might be "
"willing to tell you the story, he managed to allude it."
msgstr ""
"배리와 카를로스가 가축을 죽인 놈을 사냥하러 갔어, 숲으로 추적했지. 놈이 배릴 잡고 달아났어. 카를로스가 겨우 피했으니 얘기해줄지도."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, I could use some help getting materials.  I want to outfit that old "
"building across the road with some kilns.  We want to make our own jars and "
"pottery so we aren't dependent on scavenging."
msgstr ""
"그래, 재료 구하는 도움이 필요해. 길 건너 낡은 건물에 가마를 설치하고 싶어. 수색에 의존 안 하고 직접 항아리랑 도자기를 만들고 "
"싶어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "That is a good idea, what do you need?"
msgstr "좋은 생각이네, 뭐가 필요해?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm not interested right now, I'd better get going."
msgstr "지금은 관심 없어, 가야겠어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Luke was going to start college this year, now everything is upside down.  "
"He is adaptable though, had an idea to begin manufacturing our own jars and "
"pottery.  He's out in the old outbuilding right now, cleaning up the place."
msgstr ""
"루크는 올해 대학을 가려 했는데 모든 게 뒤집혔어. 그래도 적응력이 좋아서 직접 항아리랑 도자기를 만들자는 생각을 했지. 지금 낡은 부속"
" 건물에서 청소 중이야."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Jesse manages the horses and other livestock, she is amazing with animals."
msgstr "제시는 말이랑 다른 가축을 관리해, 동물 다루는 게 정말 대단해."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Carlos will be in his workshop if he isn't out hunting.  He is trying to get"
" a forge set up."
msgstr "카를로스는 사냥 안 나갔으면 작업장에 있을 거야. 대장간을 만들려 하고 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Your son helps with the dairy?"
msgstr "아들이 낙농장 도와?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "So, Jesse runs the horse farm?"
msgstr "그래서, 제시가 말농장을 운영해?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Where can I find Carlos?"
msgstr "카를로스는 어디서 찾아?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Gather 120 Rocks"
msgstr "돌 120개를 모으세요"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "We need to build some kilns."
msgstr "가마를 좀 지어야 해."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "I could use 120 rocks to construct some kilns."
msgstr "가마 지으려면 돌 120개가 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"You can break up some larger stones, or gather them up from the fields."
msgstr "큰 돌을 부수거나 들판에서 주워와."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks anyway, we'll find the time to get them ourselves."
msgstr "어쨌든 고마워, 시간 내서 직접 구할게."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Mining would always be an option if you had the resources."
msgstr "자원이 있다면 채광도 항상 선택지야."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Do you have the stone?"
msgstr "돌을 구했어?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "I appreciate it, this will make Luke happy."
msgstr "고마워, 루크가 좋아하겠어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Gather 2000 units of sand"
msgstr "모래 2000단위를 모으세요"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "I do have some resource gathering I could use help with."
msgstr "자원 채집에 도움이 필요하긴 해."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Now that the forge is set up, we could use 2000 units of sand to get "
"production going."
msgstr "대장간이 세워졌으니 생산 시작하려면 모래 2000단위가 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh well.  I'll try to find time to get it myself, thanks."
msgstr "어쨌든. 시간 내서 직접 구해볼게, 고마워."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"You can find it along river banks, or maybe landscaping supplies and "
"hardware stores."
msgstr "강둑에서 찾을 수 있어, 아니면 조경 자재점이나 철물점에서."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks, now Luke can get started.  Here's a token of my thanks."
msgstr "고마워, 이제 루크가 시작할 수 있겠어. 감사의 표시야."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "I wonder where all the sand went…"
msgstr "모래가 다 어디 갔지…"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Gather 1000 units of clay"
msgstr "점토 1000단위를 모으세요"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "I do have some resource gathering I could use help if you have time."
msgstr "시간 있으면 자원 채집 도움이 필요하긴 해."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Now that the clay kiln is set up, we could use 1000 units of clay to get "
"production going."
msgstr "점토 가마가 세워졌으니 생산 시작하려면 점토 1000단위가 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"You can find it along river banks, or maybe look for deposits in the forest."
msgstr "강둑에서 찾거나, 숲에서 매장지를 찾아봐."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Thanks, now Luke can get started making jugs, We'd like to give you a cow, "
"Here's Daisy, take good care of her and she'll provide you with milk."
msgstr "고마워, 이제 루크가 주전자를 만들 수 있겠어. 소를 주고 싶은데, 여기 데이지야 — 잘 돌보면 우유를 줄 거야."

#. ~ Nickname for creature 'mon_cow'
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Daisy"
msgstr "데이지"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Jack Isherwood"
msgstr "잭 이셔우드"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm the patriarch of the Isherwood family"
msgstr "난 이셔우드 가족의 가장이야."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hello traveler, what brings you here?"
msgstr "안녕 나그네, 무슨 일로 왔나?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm here to deliver some resources."
msgstr "자원을 전달하러 왔어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "This is a lot of land, you been here since the collapse?"
msgstr "땅이 넓네, 붕괴 때부터 여기 있었어?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hey, good to see you again."
msgstr "이봐, 다시 보니 좋네."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I live here with my wife, this is our family's land.  My daughter's family "
"and son live down the road."
msgstr "아내랑 여기 살아, 우리 가족의 땅이야. 딸네 가족과 아들은 길 아래에 살아."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Your whole family survived?"
msgstr "가족이 다 살아남았어?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We've had our losses… now we stay close to home, preparing for trouble.  "
"We've always taken disaster preparedness seriously, but we didn't expect "
"anything like this though."
msgstr "손실은 있었지… 이제 집 근처에 머물며 문제에 대비해. 항상 재해 대비를 진지하게 했지만 이런 건 예상 못 했어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Even out here we've had some attacks and seen … other things.  We have been "
"working on our defenses, but it takes time.  We've been able to keep up with"
" the crops and animals though so we won't have to risk our necks for "
"supplies."
msgstr ""
"여기서도 습격이 있었고… 다른 것도 봤어. 방어를 준비 중인데 시간이 걸려. 그래도 작물과 가축은 잘 돌보니 보급 때문에 목숨 걸 필요 "
"없어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "What sort of defenses do you want?"
msgstr "어떤 방어를 원해?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We want to put up more fencing and build some look out spots, maybe lay some"
" traps for the monsters.  We could use some extra resources.  If you want to"
" bring me logs, sand, clay, wire, nails, wood planks, and metal chunks, I'll"
" give you signed chits you can use to buy goods from any of the family."
msgstr ""
"울타리를 더 세우고 망루를 짓고 괴물 함정도 놓고 싶어. 여분 자원이 필요해. 통나무, 모래, 점토, 철사, 못, 목재 판자, 금속 "
"조각을 가져오면 서명한 증표를 줄게 — 우리 가족 누구한테서든 물건을 살 수 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Sounds reasonable, I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "합리적이네, 뭘 할 수 있나 볼게."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Claire and I have been together for 40 years now, couldn't run this place "
"without her.  She's quite the herbalist too, been real useful lately.  She "
"is probably in the house, you should stop in."
msgstr "클레어와 40년을 함께했어, 아내 없인 여길 못 돌려. 약초도 잘 아는데 요즘 정말 유용해. 아마 집에 있을 거야, 들러봐."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Jesse and her family live up at the horse farm.  Her husband, Carlos, may "
"have some jobs for you."
msgstr "제시와 가족이 말농장 위쪽에 살아. 남편 카를로스가 일거리가 있을지도."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Eddie's dairy is at the end of the road.  It's just him and his son since "
"Barry was taken by that thing in the woods."
msgstr "에디의 낙농장이 길 끝에 있어. 배리가 숲의 그 놈한테 끌려간 뒤론 에디랑 아들 둘뿐이야."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"You should get off my land, the government proved its incompetence with this"
" catastrophe."
msgstr "내 땅에서 나가, 정부는 이 재앙으로 무능을 증명했어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Go on ..."
msgstr "계속해…"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Tell me about your wife, is she around?"
msgstr "아내 얘기 좀 해줘, 근처에 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_staff\NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "Excellent.  What've you brought us?"
msgstr "훌륭해. 뭘 가져왔나?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_staff\NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "That's all for now.  Can we discuss something else?"
msgstr "이게 다야. 다른 얘기 해도 돼?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_staff\NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "That's all for now.  I'd best get going."
msgstr "이게 다야. 가야겠어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find 20 3L jars"
msgstr "3L 병 20개를 찾으세요"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "I could use some help scavenging."
msgstr "수색 도움이 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We could use some 3 liter jars to preserve our produce.  Can you bring me 20"
" large three liter jars?  I'll give you some preserves in exchange."
msgstr "농작물 저장용 3리터 병이 필요해. 큰 3리터 병 20개 가져다줄래? 보존식품으로 바꿔줄게."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thank you.  It's important to preserve foods while we can."
msgstr "고마워. 할 수 있을 때 음식 저장이 중요해."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh well.  I'll see if I can find another way, thanks."
msgstr "어쨌든. 다른 방법을 찾아볼게, 고마워."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_staff\NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_staff\NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Grocery stores, house kitchens, there's plenty of places to look."
msgstr "식료품점, 집 부엌, 찾을 곳은 많아."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Wow, perfect.  Thanks.  Here's your reward."
msgstr "와, 완벽해. 고마워. 여기 보상이야."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_staff\NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "I wonder where all the jars went…"
msgstr "병들이 다 어디 갔지…"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find 100 wheat seeds"
msgstr "밀 씨앗 100개를 찾으세요"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "I do have some more scavenging for you."
msgstr "수색할 게 좀 더 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We could use some seeds for the next planting season.  Can you bring me 100 "
"wheat seeds?  I'll give you some fresh produce."
msgstr "다음 파종기용 씨앗이 필요해. 밀 씨앗 100개 가져다줄래? 신선한 농산물을 줄게."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thank you.  It's important to preserve healthy foods while we can."
msgstr "고마워. 할 수 있을 때 건강식을 저장하는 게 중요해."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_staff\NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "Oh well.  I'll see if I can find another supplier, thanks."
msgstr "어쨌든. 다른 공급원을 찾아볼게, 고마워."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "I wonder where all the seeds went…"
msgstr "씨앗이 다 어디 갔지…"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Jesse Isherwood"
msgstr "제시 이셔우드"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm a horse trainer, part of the Isherwood family"
msgstr "난 조마사야, 이셔우드 가족의 일원이지."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Leave our property, Marshal."
msgstr "우리 땅에서 나가, 보안관."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hello, We don't see many people these days."
msgstr "안녕, 요즘 사람 구경이 드물어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, it looks like you are doing well here."
msgstr "안녕, 여기 잘 지내는 것 같네."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"It would be a lot harder without family.  Keeping the animals safe is "
"essential to our future."
msgstr "가족 없었으면 훨씬 힘들었을 거야. 동물을 지키는 게 우리 미래에 필수적이야."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Sounds like you are betting on civilization not coming back."
msgstr "문명이 안 돌아온다는 데 걸고 있네."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Do you have any animal care tips?"
msgstr "동물 관리 팁 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We can't wait for someone else to fix things, we need to take care of "
"ourselves."
msgstr "누가 해결해주길 못 기다려, 스스로 해결해야 해."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Horses make good all around companions.  They can get places that cars can't"
" and also help when all the engines fail.  They become very trusting if you "
"feed them some nice fodder."
msgstr "말은 다용도 동반자로 좋아. 차가 못 가는 곳도 가고 엔진이 다 멈춰도 도움 돼. 좋은 사료를 주면 아주 믿음직해져."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Oh good, I'm sure Jack wanted to put you to work.  If you're interested, I "
"could use a hand clearing out the woods.  My son, Chris has his hands full "
"trying to keep the predators under control."
msgstr "오 다행, 잭이 일 시키려 했겠네. 관심 있으면 숲 정리 도움이 필요해. 내 아들 크리스는 포식자 관리로 바빠."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'd like to speak with Carlos too about some work."
msgstr "카를로스와도 일 얘기를 하고 싶어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Is Chris around?  I'd like to know what he's run into out in the woods."
msgstr "크리스 있어? 숲에서 뭘 마주쳤는지 알고 싶어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "What needs killing?"
msgstr "뭘 죽여야 해?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "He's out back in the workshop."
msgstr "뒤쪽 작업장에 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"He's out doing some surveying, we are planning on adding a fence line and "
"some defenses."
msgstr "측량하러 나갔어, 울타리 라인과 방어를 추가할 계획이야."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Looks like you are doing well here."
msgstr "여기 잘 지내는 것 같네."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Jack and Claire suggested I come talk to you."
msgstr "잭과 클레어가 너랑 얘기하래."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Is Chris around?"
msgstr "크리스 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Kill wolves"
msgstr "늑대를 죽이세요"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "We could use some help killing some wolves."
msgstr "늑대 좀 죽이는 도움이 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"There's been some wolves that keep scaring our chickens and horses, I'd be "
"grateful if you can kill them."
msgstr "닭이랑 말을 계속 놀라게 하는 늑대들이 있어, 죽여주면 고맙겠어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Wonderful, let me know when it is done."
msgstr "좋아, 다 되면 알려줘."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks anyway, we will try some traps."
msgstr "어쨌든 고마워, 함정을 써볼게."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "A gun will probably help."
msgstr "총이 도움될 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Did you kill it?"
msgstr "죽였어?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I appreciate it, I've got this old saddle I want you to have.  I'll be happy"
" to put a horse under it if you want to do some more heroics."
msgstr "고마워, 이 낡은 안장을 줄게. 더 영웅짓 하고 싶으면 말도 내줄게."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Show me the bodies."
msgstr "시체를 보여줘."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Kill unknown monsters"
msgstr "미지의 괴물을 죽이세요"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "We could use some help killing some monsters."
msgstr "괴물 좀 죽이는 도움이 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We could use some help killing a pack of monsters.  I don't know what they "
"are, but they're very fast, I'm willing to outfit you with a horse if you "
"succeed."
msgstr "괴물 무리 죽이는 도움이 필요해. 뭔지는 모르지만 엄청 빨라, 성공하면 말을 내줄게."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Be ready for anything."
msgstr "뭐든 대비해."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "I guess we can try some traps, but we could really use the help."
msgstr "함정을 써볼 수 있겠지만 정말 도움이 필요하긴 해."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Bring something big if you've got the firepower, and keep your distance."
msgstr "화력이 있으면 큰 걸 들고 가, 거리 유지해."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I appreciate it, this will help keep our animals safe.  This is, Steve, he's"
" a good, steady horse.  You should talk to Carlos about some armor for him."
msgstr "고마워, 우리 동물들 지키는 데 도움될 거야. 여기 스티브, 얌전하고 튼튼한 말이야. 갑옷은 카를로스랑 얘기해봐."

#. ~ Nickname for creature 'mon_horse'
#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Steve"
msgstr "스티브"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Lisa Isherwood"
msgstr "리사 이셔우드"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Part of the Isherwood family"
msgstr "이셔우드 가족의 일원"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, this is a nice farm, your family live here?"
msgstr "안녕, 농장이 좋네, 네 가족이 여기 살아?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, I'm looking for Jesse."
msgstr "안녕, 제시를 찾고 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, I'm looking for Chris."
msgstr "안녕, 크리스를 찾고 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"My family owns all the land around here, my parents are out in the barn and "
"my other family is down he road."
msgstr "우리 가족이 이 근처 땅을 다 가졌어, 부모님은 헛간에 계시고 다른 가족은 길 아래에 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Ok, I'll go find them."
msgstr "알았어, 찾아볼게."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Mom is in her office, in the barn.  Be careful that you don't let our horses"
" out."
msgstr "엄마는 헛간 사무실에 계셔. 우리 말 나가게 하지 마."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Chris is out hunting or something right now."
msgstr "크리스는 지금 사냥이든 뭐든 나갔어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh, ok."
msgstr "아, 알았어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Or something?"
msgstr "뭐든이라니?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Nice talking to you, bye."
msgstr "얘기 즐거웠어, 안녕."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Well he's supposed to be hunting, but since you've been talking to Luke, I "
"bet he mentioned Chris wants to learn more about the end of the world.  "
"Sometimes he'll take off for a few days and I end up patching him up so my "
"parents don't know he left the property."
msgstr ""
"뭐 사냥하러 갔다는 건데, 루크랑 얘기했으면 크리스가 세상의 종말에 대해 더 알고 싶어한다고 들었겠네. 가끔 며칠씩 사라지는데 부모님이 "
"땅 나간 걸 모르게 치료해주는 건 내 몫이야."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Luke Isherwood"
msgstr "루크 이셔우드"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm Eddie's son, part of the Isherwood family"
msgstr "난 에디의 아들이야, 이셔우드 가족의 일원이지."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I see that badge, you should leave before my father sees you."
msgstr "그 배지 보이네, 아버지가 보기 전에 떠나."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Your dad said you were out here fixing up this place."
msgstr "네 아빠가 여기서 이곳 고치고 있다고 하더라."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hey, What are you doing out here?"
msgstr "이봐, 여기서 뭐 해?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, I work on it when I have the time.  I can't leave the farm too long, "
"so I can't find some things I need."
msgstr "그래, 시간 날 때 작업해. 농장을 오래 못 비우니 필요한 걸 못 찾아."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Must be tough having the world fall apart when you had you future to look "
"forward to."
msgstr "미래를 기대하던 참에 세상이 무너지니 힘들겠네."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I've been cleaning up this old building to make it into a workshop.  I want "
"to put up a pottery kiln and forge.  My dad doesn't want me leaving the farm"
" to find some things, says it is too dangerous."
msgstr ""
"이 낡은 건물을 청소해서 작업장으로 만들었어. 도자기 가마랑 대장간을 두고 싶어. 아빠는 위험하다고 농장 나가서 물건 찾지 말래."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I know all the grown ups worry about us, but I think we can adapt better "
"than them in the long run.  Chris has some interesting thoughts on the "
"matter."
msgstr "어른들이 다 걱정하는 건 아는데, 장기적으론 우리가 더 잘 적응할 거라 봐. 크리스가 이에 대해 재밌는 생각을 갖고 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "What sort of ideas does Chris have?"
msgstr "크리스가 어떤 생각을 갖고 있는데?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Things have been tough for my dad since Barry was captured.  He works till "
"he falls asleep most nights.."
msgstr "배리가 잡혀간 뒤로 아빠가 힘들어해. 대부분 밤에 잠들 때까지 일해…"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Chris is a little older than me, he's up at the horse farm with his parents "
"and sister, Lisa."
msgstr "크리스는 나보다 조금 연상이야, 부모님과 누나 리사랑 말농장 위쪽에 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Well, he doesn't agree that what we're doing here will last.  He thinks "
"things will only get worse.  It's tough to get the adults to listen though, "
"much less agree with his solution.  You can go talk to him more about it if "
"you want."
msgstr ""
"뭐, 우리가 여기 하는 게 지속된다고 안 믿어. 상황이 더 나빠질 거래. 어른들한테 들어라 하긴 어렵고 그의 해결책에 동의는 더 어려워."
" 원하면 직접 얘기해봐."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "You won't find any help here."
msgstr "여기선 도움 못 찾을 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Tell me about your dad."
msgstr "네 아빠 얘기 좀 해줘."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find The Art of Glassblowing book"
msgstr "『유리공예의 기술』 책을 찾으세요"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I need more knowledge to get the glass blowing started."
msgstr "유리공예를 시작하려면 더 지식이 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I could really use a book on glass blowing.  With the internet gone, I don't"
" have any handy references."
msgstr "유리공예 책이 정말 필요해. 인터넷이 사라져서 편한 참고자료가 없어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Fantastic, I'm not supposed to leave our land."
msgstr "대단해, 난 땅 나가면 안 돼서."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh well, figured I'd have to do a lot of practice anyway."
msgstr "어쨌든, 어차피 연습 많이 해야 할 것 같았어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "A library, bookstore or a glass blower's studio should have one."
msgstr "도서관, 서점, 유리공예가의 작업실에 있을 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Do you have the book?"
msgstr "책을 갖고 있습니까?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I appreciate it, this will make my life so much easier."
msgstr "고마워, 삶이 훨씬 쉬워질 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I don't see a book…?"
msgstr "책이 안 보이는데…?"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "At least you escaped with your life…"
msgstr "그래도 목숨은 건졌네…"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find a copy of DIY Compendium"
msgstr "『자작 총람』 책 한 권을 찾으세요"

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I need more knowledge to get better pottery."
msgstr "더 나은 도자기를 위해 지식이 더 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I could really use the book, DIY Compendium.  With the internet gone, I "
"don't have any handy references."
msgstr "『자작 총람』 책이 정말 필요해. 인터넷이 사라져서 편한 참고자료가 없어."

#: data\json\npcs\isherwood_farm\NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "A library, bookstore should have one, schools are another good idea."
msgstr "도서관이나 서점에 있을 거야, 학교도 좋은 곳이야."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#: data\json\npcs\scrap_trader\scrap_trader.json
msgid "Hello there.  Nice to see you, <name_g>."
msgstr "안녕. 반가워, <name_g>."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid "A stranger out here?  Who are you?"
msgstr "여기 낯선 사람? 누구야?"

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#: data\json\npcs\scrap_trader\scrap_trader.json
msgid "Do you need something?"
msgstr "뭐 필요해?"

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid "How do things work around here now?"
msgstr "지금 여기는 어떻게 돌아가?"

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#: data\json\npcs\scrap_trader\scrap_trader.json
msgid "Nah, see ya."
msgstr "아니, 나중에 봐."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid ""
"You mean you're still looking for wood?  Crazy… but we had a suspicion folks"
" might show up in an emergency.  Talk to the manager if you want to make an "
"order."
msgstr "아직도 목재를 찾아? 미쳤네… 근데 긴급상황에 사람들이 나타날지도라고 생각했어. 주문하려면 관리자한테 얘기해."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid ""
"Well, the machinery works just fine.  We were always self-sufficient and "
"<the_cataclysm> only really made that more apparent.  So if you want to "
"place an order and help keep the operation running, talk to the manager.  "
"We'll trade you for our wood."
msgstr ""
"뭐, 기계는 잘 돌아가. 우린 원래 자급자족이었고 <the_cataclysm>이 그걸 더 명확히 했지. 주문하고 싶고 운영 유지를 돕고 "
"싶으면 관리자한테 얘기해. 목재로 거래해줄게."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid ""
"Not much to it.  I worked here as a logger before <the_cataclysm> began.  "
"When all went to hell, I was on the job and had to hole up here with my "
"coworkers.  Good news is we all came out fine, and the boss decided to keep "
"the mill running.  I don't know how much longer we can last, though; not "
"unless we make some contact with other people.  Customers, I guess you might"
" call 'em."
msgstr ""
"별 거 없어. <the_cataclysm> 전부터 여기 벌목꾼이었어. 지옥이 됐을 때 일하다가 동료들과 여기 틀어박혔지. 다행히 다들 "
"무사했고, 우두머리가 제재소를 계속 돌리기로 했어. 얼마나 더 버틸진 모르겠지만; 다른 사람들과 연락 안 되면 말야. 손님이라고 부르는 "
"게 맞겠네."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid ""
"Well, I'm a logger here.  Seasonal work but good pay… or it was, at least.  "
"Before that first <zombie> showed up and made it clear how bad things were "
"really getting."
msgstr ""
"뭐, 여기 벌목꾼이야. 계절 일인데 돈은 괜찮았지… 적어도 그랬어. 첫 <zombie>가 나타나 상황이 얼마나 나쁜 지 보여주기 "
"전까지는."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid ""
"I'm a lumberjack out here.  Things were quiet for a long time.  We're pretty"
" far out in the woods so it was kind of a shock to find out just how bad "
"it'd gotten in civilization.  We had a couple close run-ins ourselves.  My "
"friend over there almost got eaten!  But we still have resources that I'm "
"sure people can use."
msgstr ""
"난 여기 벌목꾼이야. 한동안 조용했지. 숲 깊은 곳이라 문명이 얼마나 나빠졌는지 알고 충격받았어. 우리도 아찔한 조우가 몇 번 있었지. "
"저 친구는 먹힐 뻔했어! 그래도 사람들이 쓸 자원은 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid ""
"My comrades and I were lucky to be in the right place at the right time, I "
"suppose.  We keep really busy out here, so we didn't expect <the_cataclysm> "
"to land right in our lap like that.  Luckily these axes can chop more than "
"wood.  They'll take a good chunk out of anything nasty that threatens our "
"mill."
msgstr ""
"나와 동료들은 적소에 있어서 운이 좋았다고 봐. 여기서 정말 바빠서 <the_cataclysm>이 우리 무릎에 떨어질 줄 몰랐지. 다행히"
" 이 도끼는 나무만 자르는 게 아냐. 제재소를 위협하는 더러운 놈들도 썰어."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid ""
"Well, I work here.  Welcome to the mill.  Used to be trucks in and out of "
"here all the time but you're the first face we've seen in a while."
msgstr "뭐, 여기 일해. 제재소에 온 걸 환영해. 예전엔 트럭이 계속 드나들었는데 한동안 본 첫 얼굴이네."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid ""
"New to the job… or, well, whatever's happening now.  I still cut trees and "
"run logs through the saw from time to time, so I guess you'd call me a "
"logger.  Things have only gotten weirder after those fucking <zombies> "
"nearly killed us.  I'm not sure how much longer we'll last…"
msgstr ""
"이 일에 새내기야… 뭐, 지금 벌어지는 일이든 뭐든. 아직 나무 자르고 가끔 통나무를 톱에 넣으니 벌목꾼이라 부르겠지. 저 빌어먹을 "
"<zombies> 놈들이 우릴 거의 죽인 뒤로 점점 이상해졌어. 얼마나 더 버틸진 모르겠어…"

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid "Hope it goes well."
msgstr "잘되길 바라."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\TALK_lumbermill_merchant.json
msgid "A new face at the mill?  Who might you be?"
msgstr "제재소에 새 얼굴? 누구지?"

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\TALK_lumbermill_merchant.json
msgid ""
"I'm the manager here at the mill.  It's a tight-knit crew, unionized "
"operation.  When <the_cataclysm> broke out, we didn't even know about it "
"till some <zombies> wandered onto the yard.  Now, we've just held up here.  "
"I imagine any folks left out there might be needing our machinery and skills"
" to keep civilization alive.  Might make new customers yet."
msgstr ""
"난 이 제재소 관리자야. 결속된 팀이고 노조 사업장이었지. <the_cataclysm>이 터졌을 때 <zombies>가 울타리로 "
"들어오기까지 몰랐어. 지금은 여기 버티는 중이야. 밖에 남은 사람들이 문명을 유지하려면 우리 기계와 기술이 필요할 거야. 새 손님이 "
"될지도."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_employees.json
msgid "logger"
msgstr "벌목꾼"

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_employees.json
msgid "manager"
msgstr "관리자"

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_employees.json
msgid "broker"
msgstr "중개인"

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_employees.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
msgid "Lumberjack"
msgstr "벌목꾼"

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_employees.json
msgid "I felled trees before the apocalypse.  Zombies shouldn't be as tough."
msgstr "아포칼립스 전엔 나무를 베었어. 좀비가 그렇게 어려울 리 없어."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Find Drive Belts"
msgstr "구동 벨트를 찾으세요"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Find Drive Belts'
#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"Obtain 3 drive belts or makeshift drive belts in exchange for credit with "
"the loggers."
msgstr "구동 벨트나 임시 구동 벨트 3개를 구해 벌목꾼들에게 공로를 인정받으세요."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "I need three drive belts."
msgstr "구동 벨트 3개가 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"Some of our machinery received some damage before <the_cataclysm> and we "
"were waiting on replacement parts.  Now everything's changed and those parts"
" are more important than ever.  Get us three drive belts and I'll give you "
"some credit with us."
msgstr ""
"<the_cataclysm> 전에 기계 일부가 손상돼 부품을 기다리고 있었어. 이제 모든 게 바뀌어서 그 부품이 더 중요해졌지. 구동 "
"벨트 3개를 구해주면 우리 공로를 인정해줄게."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
#: data\json\npcs\scrap_trader\scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Someone's got to do it."
msgstr "누군가는 해야지."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"If you can't find actual drive belts on engines, a good replacement can be "
"made from a belt and some duct tape.  Nothing difficult."
msgstr "엔진에서 진짜 구동 벨트를 못 찾으면 벨트랑 덕트 테이프로 대용품을 만들 수 있어. 어렵지 않아."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the belts?"
msgstr "벨트 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Wonderful!  Thanks, <name_g>, we'll be fine for a long while from now."
msgstr "훌륭해! 고마워, <name_g>, 한동안 괜찮을 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
#: data\json\npcs\scrap_trader\scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Where are they?  I don't believe you."
msgstr "어디 있어? 못 믿겠어."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "That's unfortunate.  I guess we'll have to find someone else to do it."
msgstr "유감이네. 다른 사람을 찾아야겠어."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Get 1,000 Nails"
msgstr "못 1,000개를 구하세요"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Get 1,000 Nails'
#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 1,000 nails in exchange for credit with the loggers."
msgstr "못 1,000개를 구해 벌목꾼들에게 공로를 인정받으세요."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "I need 1,000 nails."
msgstr "못 1,000개가 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"Along with those drive belts, we were waiting for some nails for structural "
"repairs.  Due to <the_cataclysm>, we obviously never received them.  So, I "
"need you to get us 1,000 nails.  We'll pay you fairly."
msgstr ""
"구동 벨트와 함께 구조물 수리용 못도 기다렸어. <the_cataclysm> 때문에 당연히 못 받았지. 그래서 못 1,000개를 "
"구해줬으면 해. 공정하게 값 치를게."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Taking apart some furniture in town should get what you need."
msgstr "마을에서 가구 좀 분해하면 필요한 게 나올 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the nails?"
msgstr "못 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"Our warehouse was about to fall apart.  These will be extremely helpful to "
"us."
msgstr "우리 창고가 무너지기 직전이었어. 이게 정말 도움될 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Get 6,800 Nails"
msgstr "못 6,800개를 구하세요"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Get 6,800 Nails'
#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 6,800 nails in exchange for credit with the loggers."
msgstr "못 6,800개를 구해 벌목꾼들에게 공로를 인정받으세요."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "I need 6,800 nails."
msgstr "못 6,800개가 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"While fairly sturdy, the metal fence around this place won't hold out for "
"long.  So, we've decided to replace it with a wall.  However, the nails we "
"had were used to repair our existing structures, and they weren't nearly "
"enough.  After some calculations, we need 6,800 nails to do it.  That may "
"seem like a lot, but we're willing to give you a TON of credit for it."
msgstr ""
"꽤 튼튼하긴 하지만 이곳 금속 울타리는 오래 못 버텨. 그래서 벽으로 바꾸기로 했어. 근데 우리가 가진 못은 기존 구조물 수리에 썼고 "
"턱없이 부족했지. 계산해보니 6,800개가 필요해. 많아 보이겠지만 그만큼 아주 많은 공로를 인정해줄게."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Well, I suppose that's reasonable."
msgstr "뭐, 합리적이네."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"You might have to do more than just scrapping a bunch of furniture.  "
"Dismantling a building somewhere in town could get you what you need."
msgstr "가구 부수는 것만으론 부족할 수 있어. 마을 건물 하나를 해체하면 필요한 게 나올 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "That's absolutely amazing!  I can't thank you enough for this!"
msgstr "정말 놀라워! 감사를 다 못 표현하겠어!"

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "You're a fucking scammer, <name_b>!"
msgstr "사기꾼 새끼, <name_b>!"

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Find 6 Blankets"
msgstr "담요 6개를 찾으세요"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Find 6 Blankets'
#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"Obtain 6 blankets, fur blankets, electric blankets etc in exchange for "
"credit with the loggers."
msgstr "담요, 모피 담요, 전기 담요 등 6개를 구해 벌목꾼들에게 공로를 인정받으세요."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "I need 6 blankets."
msgstr "담요 6개가 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"Now that we should be safe from harm, I decided to start adding a few things"
" to this place.  Right now, we don't have anywhere to comfortably sleep, so "
"we're building a small sleeping quarter.  We just need 6 big, warm blankets "
"to finish our project."
msgstr ""
"이제 안전해야 하니 여기 몇 가지를 추가하기로 했어. 지금 편히 잘 곳이 없어서 작은 침실을 짓는 중이야. 프로젝트 마무리에 크고 따뜻한"
" 담요 6개가 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"I figure any hotel or motel in town should have lots of blankets, whatever "
"types you can find for us."
msgstr "마을 호텔이나 모텔에 담요가 많을 거야, 어떤 종류든 찾아줘."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Did you find us some bedding yet?"
msgstr "침구 좀 찾았어?"

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thanks!  Feel free to sleep here if you want.  It's the least we can do for "
"the help."
msgstr "고마워! 원하면 여기서 자도 돼. 도움에 최소한의 보답이야."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "How is this supposed to help us?"
msgstr "이게 어떻게 도움돼?"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Establish A Trade Route'
#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"Establish trade relations between the loggers and a refugee center, and "
"bring back a writ of the agreement."
msgstr "벌목꾼들과 피난민 센터 간의 교역 관계를 수립하고 협정 문서를 가져오세요."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"While some of us were out scavenging, we spotted an old evac shelter that "
"looks like it might have some people inside.  I want you to go over there, "
"find whoever runs the joint, and see if we can make a deal with them for "
"some processed lumber.  This will be invaluable to our survival."
msgstr ""
"우리 일부가 수색 중에 사람이 있을 것 같은 오래된 대피소를 봤어. 거기 가서 주인을 찾고 가공 목재 거래가 가능한지 알아봐줘. 생존에 "
"엄청난 도움이 될 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Please give it a try?  This is really important to us."
msgstr "한 번 해봐줘? 정말 중요한 일이야."

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "What did they say about the deal?"
msgstr "놈들이 거래에 대해 뭐래?"

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Thank you!  We're set for life on this one!"
msgstr "고마워! 이걸로 평생 든든해!"

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
#: data\json\npcs\scrap_trader\scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "How does this help us?"
msgstr "이게 어떻게 도움돼?"

#: data\json\npcs\lumberyard\lumbermill_missions.json
#: data\json\npcs\scrap_trader\scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid ""
"That's unfortunate.  I guess we'll have to find someone else to trade with."
msgstr "유감이네. 다른 거래처를 찾아야겠어."

#: data\json\npcs\mine\spiral_madman.json
msgid "miner"
msgstr "광부"

#: data\json\npcs\mine\spiral_madman.json
msgid "Miner"
msgstr "광부"

#: data\json\npcs\mine\spiral_madman.json
msgid "Hello there!"
msgstr "안녕!"

#: data\json\npcs\mine\spiral_madman.json
msgid "I'm outta here.  Bye."
msgstr "난 나갈게. 안녕."

#: data\json\npcs\mine\spiral_madman.json
msgid ""
"Poor fellow - looks like you're out of your mind.  Can't help you, sorry.  "
"I'm outta here.  Bye."
msgstr "불쌍한 녀석 — 정신이 나간 것 같네. 못 도와줘, 미안. 난 나갈게. 안녕."

#: data\json\npcs\mine\spiral_madman.json
msgid "<spirals>"
msgstr "<spirals>"

#: data\json\npcs\mine\spiral_madman.json
msgid "Sorry, what?"
msgstr "뭐라고?"

#: data\json\npcs\mine\spiral_madman.json
msgid "Why are you repeating 'spirals' over and over again?"
msgstr "왜 \"나선\"을 계속 반복하는 거야?"

#: data\json\npcs\mine\spiral_madman.json
msgid "Are you nuts?"
msgstr "미쳤어?"

#: data\json\npcs\moonshiner\TALK_NPC_moonshiner.json
msgid "Haven't seen someone new in a while.  What brings you around here?"
msgstr "한동안 새 얼굴이 없었어. 무슨 일로 왔어?"

#: data\json\npcs\moonshiner\TALK_NPC_moonshiner.json
msgid "Just wandering, <name_g>."
msgstr "그냥 돌아다니는 중이야, <name_g>."

#: data\json\npcs\moonshiner\TALK_NPC_moonshiner.json
msgid ""
"I'll make this real simple for you.  Hand over your stuff, and no one gets "
"hurt, capiche?"
msgstr "간단하게 해줄게. 물건 내놔, 그럼 아무도 안 다쳐, 알겠지?"

#: data\json\npcs\moonshiner\TALK_NPC_moonshiner.json
#: data\json\npcs\prepper\TALK_NPC_prepper.json
msgid "What can I do for you?"
msgstr "뭘 도와줄까?"

#: data\json\npcs\moonshiner\TALK_NPC_moonshiner.json
msgid "Could you tell me a bit about yourself?"
msgstr "네 얘기 좀 해줄래?"

#: data\json\npcs\moonshiner\TALK_NPC_moonshiner.json
msgid "Can I purchase any of your liquor?"
msgstr "네 술 좀 살 수 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\moonshiner\TALK_NPC_moonshiner.json
msgid "Anything I could do for you?"
msgstr "도와줄 일 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\moonshiner\TALK_NPC_moonshiner.json
msgid ""
"I run this distillery you're standing in, before <the_cataclysm> it wasn't "
"so legal with the law.  I was in some town making a deal on my product when "
"a horde of rioters busted in, so I ran for it.  I thought my business would "
"be a nice place to stay, so I came out here."
msgstr ""
"네가 서 있는 이 양조장을 운영해, <the_cataclysm> 전엔 법적으로 허가되지 않았었지. 마을에서 내 물건 거래를 하고 있는데 "
"폭도 무리가 쳐들어와서 도망쳤어. 내 사업장이 좋은 거처라고 생각해서 여기 온 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "CPT"
msgstr "대위"

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "I hope you're here to assist us."
msgstr "도우러 온 거길 바라."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid ""
"I don't know how you got down here Marshal, but if Command sent you we could"
" use your help."
msgstr "어떻게 내려왔는지 모르겠지만 보안관, 사령부가 보냈으면 도움이 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid ""
"Sir, I don't know how the hell you got down here but if you have any sense "
"you'll get out while you can."
msgstr "여기 어떻게 내려오셨는지 모르겠지만, 감각이 있다면 돌아가는 게 나을 거예요..."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid ""
"Ma'am, I don't know how the hell you got down here but if you have any sense"
" you'll get out while you can."
msgstr "여기 어떻게 내려오셨는지 모르겠지만, 감각이 있다면 돌아가는 게 나을 거예요..."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid ""
"[MISSION] I was asked to get a report from you to send to your superiors."
msgstr "[임무] 상관들에게 보낼 보고서를 받아오라고 부탁받았어."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "What are you doing down here?"
msgstr "이 아래에서 뭐하는 중이야?"

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "Can you tell me about this facility?"
msgstr "이 시설에 대해 알려줄 수 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#: data\mods\Aftershock\npcs\prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "What do you need done?"
msgstr "뭐 해야 할 거라도 있나?"

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "I've had experience with Old Guard matters before, I can help."
msgstr "구군 관련 일에 경험이 있어, 도울 수 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "This seems like a military matter to me, I'm here to assist."
msgstr "군사적 문제 같네, 도우러 왔어."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\npc\TALK_HEALER_GREY.json
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\npc\TALK_OLD_MAGUS.json
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\npc\TALK_TECHNO_KID.json
msgid "About the mission…"
msgstr "임무에 대해…"

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\npc\TALK_HEALER_GREY.json
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\npc\TALK_OLD_MAGUS.json
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\npc\TALK_TECHNO_KID.json
msgid "About one of those missions…"
msgstr "임무들 중 하나에 대해…"

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_carpenter2.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_farmer1.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_farmer2.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_woodcutter2.json
msgid "I've got to go…"
msgstr "가봐야겠어…"

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid ""
"We can use all the help we can get.  I'll send word out to the others that "
"you're cleared to be here, but be careful.  There are still some hotspots "
"contaminated with radiation in this sector, and the lower level is in even "
"worse shape."
msgstr ""
"모든 도움이 필요해. 네가 여기 있어도 된다고 다른 애들한테 알릴게, 하지만 조심해. 이 구역엔 방사능 오염 지점이 아직 있고, 하층부는"
" 더 심해."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid ""
"I was expecting someone wearing their badge, but alright.  I'll give you "
"clearance but try to be careful down here.  I don't want over-eager civilian"
" contractors, or whatever you may be, getting themselves killed just for our"
" sake."
msgstr ""
"배지를 찬 사람을 기대했지만 좋아. 출입 허가는 주겠는데 여기서 조심해. 과도하게 열심인 민간 용병이든 뭐든 우리 때문에 죽는 건 원치 "
"않아."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "I'll do what I can."
msgstr "할 수 있는 걸 해볼게."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid ""
"Not like I could look up personnel records from down here.  Our team in the "
"comms center might be able to uplink with some old registries but then I'd "
"have to give you clearance to go wandering around down here anyway.  I'll "
"take your word for it but watch yourself down here, this place is dangerous."
msgstr ""
"여기서 인사 기록을 조회할 수도 없고. 통신센터 우리 팀이 옛 등록부랑 연결할 수 있을 지도 모르지만, 그래도 여기 돌아다니려면 허가를 "
"줘야 하잖아. 네 말을 믿을게, 하지만 여기는 위험하니 조심해."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid ""
"Alright, I've got a sitrep written out.  As helpful as it'd be to have you "
"here, getting this back to the others could also help get us reinforcements "
"somewhere down the line.  Not a lot of this place is operational anymore, "
"but we're expecting comms to provide a link to other assets in the region if"
" we can get it in full working order."
msgstr ""
"알았어, 상황 보고서를 작성했어. 네가 여기 있는 게 도움되겠지만, 이걸 다른 애들한테 가져가면 지원군을 불러올 수도 있어. 이 시설은 "
"대부분 가동이 안 되지만, 통신망이 복구되면 지역 내 다른 자산과 연결될 거로 기대해."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "Thank you, that's all for now."
msgstr "고마워, 그게 다야."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid ""
"I'm leading what remains of my company on a mission to re-secure this "
"facility.  We entered the complex with two dozen men and immediately went "
"about securing this control room.  From here I dispatched my men to secure "
"vital systems located on this floor and the floors below this one.  If we "
"are successful, this facility can be cleared and used as a permanent base of"
" operations in the region.  Most importantly it will allow us to redirect "
"refugee traffic away from overcrowded outposts and free up more of our "
"forces to conduct recovery operations."
msgstr "남은 부대원들을 이끌고 이 시설 재확보 임무 중이에요..."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "Seems like a decent plan…"
msgstr "괜찮은 계획 같네…"

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid ""
"This facility was constructed to provide a safe haven in the event of a "
"global conflict.  The vault can support several thousand people for a few "
"years if all systems are operational and sufficient notification is given.  "
"Unfortunately, the power system was damaged or sabotaged at some point and "
"released a single extremely lethal burst of radiation.  The catastrophic "
"event lasted for several minutes and resulted in the deaths of most people "
"located on the 2nd and lower floors.  Those working on this floor were able "
"to seal the access ways to the lower floors before succumbing to radiation "
"sickness.  The only other thing the logs tell us is that all water pressure "
"was diverted to the lower levels."
msgstr ""
"이 시설은 세계대전 중 피난처로 쓰려는 목적으로 만들어졌어. 볼트는 모든 시설이 가동 중이고 충분한 통지가 있으면 몇 년동안 수천 명의 "
"사람들을 수용할 수 있어. 안타깝게도, 전력 시스템이 피해를 입었거나 사보타주를 당해서 단 한 번의 엄청 강력한 방사능 파를 방출했어. "
"이 재앙은 몇 분 동안 지속되었고 2층과 아래 층에 있는 대부분의 사람이 죽었어. 이 층에서 일하고 있었던 사람은 방사능 피해로 죽기 "
"전에 아래 층으로 가는 길을 봉인할 수 있었어. 남은 유일한 다른 기록은 모든 수압이 낮은 수준으로 떨어졌다는 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "Whatever they did it must have worked since we are still alive…"
msgstr "놈들이 뭘 했든 우리가 살아있으니 먹혔나봐…"

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "Locate Commo Team"
msgstr "통신팀 위치 파악"

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_staff\NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_staff\NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_visitors\NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#: data\json\obsoletion\missions.json data\mods\DinoMod\NPC\NC_Red.json
msgid "We need help…"
msgstr "도움이 필요해…"

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid ""
"My communications team went to secure the radio control room after we "
"breached the facility.  I haven't heard from them since, I need you to "
"locate them.  Their first objective was to record all active channels that "
"were transmitting information on other survivors or facilities.  Find them "
"and return the frequency list to me.  I'm sure they could probably use your "
"help also."
msgstr ""
"내 통신 팀은 시설을 개척 한 후 라디오 제어실을 지키려고 이동했어. 이후로 그들의 소식을 듣지 못 했고, 네가 그 팀의 위치를 "
"찾아냈으면 좋겠어. 그 팀의 첫 임무는 다른 생존자나 시설의 정보를 전송하고 있던 모든 활성화된 채널을 녹화하는 거였어. 사람들을 찾고 "
"나에게 주파수 목록을 돌려 줘. 분명 그 팀도 네 도움을 받아줄 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "Good luck, the communications room shouldn't be far from here."
msgstr "행운을 빌어, 통신실은 여기서 멀지 않을 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid ""
"I don't know why you would bother wasting your time down here if you can't "
"handle a few small tasks…"
msgstr "작은 일 몇 개도 못 하면서 왜 여기서 시간을 낭비하는지 모르겠네…"

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "We were briefed that the communications array was on this level."
msgstr "통신 장비가 이 층에 있다는 브리핑을 받았어."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "Thanks, let me know when you need another tasking."
msgstr "고마워. 다른 임무가 필요하면 말해줘."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "Cull Nightmares"
msgstr "악몽 처치"

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid ""
"Your assistance is greatly appreciated, we need to clear out the more "
"ruthless monsters that are wandering up from the lower levels.  If you could"
" cull twenty or so of what we refer to as 'nightmares' my men would be much "
"safer.  If you've cleared out most of this floor then the lower levels "
"should be your next target. "
msgstr ""
"당신의 도움에 정말 감사해. 하층에서 올라오는 더 흉포한 몬스터들을 처치해야 해. 우리가 악몽이라고 부르는 것들 20마리 정도를 처치하면"
" 우리 병사들이 훨씬 안전해질 거야. 이 층을 대부분 정리했다면 다음 목표는 하층이야."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "Good luck, finding a clear passage to the second level may be tricky."
msgstr "행운을 빌어, 2층으로 가는 통로를 찾는 게 쉽지 않을 수 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "These creatures can swing their appendages surprisingly far."
msgstr "이 생물들은 놀랍도록 멀리까지 팔다리를 휘두를 수 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "How is the hunt going?"
msgstr "사냥은 잘 되가니?"

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "SFC"
msgstr "중사"

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
#: data\mods\Arcana_BN\npcs\TALK_MAGE_HUNTER.json
msgid "Welcome back."
msgstr "다시 왔구나."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "Marshal, I'm rather surprised to see you here."
msgstr "보안관님, 여기서 뵙게 되어 놀랍네요."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "Sir, I'm not sure you're authorized to be here…"
msgstr "선생님, 여기 허가받으셨는지 모르겠습니다…"

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "Ma'am, I'm not sure you're authorized to be here…"
msgstr "부인, 여기 허가받으셨는지 모르겠습니다…"

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "[MISSION] The captain sent me to get a frequency list from you."
msgstr "[임무] 캡틴이 주파수 목록을 받아오라고 보냈어."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_barber.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_woodcutter2.json
msgid "Do you need any help?"
msgstr "도움이 필요한가?"

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "I should be going"
msgstr "가봐야겠어요"

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid ""
"We are securing the external communications array for this facility.  I'm "
"rather restricted in what I can release… go find my commander if you have "
"any questions."
msgstr "이 시설의 외부 통신 어레이를 확보 중입니다. 공개할 수 있는 정보가 제한되어… 질문이 있으시면 지휘관을 찾아가세요."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "I'll try and find your commander then…"
msgstr "지휘관을 찾아볼게…"

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid ""
"I was expecting the captain to send a runner.  Here is the list you are "
"looking for.  What we can identify from here are simply the frequencies that"
" have traffic on them.  Many of the transmissions are indecipherable without"
" repairing or replacing the equipment here.  When the facility was being "
"overrun, standard procedure was to destroy encryption hardware to protect "
"federal secrets and maintain the integrity of the comms network.  We are "
"hoping a few plain text messages can get picked up though."
msgstr "대위님이 연락병을 보내실 거라 생각했는데요. 찾던 목록이 여기 있습니다..."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid ""
"I hope that means you're cleared to be here.  Here is the list you are "
"looking for.  What we can identify from here are simply the frequencies that"
" have traffic on them.  Many of the transmissions are indecipherable without"
" repairing or replacing the equipment here.  When the facility was being "
"overrun, standard procedure was to destroy encryption hardware to protect "
"federal secrets and maintain the integrity of the comms network.  We are "
"hoping a few plain text messages can get picked up though."
msgstr ""
"여기 있어도 된다는 뜻이길. 찾는 목록이야. 여기서 식별 가능한 건 단순히 트래픽이 있는 주파수뿐이야. 장비를 수리하거나 교체하지 않으면"
" 많은 송신이 해독 불가야. 시설이 함락될 때 표준 절차는 연방 기밀을 지키고 통신망 무결성을 유지하기 위해 암호 하드웨어를 파괴하는 "
"거였어. 그래도 평문 메시지 몇 개는 잡히길 바라."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "Fabricate Repeater Mod"
msgstr "중계기 모듈 제작"

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid ""
"My chief responsibility is to monitor radio traffic and locate potential "
"targets to secure or rescue.  The majority of radio repeaters are down and "
"those that are working have only emergency power.  If you have a basic "
"understanding of electronics you should be able to fabricate the 'radio "
"repeater mod' found in these plans.  When this mod is attached to a radio "
"station's main terminal, all short range radio traffic on emergency channels"
" is boosted so we can pick it up at much longer ranges.  I really need you "
"make me one."
msgstr ""
"내 주요 임무는 무선 통신을 감시하고 확보하거나 구조할 잠재적 목표를 찾는 거야. 대부분의 라디오 중계기가 다운됐고 작동하는 것들도 비상"
" 전력만 있어. 전자공학 기초가 있다면 이 설계도에 있는 라디오 중계기 모드를 제작할 수 있을 거야. 이 모드를 라디오 방송국의 주 "
"단말기에 연결하면 비상 채널의 단거리 무선 통신이 증폭되어 훨씬 먼 거리에서도 수신할 수 있어. 꼭 하나 만들어줘."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid ""
"Thanks, I know the labs on the other side of the complex have electronic "
"parts sitting around."
msgstr "고마워, 복합건물 반대편 연구소에 전자 부품들이 놓여 있을 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "I'm sure the motorpool has a truck battery you could salvage."
msgstr "배차장에서 트럭 배터리를 구할 수 있을 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "Have you had any luck fabricating it?"
msgstr "제작에 성공했어?"

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid ""
"Thanks, I'll see to installing this one.  It will be some time but I could "
"use someone to position these around the region."
msgstr "고마워, 이걸 설치할게. 시간이 좀 걸리겠지만 지역 곳곳에 배치할 사람이 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid ""
"I guess I could use your skills once again.  There are small transmitters "
"located in the nearby evacuation shelters; if we don't separate them from "
"the power grid their power systems will rapidly deteriorate over the next "
"few weeks.  The task is rather simple but the shelters offer us a place to "
"redirect refugees until this vault can be secured. "
msgstr ""
"기술을 한 번 더 빌려야겠어. 근처 대피소에 소형 송신기가 있는데, 전력망에서 분리하지 않으면 몇 주 안에 전력 시스템이 빠르게 악화될 "
"거야. 작업 자체는 간단하지만 대피소는 이 금고가 확보될 때까지 피난민들을 유도할 장소가 돼."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid ""
"Thanks, I should be ready for you to install the radio repeater mods by the "
"time you get back."
msgstr "고마워, 네가 돌아올 때쯤엔 무선 중계기 모드 설치 준비가 될 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "Try searching on the outskirts of towns."
msgstr "마을 외곽을 수색해봐."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "Have you had any luck severing the connection?"
msgstr "연결을 끊는 데 성공했어?"

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "We are good to go!  The last of the gear is powering up now."
msgstr "준비 완료야! 마지막 장비가 지금 가동 중이야."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid ""
"Most of my essential gear has been brought back online so it is time for you"
" to install your first radio repeater mod.  Head topside and locate the "
"nearest radio station.  Install the mod on the backup terminal and return to"
" me so that I can verify that everything was successful.  Radio towers must "
"unfortunately be ignored for now, without a dedicated emergency power system"
" they won't be useful for some time."
msgstr ""
"필수 장비 대부분이 다시 가동됐으니 이제 첫 번째 라디오 중계기 모드를 설치할 차례야. 지상으로 올라가서 가장 가까운 라디오 방송국을 "
"찾아. 백업 단말기에 모드를 설치하고 돌아와서 모든 게 성공적인지 확인할게. 라디오 탑은 지금은 무시해야 해, 비상 전력 시스템이 없으면"
" 당분간 쓸 수 없어."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "I'll be standing by down here once you are done."
msgstr "네가 끝내면 여기서 대기하고 있을게."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid ""
"If you could make some sort of directional antenna, it might help locating "
"the radio stations."
msgstr "지향성 안테나를 만들 수 있다면 라디오 방송국 위치를 찾는 데 도움이 될 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "Have you had any luck finding a radio station?"
msgstr "라디오 방송국을 찾는 데 성공했어?"

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "That's one down."
msgstr "하나 완료했어."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid ""
"I could always use you to put another repeater mod up.  I don't have to "
"remind you but every one that goes up extends our response area just a "
"little bit more.  With enough of them we'll be able to maintain "
"communication with anyone in the region."
msgstr ""
"중계기 모드를 하나 더 설치하는 데 당신을 써야겠어. 말하지 않아도 알겠지만 하나씩 설치할 때마다 대응 지역이 조금씩 넓어져. 충분히 "
"설치하면 지역의 누구와도 통신을 유지할 수 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "I'll be standing by."
msgstr "대기하고 있을게."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid ""
"Getting a working vehicle is going to become important as the distance you "
"have to travel increases."
msgstr "이동 거리가 늘어날수록 작동하는 차량을 구하는 게 중요해질 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid ""
"I'll try and update the captain with any signals that I need investigated."
msgstr "조사가 필요한 신호가 있으면 대장에게 업데이트해 줄게."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "Glad to see we're not on our own down here…"
msgstr "여기서 혼자가 아니라 다행이야…"

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid ""
"I'm afraid I can't talk now, check with the captain or our comms officer."
msgstr "지금은 얘기를 못 해, 대장이나 통신 장교한테 확인해."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "Not much I can tell you, I'm not in charge here"
msgstr "말해줄 게 별로 없어, 난 여기 책임자가 아니야"

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "I'm supposed to direct all questions to my leadership."
msgstr "모든 질문은 상부한테 하라고 되어 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "Be careful out there, the lower levels are still a mess."
msgstr "조심해, 하층부는 아직 엉망이야."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "Hello, marshal.  You should check in with the captain."
msgstr "안녕, 보안관. 대장한테 보고하는 게 좋을 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "I'm afraid I can't talk now, speak with my commanding officer."
msgstr "지금은 얘기를 못 해, 지휘관한테 얘기해."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "A marshal, huh?  The captain would like a word with you."
msgstr "보안관이야? 대장이 너랑 얘기하고 싶어 해."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "Are you our reinforcements?  I'd suggest you talk to our CO."
msgstr "우리 지원군이야? 지휘관이랑 얘기하는 게 좋을 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "Sorry marshal, I'm on duty.  Check in with our commander."
msgstr "미안 보안관, 근무 중이야. 지휘관한테 보고해."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "Hey, citizen… I'm not sure you belong here."
msgstr "이봐, 시민… 여기 있을 사람이 아닌 것 같은데."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "You should mind your own business, nothing to see here."
msgstr "신경 꺼요, 볼 것 없어요."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "If you need something you'll need to talk to someone else."
msgstr "뭔가 필요하면 다른 사람한테 얘기해요."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_staff\NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
#: data\json\npcs\robofac\NPC_robofac_generic_security.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_guard.json
msgid "Sir."
msgstr "선생님."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "Dude, if you can hold your own you should look into enlisting."
msgstr "야, 버텨낼 수 있으면 입대 생각해봐요."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_staff\NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
#: data\json\npcs\robofac\NPC_robofac_generic_security.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_guard.json
msgid "Ma'am"
msgstr "부인."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "Hey miss, don't you think it would be safer if you stuck with me?"
msgstr "이봐요, 저랑 같이 있으면 더 안전하지 않을까요?"

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid ""
"I don't know how bad things have gotten out there, but this place seriously "
"isn't safe for civilians."
msgstr "밖이 얼마나 나쁜 지 모르겠지만 여기는 진짜 민간인한테 안전하지 않아."

#: data\json\npcs\necropolis\NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_staff\NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_guard.json
#: data\mods\Arcana_BN\npcs\TALK_GUARD_CF_AUX.json
msgid "Don't mind me…"
msgstr "난 신경 쓰지 마…"

#: data\json\npcs\prepper\TALK_NPC_prepper.json
msgid "Would you be interested in bartering?"
msgstr "물물교환할 생각 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\prepper\TALK_NPC_prepper.json
msgid "Can I stay here for a while?"
msgstr "한동안 여기 있어도 돼?"

#: data\json\npcs\prepper\TALK_NPC_prepper.json
msgid ""
"They all said I was crazy for preparing for <the_cataclysm>.  Now, they're "
"all dead, and I'm still kickin'.  When the riots turned to hordes, I was "
"ready; all I had to do was dodge a few <zombies> to get back to my bastion."
"  I've been living safely here ever since."
msgstr ""
"다들 내가 <the_cataclysm>에 대비한다고 미쳤대. 이제 걔넨 다 죽고 나는 살아있어. 폭동이 무리로 변했을 때 난 준비돼 "
"있었지; 내 요새로 돌아가려고 <zombies> 몇 놈만 피하면 됐어. 그 뒤로 여기서 안전하게 살고 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\prepper\TALK_NPC_prepper.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_staff\NPC_scientistquestgiver_docmission.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_visitors\NPC_exterminator.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_visitors\NPC_hunter.json
#: data\json\npcs\scrap_trader\scrap_trader.json
#: data\json\npcs\tacoma_ranch\NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
#: data\mods\DinoMod\NPC\NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "Interesting."
msgstr "흥미롭군."

#: data\json\npcs\prepper\TALK_NPC_prepper.json
msgid ""
"Well, I guess you could borrow one of the spare beds, just don't hog it.  I "
"kept a few in case someone else joined me, but no one I knew came here."
msgstr "뭐, 여분 침대 하나 빌려도 돼, 독점만 하지 마. 누가 합류할까 봐 몇 개 뒀는데 아는 사람은 아무도 안 왔어."

#: data\json\npcs\prisoners\mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "prisoner"
msgstr "죄수"

#: data\json\npcs\prisoners\mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "Prisoner"
msgstr "죄수"

#: data\json\npcs\prisoners\mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid ""
"My god, you've got to get me out of here.  The things… the things they've "
"done… please help."
msgstr "맙소사, 여기서 꺼내줘야 해. 놈들이… 놈들이 한 짓… 제발 도와줘."

#: data\json\npcs\prisoners\mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "Aren't you a little short to be a stormtrooper?"
msgstr "스톰트루퍼치고 키가 좀 작지 않아?"

#: data\json\npcs\prisoners\mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "Please, help me."
msgstr "제발, 도와줘."

#: data\json\npcs\prisoners\mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "Can you get me out of this hell hole?"
msgstr "이 지옥구덩이에서 꺼내줄 수 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\prisoners\mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "Who are you?  Are you real?"
msgstr "누구야? 진짜야?"

#: data\json\npcs\prisoners\mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "Can you please save me?  I have to get out of here."
msgstr "제발 구해줄래? 여기서 나가야 해."

#: data\json\npcs\prisoners\mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "Hallelujah, rescue!"
msgstr "할렐루야, 구조대다!"

#: data\json\npcs\prisoners\mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "I can't believe my eyes.  Thank you, thank you!"
msgstr "내 눈을 못 믿겠어. 고마워, 고마워!"

#: data\json\npcs\prisoners\mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "You're… you're actually real!"
msgstr "너… 진짜 실제야!"

#: data\json\npcs\prisoners\mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "How are you here?  Are you one of them, somehow?  What's going on?"
msgstr "여길 어떻게 왔어? 설마 놈들 중 하나야? 무슨 일이야?"

#: data\json\npcs\prisoners\mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "Come with me, if you want to live."
msgstr "살고 싶으면 따라와."

#: data\json\npcs\prisoners\mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "I've no use for weaklings.  Run.  Now."
msgstr "약골한테 볼 일 없어. 뛰어. 지금."

#: data\json\npcs\professions\escape_team.json
msgid "Escapist"
msgstr "탈출가"

#: data\json\npcs\professions\escape_team.json
msgid "I'm looking for a way out."
msgstr "탈출구를 찾고 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\professions\escape_team.json
msgid "Mutant Patient"
msgstr "변이 환자"

#: data\json\npcs\professions\escape_team.json
msgid "Captive"
msgstr "포로"

#: data\json\npcs\professions\frat.json
msgid "Frat Member"
msgstr "대학생 클럽 회원"

#: data\json\npcs\professions\frat.json
msgid "I'm looking for parties."
msgstr "파티를 찾고 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\professions\graffiti_crew.json
msgid "Street Artist"
msgstr "스트리트 아티스트"

#: data\json\npcs\professions\graffiti_crew.json
msgid "I'm just looking for a good spot to tag."
msgstr "태그할 좋은 곳을 찾는 중이야."

#: data\json\npcs\professions\heist_crew.json
msgid "Heist Shooter"
msgstr "강도총잡이"

#: data\json\npcs\professions\heist_crew.json
msgid "I'm just looking for a quick buck."
msgstr "그냥 한탕을 찾고 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\professions\heist_crew.json
msgid "Heist Thief"
msgstr "강도도둑"

#: data\json\npcs\professions\neighborhood_watch.json
msgid "Neighborhood Hunter"
msgstr "근방 사냥꾼"

#: data\json\npcs\professions\neighborhood_watch.json
msgid "Neighborhood Mechanic"
msgstr "근방 정비공"

#: data\json\npcs\professions\neighborhood_watch.json
msgid "Neighborhood Doctor"
msgstr "근방 의사"

#: data\json\npcs\professions\neighborhood_watch.json
msgid "Neighborhood Delinquent"
msgstr "근방 불량배"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\missiondef_free_merchants.json
msgid "Reach Refugee Center"
msgstr "피난시설에 도달"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "Full"
msgstr "배부름"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Full'.
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "This beggar in the refugee center has had something to eat recently."
msgstr "피난민 센터의 이 거지는 최근에 뭘 먹었다."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid "beggar"
msgstr "거지"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "Reena Sandhu"
msgstr "Reena Sandhu"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid "Beggar"
msgstr "거지"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"So, any luck with convincing the others to come on your crazy adventure yet?"
msgstr "그래서, 다른 애들을 네 미친 모험에 설득하는 건 잘 돼가?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"I'm sorry to say it after all you've done for me, but… I don't suppose "
"you've got anything to eat?"
msgstr "네가 해준 게 있는데 말하긴 미안하지만… 먹을 거 없어?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "Thank you again.  I really appreciate the food."
msgstr "다시 고마워. 음식 정말 감사해."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"Please, help me.  I need food.  Aren't you their sheriff?  Can't you help "
"me?"
msgstr "제발, 도와주세요. 음식이 필요해요. 당신이 보안관 아닌가요? 도와줄 수 없나요?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "Please, help me.  I need food."
msgstr "제발 도와주세요. 음식 좀 나눠주세요."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"I've talked to the others, and they're all willing to come.  So, you joining"
" us?"
msgstr "다른 애들과 얘기했어, 다 같이 가겠대. 너도 우리랑 갈래?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "Hey, here, I might have some food for you.  Let me check."
msgstr "이봐, 먹을 게 있을지도. 확인해볼게."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Get away from me."
msgstr "저리 가요."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"They won't let me in.  They say they're too full.  I'm allowed to camp out "
"here as long as I keep it clean and don't make a fuss, but I'm reduced to "
"begging to survive."
msgstr "날 안 들여줘. 자리가 꽉 찼대. 깨끗하게 하고 소란 안 피우면 여기 야영은 허락했지만, 살려면 구걸밖에 없어."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"They won't let me in.  They say they're too full.  I'm allowed to camp out "
"here as long as I keep it clean and don't make a fuss, but I'm so hungry."
msgstr "안에 못 들어가게 해요. 너무 꽉 찼대요. 밖에서 텐트 치고 있어도 된다는데..."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "Why don't you scavenge your own food?"
msgstr "직접 식량을 구하면 어때요?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid "What did you do before <the_cataclysm>?"
msgstr "<the_cataclysm> 전엔 뭐 했어?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "I might have some food for you.  Let me check."
msgstr "먹을 게 있을지도. 확인해볼게."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "I've got some more food, if you want it."
msgstr "음식 더 있는데, 원해?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "I'm sorry, I can't help you."
msgstr "미안해요, 도와드릴 수 없어요."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#: data\mods\DinoMod\obsolete\npc_dialogue.json
msgid "Thank you so much."
msgstr "정말 고마워."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "Can I ask you something else first?"
msgstr "먼저 다른 거 물어봐도 돼?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "I'm sorry, I was wrong.  I can't help you."
msgstr "미안, 내가 잘못 했어. 도와줄 수 없어."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "This is wonderful of you, I really appreciate it."
msgstr "정말 고맙네, 진심으로 감사해."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "No problem.  See you around."
msgstr "괜찮아. 또 봐."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"Where else?  I can't fight those things out there.  I'm in terrible physical"
" condition, don't have any useful skills, and I'm terrified of <zombies> and"
" violence.  How am I supposed to find a safe place?"
msgstr "어디로요? 저 밖에서 저것들과 싸울 수 없어요. 몸 상태가 너무 안 좋아서..."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"Come with me.  Maybe you're not the greatest adventurer, but it's better "
"than living here."
msgstr "같이 가. 최고의 모험가는 아니겠지만 여기 사는 것보단 나아."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"I have a camp of my own, away from here.  You could come there.  There "
"aren't many people left, we could use anyone regardless of skills."
msgstr "여기서 떨어진 곳에 내 야영지가 있어. 올 수 있어. 남은 사람이 별로 없으니 기술 상관없이 아무나 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"Out there?  That's suicide!  People that go out there don't come back, "
"people who can hold their own… unlike me.  I'd rather take my chances "
"begging for scraps and waiting for someone in the center to die and make "
"room for me, thanks."
msgstr ""
"밖으로? 자살이야! 밖에 나간 사람들은 못 돌아와, 자기 몫 할 수 있는 사람만… 난 아니야. 차라리 찌꺼기 구걸하고 센터 누가 죽어서 "
"자리 나길 기다릴게, 고마워."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"I have a camp of my own, away from here.  Maybe you can't scavenge, but we "
"can use any warm bodies that can lift a tool.  You'd be safer and better fed"
" there."
msgstr ""
"여기서 떨어진 곳에 내 야영지가 있어. 수색은 못 해도 도구 들 수 있는 사람이면 다 필요해. 거기가 더 안전하고 잘 먹을 수 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"I was a high school math teacher.  It was a good job, I loved it.  Funny "
"enough, it's not super applicable after the end of the world.  I mean, at "
"some point people are going to need a teacher again, but right now they just"
" want food, shelter, and clothing."
msgstr "고등학교 수학 선생이었어요. 좋은 직업이었고 좋아했어요. 재밌는 건..."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"I have a camp of my own, away from here.  Maybe they can't use your skills "
"here, but I could."
msgstr "여기서 떨어진 곳에 내 야영지가 있어. 여기선 네 기술이 필요 없을지 몰라도 나한텐 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"That's a kind offer of you, but I think I'd rather take my chances here than"
" risking it out there again.  I remember <the_cataclysm>, I'm not in any "
"hurry to face that again."
msgstr ""
"친절한 제안이지만, 다시 밖에서 위험 무릅쓰는 것보다 여기서 운을 믿을래. <the_cataclysm>을 기억해, 다시 마주하고 싶지 "
"않아."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"That's quite the offer, but I don't think I'd survive the trip.  I don't "
"think you realize how useless I am in this world."
msgstr "좋은 제안이지만 여행을 살아남지 못 할 거야. 이 세상에서 내가 얼마나 쓸모없는지 모르겠네."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "I'm sorry, I'm too hungry to make a big decision like that."
msgstr "미안, 너무 배고파서 그런 큰 결정을 못 해."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "I can keep you safe.  I'll take you there myself."
msgstr "안전하게 지켜줄게. 직접 데려갈게."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Let's talk about something else then."
msgstr "그럼 다른 얘기 하자."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"I really appreciate everything you've done for me, but I don't think you get"
" it.  I can't go out there.  I will die.  I know it's horrible camping out "
"here, but I just can't face that nightmare again."
msgstr ""
"네가 해준 모든 게 정말 고맙지만 이해 못 하는 것 같아. 밖으론 못 나가. 죽을 거야. 여기 야영이 끔찍한 건 아는데 그 악몽을 다시 "
"못 마주해."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "I hope you'll reconsider eventually.  Bye."
msgstr "언젠가 재고하길 바라. 안녕."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"Well… you have shown that you can survive out there, and you've been able to"
" provide food, so I know you're thriving more than we are here.  All right, "
"I'll tell you what.  I'm not going anywhere without my friends here, we've "
"been through way too much together.  If you can convince Luo, Brandon, and "
"Yusuke to come along, then I'll go."
msgstr ""
"흠… 밖에서 살아남을 수 있다는 걸 보였고 음식도 구할 수 있으니 여기 우리보다 잘 살고 있단 건 알아. 좋아, 말할게. 여기 친구들 "
"없인 안 가, 우린 너무 많이 함께 겪었어. 루오, 브랜든, 유스케를 설득해서 같이 오면 나도 갈게."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "OK.  For now let's talk about something else."
msgstr "알았어. 일단 다른 얘기 하자."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "OK, I'll talk to them too."
msgstr "알았어, 걔네한테도 얘기해볼게."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "All right!  Let's get going."
msgstr "좋아! 가자."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Dino Dave"
msgstr "Dino Dave"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "We've done it!  We've solved the list!"
msgstr "해냈다! 목록을 해결했어!"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"How's things with you?  My cardboard collection is getting quite impressive."
msgstr "어때, 잘 지내? 내 골판지 수집이 꽤 대단해지고 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Have I told you about cardboard, friend?  Do you have any?"
msgstr "골판지 얘기 해도 돼요, 친구? 혹시 있어요?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "About that shopping list of yours…"
msgstr "네 쇼핑 목록에 대해…"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Is there anything else I can do for you?"
msgstr "다른 도와줄 일 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "What are you going to do with all that cardboard now?"
msgstr "그 골판지 다 갖고 뭐 할 거야?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"We've done it, Dave!  Merchant says you can build yourself a house up on the"
" roof if you want.  You've got to keep it nice and clean, and help out the "
"people down here by looking out for zombies, but you can still use the "
"washrooms and things downstairs when you need to.  What do you say?"
msgstr ""
"해냈다 데이브! 상인이 옥상에 집을 지어도 된대. 깨끗하게 유지해야 하고, 아래 사람들 좀비 망봐주는 걸 도와야 하지만, 필요할 땐 "
"아래층 화장실 등은 쓸 수 있어. 어때?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Cardboard?"
msgstr "골판지요?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#: data\mods\DinoMod\NPC\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Why are you sitting out here?"
msgstr "왜 여기 앉아 계세요?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Are you seriously wearing a dinosaur costume?"
msgstr "진짜 공룡 의상을 입고 있는 건가요?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Do you need something to eat?"
msgstr "먹을 거 필요해?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Oh nice.  Crunchings and munchings.  That's a cool, a cool thing."
msgstr "오 좋아. 아삭아삭 냠냠. 멋진 거야, 진짜 멋진 거."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'm real hungry and they put drugs in most of the food.  I can see "
"you're not like that."
msgstr "그래, 정말 배고픈데 놈들이 대부분 음식에 약을 넣어. 넌 안 그런 게 보여."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "Actually can I ask you something else?"
msgstr "근데 다른 거 물어봐도 돼?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"I can tell when it has stuff in it, it's got a sandy texture.  But this "
"doesn't.  Thanks again."
msgstr "뭔가 들었으면 알아, 모래 같은 식감이거든. 근데 이건 아니야. 다시 고마워."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"I'm building a house out of cardboard.  The sandman doesn't want me to, but "
"I told him to go fuck himself."
msgstr "골판지로 집을 짓고 있어요. 모래 사람이 하지 말라고 했지만 이겼어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Why cardboard?"
msgstr "왜 골판지로요?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "The sandman?"
msgstr "모래 사나이?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Would you like me to give you some cardboard?"
msgstr "골판지 좀 줄까?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#: data\mods\DinoMod\NPC\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "I think I have to get going…"
msgstr "가봐야 할 것 같아…"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"There's so much of it now, and the zombies are afraid of it.  It's kept me "
"safe so far.  The beta rays come from the center point of the zombie, so it "
"hits the cardboard and can't penetrate.  The reflection can stop any further"
" damage."
msgstr "지금은 널려 있고, 좀비들이 무서워해요. 덕분에 살았어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"Kind of a question's that?  Yeah man, you got cardboard, I got a whole… a "
"whole shopping list.  Got it here."
msgstr "그게 무슨 질문이야? 그래 형씨, 골판지 있어? 나한텐 완전한… 완전한 쇼핑 목록이 있어. 여기 있지."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "What's next on the list?"
msgstr "목록 다음은 뭐야?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"If you don't know who he is, I definitely can't tell you.  He talks to "
"everyone, if you didn't hear him that means you can't be trusted, except to "
"help me out."
msgstr "걔가 누군지 모르면 절대 말 못 해. 걘 모두랑 얘기해, 못 들었으면 넌 믿을 수 없는 거야, 나 돕는 거 빼고는."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "…What were you saying before?"
msgstr "…아까 뭐라 했었지?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"These cowards are afraid of me.  They won't let me into their base.  I'm "
"going to build my new house and I won't let them in."
msgstr "이 겁쟁이들이 날 안에 안 들여보내줘요. 혼내줄 거예요..."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "You said you were building a house?"
msgstr "집 짓고 있다며?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#: src/handle_action.cpp src/overmap_ui.cpp
msgid "No."
msgstr "아니오."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "I… I can see you wearing it.  Why are you wearing that?"
msgstr "나… 네가 입고 있는 거 보여. 왜 그걸 입고 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#: data\mods\DinoMod\NPC\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "What was that about cardboard?"
msgstr "골판지 얘기가 뭐였죠?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#: data\mods\DinoMod\NPC\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"You ask me what I can see, but I don't tell you what you see.  Sometimes we "
"have shields up, to protect ourselves."
msgstr "내가 뭘 보는지 묻는데, 네가 보는 건 안 알려줘. 가끔 우린 방패를 세워, 스스로를 지키려고."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Well… I had it all pretty together, "
msgstr "뭐… 다 잘 준비됐는데,"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "but the others have left, and "
msgstr "근데 다른 애들이 떠났고"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "and I feel bad with all the help you've given me already, but "
msgstr "그리고 이미 많이 도와줬는데 미안하지만"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"now the masters won't let me build my sanctuary.  I know I can't build it in"
" here, they wouldn't allow it.  They won't listen to me when I ask for a "
"safe place.  They just want me to disappear, like the others.  Can you help "
"me figure them out?"
msgstr ""
"이제 주인들이 내 안식처를 못 짓게 해. 여기 짓는 게 안 된다는 건 알아, 허락 안 하거든. 안전한 곳을 달래도 들어주지 않아. 걔넨 "
"내가 다른 애들처럼 사라지길 바라. 걔네를 알아내는 걸 도와줄래?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"Why don't you leave this place?  Come with me, I could use some help out "
"there."
msgstr "여기를 떠나지 그래? 같이 가, 밖에서 도움이 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"Sure, Dave.  One last favor, I think I can talk to merchant about finding "
"you a place to go."
msgstr "알았어, 데이브. 마지막 부탁으로, 상인한테 네가 갈 곳을 얘기해볼게."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "I'll have to think on that, Dave, I've done a lot already."
msgstr "생각해봐야겠어, 데이브, 이미 많이 했어."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"The roof!  So high!  So lofty!  I can hardly believe it!  This will be a "
"nicer house than I had before everything went funny.  I can watch out, I'm "
"happy to do that.  And it'll be nice to still have a bathroom!  Come see me "
"there, my friend.  I will not disappoint you."
msgstr ""
"옥상! 엄청 높아! 웅장해! 믿기지 않아! 모든 게 이상해지기 전보다 더 좋은 집이 될 거야. 망도 볼 수 있어, 기꺼이 할게. 그리고 "
"화장실도 그대로 있으니 좋지! 거기서 찾아와, 내 친구. 실망 안 시킬게."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "I'll see you on the rooftop.  Good luck, Dave."
msgstr "옥상에서 보자. 행운을 빌어, 데이브."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"No!  I just got everything together.  I am not leaving, not now.  "
"Everything's finally coming together!"
msgstr "안 돼! 이제 다 준비됐어. 안 떠나, 지금은 안 돼. 드디어 다 갖춰졌어!"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"Well, OK then, Dave.  One last favor, I think I can talk to merchant about "
"finding you a place to go."
msgstr "음, 알았어 데이브. 마지막 부탁으로, 상인한테 네가 갈 곳을 얘기해볼게."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "I'll have to think on it, Dave, I've done a lot already."
msgstr "생각해봐야겠어, 데이브, 이미 많이 했어."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Bring 40 small cardboard boxes"
msgstr "작은 골판지 상자 40개를 가져오세요"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"Gotta start small right?  Little ones for keeping little things safe.  I "
"could use 'em."
msgstr "작게 시작해야지? 작은 물건 지키는 작은 상자들. 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"Gotta start small right?  Little ones for keeping little things safe.  I "
"could use 'em.  I need a bunch of 'em.  Little ones, you know?  Can you "
"bring me like… like… forty?"
msgstr ""
"작게 시작해야지? 작은 물건 지키는 작은 상자들. 필요해. 잔뜩 필요해. 작은 거, 알지? 나한테 뭐… 뭐… 마흔 개 정도 가져다줄래?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Oh man, thanks so much my friend.  You won't regret it."
msgstr "오 이봐, 정말 고마워 친구. 후회 안 할 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "I didn't think so."
msgstr "역시 그럴 줄 알았어."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Watch out, he's looking for it too."
msgstr "조심해, 걔도 그걸 찾고 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Got the little ones yet?"
msgstr "작은 거 구했어?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Oh this is so great, so great!"
msgstr "오 이건 정말 대단해, 정말 대단해!"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Oh, that's too bad.  Guess they're eating it all."
msgstr "오, 안 됐네. 걔네가 다 먹어버린가봐."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Bring a roll of duct tape (200 charges)"
msgstr "덕트 테이프 한 롤(200회분)을 가져오세요"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"These ones are good, good ones.  They need something to, you know, bind them"
" together.  Surround them, light side, dark side."
msgstr "이건 좋은 거야, 정말 좋은 거. 뭐라 해야지, 함께 묶어줄 게 필요해. 감싸줘야지, 밝은 면, 어두운 면."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"These ones are good, good ones.  They need something to, you know, bind them"
" together.  Surround them, light side, dark side.  Bring me the Force!"
msgstr ""
"이건 좋은 거야, 정말 좋은 거. 뭐라 해야지, 함께 묶어줄 게 필요해. 감싸줘야지, 밝은 면, 어두운 면. 포스를 가져다줘!"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "It's all around us… but did you get it in a crude matter form?"
msgstr "우리 주변에 다 있는데… 물질 형태로 가져왔어?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Bring 10 medium-sized cardboard boxes"
msgstr "중간 크기 골판지 상자 10개를 가져오세요"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"Ten bigger ones now please.  The list doesn't lie.  You've done so well."
msgstr "이제 큰 거 10개 부탁해. 목록은 거짓말 안 해. 잘해줬어."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"Ten bigger ones now please.  The list doesn't lie.  You've done so well.  I "
"got a little more on the list, but we're more than half there."
msgstr "이제 큰 거 10개 부탁해. 목록은 거짓말 안 해. 잘해줬어. 목록에 좀 더 있지만 절반은 넘었어."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Any luck?  Bigger ones?"
msgstr "구했어? 큰 거?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "I'm so happy now!"
msgstr "너무 행복해!"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Bring 10 large plastic sheets"
msgstr "큰 플라스틱 시트 10개를 가져오세요"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"If I can set it up in here I won't need it, but they might drive me out, so "
"I guess I need some plastic just in case.  I don't like it, the sandman can "
"smell through plastic, but I think the cardboard is stronger."
msgstr ""
"여기 설치할 수 있으면 필요 없겠지만 쫓겨날 수도 있으니 혹시 모르니 플라스틱이 필요해. 싫지만, 모래 사나이는 플라스틱을 뚫고 냄새 "
"맡아, 근데 골판지가 더 강한 것 같아."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"If I can set it up in here I won't need it, but they might drive me out, so "
"I guess I need some plastic just in case.  I don't like it, the sandman can "
"smell through plastic, but I think the cardboard is stronger.  Please bring "
"me some plastic sheets."
msgstr ""
"여기 설치할 수 있으면 필요 없겠지만 쫓겨날 수도 있으니 혹시 모르니 플라스틱이 필요해. 싫지만, 모래 사나이는 플라스틱을 뚫고 냄새 "
"맡아, 근데 골판지가 더 강한 것 같아. 플라스틱 시트 좀 가져다줘."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "We're almost there, now."
msgstr "이제 거의 다 됐어."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "They keep a lot of this stuff in hardware stores and lumber yards."
msgstr "이런 건 철물점이랑 목재장에 많이 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"I really feel bad sending you on this one, it's dangerous.  Have you found "
"anything?"
msgstr "이걸 부탁하는 건 정말 미안해, 위험하거든. 뭔가 찾았어?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Nice, this will do perfectly!"
msgstr "좋아, 딱 맞아!"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Oh, that's too bad."
msgstr "오, 안 됐네."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Bring 5 large cardboard boxes"
msgstr "큰 골판지 상자 5개를 가져오세요"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"This is the last thing I need from you.  I've been collecting the other "
"parts myself, it's been easier with more cardboard around.  Can you bring me"
" five more really big cardboard boxes?"
msgstr "네게 필요한 마지막 물건이야. 나머진 내가 모았어, 골판지가 많아서 쉬워졌거든. 정말 큰 골판지 상자 5개 더 가져다줄래?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"This is the last thing I need from you.  I've been collecting the other "
"parts myself, it's been easier with more cardboard around.  Can you bring me"
" five more really big cardboard boxes?  Five more cardboard boxes, as big as"
" it gets.  I have a few already stored up, that should be all I need."
msgstr ""
"네게 필요한 마지막 물건이야. 나머진 내가 모았어, 골판지가 많아서 쉬워졌거든. 정말 큰 골판지 상자 5개 더 가져다줄래? 골판지 상자 "
"5개, 제일 큰 거로. 이미 몇 개 비축해뒀으니 그게 다 필요한 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Yes!  The home stretch!"
msgstr "그래! 막바지다!"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Oh man, but we're so close!"
msgstr "오 이봐, 거의 다 왔는데!"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Try looking in cargo storage areas."
msgstr "화물 보관 구역을 찾아봐."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Did you bring me those last few boxes?"
msgstr "그 마지막 상자들 가져왔어?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"Brilliant!  You're a true hero.  I'll see if I can find a place to set these"
" up now."
msgstr "멋져! 진짜 영웅이야. 이제 이걸 세울 곳을 찾아볼게."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "No!  Oh god, no, this can't be happening…"
msgstr "안 돼! 오 이런, 안 돼, 이럴 수 없어…"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Talk to merchant about Dave."
msgstr "상인에게 데이브에 대해 얘기하세요."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"I have it, I have it all, but I can't find a place to put it.  Will you ask "
"the masters?  Maybe?  I've tried but they ignore me."
msgstr "다 있어, 전부 다 있는데, 둘 곳을 못 찾았어. 주인들한테 물어봐줄래? 어쩌면? 나도 해봤는데 무시해."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"I have it, I have it all, but I can't find a place to put it.  Will you ask "
"the masters?  Maybe?  I've tried but they ignore me.  I just need a place to"
" put it all, a place I can be safe, and not make anyone upset."
msgstr ""
"다 있어, 전부 다 있는데, 둘 곳을 못 찾았어. 주인들한테 물어봐줄래? 어쩌면? 나도 해봤는데 무시해. 그냥 다 둘 곳이 필요해, 내가"
" 안전할 수 있는 곳, 아무도 화 안 나게 하는 곳."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Thank you!  I'm sorry, I thought we were done, but we can do this!"
msgstr "고마워! 미안, 끝난 줄 알았는데, 할 수 있어!"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Maybe somewhere they can't see me?  Where I can just be me?"
msgstr "걔네가 날 못 보는 곳? 내가 나일 수 있는 곳?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Did you ask the masters?"
msgstr "주인들한테 물어봤어?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"The roof!  So high!  So lofty!  Come see me there, my friend.  I will not "
"disappoint you."
msgstr "옥상! 엄청 높아! 웅장해! 거기서 찾아와, 내 친구. 실망 안 시킬게."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\npc\missiondef.json
msgid "I don't understand."
msgstr "이해 못 하겠어."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Insulted"
msgstr "모욕받음"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Insulted'.
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Oh, you went there."
msgstr "아, 거기까지 가셨네."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Luo Meizhen"
msgstr "Luo Meizhen"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Fuck off, dickwaddle."
msgstr "[공격] 꺼져라."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Yo.  Anyone else keen on moving from this bus stop to your tent city?"
msgstr "야. 이 버스 정류장에서 네 텐트촌으로 가고 싶은 애 또 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Hey there.  Good to see you again."
msgstr "안녕. 다시 보니 좋네."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Careful, I'm getting hangry again and am not totally responsible for my own "
"actions."
msgstr "조심해, 또 배고파서 화나는 중이라 내 행동에 전적으로 책임 못 져."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Look, I'm sorry for freaking out earlier.  You might be an asshole but I'm "
"sure you didn't mean it like that.  My blood sugar is hella low, I get a bit"
" cranky.  We cool?"
msgstr "있잖아, 아까 날뛴 건 미안해. 네가 좆 같긴 해도 그런 뜻은 아니었겠지. 혈당이 존나 낮아서 좀 예민해져. 우리 괜찮지?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Hey there, not-asshole.  Good to see you again."
msgstr "안녕, 좆 같지-않은 사람. 다시 보니 좋네."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Don't bother with these assholes."
msgstr "저 놈들 신경 쓰지 마요."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
#: data\json\npcs\robofac\NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
#: data\json\obsoletion\npc_dialogue.json
msgid "What's up?"
msgstr "무슨 일이야?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "I might have some food for you.  Are you hungry?"
msgstr "먹을 게 있을지도. 배고파?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "We're cool.  Sorry for insulting you earlier."
msgstr "우리 괜찮아. 아까 모욕한 건 미안."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "I found a sample of alien fungus for you."
msgstr "네가 찾던 외계 진균 샘플을 찾았어."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Ok… see ya."
msgstr "알았어… 나중에 봐."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Actually yeah, I'm always hungry these days.  I don't like taking handouts, "
"but I wouldn't say no."
msgstr "사실 그래, 요즘 항상 배고파. 동냥은 싫지만 거절하진 않을게."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Thanks, I really appreciate this."
msgstr "고마워, 정말 감사해."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "They're 'too full'.  Won't share fuck-all."
msgstr "그들은 '너무 많이' 가졌어. 모두 나눠 주려고 하지 않는다고."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Why are you living here then?"
msgstr "넌 왜 여기에 살고있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Well, they might not share, but I can.  Are you hungry?"
msgstr "뭐, 걔넨 안 나눠줄지 몰라도 난 줄 수 있어. 배고파?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Even without them helping, it's the safest place to squat.  As long as we "
"keep it clean up here and don't cause sanitation problems, they don't mind "
"us sitting around the entryway.  So kind and generous of them, to let us sit"
" here and slowly starve."
msgstr "도움은 없어도 숨기에는 제일 좋은 곳이에요. 조용히만 있으면..."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Oh, same old story at first.  I got evacuated on to the local concentration "
"center, then picked up on a repurposed school bus and dragged out here.  "
"Then the chick processing me to get in saw my name and Chinese name and "
"conveniently 'lost' my paperwork.  I was sent out here to wait for further "
"processing, while I watched busloads of people get processed and taken in.  "
"By the time they 'found' it, the place was full up, wouldn't ya know it.  "
"Now I'm stuck out here and they won't consider letting me in."
msgstr ""
"오, 처음엔 늘 있는 얘기야. 지역 수용소로 대피했다가 개조 스쿨버스에 태워져서 여기 끌려왔어. 그다음 입소 처리하는 여자가 내 이름이랑"
" 중국어 이름을 보고 편하게 서류를 '잃어버렸지'. 추가 처리를 기다리라며 여기로 보내졌어, 버스 가득 탄 사람들이 처리되어 들어가는 걸"
" 보면서. 서류를 '찾았을' 땐 자리가 꽉 찼고, 이럴 줄 알았지. 이제 여기 갇혔고 들여보낼 생각이 없어."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "You think you were treated like that because of your race?"
msgstr "인종 때문에 그런 대우를 받았다고 생각해?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Does that mean you were part of that back room evacuation I heard about?"
msgstr "그럼 내가 들은 후실 대피의 일원이었어?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Why stay out here then?"
msgstr "그럼 왜 여기 있는데?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"I have a camp of my own, away from here.  No paperwork required.  Want to "
"come?"
msgstr "여기서 떨어진 곳에 내 야영지가 있어. 서류 필요 없어. 올래?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Oh yeah, that was a hell of a shitstorm.  We were waiting back there for "
"'processing' for hours and hours, with the sick and wounded.  One guy died, "
"we all thought he was sleeping until he got back up.  That started a panic, "
"gunshots in a closed area, that kind of stuff.  In just a few minutes, a "
"bunch more people were dead.  Then the assholes called it an 'outbreak' and "
"tried to barricade us in… took us way too long to convince the panicking "
"guards that we were alive and needed to get out.  I'll give the one guy "
"credit, Sean: when he found out they'd locked living people in with zombies,"
" he came in himself, as some of the newly dead were starting to get back up,"
" and he held them off for us to escape.  That… that was probably the only "
"actual good thing I've seen since before the end of the world: he owned his "
"error and he put himself in harm's way to make up for it.  Massive respect "
"to that guy.  So, of course, he's a zombie now.  Fuck, thanks for reminding "
"me of all that sunny fun."
msgstr ""
"오 그래, 그건 개판이었어. 우린 '처리'를 기다리며 몇 시간이고 있었어, 아픈 사람과 부상자와 함께. 한 놈이 죽었는데 자는 줄 "
"알았어, 다시 일어나기 전까지. 그게 패닉을 시작했지, 밀폐 공간 총격, 그런 거. 몇 분 만에 많은 사람이 더 죽었어. 그때 놈들이 "
"'집단발병'이라 부르며 우릴 가둬버렸지… 공황한 경비들한테 우리가 살아있고 나가야 한다고 설득하는 데 너무 오래 걸렸어. 숀이라는 놈한텐"
" 인정해: 산 사람들을 좀비랑 가둔 걸 알고 직접 들어와서, 막 죽은 놈들이 일어나기 시작할 때 우리 탈출 시간을 벌어줬어. 그게… 그게"
" 아마 세상 망한 뒤 본 유일하게 진짜 좋은 일이야: 자기 잘못을 인정하고 스스로 위험을 감수해 만회했지. 그 놈한텐 엄청난 존경이야. "
"그래서, 당연히, 지금 좀비야. 씨발, 그 화창한 추억을 떠올려줘서 고맙다."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Sorry for bringing it up. What were you saying?"
msgstr "꺼내서 미안. 뭐라 했었지?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Sure.  My grandparents were from China.  That means I'm obviously personally"
" responsible for all this.  Do you think there's some other reason they let "
"hundreds of other educated people in and I'm sitting out here?"
msgstr ""
"그래. 내 조부모는 중국 출신이야. 즉 내가 분명 이 모든 것에 개인적으로 책임 있다는 거지. 수백 명의 다른 교육받은 사람들은 "
"들여보내고 난 여기 앉아 있는 다른 이유가 있다고 생각해?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "I don't care if you're Chinese.  You can travel with me if you want."
msgstr "중국인이든 상관없어. 원하면 나랑 여행해도 돼."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"I mean, racism could definitely be a part of it… but you are visibly in poor"
" shape.  They need strong survivor material."
msgstr "뭐 인종차별이 분명 한 몫했겠지만… 네가 보기에도 몸 상태가 안 좋아. 놈들은 강한 생존자 재료가 필요해."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"That's awful kind of you, but look at me.  I'm not traveling material, I've "
"managed to stay fifty pounds overweight on a diet of pine nuts and wilted "
"rhubarb, and I scream and shake uncontrollably at the sight of blood."
msgstr ""
"친절해도 너무 친절하네, 근데 날 좀 봐. 난 여행감이 아니야, 잣과 시든 루바브만 먹고도 50파운드 과체중 유지했고, 피만 보면 비명 "
"지르고 통제 불가로 떨어."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"It'd be temporary.  I have a base set up.  There are only a few of us "
"survivors left, we need to work together"
msgstr "임시일 거야. 내 기지가 있어. 남은 생존자가 몇 안 돼서 함께 해야 해."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Okay, yeah, that's a bit of a problem.  What were you saying before?"
msgstr "알았어, 그래, 그건 좀 문제네. 아까 뭐라 했었지?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"It may not be much, but we've got a little community.  We can't live like "
"this forever, but we're safer than out there, and we look out for each "
"other.  One way or another we'll shake things out to something better."
msgstr "대단하진 않지만 작은 공동체가 있어. 영원히 이렇게 못 살지만 밖보단 안전하고 서로 돌봐. 어떻게든 더 나은 게 될 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "You sound more optimistic than usual."
msgstr "평소보다 낙관적이네."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "So, about that doctorate of yours…"
msgstr "그래서, 네 박사 학위 얘기…"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Don't get me wrong, I hate this place and this situation, and especially the"
" selfish racist fucks that landed me here… but these other losers that "
"landed out here with me?  I like them.  We might be miserable, but we're "
"miserable together."
msgstr ""
"오해는 마, 이곳과 이 상황이 싫고, 특히 날 여기 처박은 이기적 인종차별 새끼들이 싫어… 하지만 같이 처박힌 다른 루저들? 걔넨 좋아."
" 비참할지 몰라도 같이 비참해."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Oooooh.  Oh.  You did not just fucking go there.  Let's leave the fatties to"
" die, hey?  Wanna know how easy it is to find fucking *thyroid medication* "
"after the apocalypse, asshat?  Besides, there are more skills than heavy "
"lifting needed now… no, you know what?  Screw it.  You're not worth my time."
msgstr ""
"오오오오. 아. 그걸 건드리네. 뚱뚱한 놈들은 버려두자, 그치? 아포칼립스 뒤 빌어먹을 *갑상선약* 찾는 게 얼마나 쉬운지 아냐, 병신?"
" 게다가 지금은 무거운 거 드는 것 말고도 기술이 필요해… 아니, 됐어. 내 시간 낭비할 가치 없어."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Thanks for saying it.  So, what brings you around?"
msgstr "말해줘서 고마워. 그래서, 무슨 일이야?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Just wanted to get square.  I'd better get going."
msgstr "그냥 화해하고 싶었어. 가야겠다."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Tempting offer, but I don't know how much I trust a random stranger offering"
" me a place to live.  Call me crazy."
msgstr "솔깃한 제안이지만, 살 곳을 주겠다는 낯선 놈을 얼마나 믿을 수 있을지 모르겠네. 미친 놈이라 불러도 돼."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Oh, come on.  I'm not a random stranger anymore, I brought you that crazy "
"mushroom didn't I?"
msgstr "오, 이봐. 이젠 낯선 놈 아니잖아, 그 미친 버섯 가져다줬잖아?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"What better choice do you have?  It's not like it would be just you and me, "
"the others out here can come too."
msgstr "더 나은 선택이 있어? 너랑 나만 있는 것도 아니고, 여기 다른 애들도 같이 올 수 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Like I said, sorry, it's just not happening.  It's not that I don't trust "
"you, it's just that I don't really trust you."
msgstr "말했듯이, 미안, 안 될 것 같아. 널 안 믿는 게 아니라, 그냥 정말 믿을 수 없는 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Aw damn, I was worried you'd say that.  Okay, listen: you've got yourself a "
"deal.  I'll come to your base, but you've gotta get me hooked up with a "
"microscope as soon as you can.  This could be the beginning of something "
"really cool.  Oh, and it should go without saying that I'm not coming unless"
" you can find a place for my friends here in your base.  I'm sure you "
"anticipated that.  Talk them into going and I'm in.  It should be easy, "
"they're a bunch of sweet hearted saps."
msgstr ""
"이런 젠장, 그럴 줄 알았어. 좋아, 들어: 거래 성사. 네 기지로 가는데, 될 수 있는 빨리 현미경을 구해줘. 뭔가 정말 멋진 일의 "
"시작일 수 있어. 아, 그리고 네 기지에 내 친구들 자리를 못 찾으면 안 가는 건 말할 것도 없어. 이미 예상했겠지. 걔넬 설득해서 가면"
" 나도 가. 쉬울 거야, 다들 착한 등신들이라."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Well, before <the_cataclysm> ended I was working at a university bookstore."
"  I know a little bit about a lot of things, I guess you could say.  I kinda"
" loved the job, to be honest."
msgstr ""
"뭐, <the_cataclysm>이 끝나기 전엔 대학 서점에서 일했어. 뭐든 조금씩은 안다고 할 수 있지. 솔직히 그 일 좋아했어."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"What had you working at the university bookstore in the first place?  Are "
"you an academic yourself?"
msgstr "애초에 왜 대학 서점에서 일했어? 너도 학자야?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "What's this I hear about you having a doctorate?"
msgstr "네가 박사라는 소문은 뭐야?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_refugees\NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_staff\NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "What was it you were saying before?"
msgstr "아까 뭐라 했었지?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, yeah, it's all very glamorous.  Sure, I trained in the great ivory "
"tower, got my PhD in mycology.  Did my dissertation on signaling pathways in"
" hyphae formation, and a postdoc in plant-fungus communication in rhizomes."
"  Then I got the job at the bookstore because there wasn't a ton of work for"
" a doctor of mycology, although I'd had a few nibbles before things really "
"got crazy.  Now, people are just breaking down my door to get my sweet sweet"
" knowledge of mold to help them fight the incoming zombie threat."
msgstr ""
"그래, 그래, 아주 화려해. 물론, 위대한 아이보리타워에서 수련했고 균류학 박사를 땄어. 논문은 균사 형성의 신호 전달 경로였고, "
"박사후는 뿌리줄기의 식물-진균 통신이었지. 그다음 서점에서 일하게 된 건 균류학 박사한테 일이 별로 없어서야, 완전 미치기 전엔 제안이 "
"좀 있었지만. 이제 다들 내 달콤달콤한 곰팡이 지식으로 좀비 위협과 싸우려고 내 문을 부수는 중이야."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Do you know about the fungal zombies though?"
msgstr "근데 진균 좀비에 대해 알아?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Heh.  Yeah, that was a great use of my time.  As you can see it really "
"helped my employment prospects.  Yeah, I have a PhD in mycology.  Did my "
"dissertation on signaling pathways in hyphae formation, and a postdoc in "
"plant-fungus communication in rhizomes.  Then I got the job at the bookstore"
" because there wasn't a ton of work for a doctor of mycology, although I'd "
"had a few nibbles before things really got crazy.  Now, people are just "
"breaking down my door to get my sweet sweet knowledge of mold to help them "
"fight the incoming zombie threat."
msgstr ""
"헤. 그래, 시간 잘 썼지. 보다시피 취업 전망에 아주 도움됐어. 그래, 난 균류학 박사야. 논문은 균사 형성의 신호 전달 경로였고, "
"박사후는 뿌리줄기의 식물-진균 통신이었지. 그다음 서점에서 일하게 된 건 균류학 박사한테 일이 별로 없어서야, 완전 미치기 전엔 제안이 "
"좀 있었지만. 이제 다들 내 달콤달콤한 곰팡이 지식으로 좀비 위협과 싸우려고 내 문을 부수는 중이야."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"No, no I don't, and I'd appreciate you not leaving me hanging on that.  "
"There are fungal zombies?"
msgstr "아니, 몰라, 애간장 태우지 말아줘. 진균 좀비가 있다고?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Encroaching alien mushrooms, fungal towers, tough mycelium invading ground "
"and trees, zombies taken over by aggressive mold…  Yeah.  It's ugly stuff."
msgstr "침식하는 외계 버섯, 진균 탑, 땅과 나무를 침범하는 질긴 균사체, 공격적 곰팡이에 지배된 좀비… 그래. 지저분한 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Okay, you've got my attention.  Listen, do you think you could bring me some"
" kind of sample of these things?"
msgstr "좋아, 흥미 생겼어. 있잖아, 그런 놈들 샘플 좀 가져다줄 수 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"It'd be dangerous.  What kind of benefit is there from taking a risk like "
"that?"
msgstr "위험할 거야. 그런 위험을 무릅쓰면 뭐가 좋은데?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"If you get me a sample, I'll join your crazy camp expedition.  Hell, if you "
"bring me a sample maybe I'll help you set up a lab to study this stuff.  "
"Almost anything could work, but if this stuff is as dangerous as you make it"
" sound, maybe make sure it's not a sporulating body."
msgstr ""
"샘플을 가져오면 네 미친 야영지 원정대에 합류할게. 빌어먹을, 샘플만 가져오면 이걸 연구할 실험실도 도와줄 수 있어. 거의 뭐든 되는데,"
" 말한 대로 위험하면 포자체는 안 되게 해."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"I dunno, scientific interest?  If you don't bring me anything, no worries.  "
"I'm positively swimming in entertainment here, as you can see."
msgstr "글쎄, 과학적 호기심? 아무것도 안 가져와도 괜찮아. 보다시피 여기선 오락거리에 푹 빠져 있어."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "It just so happens I have a chunk of fungal matter on me right now."
msgstr "마침 지금 진균 덩어리를 갖고 있는데."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Sure, I'd better get going.  I'll see if I can find you something."
msgstr "알았어, 가야겠어. 뭔가 찾아볼게."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Well.  Well, well, well.  This is really interesting.  Look, you can see reticulations here, it looks sort of like an enlarged piece of a stipe from a basidiocarp… but look at this, these fibers are clearly unlike anything I've seen before.  I wonder if they're motile?\n"
"\n"
"Okay, listen: you've got yourself a deal.  I'll come to your base, but you've gotta get me hooked up with a microscope as soon as you can.  This could be the beginning of something really cool.  Oh, and it should go without saying that I'm not coming unless you can find a place for my friends here in your base.  I'm sure you anticipated that.  Talk them into going and I'm in.  It should be easy, they're a bunch of sweet hearted saps."
msgstr ""
"흠. 흠, 흠, 흠. 이건 정말 흥미로워. 봐, 여기 그물 무늬가 보여, 담자자체의 균병 조각이 확대된 것 같은데… 근데 이걸 봐, 이 "
"섬유는 내가 본 어떤 것과도 확실히 달라. 움직일까?\\n\\n좋아, 들어: 거래 성사. 네 기지로 가는데, 될 수 있는 빨리 현미경을 "
"구해줘. 뭔가 정말 멋진 일의 시작일 수 있어. 아, 그리고 네 기지에 내 친구들 자리를 못 찾으면 안 가는 건 말할 것도 없어. 이미 "
"예상했겠지. 걔넬 설득해서 가면 나도 가. 쉬울 거야, 다들 착한 등신들이라."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Great!  I'll go see what I can do about that."
msgstr "좋아! 그거 어떻게 해볼게."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Well.  Well, well, well.  This is really interesting.  Look, you can see reticulations here, it looks sort of like an enlarged piece of a stipe from a basidiocarp… but look at this, these fibers are clearly unlike anything I've seen before.  I wonder if they're motile?\n"
"\n"
"Sorry.  I could stare at this all day.  I owe you one, a big one.  Thanks for this.  Let me know if you ever need a favor from a chubby beggar woman."
msgstr ""
"흠. 흠, 흠, 흠. 이건 정말 흥미로워. 봐, 여기 그물 무늬가 보여, 담자자체의 균병 조각이 확대된 것 같은데… 근데 이걸 봐, 이 "
"섬유는 내가 본 어떤 것과도 확실히 달라. 움직일까?\\n\\n미안. 하루 종일 쳐다볼 수 있어. 너한테 큰 빚을 졌네. 이건 고마워. "
"통통한 거지 여자한테 부탁이 필요하면 말해."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Glad you like it.  If I think of something you can do in return, I'll let "
"you know."
msgstr "마음에 들어서 다행이야. 보답할 걸 생각하면 말할게."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Well good.  Let's get going, I want to see some more of these crazy "
"mushrooms."
msgstr "잘됐네. 가자, 이 미친 버섯을 더 보고 싶어."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\surface_staff\NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
#: data\mods\Arcana_BN\npcs\TALK_CF_DEACON.json
#: data\mods\Arcana_BN\npcs\TALK_CF_GM.json
#: data\mods\Arcana_BN\npcs\TALK_HERMIT.json
msgid "I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "어떻게 해볼게."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "Brandon Garder"
msgstr "Brandon Garder"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "Thanks again for the grub, my friend."
msgstr "먹을 거 고마워, 친구."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "Hey, are you a big fan of survival of the fittest?"
msgstr "이봐요, 적자생존 원리 크게 믿으세요?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "Why do you ask?"
msgstr "왜 그러세요?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid "Sorry, not interested."
msgstr "미안하지만 관심 없어요."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "Nice to see you too, what's up?"
msgstr "나도 반가워, 무슨 일이야?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "Nice to see you.  I gotta be going though."
msgstr "반가워. 가야겠지만."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"Oh you know, the usual: sittin' out here until I starve to death, playin' "
"cards with Dave, that kinda thing."
msgstr "오 있잖아, 늘 그렇듯이: 굶어 죽을 때까지 여기 앉아 있고, 데이브랑 카드놀이하고, 뭐 그런 거."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"Because I sure ain't fit, so I'm sittin' out here until I starve to death.  "
"Help a poor sickly soul out?"
msgstr "저는 딱히 적합하지 않아서, 굶어죽을 때까지 여기 앉아 있을 거예요. 도움이 필요해요..."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "I could maybe help you out… want something to eat?"
msgstr "도와줄 수 있을지도… 먹을 거 필요해?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "What's wrong with you?"
msgstr "어디가 안 좋으세요?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "They won't let you in because you're sick?"
msgstr "아파서 못 들여보내준다고요?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "How did you even get here if you're so sick?"
msgstr "그렇게 아프면서 여기까지 어떻게 왔어요?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "Why are you camped out here if they won't let you in?"
msgstr "안에 못 들여보내주는데 왜 여기 캠프 치고 있어요?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "That's awful kind of you, you really are a wonderful person."
msgstr "정말 친절하네, 정말 멋진 사람이야."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"Oh, wow!  You're a real gem, you know that?  Thanks for even thinking of it."
msgstr "오, 와! 진짜 보석 같은 사람이네, 알아? 생각해준 것만으로 고마워."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"It's good to know there are still people like you in the world, it really "
"is."
msgstr "이 세상에 너 같은 사람이 아직 있다니 좋아, 정말."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "What are you up to?"
msgstr "뭐 하고 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"You name it!  Asthma, diabetes, arthritis.  Diabetes hasn't been so bad "
"since I stopped, y'know, eating regularly.  Well, I assume it hasn't.  Not "
"like I can check that ol' whatchamacallit, the blood test the docs used to "
"bug me about every couple months."
msgstr "다 있어요! 천식, 당뇨, 관절염. 당뇨는 요즘 좀 나아졌어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "You seem awfully happy considering the situation."
msgstr "상황치곤 너무 행복해 보이네."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"They got enough mouths to feed that can pull their own weight.  I got a lot "
"of weight and I'm too weak to pull it, so I'm out here."
msgstr "자기 몫을 할 수 있는 입만 먹일 여유가 있대요. 저는 고칠 게 많아서..."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"Came with a small group quite a while ago.  The others were young and fit, "
"they got in.  They were some of the last ones to get in actually.  I didn't "
"make the cutoff."
msgstr "꽤 전에 작은 그룹이랑 왔어요. 다른 사람들은 젊고 건강해서 안에 들어갔어요..."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"This is a mercy.  I get shelter, light, and heat, and those guards will help"
" us if any zombies show up.  It ain't so bad.  If I was out on my own I'd "
"have none of this and still have to look for food… in other words, I'd be "
"dead as a doornail.  Or I guess undead."
msgstr ""
"이건 자비야. 피난처랑 빛이랑 온기가 있고, 좀비가 나타나면 경비들이 도와줘. 나쁘지 않아. 혼자 밖에 있었으면 이런 거 없이 음식도 "
"찾아야 해… 즉 완전 죽었을 거야. 아니면 언데드든."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"What's the alternative?  You take the hand you're dealt.  I've given "
"eulogies for two of the people I love most on this earth, and the third "
"wrote me off.  I've already been through the end of the world.  Came out the"
" other side with my bits intact.  And you know, I've been pretty lonely "
"since my wife passed.  Here I've got friends.  We might be hungry but we're "
"close.  Reena's been teaching me math and science, Luo is one of the "
"smartest folks I've ever met - she's got a doctorate you know - and Yusuke "
"is the only one here that can beat me at poker.  And Dave, well, he's Dave."
"  There's more goin' on under the surface there, mark my words.  We may be "
"unfit, but we aren't worthless."
msgstr ""
"대안이 뭐야? 주어진 손을 받아드는 거지. 지상에서 내가 제일 사랑한 두 사람의 조사를 읽었고, 셋째는 날 절교했어. 난 이미 세상의 "
"끝을 겪었어. 저편에서 몸 온전히 나왔지. 그리고 있잖아, 아내가 죽은 뒤 꽤 외로웠어. 여기선 친구가 있어. 배고플지 몰라도 가까워. "
"리나가 나한테 수학이랑 과학을 가르쳐주고, 루오는 내가 만난 사람 중 제일 똑똑해 - 박사거든 - 유스케는 여기서 나를 포커로 이길 수 "
"있는 유일한 놈이야. 그리고 데이브는, 뭐, 데이브야. 표면 아래 뭔가 더 있어, 내 말 명심해. 우리가 부적합할진 몰라도 쓸모없진 "
"않아."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"Well, I used to be a roofer, but ten years ago I had a bad fall and wrecked "
"my back.  Tried to get into other kinds of carpentry and construction but I "
"just don't have the head for it and my back still hurt.  My wife managed to "
"support both of us with the extra bit I made from odd jobs, but she had a "
"stroke and I was on my own the last few years slowly draining my savings dry"
" while I work whatever junk jobs I can handle.  Couple days before "
"<the_cataclysm> I got the notice that the bank was going to foreclose on my "
"crappy little trailer."
msgstr ""
"뭐, 전엔 지붕공이었는데, 10년 전 나쁜 낙하로 등을 망쳤어. 다른 목공이랑 건설을 하려 했지만 머리가 안 되고 등도 계속 아팠지. "
"아내가 내 잡일 수입으로 우리 둘을 먹여 살렸는데, 뇌졸중을 겪고 나서 지난 몇 년은 혼자서 할 수 있는 잡일을 하며 저축을 갉아먹었어."
" <the_cataclysm> 며칠 전에 은행이 내 형편없는 트레일러를 압류한다는 통지를 받았지."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "You have any kids?"
msgstr "자식 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"Would you like to travel with me?  Someone good with a trade could be "
"helpful, and it's got to be better than wasting away here."
msgstr "나랑 여행할래? 기술 좋은 사람이 도움돼, 여기서 말라비틀어지는 것보단 나을 거야."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"I have a camp.  It's a damn sight better than those place, and there are "
"regular meals.  Someone with your trades experience would be welcome, even "
"if you can't do the big jobs anymore."
msgstr "내 야영지가 있어. 저런 곳보다 훨씬 나아, 정기 식사도 있고. 네 기술 경험을 가진 사람은 환영이야, 큰일은 못 해도."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, we had two.  My daughter died of an OD right at the start of that "
"fentanyl stuff.  It did a real number on my son - they were twins you see - "
"and he cut ties to me and my wife.  Wasn't even there for her funeral.  I "
"can't blame him, it messed us all up pretty fierce.  As far as I'm concerned"
" he's still out there with my grandkids, hiding away somewhere safe.  These "
"days, no news is good news."
msgstr ""
"그래, 둘 있었어. 내 딸은 펜타닐 사태 시작 때 과다복용으로 죽었어. 내 아들한텐 큰 충격이었지 - 둘이 쌍둥이었거든 - 나랑 아내와 "
"연을 끊었어. 장례식에도 안 왔지. 탓할 수 없어, 우리 모두 엉망이 됐거든. 내가 아는 한 아들은 손주들과 어디 안전한 곳에 숨어있어."
" 요즘은 소식 없는 게 좋은 소식이야."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"It's sweet of you to say that, but I'm just not up to the wandering life, "
"not with these knees."
msgstr "그렇게 말해주니 고맙지만, 방랑 생활은 무리야, 이 무릎으론."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"That's awful nice of you.  Tell you what: if you can help Dave get himself "
"sorted out, so I don't feel like I've gotta stay here keeping an eye on the "
"poor fella, then I'll come along."
msgstr ""
"정말 친절하네. 이렇게 하자: 데이브를 정리되게 도와주면, 내가 불쌍한 녀석을 여기서 돌봐야 한다는 생각 안 들게, 그러면 같이 갈게."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"I think I've sorted Dave out pretty well, don't you?  Would you consider "
"coming with me now?"
msgstr "데이브는 꽤 잘 정리했다고 생각하는데, 안 그래? 이제 나랑 갈 생각 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"Well… I'll be honest, I didn't even think Dave could be sorted out, and "
"you've gone and called my bluff!  It's a darn fine thing you've done for "
"that poor soul.  Listen, I wasn't… entirely serious about wanting to come "
"with you, but if you can convince the others to go, then I guess I'll come "
"along."
msgstr ""
"흠… 솔직히 말하면, 데이브가 정리될 수 있을 거라 생각도 못 했어, 네가 내 허세를 간파했네! 그 불쌍한 녀석한테 정말 좋은 일을 "
"했어. 있잖아, 너랑 같이 간다는 게… 완전 진심은 아니었는데, 다른 애들을 설득하면 나도 갈게."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"Golly.  I didn't expect that, but I'm as good as my word.  Let's get going."
msgstr "세상에. 예상 못 했는데, 말한 대로 할게. 가자."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "Let's get going."
msgstr "가자."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid "Yusuke Taylor"
msgstr "Yusuke Taylor"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid "Hey there, friend."
msgstr "안녕하세요, 친구."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
#: data\json\snippets\schizophrenia.json
msgid "What are you doing out here?"
msgstr "여기서 뭐하고 있는 거야?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid "I couldn't help but notice, you're covered in fur."
msgstr "실례지만, 온몸에 털이 있네요."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid "Would you like something to eat?"
msgstr "먹을 거 줄까?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid ""
"I live here.  Too mutant to join the cool kids club, but not mutant enough "
"to kill on sight."
msgstr ""
"난 여기서 살고있어. 그렇지만 피난민의 일원으로 받아주기에는 너무 변이가 심각하게 진행됐고, 보자마자 죽여버리기에는 변이가 덜 진행됐지."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid "Why live out here?"
msgstr "왜 여기서 살고 있는 거야?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid "You seem like you can hold your own.  Why not travel with me?"
msgstr "혼자서도 잘 버티는 것 같던데요. 같이 다니는 건 어때요?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid ""
"It's safer than making my own home.  I head out and forage when I have to.  "
"As long as we keep it clean and do our part when a zombie comes, they let us"
" squat here as an extra defense.  They don't like that I've been bringing "
"food for the other squatters though…  I think they are trying to slowly "
"starve us out, and even though I can't keep everyone's bellies full, I've "
"been able to bring back enough to keep these folk in better shape.  I "
"suspect they'll find an excuse to kick me out eventually."
msgstr ""
"직접 집 짓는 것보다 안전해. 필요할 때 나가서 채집해. 깨끗하게 하고 좀비가 오면 제 몫을 하면, 추가 방어로 여기 쭈그려 있게 해줘."
" 근데 다른 쭈그리들한테 음식을 가져다주는 걸 싫어해… 우릴 천천히 굶겨 내쫓으려는 것 같아. 모두 배불리 못 해도 충분히 가져와 이 "
"사람들을 더 나은 상태로 유지했어. 결국 날 쫓아낼 핑계를 찾을 것 같아."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid ""
"Gross, isn't it? Feels like pubes.  I just started growing it everywhere a "
"little while after the Cataclysm.  No idea what caused it.  I can't blame "
"them for hating it, I hate it."
msgstr ""
"징그럽지? 음모 같은 느낌이야. 카타클리즘 직후부터 온몸에서 나기 시작했어. 원인은 몰라. 놈들이 싫어하는 걸 탓할 수 없어, 나도 "
"싫거든."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid ""
"I do okay for myself actually.  I eat a lot of things close to spoilage "
"while I'm foraging.  If you've got food to spare, please give it to my "
"friends."
msgstr "사실 난 괜찮아. 채집할 때 상하기 직전인 걸 많이 먹어. 여분 음식이 있으면 내 친구들한테 줘."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid ""
"Nothing too exciting.  I was in trade college, learning to be a computer "
"technician.  Those skills aren't too helpful, but when I was a kid I was an "
"Eagle scout.  I learned all kinds of useful stuff about plants and foraging,"
" and that's come in pretty handy."
msgstr ""
"대단한 건 없어. 전문대에서 컴퓨터 기술자를 배웠어. 그 기술은 별로 도움 안 되지만, 어렸을 때 이글 스카우트였거든. 식물과 채집에 "
"대한 온갖 유용한 걸 배웠고 그게 꽤 도움 됐어."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid "What about your family, stuff like that?"
msgstr "네 가족은, 그런 건?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid ""
"I don't want to think about it.  I grew up in Rhode Island, they're still "
"there.  I haven't heard from them since the insanity with the Governor and "
"that secession stuff.  All communication lines got closed off.  I haven't "
"met anyone who knows what happened to the people there but I don't have much"
" hope."
msgstr ""
"생각하기 싫어. 로드아일랜드에서 자랐고, 가족은 아직 거기 있어. 주지사의 미친 짓과 분리독립 사태 이후 연락이 없어. 모든 통신망이 "
"끊겼지. 거기 사람들이 어떻게 됐는지 아는 사람을 못 만났지만 희망은 없어."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid "Why don't you go back there?"
msgstr "왜 거기 안 돌아가?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid "Could you tell me more about what happened with Rhode Island?"
msgstr "로드아일랜드에서 무슨 일 있었는지 더 알려줄래?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid ""
"Same reason as I'm stuck here… it's way too dangerous, for one thing.  "
"Almost a hundred miles, through zombie infested territory, on foot, to get "
"to the shoreline?  No <swear> thank you.  And then, how would I get from the"
" shore to Block Island?  My family moved out there when Dad retired, and I "
"get the impression the ferry probably isn't running anymore.  Even if I got "
"there, I don't know what I'd find, and I think maybe that scares me the "
"most."
msgstr ""
"여기 갇힌 이유와 같아… 일단 너무 위험해. 좀비 들끓는 땅을 거의 백 마일, 걸어서, 해안까지? <swear> 사양해. 그리고 해안에서"
" 블록아일랜드까지 어떻게 가? 아빠가 은퇴하고 우리 가족이 거기 이사했는데, 페리는 이제 안 다니겠지. 가더라도 뭘 찾을지 모르겠고, "
"그게 제일 무서운 것 같아."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid ""
"You don't know?  The governor went nuts, like a lot of people did leading up"
" to the end, only he had a lot more power to work with.  One day he just "
"showed up to work with a militia of rowdies and loyalists and staged a coup,"
" taking over the government completely, killing those that opposed him, and "
"moving as many people as he could get behind him onto the islands.  The "
"rumors I've heard is that most of them survived the Cataclysm and are still "
"running the show there, but that seems kind of impossible to me."
msgstr ""
"몰라? 주지사가 미쳤어, 말세 직전 많은 사람들처럼, 근데 걘 손에 힘이 훨씬 많았지. 어느 날 난동자와 충신의 민병대를 데리고 출근해서"
" 쿠데타를 일으켜, 정부를 완전히 장악하고 반대자들을 죽이고 끌어모을 수 있는 사람들을 섬으로 옮겼어. 들은 소문으론 대부분 카타클리즘을"
" 살아남아 아직 거기서 권력을 잡고 있다는데, 내겐 좀 불가능해 보여."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid "Do you think you'd go back and look for your family?"
msgstr "가족 찾으러 돌아갈 생각 있어?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid ""
"Well now, that's quite a kind offer, and I appreciate you looking past my "
"full-body pubic hair.  Sorry though.  I've come to feel sort of responsible "
"for this little gaggle of squatters.  As long as I'm the only one providing "
"for them, I don't think I can leave."
msgstr "와, 정말 친절한 제안이고 감사해요, 내 전신 털을 봐줘서..."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid ""
"I've spoken to all your friends, and except for Dave, they're good to go.  "
"Dave wants to stay here.  How about you?"
msgstr "네 친구들 다 얘기했어, 데이브 빼곤 갈 준비 됐대. 데이브는 여기 남고 싶대. 넌 어때?"

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid ""
"Huh.  Getting those three to sign on to a suicide mission is quite the feat…"
" sounds like you're pretty dedicated to this.  OK, I'm with you.  Let's "
"round up the others and hit the road."
msgstr ""
"허. 그 셋을 자살 임무에 서명하게 한 건 대단한 일인데… 꽤 진심인 것 같네. 좋아, 난 너랑 갈게. 다른 애들 모아서 출발하자."

#: data\json\npcs\refugee_center\beggars\BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid "Right.  Let's go."
msgstr "좋아. 가자."

