#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '(ethanol) filtered low quality crude oil'}
#: data\json\obsoletion\items.json
msgid ""
"This is low quality concentrated oil derived from cannabis thats been "
"diluted in ethanol, heated over a hotplate, and filtered through a buchner "
"flask.  The next step would be to run it through a rotovap."
msgstr ""
"에탄올로 희석하고 핫플레이트로 가열하고 부흐너 플라스크로 여과한 대마 유래 저급 농축 오일입니다. 다음 단계는 회전농축기 통과입니다."

#: data\json\obsoletion\items.json
msgid "(ethanol) filtered high quality crude oil"
msgid_plural "(ethanol) filtered high quality crude oil"
msgstr[0] "(에탄올) 여과된 고급 원유"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '(ethanol) filtered high quality crude oil'}
#: data\json\obsoletion\items.json
msgid ""
"This is high quality concentrated oil derived from cannabis thats been "
"diluted in ethanol, heated over a hotplate, and filtered through a buchner "
"flask.  The next step would be to run it through a rotovap."
msgstr ""
"에탄올로 희석하고 핫플레이트로 가열하고 부흐너 플라스크로 여과한 대마 유래 고급 농축 오일입니다. 다음 단계는 회전농축기 통과입니다."

#: data\json\obsoletion\items.json
msgid "filtered low quality crude oil"
msgid_plural "filtered low quality crude oil"
msgstr[0] "여과된 저급 원유"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'filtered low quality crude oil'}
#: data\json\obsoletion\items.json
msgid ""
"This is low quality concentrated oil derived from cannabis thats been "
"diluted in ethanol, heated over a hotplate, filtered through a buchner "
"flask, and all the ethanol recovered using a rotary evaporator.  It is ready"
" for the distillation."
msgstr ""
"에탄올로 희석하고 핫플레이트로 가열하고 부흐너 플라스크로 여과하고 회전 증발기로 에탄올을 전부 회수한 대마 유래 저급 농축 오일입니다. "
"증류 준비가 됐습니다."

#: data\json\obsoletion\items.json
msgid "dab pen (on)"
msgid_plural "dab pens (on)"
msgstr[0] "댑펜(켜짐)"

