#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\kawaii_other.json
msgid "manhack firebomb"
msgid_plural "manhack firebombs"
msgstr[0] "맨핵 화염폭탄"

#. ~ Description for manhack firebomb
#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\kawaii_other.json
msgid ""
"This is an firebomb fitted into a manhack and rigged so the manhack can "
"self-activate it.  This one is active."
msgstr "맨핵에 장착되어 맨핵이 스스로 작동시킬 수 있도록 설치된 화염폭탄입니다. 이것은 활성화 상태입니다."

#. ~ Use action no_deactivate_msg for manhack firebomb.
#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\kawaii_other.json
msgid ""
"Its a bug that you can see this, but that doesnt mean it won't kill you.  "
"Throw it!"
msgstr "이걸 보게 되는 건 버그지만, 그래도 안 죽는다는 뜻은 아니다. 던져라!"

#. ~ Use action sound_msg for manhack firebomb.
#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\kawaii_other.json
msgid "pphhhfftttt"
msgstr "프프프프으읏"

#. ~ Description for manhack firebomb
#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\kawaii_other.json
msgid ""
"This is an acidbomb fitted into a manhack and rigged so the manhack can "
"self-activate it.  Due to the manhack exploding the effective radius is "
"somewhat larger."
msgstr ""
"맨핵에 장착되어 맨핵이 스스로 작동시킬 수 있도록 설치된 산성폭탄입니다. 맨핵이 폭발하기 때문에 유효 반경이 다소 더 넓습니다."

