msgid "The tactical shield is pulled to a defensive posture!"
msgstr "전술 방패를 방어 자세로 들었다!"

#. ~ Description for tactical shield
#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\kawaii_other.json
msgid ""
"A ballistic shield designed to protect the approach of its holder and "
"anybody standing behind them.  It is heavy and somewhat cumbersome, but its "
"protection cannot be denied.  When activated it will be held close and in "
"front of you."
msgstr ""
"사용자와 뒤에 서 있는 사람의 접근을 보호하도록 설계된 방탄 방패입니다. 무겁고 다소 다루기 힘들지만, 방어력은 확실합니다. 사용하면 "
"가까이 몸 앞에 들게 됩니다."

