#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\pk_effects.json
msgid "Stamina Tonic"
msgstr "스테미나 토닉"

#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\pk_effects.json
msgid "web spider poison"
msgstr "거미줄 독"

#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\pk_effects.json
msgid "You take and the antibiotics ... and hope."
msgstr "항생제를 먹고... 기대해 본다."

#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\pk_effects.json
msgid "Your body is less immune."
msgstr "몸의 면역력이 약해졌다."

#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\pk_effects.json
msgid "Your body's natural defenses surpass the effects of the antibodies."
msgstr "몸의 자연 방어력이 항체의 효과를 넘어섰다."

#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\pk_effects.json
msgid "You feel itchy."
msgstr "가렵다."

#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\pk_effects.json
msgid "The toxin-negating effects of the tonic wears off."
msgstr "토닉의 독소 무효화 효과가 사라졌다."

#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\pk_effects.json
msgid "You feel less itchy."
msgstr "덜 가려워졌다."

#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\pk_effects.json
msgid "The toxin-negating effects of the serum wears off."
msgstr "혈청의 독소 무효화 효과가 사라졌다."

#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\pk_effects.json
msgid "Overpoweringly Smelly"
msgstr "압도적인 악취"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Overpoweringly Smelly'.
#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\pk_effects.json
msgid ""
"You can hardly concentrate or breathe because the smell is overpowering."
msgstr "악취가 너무 강해서 집중도, 호흡도 거의 불가능하다."

#. ~ Apply message for effect(s) 'Overpoweringly Smelly'.
#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\pk_effects.json
msgid "The monster sprays you in a foul-smelling liquid!"
msgstr "괴물이 당신에게 지독한 액체를 뿌렸다!"

#. ~ Decay message for effect(s) 'Overpoweringly Smelly'.
#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\pk_effects.json
msgid "You don't think you smell quite so gross anymore."
msgstr "더 이상 그렇게 역겹게 냄새나진 않는 것 같다."

#. ~ Decay message for effect(s) 'Overpoweringly Smelly'.
#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\pk_effects.json
msgid "You grow used to that foul smell."
msgstr "그 지독한 냄새에 익숙해졌다."

#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\pk_effects.json
msgid "Paralyzed"
msgstr "마비"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Paralyzed'.
#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\pk_effects.json
msgid "You are paralyzed!"
msgstr "마비되었다!"

#. ~ Apply message for effect(s) 'Paralyzed'.
#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\pk_effects.json
msgid "Your joints lock up!"
msgstr "관절이 굳었다!"

#. ~ Decay message for effect(s) 'Paralyzed'.
#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\pk_effects.json
msgid "You can now use Free Action!"
msgstr "이제 자유 행동을 사용할 수 있다!"

#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\pk_effects.json
msgid "Biotoxin"
msgstr "생체 독소"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Biotoxin'.
#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\pk_effects.json
msgid "Your body is both hot and cold, burning with pain and numbed and cold!"
msgstr "몸이 뜨겁기도 차갑기도 하고, 고통에 타오르면서도 무감각하게 차갑다!"

#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\pk_effects.json
msgid "Minor Inflammation"
msgstr "경미한 염증"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Minor Inflammation'.
#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\pk_effects.json
msgid ""
"Your wounds are inflammed.  Strong immunities or proper dressing should "
"help."
msgstr "상처에 염증이 생겼다. 강한 면역력이나 적절한 드레싱이 도움이 될 것이다."

#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\pk_effects.json
msgid "Quivering Bowels"
msgstr "떨리는 장"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Quivering Bowels'.
#: data\mods\2.7.4 KawaiiMaidMod\pk_effects.json
msgid "Your bowels feel weak, your blood hot, your insides like runny eggs."
msgstr "장이 힘없고, 피는 뜨겁고, 속은 묽은 달걀 같다."

