#. ~ Description for {'str': 'glyph of trickery (active)', 'str_pl': 'glyphs
#. of trickery (active)'}
#: data\mods\Arcana_BN\obsolete.json
msgid ""
"A strange silver emblem, engraved with depictions of grotesque creatures.  "
"Using it will call forth a kreck, and bind it to your will.  Hopefully."
msgstr ""
"이상한 은 문양으로, 기괴한 생물들이 새겨져 있습니다. 사용하면 크렉을 불러내어 당신의 의지에 결속시킵니다. 되기를 바라면요."

#: data\mods\Arcana_BN\obsolete.json
msgid "glyph of the root (active)"
msgid_plural "glyphs of the root (active)"
msgstr[0] "뿌리의 문양(활성)"

#. ~ Use action friendly_msg for {'str': 'glyph of the root (active)',
#. 'str_pl': 'glyphs of the root (active)'}.
#. ~ Use action friendly_msg for {'str': 'glyph of the root', 'str_pl':
