#. ~ Description for {'str': 'glyph of Gehenna (active)', 'str_pl': 'glyphs of
#. Gehenna (active)'}
#: data\mods\Arcana_BN\obsolete.json
msgid ""
"A strange silver emblem, engraved with a mockery of angelic figures.  Using "
