msgstr[0] "리틀 메이드 펫 (인육 훈제 중)"

#. ~ Use action not_ready_msg for {'str_sp': 'little maid pet (smoking human
#. flesh)'}.
#: data\mods\Battle_Maid_Redux\tools.json
msgid ""
"The little maid tastes the smoking meat and shakes her head a little. Don't "
