#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'little maid pet (smoking fish)'}
#: data\mods\Battle_Maid_Redux\tools.json
msgid ""
"Your little maid is in the process of smoking fish. She seems to be having "
"fun."
msgstr "리틀 메이드가 생선을 훈제하는 중입니다. 즐거워 보입니다."

#: data\mods\Battle_Maid_Redux\tools.json
