"providing support fire.  When the cataclysm struck, your trusty LMG couldn't"
" keep the veritable tide of undead from overtaking your squad.  Now running "
"with all the strength your body can muster, will you have what it takes to "
"survive or is this hellish landscape something you just can't suppress?"
msgstr ""
