#: data\mods\CRT_EXPANSION\scenarios\crt_grunt_classes.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "C.R.I.T. Commanding Officer"
msgstr "C.R.I.T. 지휘관"

#: data\mods\CRT_EXPANSION\scenarios\crt_grunt_classes.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "C.R.I.T. Commanding Officer"
msgstr "C.R.I.T. 지휘관"

#. ~ Profession (male C.R.I.T. Commanding Officer) description
#: data\mods\CRT_EXPANSION\scenarios\crt_grunt_classes.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As a top-ranking CO, you didn't see much in the way of combat other than "
"when you felt like it.  Your charisma and sharp intellect helped you climb "
"up the ranks and provided support to allies in need.  Now that everything "
"went down the drain, will it help you again?"
msgstr ""
"고위 지휘관으로서, 원할 때를 빼면 전투를 거의 겪지 않았습니다. 카리스마와 예리한 지성으로 계급을 타고 올라가며 도움이 필요한 아군을 "
"지원했습니다. 이제 모든 것이 수포가 됐는데, 그것이 다시 도움이 될까요?"

#. ~ Profession (female C.R.I.T. Commanding Officer) description
#: data\mods\CRT_EXPANSION\scenarios\crt_grunt_classes.json
