#. ~ Profession (male C.R.I.T. Sniper) description
#: data\mods\CRT_EXPANSION\scenarios\crt_lone_wolf.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were deep in training to become a Lone Wolf; Now you need to prove "
"yourself, perhaps you could even become one, the old guard would support "
"that."
msgstr ""
"론 울프가 되기 위한 훈련에 깊이 몰두했습니다. 이제 스스로를 증명해야 합니다. 어쩌면 진짜로 될 수도 있고, 고참들도 지지할 것입니다."

#. ~ Profession (female C.R.I.T. Sniper) description
#: data\mods\CRT_EXPANSION\scenarios\crt_lone_wolf.json
