#: data\mods\CRT_EXPANSION\scenarios\crt_lone_wolf.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "C.R.I.T. Hunter"
msgstr "C.R.I.T. 사냥꾼"

#: data\mods\CRT_EXPANSION\scenarios\crt_lone_wolf.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "C.R.I.T. Hunter"
msgstr "C.R.I.T. 사냥꾼"

#. ~ Profession (male C.R.I.T. Hunter) description
#: data\mods\CRT_EXPANSION\scenarios\crt_lone_wolf.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were recently recruited into the CRIT Lone Wolf training program. While "
"you are barely trained at all, they still sent you out there just like the "
"rest of the team. Maybe you stand a chance though, a better chance then the "
"medics that is."
msgstr ""
"최근 CRIT 론 울프 훈련 프로그램에 모집됐습니다. 거의 훈련받지 못 했지만 나머지 팀과 마찬가지로 투입됐습니다. 그래도 기회는 "
"있을지도. 적어도 의무병보다는 나은 기회를요."

#. ~ Profession (female C.R.I.T. Hunter) description
#: data\mods\CRT_EXPANSION\scenarios\crt_lone_wolf.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were recently recruited into the CRIT Lone Wolf training program. While "
"you are barely trained at all, they still sent you out there just like the "
"rest of the team. Maybe you stand a chance though, a better chance then the "
"medics that is."
msgstr ""
"최근 CRIT 론 울프 훈련 프로그램에 모집됐습니다. 거의 훈련받지 못 했지만 나머지 팀과 마찬가지로 투입됐습니다. 그래도 기회는 "
"있을지도. 적어도 의무병보다는 나은 기회를요."

#: data\mods\CRT_EXPANSION\scenarios\crt_med.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "C.R.I.T. Aerial Surgeon"
msgstr "C.R.I.T. 항공 외과의"

#: data\mods\CRT_EXPANSION\scenarios\crt_med.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "C.R.I.T. Aerial Surgeon"
msgstr "C.R.I.T. 항공 외과의"

#. ~ Profession (male C.R.I.T. Aerial Surgeon) description
#: data\mods\CRT_EXPANSION\scenarios\crt_med.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"While initially a mere Combat Medic, you have demonstrated exceptional "
"piloting and medical ability. In the last days before the cataclysm, you "
"were given a C.R.I.T. Medical Blimp, now if only there was any survivor to "
"heal..."
msgstr ""
"처음엔 평범한 전투 의무병이었지만 뛰어난 조종과 의료 능력을 보였습니다. 대재앙 직전 C.R.I.T. 의료 비행선을 지급받았습니다. 이제"
" 치료할 생존자만 있다면 좋겠지만…"

#. ~ Profession (female C.R.I.T. Aerial Surgeon) description
#: data\mods\CRT_EXPANSION\scenarios\crt_med.json
