#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_aperturepotato.json
msgid "companion potato"
msgid_plural "companion potatoes"
msgstr[0] "동행감자"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'companion potato', 'str_pl': 'companion
#. potatoes'}
#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_aperturepotato.json
msgid ""
"Seems like some kind of Genetic Lifeform and Disk Operating System, attached"
" to a potato."
msgstr "감자에 부착된 유전자 생명체와 디스크 운영 체제처럼 보인다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_balloons.json
msgid "bundle of balloons"
msgid_plural "bundle of balloonss"
msgstr[0] "풍선 다발"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bundle of balloons'}
#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_balloons.json
msgid ""
"A large bunch of party balloons tied together with string, attached to a "
"rock so it doesn't float away. If attached to a vehicle instead this may "
"provide a small amount of lift."
msgstr "끈으로 묶은 커다란 파티 풍선 다발로, 날아가지 않게 바위에 매여 있습니다. 차량에 달면 약간의 부력을 제공할 수 있습니다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_balloons.json
msgid "external bundle of balloons"
msgstr "외장 풍선 다발"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_comestibles.json
msgid "SpOreos"
msgid_plural "SpOreos"
msgstr[0] "특별한 오레오"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'SpOreos'}
#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_comestibles.json
msgid ""
"The hit cookie from Mycus Industries!  Now comes in addicting flavors such "
"as Marloss, Chanterelle, and The Encroaching, Unavoidable Death of Human "
"Civilization."
msgstr ""
"마이커스 인더스트리의 히트 쿠키! 이제 말로스, 샹트렐, 인류 문명의 피할 수 없는 침식적 죽음 같은 중독적인 맛으로 만나보세요."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_items.json
msgid "chaos canister"
msgid_plural "chaos canisters"
msgstr[0] "카오스 통"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chaos canister'}
#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_items.json
msgid ""
"A suspiciously uncanny-looking cylinder that hums like a compiler about to "
"throw warnings. Handle with care."
msgstr "경고를 뿜으려는 컴파일러처럼 윙윙거리는 수상쩍게 괴기한 원통입니다. 조심히 다루세요."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_items.json
msgid "active chaos canister"
msgid_plural "active chaos canisters"
msgstr[0] "활성 카오스 통"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'active chaos canister'}
#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_items.json
msgid ""
"A suspiciously uncanny-looking cylinder that hums like a compiler about to "
"throw warnings. Handle with care. Better throw it!"
msgstr "경고를 뿜으려는 컴파일러처럼 윙윙거리는 수상쩍게 괴기한 원통입니다. 조심히 다루세요. 던지는 게 좋겠습니다!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_items.json
msgid "Ionic Overload Generator CBM"
msgid_plural "Ionic Overload Generator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM:이온 과부하 발생기"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Ionic Overload Generator CBM'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Ionic Overload Generator'}
#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_items.json
msgid ""
"A powerful ion energy generator is implanted on your chest.  Fires a "
"powerful, ever-expanding energy blast.  The resulting blast ignites oxygen "
"creating fires as it moves and an explosion on impact.  Close range use is "
"highly discouraged."
msgstr ""
"강력한 이온 에너지 발생기가 가슴에 이식됐습니다. 계속 확장되는 강력한 에너지 폭발을 발사합니다. 폭발이 이동하며 산소를 태워 불길을 "
"만들고 충격 시 폭발합니다. 근거리 사용은 강력히 권장하지 않습니다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_items.json
msgid "Ionic Overload Generator"
msgid_plural "Ionic Overload Generators"
msgstr[0] "이온 과부하 발생기"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_items.json
msgid ""
"A powerful ion energy generator is implanted on your chest.  Fires a "
"powerful, ever-expanding energy blast that goes through various targets.  "
"The energy shot ignites oxygen creating fires as it moves and an explosion "
"on impact."
msgstr ""
"강력한 이온 에너지 발생기가 가슴에 이식되었습니다. 다양한 목표물을 통과하는 강력하고 계속 확장되는 에너지 폭발을 발사합니다. 에너지 "
"발사체는 이동하면서 산소를 점화하여 화재를 일으키고 충돌 시 폭발합니다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_items.json
msgid "Yeet Cannon"
msgid_plural "Yeet Cannons"
msgstr[0] "예잇 캐논"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_items.json
msgid ""
"You can YEET all the bullets with this baby.  YEET them right into all of "
"the zombies in your path, all the hulks, the spiders, and those damned mole "
"rats."
msgstr "이 녀석으로 총알을 전부 내던질 수 있습니다. 길 위의 좀비 전부, 헐크, 거미, 저 망할 두더지쥐에게 곧장 내던지세요."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'shocker zombie'}
#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_monsters.json
msgid ""
"A human body with pale blue flesh, crackling with electrical energy.  It "
"seems eager to tell you something."
msgstr "전기 에너지가 지직거리는 창백한 푸른 살의 인간 몸입니다. 뭔가 말하고 싶어 보입니다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_monsters.json
msgid "mr skeltal"
msgid_plural "mr skeltals"
msgstr[0] "미스터 스켈탈"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mr skeltal'}
#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_monsters.json
msgid ""
"Devoid entirely of flesh and organs, this walking skeleton rattles you to "
"the bone.  In its bony hand, it holds a pristine trumpet, unmarred by the "
"end of the world."
msgstr ""
"살과 장기가 완전히 없는 걸어다니는 해골이 뼛속까지 덜컹거립니다. 뼈 손에 세상의 종말에도 더럽혀지지 않은 깨끗한 트럼펫을 들고 "
"있습니다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_monsters.json
msgid "minion of skeltal"
msgid_plural "minions of skeltal"
msgstr[0] "스켈탈의 부하"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'minion of skeltal', 'str_pl': 'minions of
#. skeltal'}
#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_monsters.json
msgid "A lesser skeleton, raised by the forlorn dooting of a trumpet."
msgstr "트럼펫의 처량한 연주로 일으켜진 열등한 해골."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_monsters.json
msgid "Smoky bear"
msgid_plural "Smoky bears"
msgstr[0] "연기 곰"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Smoky bear'}
#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_monsters.json
msgid ""
"A smoking husk is all that remains of this once proud bear.  Its black eyes "
"gaze at you with malice… and hunger."
msgstr "한때 자랑스러웠던 곰의 연기 나는 껍데기만 남았습니다. 검은 눈이 악의와… 허기로 당신을 응시합니다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "When the testing is over, you will be missed."
msgstr "테스트가 끝나면, 당신이 그리울 것입니다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Unbelievable.  You, [subject name here], must be the pride of [subject "
"hometown here]!"
msgstr ""
"믿을 수 없습니다. 당신, [subject name here]은(는) 분명 [subject hometown here]의 자랑이겠군요!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"That thing is probably some sort of raw sewage container.  Go ahead and rub "
"your face all over it."
msgstr "저건 아마 하수 저장통 같은 겁니다. 어서 얼굴을 온통 문질러 보세요."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"For your own safety and the safety of others, please refrain from touching "
"[bzzzzzt]"
msgstr "본인과 타인의 안전을 위해 [버버버버저]에 손대지 마십시오."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"No one will blame you for giving up.  In fact, quitting at this point is a "
"perfectly reasonable response."
msgstr "포기해도 아무도 탓하지 않을 겁니다. 사실 이 시점에서 그만두는 것은 완전히 합리적인 대응입니다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Fantastic!  You remained resolute and resourceful in an atmosphere of "
"extreme pessimism."
msgstr "훌륭합니다! 극도의 비관적인 분위기 속에서도 결단력과 지략을 유지하셨군요."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "Hello again.  To reiterate our previous warning: [garbled]"
msgstr "다시 안녕하세요. 이전 경고를 반복하자면: [잡음]"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "Weeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee[bzzt]"
msgstr "위이이이이이이이이이이이이이이이이이이이이이이[지직]"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "If you become light headed from thirst, feel free to pass out."
msgstr "목마름으로 어지러우시면 언제든지 쓰러지셔도 됩니다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"No further compliance information is required or will be provided, and you "
"are an excellent test subject!"
msgstr "더 이상의 지시 사항은 필요하지 않으며 제공되지도 않습니다. 당신은 훌륭한 피실험자입니다!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "Thank you for helping us help you help us all."
msgstr "우리가 당신을 돕고 당신이 우리 모두를 돕도록 도와주셔서 감사합니다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Cake and grief counseling will be available at the conclusion of the test."
msgstr "테스트 결론 시 케이크와 슬픔 상담이 제공될 것입니다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "The experiment is nearing its conclusion."
msgstr "실험이 마무리 단계에 접어들고 있습니다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"The Enrichment Center is required to remind you that you will be baked "
"[garbled] cake."
msgstr "풍요 연구소는 당신이 [알아들을 수 없음] 케이크를 받으실 것임을 알려드립니다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "We are very, very happy for your success."
msgstr "당신의 성공이 매우, 매우 기쁩니다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "We are throwing a party in honor of your tremendous success."
msgstr "당신의 놀라운 성공을 기념하여 파티를 열고 있습니다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "A party associate will arrive shortly to collect you for your party."
msgstr "파티 담당자가 곧 당신을 파티로 데리러 올 것입니다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "I know you're there.  I can feel you here."
msgstr "당신이 거기 있다는 걸 알아요. 여기서 느껴지거든요."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "You're not going the right way."
msgstr "당신은 올바른 방향으로 가지 않고 있어요."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "You shouldn't be here.  This isn't safe for you."
msgstr "여기 있으면 안 됩니다. 당신에게 안전하지 않아요."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Maybe you think you're helping yourself.  But you're not.  This isn't "
"helping anyone."
msgstr "스스로 돕고 있다고 생각할지 모르지만, 그렇지 않아요. 이건 아무에게도 도움이 안 됩니다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "It's not too late to turn back."
msgstr "되돌리기에는 너무 늦지 않았다고."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "Someone is going to get badly hurt."
msgstr "누군가 심하게 다칠 것입니다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Uh oh.  Somebody cut the cake.  I told them to wait for you, but they did it"
" anyway."
msgstr "이런. 누가 케이크를 잘랐네요. 당신을 기다리라고 했는데 어쨌든 잘라버렸습니다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "This is your fault.  It didn't have to be like this."
msgstr "이게 다 너 때문이야. 꼭 이렇게까지 할 필요는 없었잖아."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "You're not a good person.  You know that, right?"
msgstr "당신은 좋은 사람이 아니에요. 그건 알고 있죠?"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "Good people don't end up here."
msgstr "좋은 사람은 여기 오지 않아요."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "You should have turned left before."
msgstr "아까 왼쪽으로 돌았어야 했는데."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Despite your violent behavior, the only thing you've managed to break so far"
" is my heart."
msgstr "폭력적인 행동에도 불구하고, 지금까지 당신이 부순 건 제 마음뿐이에요."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "What was that?  Did you say something?"
msgstr "방금 뭐였죠? 뭐라고 말했나요?"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"I'd just like to point out that you were given every opportunity to succeed."
msgstr "당신에게 성공할 모든 기회가 주어졌었다는 점을 지적하고 싶습니다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "What's your point, anyway?  Survival?"
msgstr "그래서 요점이 뭡니까? 생존?"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"You've been wrong about every single thing you've ever done, including this "
"thing."
msgstr "당신이 지금까지 한 모든 것이, 이것도 포함해서, 전부 틀렸어요."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"I have an infinite capacity for knowledge, and even I'm not sure what's "
"going on outside."
msgstr "저는 무한한 지식 용량을 가지고 있는데, 저도 밖에서 무슨 일이 벌어지는지 잘 모르겠어요."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Stop squirming and die like an adult or I'm going to delete your backup."
msgstr "그만 버둥거리고 어른답게 죽든지, 아니면 당신 백업을 삭제하겠어요."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "Good job on that, by the way.  SARCASM SPHERE SELF-TEST COMPLETE."
msgstr "그건 잘했네요, 그건 그렇고. 비꼬기 구체 자가 테스트 완료."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"I don't want to tell you your business, but if it were me, I'd leave that "
"thing alone."
msgstr "참견하고 싶지 않지만, 저라면 그건 그냥 두겠어요."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Let's be honest: Neither one of us knows what that thing does.  Just put it "
"in the corner, and I'll deal with it later."
msgstr "솔직히 말해서: 우리 둘 다 저게 뭔지 몰라요. 그냥 구석에 두면 나중에 제가 처리할게요."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"I know you don't believe this, but everything that has happened so far was "
"for your benefit."
msgstr "믿지 않으시겠지만, 지금까지 일어난 모든 것은 당신을 위한 거였어요."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"I'm checking some blueprints, and I think…  Yes, right here.  You're "
"definitely going the wrong way."
msgstr "설계도를 확인 중인데… 네, 바로 여기. 확실히 잘못된 길로 가고 있습니다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "Are you even listening to me?"
msgstr "너 내 말을 듣고 있기는 한 거야?"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "KEVIN SACRIFICING GAMEPLAY FOR REALISM?  THE SHOCKING TRUTH REVEALED"
msgstr "케빈이 사실주의를 위해 게임성을 희생한다고? 충격의 진실이 밝혀졌다"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "TEN FACTS ABOUT THE NEW BIONIC SYSTEM THAT WILL SHOCK YOU"
msgstr "새로운 바이오닉 시스템에 대한 당신을 충격에 빠뜨릴 열 가지 사실"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "YOU WON'T BELIEVE WHO JUST ADDED A NEW PROFESSION"
msgstr "새 직업을 추가한 사람이 누군지 믿지 못 할 거예요"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"TRIVIALIZE THE EARLY GAME WITH THIS ONE SIMPLE SPEAR WEAPON!  CONTRIBUTORS "
"HATE HIM"
msgstr "이 간단한 창 무기 하나로 초반을 쉽게 만들기! 기여자들이 그를 증오한다"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"A MEDICAL MUTANT SET THEMSELVES ON FIRE - YOU WON'T BELIEVE WHAT HAPPENED "
"NEXT"
msgstr "의료 돌연변이가 스스로 불을 붙였어요 - 그 다음에 일어난 일을 믿지 못 할 거예요"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "THE TRUTH ABOUT CATACLYSM'S DEVELOPMENT - AND ITS DISGUSTING SECRET"
msgstr "카타클리즘 개발의 진실 - 그리고 역겨운 비밀"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "IT'S TRUE - MUTAGEN IS 40% BLEACH, AND HERE'S WHY"
msgstr "사실이에요 - 뮤타젠은 40% 표백제예요, 그리고 이유는"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "20 EASY WAYS TO ESCAPE A LAB - #4 WILL BLOW YOUR MIND"
msgstr "연구소에서 탈출하는 20가지 쉬운 방법 - #4가 당신을 놀라게 할 거예요"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I've got a feeling we're not in Kansas anymore.\""
msgstr "더 이상 캔자스가 아닌 것 같아."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Go ahead, make my day.\""
msgstr "어디 해봐, 내 하루를 만들어봐."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"You talkin' to me?\""
msgstr "나한테 말하는 거야?"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Then who the hell else are you talkin' to?\""
msgstr "그럼 도대체 누구한테 말하는 거야?"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Well I'm the only one here.\""
msgstr "여기엔 나밖에 없잖아."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Who the fuck do you think you're talking to?\""
msgstr "나한테 누가 말하는 줄 알고 있어?"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"What we've got here is failure to communicate.\""
msgstr "문제는 소통 실패야."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"E.T.  phone home.\""
msgstr "\"E.T.  집에 전화해.\""

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I'm as mad as hell, and I'm not going to take this anymore!\""
msgstr "나는 지금 매우 화가 났고, 더 이상 참지 않겠어!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"There's no place like home.\""
msgstr "집 같은 곳은 없어."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Badges?  We ain't got no badges!\""
msgstr "배지? 우린 배지 같은 거 없어!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"\"We don't need no badges!  I don't have to show you any stinking badges!\""
msgstr "배지 같은 거 필요 없어! 이 썩은 배지 같은 거 보여줄 필요 없다고!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I'll be back.\""
msgstr "돌아올 거야."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I see dead people.\""
msgstr "죽은 사람이 보여."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"It's alive!  It's alive!\""
msgstr "\"살았다! 살았어!\""

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Say hello to my little friend!\""
msgstr "내 작은 친구에게 인사해!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Here's Johnny!\""
msgstr "조니가 왔다!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Open the pod bay doors, HAL.\""
msgstr "HAL, 포드 베이 문 열어."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"They may take our lives, but they'll never take our freedom!\""
msgstr "우리의 목숨은 빼앗을 수 있어도, 우리의 자유는 절대 빼앗지 못 한다!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"\"If you let my daughter go now, that'll be the end of it.  I will not look "
"for you, I will not pursue you.\""
msgstr "지금 내 딸을 놓아준다면, 그걸로 끝이야. 널 찾지도, 쫓지도 않겠어."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"\"If you don't, I will look for you, I will find you, and I will kill you.\""
msgstr "그렇지 않으면, 너를 찾아내고, 찾아서, 죽이겠어."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Roads?  Where we're going, we don't need roads.\""
msgstr "도로? 우리가 가는 곳엔 도로가 필요 없어."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Fasten your seatbelts.  It's going to be a bumpy night.\""
msgstr "\"안전벨트를 매세요. 험난한 밤이 될 겁니다.\""

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"\"You've got to ask yourself one question:  'Do I feel lucky?'  Well, do ya "
"punk?\""
msgstr "스스로에게 물어봐: 운이 좋다고 생각해? 어떻게 생각해, 짜식아?"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"You had me at hello.\""
msgstr "헬로라고 했을 때 이미 내 마음을 뺏어갔어."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Houston, we have a problem.\""
msgstr "\"휴스턴, 문제가 생겼다.\""

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Yippie-ki-yay, motherfucker!\""
msgstr "이어이어이야, 개새끼야!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"The first rule of The Lab is:  You do not talk about The Lab.\""
msgstr "연구소의 첫 번째 규칙: 연구소에 대해 말하지 않는다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Don't be afraid.  It's just a big, big lap dog.\""
msgstr "무서워하지 마. 그냥 크고 큰 무릎 강아지야."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Bring me everyone.\""
msgstr "모두 데려와."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"What do you mean everyone?\""
msgstr "모두라니 무슨 말이야?"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"EVERYONE!\""
msgstr "모두!!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I'm going to make him an offer he can't refuse.\""
msgstr "거절할 수 없는 제안을 하겠어."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"This is the beginning of a beautiful friendship.\""
msgstr "이것이 아름다운 우정의 시작이야."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"You can’t handle the truth!\""
msgstr "진실을 감당 못 할 거야!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"If you built it, he will come.\""
msgstr "네가 만들면, 그가 올 거야."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hasta la vista, baby.\""
msgstr "아스타 라 비스타, 베이비."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"They’re here!\""
msgstr "그들이 왔다!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Tis but a scratch!\""
msgstr "그냥 긁힌 거야!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Frankly, my dear, I don't give a damn.\""
msgstr "솔직히, 내 사랑, 나는 아무 상관 없어."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"All work and no play makes Jack a dull boy.\""
msgstr "일만 하고 놀지 않으면 잭은 둔해진다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Remember: all I'm offering is the truth.  Nothing more.\""
msgstr "기억해: 내가 제공하는 건 진실뿐이야. 그 이상은 없어."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Don't call me Shirley.\""
msgstr "셜리라고 부르지 마."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I have had it with these motherfucking snakes!\""
msgstr "이 빌어먹을 뱀들 때문에 진저리 나!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"\"Back up, put down the gun, and gimme some tropical flavored bubblicious.\""
msgstr "물러서, 총 내려놔, 트로피컬 맛 버블리셔스 줘."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"And some skittles.\""
msgstr "그리고 스키틀즈도."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"You'll shoot your eye out, kid.\""
msgstr "눈을 쏠 거야, 꼬마야."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Cocainum!\""
msgstr "코카인!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I am your father.\""
msgstr "\"난 네 아버지다\""

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Who said that?\""
msgstr "누가 말했어?"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"WHO THE FUCK SAID THAT?!\""
msgstr "도대체 누가 말한 거야?!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Bullshit!  You didn't convince me!  Show me your real war face!\""
msgstr "\"개소리! 날 설득하지 못 했어! 진짜 전투 표정을 보여!\""

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"What is your major malfunction, numbnut?\""
msgstr "도대체 뭐가 문제야, 멍청아?"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Leeeeeeeeeeeeeroy!  Jenkins rebuild!\""
msgstr "레에에에에에에에에에에로이! 젠킨스 재건!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Activated!\""
msgstr "활성화!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Search mode activated!\""
msgstr "수색 모드 활성화!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Coming through!\""
msgstr "지나갑니다!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Deploying!\""
msgstr "배치 중!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Critical Error!\""
msgstr "\"치명적인 오류!\""

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Ow ow ow!\""
msgstr "아야 아야 아야!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Put me down!\""
msgstr "내려놔!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Target lost!\""
msgstr "표적 소실!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Searching!\""
msgstr "수색 중!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hey!  It's me!\""
msgstr "이봐! 나야!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Ouch!\""
msgstr "\"아야!\""

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Sentry mode activated.\""
msgstr "보초 모드 활성화."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hi.\""
msgstr "\"안녕.\""

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Target acquired.\""
msgstr "표적 확보."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Dispensing product.\""
msgstr "제품 배출 중."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Firing.\""
msgstr "발사."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hello friend.\""
msgstr "안녕하세요 친구."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Gotcha.\""
msgstr "잡았다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Is anyone there?\""
msgstr "거기 누구 있어요?"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I see you.\""
msgstr "보여요."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Could you come over here?\""
msgstr "이리 좀 와줄 수 있어요?"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hellooo.\""
msgstr "여보세요."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"My fault.\""
msgstr "\"내 잘못이야.\""

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Ohh.\""
msgstr "오."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Critical error.\""
msgstr "치명적 오류."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Shutting down.\""
msgstr "종료 중."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I don't blame you.\""
msgstr "탓하지 않아요."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I don't hate you.\""
msgstr "미워하지 않아요."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Whyyyy.\""
msgstr "왜애애애."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"No hard feelings.\""
msgstr "감정 없어요."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Aiaiaiaiaiai.\""
msgstr "아이아이아이아이아이."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"누구세요?\""

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Help.\""
msgstr "\"도와줘\""

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Uh oh.\""
msgstr "어이쿠."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Illegal operation.\""
msgstr "불법 작동."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Goodbye.\""
msgstr "안녕히 계세요."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Sleep mode activated.\""
msgstr "\"수면 모드 활성화.\""

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Your business is appreciated.\""
msgstr "이용해주셔서 감사합니다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hibernating.\""
msgstr "동면 중."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Goodnight.\""
msgstr "안녕히 주무세요."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Resting.\""
msgstr "휴식 중."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Nap time.\""
msgstr "\"낮잠 시간이야.\""

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Are you still there?\""
msgstr "아직 거기 있어요?"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hey, it's me!\""
msgstr "이봐, 나야!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Don't shoot!\""
msgstr "쏘지 마!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"\""
msgstr "\"\""

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Stop shooting!\""
msgstr "쏘는 것 멈춰!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Self test error.\""
msgstr "자가 테스트 오류."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Aah.\""
msgstr "아."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Unknown error.\""
msgstr "알 수 없는 오류."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Malfunctioning.\""
msgstr "오작동 중."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Aaaah.\""
msgstr "아아아."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Ow ow ow ow owww.\""
msgstr "아야 아야 아야 아야 아아야."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Why?\""
msgstr "왜요?"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I did everything you asked!\""
msgstr "시키는 대로 다 했는데!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I don't understand!\""
msgstr "이해 못 하겠어요!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I'm fine!\""
msgstr "괜찮아요!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Wheeeeee-OH NO!\""
msgstr "위이이이이이이-안 돼!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I'm scared!\""
msgstr "무서워요!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Come closer.\""
msgstr "\"가까이 와.\""

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Something's wrong…\""
msgstr "\"뭔가 잘못됐어…\""

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"What are you doing?\""
msgstr "뭐 하는 거예요?"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Please stop.\""
msgstr "그만해 주세요."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"You've made your point.\""
msgstr "요점은 알겠어요."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Okay, you win.\""
msgstr "알았어요, 당신이 이겼어요."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"This is not good.\""
msgstr "좋지 않네요."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Excuse me?\""
msgstr "실례지만?"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I'm different…\""
msgstr "\"난 달라…\""

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Thanks anyway…\""
msgstr "\"어쨌든 고마워…\""

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Take me with you…\""
msgstr "\"나도 데려가…\""

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"You have excellent aim!\""
msgstr "조준 실력이 훌륭하군요!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I need backup!\""
msgstr "지원 요청!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I never liked her.\""
msgstr "그녀가 싫었어."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"These things happen.\""
msgstr "이런 일이 생기기 마련이지."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"That was nobody's fault.\""
msgstr "누구의 잘못도 아니야."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"She was provoking you.\""
msgstr "그녀가 자극한 거야."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Oh dear.\""
msgstr "오 이런."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Oh my!\""
msgstr "오 맙소사!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I blame myself.\""
msgstr "내 탓이야."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"He probably deserved it.\""
msgstr "그럴 만했을 거야."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I saw it.  It was an accident.\""
msgstr "봤어. 사고였어."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"She's probably okay.\""
msgstr "그녀는 괜찮을 거야."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Noted.\""
msgstr "확인했습니다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"But I need to protect the humans!\""
msgstr "그런데 인간을 보호해야 하는데!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"We're back!\""
msgstr "우리가 왔다!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hi there!\""
msgstr "안녕하세요!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Back again!\""
msgstr "또 왔어요!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Well, hello, stranger!\""
msgstr "어, 안녕하세요, 낯선 분!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"This time is OUR time.\""
msgstr "이번은 우리의 시간이야."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Second time's a charm…\""
msgstr "\"두 번째가 행운이야…\""

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Howdy, stranger!\""
msgstr "어이, 낯선 분!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Thought you'd seen the last of us, didn't ya?\""
msgstr "우리를 마지막으로 봤다고 생각했죠?"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Dang!\""
msgstr "이런!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I thought we fixed that.\""
msgstr "고쳤다고 생각했는데."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"What's a guy gotta got to do to get some bullets around here?\""
msgstr "여기서 총알 좀 구하려면 어떻게 해야 하나요?"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Nope.  Still can't see.\""
msgstr "아니요. 아직도 안 보여."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Yep.  Still blind.\""
msgstr "\"그래. 아직도 안 보여.\""

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Click click click!  Still defective!\""
msgstr "딸깍 딸깍 딸깍! 아직도 고장!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Yeah, that's right!  Still defective!\""
msgstr "맞아! 아직도 고장이야!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Yeah!  Still not working.\""
msgstr "맞아! 아직도 안 돼."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Yeah!  Non-lethal as ever.\""
msgstr "맞아! 여전히 무해한 상태야."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Can't.  See.  A.  Thing.\""
msgstr "아무것도. 안. 보여."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Absolutely no improvement.\""
msgstr "전혀 나아진 게 없어."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Not getting better with age!\""
msgstr "나이를 먹어도 나아지지 않네!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"This is just getting embarrassing.\""
msgstr "이건 그냥 창피한 일이 되고 있어."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Alright, you can go.\""
msgstr "알았어, 가도 돼."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"[sigh] Don't tell anyone about this.\""
msgstr "\"[한숨] 누구에게도 이것을 알리지마.\""

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Well, I tried.  Best of luck!\""
msgstr "\"뭐, 해봤지. 행운을 빌어!\""

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hey, safe travels, there.\""
msgstr "이봐, 잘 가, 거기."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hey, thanks so much!\""
msgstr "\"이봐, 정말 고마워!\""

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Don't be a stranger!\""
msgstr "낯설게 굴지 마!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"It's been a pleasure!\""
msgstr "만나서 좋았어요!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"That was fun, wasn't it?\""
msgstr "재밌었죠?"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"\"I can't see a thing.  What just happened?  Better open fire!  [click click"
" click click]  Dang!\""
msgstr "아무것도 안 보여. 무슨 일이야? 그냥 쏴야겠어! [딸깍 딸깍 딸깍 딸깍] 이런!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"*clicking noises*\""
msgstr "*딸깍거리는 소리*"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"No, wait, wait!\""
msgstr "\"잠깐, 기다려, 기다려!\""

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hey, hold on now WHOA WHOA WHOA!\""
msgstr "이봐, 잠깐만 워워워!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Oh, this is ridiculous!\""
msgstr "오, 이건 말도 안 돼!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Give me another channnnce!\""
msgstr "한 번만 더 기회를 주세요!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hey!  Squeaky-voice!  Gimme some of your bullets!\""
msgstr "이봐! 삑삑이! 총알 좀 줘!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Can I get some bullets here?  Anybody got bullets?\""
msgstr "총알 좀 있어요? 총알 있는 사람?"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Uhhh, no bullets.  Sorry.\""
msgstr "음, 총알 없어요. 미안해요."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Shootin' blanks every time, ALL the time.\""
msgstr "매번 공포탄이야, 언제나, 항상."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Standing down.\""
msgstr "물러납니다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Watch and learn, everybody.  Watch and learn.\""
msgstr "다들 보고 배워요. 보고 배워."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"So what am I, uh, supposed to do here?\""
msgstr "그래서 난 뭘 해야 하는 건가요?"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Identify yourself or I will shoot.\""
msgstr "신원을 밝히지 않으면 쏘겠습니다."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Pleased to meetcha.\""
msgstr "만나서 반가워요."

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I'm gonna make you proud!\""
msgstr "자랑스럽게 해드리겠습니다!"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\crazy_vehicles.json
msgid "Flaming Atomic Car"
msgstr "불타는 원자력 자동차"

#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\modinfo.json
msgid "Crazy Cataclysm"
msgstr "크레이지 카타클리즘"

#. ~ Description for Crazy Cataclysm
#: data\mods\CrazyCataclysm\modinfo.json
msgid "Want a little crazy in your Cataclysm?  Try this one."
msgstr "살짝 제정신이 아닌 컨텐츠를 원한다면 이 모드를 적용시켜보세요."

#: data\mods\Dangerous Fungi\modinfo.json
msgid "Dangerous Fungi"
msgstr "위험한 곰팡이"

#. ~ Description for Dangerous Fungi
#: data\mods\Dangerous Fungi\modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Allows infestation of non-dirt tiles. Allows fungal breed through fungal "
"stalk."
msgstr "흙이 아닌 타일에도 감염을 허용하고 곰팡이 자루를 통한 곰팡이 번식을 허용합니다."

#: data\mods\DeoxyMod\Deoxy_vehicle_parts.json
msgid "folding extra light quarterpanel"
msgstr "접이식 초경량 쿼터패널"

#: data\mods\DeoxyMod\Deoxy_vehicle_parts.json
msgid "foldable door"
msgstr "접이식 문"

#: data\mods\DeoxyMod\Deoxy_vehicle_parts.json
msgid "superalloy coating"
msgstr "얇은 초합금판"

#: data\mods\DeoxyMod\modinfo.json
msgid "Folding Parts pack"
msgstr "접이식 부품팩"

#. ~ Description for Folding Parts pack
#: data\mods\DeoxyMod\modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Makes solar panels and several other parts foldable, and adds foldable "
"quarterboards."
msgstr "태양광 패널과 기타 여러 부품을 접을 수 있게 하고 접이식 쿼터보드를 추가합니다."

#: data\mods\DinoMod\lab_notes.json
msgid ""
"Research on our visitors is proceeding nicely.  The raptor DNA is of special"
" interest, with some novel protein chains that may lead to medical "
"breakthroughs."
msgstr ""
"방문자들에 대한 연구가 순조롭게 진행 중이다. 랩터 DNA는 의학적 획기적 발견으로 이어질 수 있는 새로운 단백질 사슬이 있어 특히 관심"
" 대상이다."

#: data\mods\DinoMod\lab_notes.json
msgid ""
"Research proceeds apace on our visitors.  While Operation Major Laser did "
"not receive enough funding as hoped, our more humble bio-operator protocols "
"were already prepared and are proceeding ahead of schedule.  The hosts are "
"most receptive to improvement."
msgstr ""
"방문자들에 대한 연구가 빠르게 진행 중이다. 메이저 레이저 작전은 희망만큼 자금을 받지 못 했지만, 우리의 더 소박한 바이오 오퍼레이터 "
"프로토콜은 이미 준비되어 일정보다 앞서 진행 중이다. 숙주들이 개량에 아주 잘 반응한다."

#: data\mods\DinoMod\lab_notes.json
msgid ""
"Dr. Yoshimi has been reprimanded for unauthorized contact with the "
"procompsignathids.  Disgusting behavior, and a terrible example to the "
"junior researchers."
msgstr "요시미 박사가 프로콥소그나투스와의 무단 접촉으로 징계를 받았다. 역겨운 행동이고 하급 연구원들에게 나쁜 본보기다."

#: data\mods\DinoMod\lab_notes.json
msgid ""
"Dr. Yoshimi has escaped, along with an unknown number of dinosaurs.  "
"Unfortunately, we have bigger problems with XE037."
msgstr "요시미 박사가 불명 수의 공룡들과 함께 탈출했다. 불행히도 XE037이라는 더 큰 문제가 있다."

#: data\mods\DinoMod\lab_notes.json
msgid ""
"Strange sounds have been reported from the swamp nearby.  An enhanced "
"security team was dispatched, but has not returned in 48 hours.  The "
"facility is on lockdown.  We can’t let them get back in."
msgstr ""
"근처 늪지에서 이상한 소리가 보고됐다. 강화 보안팀이 파견됐지만 48시간째 돌아오지 않았다. 시설은 봉쇄 중이다. 놈들이 다시 들어오게 "
"둘 수 없다."

#: data\mods\DinoMod\lab_notes.json
msgid ""
"Tingle lab situation normal.  Dr. Tingle believes the Acrocanthosaurus is "
"the best fit for hybridization and Tingle lab is working on safety protocols"
" to provide the needed material to Dr. Tingle.  Velociraptor is another "
"possibility given prior research.  Testing with chickens and the "
"velociraptor specimens suggests some resistance."
msgstr ""
"팅글 연구실 상황 정상. 팅글 박사는 아크로칸토사우루스가 교잡에 가장 적합하다고 보고 팅글 연구실은 필요한 재료를 팅글 박사에게 제공하기"
" 위한 안전 프로토콜을 작업 중이다. 기존 연구로 미뤄 벨로시랍토르도 가능성이다. 닭과 벨로시랍토르 표본으로 한 시험은 어느 정도 저항이"
" 있음을 시사한다."

#: data\mods\DinoMod\lab_notes.json
msgid ""
"Tingle lab situation critical.  Dr. Tingle violated safety protocols last "
"night and attempted to secure genetic material directly, possibly under the "
"influence of some drug or toxin, given the anatomical impossibility and "
"danger of the procedure.  The Acrocanthosaurus specimen has escaped into the"
" facility."
msgstr ""
"팅글 연구실 상황 위험. 팅글 박사가 어젯밤 안전 프로토콜을 위반하고 유전 물질을 직접 확보하려 시도했는데, 시술의 해부학적 불가능성과 "
"위험성으로 미뤄 약물이나 독소의 영향일 수 있다. 아크로칸토사우루스 표본이 시설 내로 탈출했다."

#: data\mods\DinoMod\modinfo.json
msgid "DinoMod"
msgstr "공룡 모드"

#. ~ Description for DinoMod
#: data\mods\DinoMod\modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Adds dinosaurs. Some rideable, others less friendly. Life will find a way."
msgstr "공룡을 추가합니다. 탈 수 있는 것도, 덜 온순한 것도 있습니다. 생명은 길을 찾아내죠."

#: data\mods\DinoMod\monster_attacks.json
msgid "%1$s stomps on your %2$s!"
msgstr "%1$s이(가) 당신의 %2$s을(를) 짓밟습니다!"

#: data\mods\DinoMod\monster_attacks.json
msgid "%1$s stomps on <npcname>!"
msgstr "%1$s이(가) <npcname>을(를) 짓밟습니다!"

#: data\mods\DinoMod\monster_attacks.json
msgid "%1$s stomps on your %2$s, but your armor protects you."
msgstr "%1$s이(가) 당신의 %2$s을(를) 짓밟지만, 갑옷이 당신을 보호합니다."

#: data\mods\DinoMod\monster_attacks.json
msgid "%1$s stomps on <npcname>, but their armor protects them."
msgstr "%1$s이(가) <npcname>을(를) 짓밟지만, 갑옷이 보호합니다."

#: data\mods\DinoMod\monster_attacks.json
msgid "%1$s swings its massive tail at your %2$s, pulverizing it!"
