msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "Hunted by Dinosaurs"
msgstr "공룡에게 사냥당함"

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Hunted by Dinosaurs' for a male character.
#: data\mods\DinoMod\scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You find yourself among trees.  The screaming and moaning is fainter, but it"
" sounds like something bigger and more dangerous is close by."
msgstr "나무들 사이에 있습니다. 비명과 신음이 더 희미하지만, 더 크고 위험한 무언가가 가까이 있는 소리가 들립니다."

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Hunted by Dinosaurs' for a female character.
#: data\mods\DinoMod\scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You find yourself among trees.  The screaming and moaning is fainter, but it"
" sounds like something bigger and more dangerous is close by."
msgstr "나무들 사이에 있습니다. 비명과 신음이 더 희미하지만, 더 크고 위험한 무언가가 가까이 있는 소리가 들립니다."

#. ~ Name for scenario 'Woke up in a Dinosaur Nest' for a male character
#: data\mods\DinoMod\scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "Woke up in a Dinosaur Nest"
msgstr "공룡 둥지에서 깸"

#. ~ Name for scenario 'Woke up in a Dinosaur Nest' for a female character
#: data\mods\DinoMod\scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "Woke up in a Dinosaur Nest"
msgstr "공룡 둥지에서 깸"

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Woke up in a Dinosaur Nest' for a male
#. character.
#: data\mods\DinoMod\scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When you wake up, you find yourself in the swamp next to some large eggs."
msgstr "눈을 떠보니 늪지에서 커다란 알 몇 개 옆에 있습니다."

