#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fungal centrosaurus zombie'}
#: data\mods\DinoMod\monsters\fungus.json
msgid ""
"This was once a large stocky four-legged dinosaur with a bony crest and one "
"large horn above the nose.  Fungal tendrils now sprout from its mouth, eyes,"
