#: data\mods\MagicalNights\modinfo.json
msgid "Magical Nights"
msgstr "매지컬 나이트"

#. ~ Description for Magical Nights
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Bright Nights, but with magic!  From the ashes of Magiclysm rises a new mod,"
" and a new head at the controls.  "
msgstr "마법이 있는 브라이트 나이트! 매지클리즘의 잿더미에서 새로운 모드와 새로운 수장이 올라섭니다.  "

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\modinfo.json data\mods\rpg_system\main.lua
#: data\mods\skills_through_kills\main.lua
msgid "Spellcraft"
msgstr "주문공예"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Spellcraft'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in the arcane.  Represents magic theory and all that entails.  A "
"higher skill increases how quickly you can learn spells, and decreases their"
" spell failure chance.  You learn this skill by studying books or spells."
msgstr ""
"비전(秘傳)에 대한 당신의 기량입니다. 마법 이론과 그에 수반되는 모든 것을 나타냅니다. 기량이 높을수록 주문을 더 빨리 배우고 주문 "
"실패 확률이 줄어듭니다. 책이나 주문을 연구해 이 기량을 배웁니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\monster_attacks.json
msgid "The %1$s impales your %2$s with its trident!"
msgstr "%1$s이(가) 삼지창으로 당신의 %2$s을(를) 꿰뚫습니다!"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\monster_attacks.json
msgid "The %1$s impales <npcname>'s %2$s with its trident!"
msgstr "%1$s이(가) 삼지창으로 <npcname>의 %2$s을(를) 꿰뚫었습니다!"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\monster_attacks.json
msgid ""
"The %1$s tries to impale your %2$s with its trident, but fails to penetrate "
"your armor!"
msgstr "%1$s이(가) 삼지창으로 당신의 %2$s을(를) 꿰뚫으려 하지만 방어구를 뚫지 못 했습니다!"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\monster_attacks.json
msgid ""
"The %1$s tries to impale <npcname>'s %2$s with its trident, but fails to "
"penetrate their armor!"
msgstr "%1$s이(가) 삼지창으로 <npcname>의 %2$s을(를) 꿰뚫으려 하지만 방어구를 뚫지 못 했습니다!"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\monster_attacks.json
msgid "The %1$s crushes your %2$s with its greatclub!"
msgstr "%1$s이(가) 대형 곤봉으로 당신의 %2$s을(를) 으깹니다!"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\monster_attacks.json
msgid "The %1$s crushes <npcname>'s %2$s with its greatclub!"
msgstr "%1$s이(가) 대형 곤봉으로 <npcname>의 %2$s을(를) 으깼습니다!"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\monster_attacks.json
msgid ""
"The %1$s tries to crush your %2$s with its greatclub, but swings wide and "
"stumbles."
msgstr "%1$s이(가) 대형 곤봉으로 당신의 %2$s을(를) 으깨려 하지만 크게 빗나가 휘청입니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\monster_attacks.json
msgid ""
"The %1$s tries to crush <npcname>'s %2$s with its greatclub, but swings wide"
" and stumbles."
msgstr "%1$s이(가) 대형 곤봉으로 <npcname>의 %2$s을(를) 으깨려 하지만 크게 빗나가 휘청였습니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\monsters.json
msgid "animated blade"
msgid_plural "animated blades"
msgstr[0] "살아있는 검"

#. ~ Description for animated blade
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\monsters.json
msgid ""
"A conjured glowing longsword that darts and dodges around, slicing and "
"cutting your foes into small pieces."
msgstr "불러낸 빛나는 장검이 날아다니며 피하면서 적을 조각조각 썰어내고 베어냅니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\monsters.json
msgid "Summoned Zombie"
msgid_plural "Summoned Zombies"
msgstr[0] "소환된 좀비"

#. ~ Description for Summoned Zombie
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\monsters.json
msgid "A summoned zombie.  Slightly more intelligent than its wild cousins."
msgstr "소환된 좀비입니다. 야생 사촌보다 약간 더 똑똑합니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\monsters.json
msgid "Summoned Skeleton"
msgid_plural "Summoned Skeletons"
msgstr[0] "소환된 해골"

#. ~ Description for Summoned Skeleton
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\monsters.json
msgid ""
"A summoned skeleton.  Slightly more intelligent than its wild cousins.  "
"Seems like it somehow enjoys puns."
msgstr "소환된 해골입니다. 야생 사촌보다 약간 더 똑똑합니다. 어쩐지 말장난을 즐기는 듯합니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\monsters.json
msgid "Summoned Decayed Pouncer"
msgid_plural "Summoned Decayed Pouncers"
msgstr[0] "소환된 부식한 도약괴"

#. ~ Description for Summoned Decayed Pouncer
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\monsters.json
msgid ""
"A summoned zombie cougar.  Slightly more intelligent than its wild cousins."
msgstr "소환된 좀비 쿠거입니다. 야생 사촌보다 약간 더 똑똑합니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\obsolete.json
msgid "Obsolete Blood Power Generator CBM"
msgstr "구형 혈력 발전기 CBM"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Obsolete Blood Power Generator CBM'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\obsolete.json
msgid "This bionic is obsolete!"
msgstr "이 바이오닉은 구형입니다!"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\obsolete.json
msgid "OBSOLETE Acid Resistance"
msgstr "구형 산성 저항"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'OBSOLETE Acid Resistance'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\obsolete.json
msgid "OBSOLETE!  Please instead switch to the proper acid ward."
msgstr "구형! 정식 산성 결계로 교체하십시오."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\obsolete.json
msgid "OBSOLETE Greater Acid Resistance"
msgstr "구형 상급 산성 저항"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'OBSOLETE Greater Acid Resistance'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\obsolete.json
msgid "OBSOLETE!  And likely not even very good at that."
msgstr "구형! 그리고 별로 좋지도 않았을 겁니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\obsolete.json
msgid "OBSOLETE Scroll of Acid Resistance"
msgid_plural "OBSOLETE Scrolls of Acid Resistance"
msgstr[0] "구형 산성 저항 두루마리"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'OBSOLETE Scroll of Acid Resistance', 'str_pl':
#. 'OBSOLETE Scrolls of Acid Resistance'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\obsolete.json
msgid ""
"OBSOLETE!  This spell creates an invisible aura to protect you poorly from "
"acid."
msgstr "구형! 이 주문은 산으로부터 서툴게 지키는 보이지 않는 오오라를 만듭니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Would-be Wizard"
msgstr "마법사 지망생"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Would-be Wizard"
msgstr "마법사 지망생"

#. ~ Profession (male Would-be Wizard) description
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You found a pamphlet with bright colors claiming you can be a Wizard, oddly "
"serene with the world falling down around you."
msgstr "당신도 마법사가 될 수 있다고 주장하는 알록달록한 팸플릿을 발견했고, 세상이 무너지는 와중에도 이상할 정도로 평온했습니다."

#. ~ Profession (female Would-be Wizard) description
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You found a pamphlet with bright colors claiming you can be a Wizard, oddly "
"serene with the world falling down around you."
msgstr "당신도 마법사가 될 수 있다고 주장하는 알록달록한 팸플릿을 발견했고, 세상이 무너지는 와중에도 이상할 정도로 평온했습니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Pyromaniac Kelvinist"
msgstr "방화광 켈빈술사"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Pyromaniac Kelvinist"
msgstr "방화광 켈빈술사"

#. ~ Profession (male Pyromaniac Kelvinist) description
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have loved fire all of your life.  You have now discovered your inner "
"fire, and want to exercise that upon the world."
msgstr "평생 불을 사랑해 왔습니다. 이제 내면의 불을 발견했고, 그것을 세상에 발휘하고 싶습니다."

#. ~ Profession (female Pyromaniac Kelvinist) description
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have loved fire all of your life.  You have now discovered your inner "
"fire, and want to exercise that upon the world."
msgstr "평생 불을 사랑해 왔습니다. 이제 내면의 불을 발견했고, 그것을 세상에 발휘하고 싶습니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Druid"
msgstr "드루이드"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Druid"
msgstr "드루이드"

#. ~ Profession (male Druid) description
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The ancient circle of druids is gone with the Cataclysm.  Nature must "
"thrive."
msgstr "고대 드루이드 결사는 대재앙과 함께 사라졌습니다. 자연은 번성해야 합니다."

#. ~ Profession (female Druid) description
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The ancient circle of druids is gone with the Cataclysm.  Nature must "
"thrive."
msgstr "고대 드루이드 결사는 대재앙과 함께 사라졌습니다. 자연은 번성해야 합니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Novice Necromancer"
msgstr "수련 네크로맨서"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Novice Necromancer"
msgstr "수련 네크로맨서"

#. ~ Profession (male Novice Necromancer) description
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You always had to hide your magic, as it was generally not an acceptable "
"type of magic in the wizarding world, but with the Cataclysm you need to "
"pull every trick out of the book."
msgstr "마구스 세계에서 대체로 용납되지 않는 종류의 마법이라 항상 숨겨야 했지만, 대재앙과 함께 온갖 수단을 다 꺼내야 합니다."

#. ~ Profession (female Novice Necromancer) description
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You always had to hide your magic, as it was generally not an acceptable "
"type of magic in the wizarding world, but with the Cataclysm you need to "
"pull every trick out of the book."
msgstr "마구스 세계에서 대체로 용납되지 않는 종류의 마법이라 항상 숨겨야 했지만, 대재앙과 함께 온갖 수단을 다 꺼내야 합니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Novice Stormshaper"
msgstr "수련 폭풍조형사"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Novice Stormshaper"
msgstr "수련 폭풍조형사"

#. ~ Profession (male Novice Stormshaper) description
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The son of a weatherman, you were always interested in the weather.  "
"Recently you found it was possible to manipulate the weather yourself "
"through arcane means!  Unfortunately you did not have long to enjoy your "
"power, as events unfolded…"
msgstr ""
"기상예보관의 아들로, 늘 날씨에 관심이 있었습니다. 최근에는 비전적인 수단으로 날씨를 직접 조종할 수 있다는 것을 알게 되었습니다! "
"아쉽게도 힘을 오래 즐기지는 못 했는데, 사건들이 벌어지면서…"

#. ~ Profession (female Novice Stormshaper) description
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The son of a weatherman, you were always interested in the weather.  "
"Recently you found it was possible to manipulate the weather yourself "
"through arcane means!  Unfortunately you did not have long to enjoy your "
"power, as events unfolded…"
msgstr ""
"기상예보관의 아들로, 늘 날씨에 관심이 있었습니다. 최근에는 비전적인 수단으로 날씨를 직접 조종할 수 있다는 것을 알게 되었습니다! "
"아쉽게도 힘을 오래 즐기지는 못 했는데, 사건들이 벌어지면서…"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Novice Earthshaper"
msgstr "수련 대지조형사"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Novice Earthshaper"
msgstr "수련 대지조형사"

#. ~ Profession (male Novice Earthshaper) description
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You always were tough in a fight.  Your coach managed to teach you a trick "
"or two to make you a little tougher."
msgstr "싸움에서 늘 억셌습니다. 코치가 조금 더 억세지는 요령 한두 가지를 가르쳐 주었습니다."

#. ~ Profession (female Novice Earthshaper) description
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You always were tough in a fight.  Your coach managed to teach you a trick "
"or two to make you a little tougher."
msgstr "싸움에서 늘 억셌습니다. 코치가 조금 더 억세지는 요령 한두 가지를 가르쳐 주었습니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Novice Technomancer"
msgstr "수련 테크노맨서"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Novice Technomancer"
msgstr "수련 테크노맨서"

#. ~ Profession (male Novice Technomancer) description
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"With the recent Cataclysm, the way you found to cheat on tests may have to "
"find some other use."
msgstr "최근의 대재앙으로, 시험에서 커닝하던 수단이 다른 쓰임새를 찾아야 할 지도 모릅니다."

#. ~ Profession (female Novice Technomancer) description
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"With the recent Cataclysm, the way you found to cheat on tests may have to "
"find some other use."
msgstr "최근의 대재앙으로, 시험에서 커닝하던 수단이 다른 쓰임새를 찾아야 할 지도 모릅니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Novice Kelvinist"
msgstr "수련 켈빈술사"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Novice Kelvinist"
msgstr "수련 켈빈술사"

#. ~ Profession (male Novice Kelvinist) description
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Even from a young age, you'd always felt drawn to the hot and cold.  Fire "
"had always warmed your spirits, and every Winter you were praying for a snow"
" day simply because you loved them so much, even as you got older.  It's "
"only natural that you'd find yourself learning the magic to control these "
"primal elements."
msgstr ""
"어렸을 때부터 늘 더위와 추위에 끌렸습니다. 불은 늘 마음을 덥혀 주었고, 나이가 들어서도 매년 겨울마다 눈 오는 날이 좋아 눈 오기를 "
"빌곤 했습니다. 이런 원초적 원소를 다루는 마법을 배우게 된 것은 당연한 일입니다."

#. ~ Profession (female Novice Kelvinist) description
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Even from a young age, you'd always felt drawn to the hot and cold.  Fire "
"had always warmed your spirits, and every Winter you were praying for a snow"
" day simply because you loved them so much, even as you got older.  It's "
"only natural that you'd find yourself learning the magic to control these "
"primal elements."
msgstr ""
"어렸을 때부터 늘 더위와 추위에 끌렸습니다. 불은 늘 마음을 덥혀 주었고, 나이가 들어서도 매년 겨울마다 눈 오는 날이 좋아 눈 오기를 "
"빌곤 했습니다. 이런 원초적 원소를 다루는 마법을 배우게 된 것은 당연한 일입니다."

