#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Scroll of Rock Tomb', 'str_pl': 'Scrolls of Rock
#. Tomb'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"This scroll details how to tear up the ground beneath you to throw a medium "
"boulder."
msgstr "발밑의 땅을 찢어 중간 크기의 바위를 던지는 방법이 적힌 두루마리입니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spell_scrolls.json
msgid "Scroll of Meteor"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Meteor"
msgstr[0] "두루마리: 운석"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Scroll of Meteor', 'str_pl': 'Scrolls of
#. Meteor'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"This scroll contains a powerful spell to call down a meteor from high in the"
" sky.  With this cataclysm, maybe another dinosaur-killer would be a good "
"thing."
msgstr ""
"하늘 높은 곳에서 운석을 불러내리는 강력한 주문이 담긴 두루마리입니다. 이 대재앙이라면, 또 다른 공룡 멸종자도 나쁘지 않을 지도 "
"모릅니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spell_scrolls.json
msgid "Scroll of Acid Bolt"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Acid Bolt"
msgstr[0] "두루마리: 산성 화살"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Scroll of Acid Bolt', 'str_pl': 'Scrolls of Acid
#. Bolt'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spell_scrolls.json
msgid "This scroll details how to throw acid at someone."
msgstr "누군가에게 산성을 던지는 방법이 적힌 두루마리입니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spell_scrolls.json
msgid "Scroll of Acid Bomb"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Acid Bomb"
msgstr[0] "두루마리: 산성 폭탄"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Scroll of Acid Bomb', 'str_pl': 'Scrolls of Acid
#. Bomb'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"This scroll contains details on how to shape acid into a compressed "
"spherical shape."
msgstr "산성을 압축된 구 형태로 만드는 방법이 자세히 적힌 두루마리입니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spell_scrolls.json
msgid "Scroll of Acid Storm"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Acid Storm"
msgstr[0] "두루마리: 산성 폭풍"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Scroll of Acid Storm', 'str_pl': 'Scrolls of
#. Acid Storm'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"This scroll details how a spell called 'Acid Bomb' can be altered to become "
"much more powerful, at a much higher mana cost."
msgstr "\"산성 폭탄\"이라는 주문을 훨씬 더 높은 마나 비용으로 훨씬 더 강력하게 변형하는 방법이 적힌 두루마리입니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spell_scrolls.json
msgid "Scroll of Acid Ward"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Acid Ward"
msgstr[0] "두루마리: 산성 방벽"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Scroll of Acid Ward', 'str_pl': 'Scrolls of Acid
#. Ward'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"Creating all that acid is no good if you can't protect yourself from your "
"own spells."
msgstr "산성을 그렇게 많이 만들어도 자기 자신의 주문으로부터 몸을 지킬 수 없다면 소용이 없습니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spell_scrolls.json
msgid "Scroll of Anomaly Ward"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Anomaly Ward"
msgstr[0] "두루마리: 이상 방벽"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Scroll of Anomaly Ward', 'str_pl': 'Scrolls of
#. Anomaly Ward'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"In this catastrophe, it's very tempting to be able to say 'screeeewwwwww the"
" nether'."
msgstr "이 재앙에서 \"네더따윈 안드로메다로\"라고 외칠 수 있다는 건 무척 매력적입니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spell_scrolls.json
msgid "Scroll of Ice Ward"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Ice Ward"
msgstr[0] "두루마리: 얼음 방벽"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Scroll of Ice Ward', 'str_pl': 'Scrolls of Ice
#. Ward'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spell_scrolls.json
msgid "Your enemies may be as cold as ice, but you shouldn't have to be."
msgstr "적들은 얼음처럼 차가울지 모르지만, 당신까지 그럴 필요는 없습니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spell_scrolls.json
msgid "Scroll of Fire Ward"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Fire Ward"
msgstr[0] "두루마리: 화염 방벽"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Scroll of Fire Ward', 'str_pl': 'Scrolls of Fire
#. Ward'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spell_scrolls.json
msgid "Your enemies may want you to die in a fire, but you'd rather not."
msgstr "적들은 당신이 불에 타 죽길 원할지 모르지만, 당신은 원치 않을 겁니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spell_scrolls.json
msgid "Scroll of Electric Ward"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Electric Ward"
msgstr[0] "두루마리: 전기 방벽"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Scroll of Electric Ward', 'str_pl': 'Scrolls of
#. Electric Ward'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"With this spell, you will no-longer be thunderstruck by pesky bolts of "
"electricity."
msgstr "이 주문으로, 성가신 전기 볼트에 벼락 맞을 일은 없어집니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spell_scrolls.json
msgid "Scroll of Slow"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Slow"
msgstr[0] "두루마리: 느림"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Scroll of Slow', 'str_pl': 'Scrolls of Slow'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"This spell slows timeflow around your target, resulting in a decrease of "
"speed lasting a short period of time."
msgstr "이 주문은 대상 주변의 시간 흐름을 느리게 해 짧은 시간 동안 속도를 감소시킵니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spell_scrolls.json
msgid "Scroll of Force Push"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Force Push"
msgstr[0] "두루마리: 포스 밀기"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spell_scrolls.json
msgid "Scroll of Force Pull"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Force Pull"
msgstr[0] "두루마리: 포스 당기기"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spell_scrolls.json
msgid "Scroll of Mana Bomb"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Mana Bomb"
msgstr[0] "두루마리: 마나 폭탄"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Scroll of Mana Bomb', 'str_pl': 'Scrolls of Mana
#. Bomb'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spell_scrolls.json
msgid "As if normal nukes weren't enough."
msgstr "보통 핵폭탄도 모자라다는 듯이."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spell_scrolls.json
msgid "Scroll of Phase Jump"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Phase Jump"
msgstr[0] "두루마리: 위상 도약"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "A Technomancer's Guide to Debugging C:DDA"
msgid_plural "copies of A Technomancer's Guide to Debugging C:DDA"
msgstr[0] "테크노맨서를 위한 C:DDA 디버깅 안내서"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "A Technomancer's Guide to Debugging C:DDA",
#. 'str_pl': "copies of A Technomancer's Guide to Debugging C:DDA"}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "static std::string description( spell sp ) const;"
msgstr "static std::string description( spell sp ) const;"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "A Beginner's Guide to Magic"
msgid_plural "copies of A Beginner's Guide to Magic"
msgstr[0] "초보자를 위한 마법 입문서"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "A Beginner's Guide to Magic", 'str_pl': "copies
#. of A Beginner's Guide to Magic"}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid ""
"Looks just like a typical pamphlet claiming to teach people magic.  Yet, for"
" some reason you can't quite put your finger on, you get the feeling that "
"there's a little more truth than usual to this one…"
msgstr ""
"사람들에게 마법을 가르친다고 주장하는 전형적인 소책자처럼 보입니다. 하지만 정확히 뭐라고 짚을 수는 없는 어떤 이유로, 이건 평소보다 "
"조금 더 진실이 담겨 있는 느낌이 듭니다…"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "Wizarding Guide to Backpacking"
msgid_plural "copies of Wizarding Guide to Backpacking"
msgstr[0] "마법사의 배낭여행 안내서"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Wizarding Guide to Backpacking', 'str_pl':
#. 'copies of Wizarding Guide to Backpacking'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid ""
"This appears to be the spell version of a guide for what things to take with"
" you when backpacking.  It's a little bulky, but will certainly prove "
"useful."
msgstr "배낭여행을 갈 때 무엇을 챙겨야 하는지 알려주는 안내서의 주문판으로 보입니다. 조금 부피가 크지만 분명 쓸모 있을 겁니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "Pyromancy for Heretics"
msgid_plural "copies of Pyromancy for Heretics"
msgstr[0] "이단자를 위한 화염술"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Pyromancy for Heretics', 'str_pl': 'copies of
#. Pyromancy for Heretics'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid ""
"This charred husk of a book still contains many ways to light things aflame."
msgstr "이 까맣게 탄 책의 잔해에는 아직도 물건에 불을 붙이는 수많은 방법이 담겨 있습니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "A Treatise on Magical Elements"
msgid_plural "copies of A Treatise on Magical Elements"
msgstr[0] "마법 원소론"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'A Treatise on Magical Elements', 'str_pl':
#. 'copies of A Treatise on Magical Elements'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid ""
"This details complex diagrams, rituals, and choreography that describes "
"various spells."
msgstr "다양한 주문을 설명하는 복잡한 도해와 의식, 율동이 상세히 실려 있습니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "Introduction to the Divine"
msgid_plural "copies of Introduction to the Divine"
msgstr[0] "신성 입문"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Introduction to the Divine', 'str_pl': 'copies
#. of Introduction to the Divine'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid ""
"This appears to mostly be a religious text, but it does have some notes on "
"healing."
msgstr "대부분 종교 서적인 듯하지만, 치유에 관한 메모도 좀 있습니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "The Paladin's Guide to Modern Spellcasting"
msgid_plural "copies of The Paladin's Guide to Modern Spellcasting"
msgstr[0] "팔라딘을 위한 현대 주문 시전 안내서"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "The Paladin's Guide to Modern Spellcasting",
#. 'str_pl': "copies of The Paladin's Guide to Modern Spellcasting"}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid ""
"Despite the title, this seems to be written in Middle English.  A little "
"obtuse, but you can make out most of the words well enough."
msgstr "제목과 달리 중세 영어로 쓰인 듯합니다. 조금 애매하지만 대부분의 단어는 충분히 알아볼 수 있습니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "Winter's Eternal Grasp"
msgid_plural "copies of Winter's Eternal Grasp"
msgstr[0] "겨울의 영원한 손아귀"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "Winter's Eternal Grasp", 'str_pl': "copies of
#. Winter's Eternal Grasp"}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid ""
"This slim book almost seems to be made from ice, it's cold to the touch."
msgstr "이 얇은 책은 거의 얼음으로 만들어진 듯하며 만지면 차갑습니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "The Tome of The Oncoming Storm"
msgid_plural "copies of The Tome of The Oncoming Storm"
msgstr[0] "다가오는 폭풍의 고서"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'The Tome of The Oncoming Storm', 'str_pl':
#. 'copies of The Tome of The Oncoming Storm'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid ""
"A large book embossed with crossed lightning bolts and storm clouds, it "
"tingles to the touch."
msgstr "교차한 번개와 폭풍 구름이 양각된 큰 책으로, 만지면 찌릿찌릿합니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "Nondescript Spellbook"
msgid_plural "copies of Nondescript Spellbook"
msgstr[0] "평범한 주문서"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Nondescript Spellbook', 'str_pl': 'copies of
#. Nondescript Spellbook'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid ""
"A small composition notebook, containing spells created by a novice "
"magician."
msgstr "초보 마구스가 만든 주문이 담긴 작은 작문 노트입니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "Of Light and Falsehoods"
msgid_plural "copies of Of Light and Falsehoods"
msgstr[0] "빛과 허위에 대하여"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Of Light and Falsehoods', 'str_pl': 'copies of
#. Of Light and Falsehoods'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "A small white book, it subtly amplifies the ambient light around it."
msgstr "작은 하얀 책으로, 주변의 빛을 은근히 증폭시킵니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "The Tome of Flesh"
msgid_plural "copies of The Tome of Flesh"
msgstr[0] "살의 고서"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'The Tome of Flesh', 'str_pl': 'copies of The
#. Tome of Flesh'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "A small tome, seemingly covered in tanned human skin."
msgstr "무두질한 인간 가죽으로 덮인 듯한 작은 고서입니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "The Book of Trees"
msgid_plural "copies of The Book of Trees"
msgstr[0] "나무들의 책"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'The Book of Trees', 'str_pl': 'copies of The
#. Book of Trees'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "A bark covered book."
msgstr "수피로 덮인 책입니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "The Utility of Mana as an Energy Source"
msgid_plural "copies of The Utility of Mana as an Energy Source"
msgstr[0] "에너지원으로서의 마나 활용"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'The Utility of Mana as an Energy Source',
#. 'str_pl': 'copies of The Utility of Mana as an Energy Source'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid ""
"This book details spells that use your mana to recover various physiological"
" effects."
msgstr "마나를 써서 여러 생리 효과를 회복하는 주문들이 상세히 실려 있습니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "The Tome of The Battle Mage"
msgid_plural "copies of The Tome of The Battle Mage"
msgstr[0] "전투마법사의 고서"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'The Tome of The Battle Mage', 'str_pl': 'copies
#. of The Tome of The Battle Mage'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid ""
"Your standard wizardy looking spellbook, filled with Magus combat spells.  "
"You sure lucked out!"
msgstr "매거스 전투 주문으로 가득한, 전형적인 마법사풍 주문서입니다. 정말 운이 좋으시군요!"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "The Tome of the Hollow Earth"
msgid_plural "copies of The Tome of the Hollow Earth"
msgstr[0] "빈 땅속의 고서"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'The Tome of the Hollow Earth', 'str_pl': 'copies
#. of The Tome of the Hollow Earth'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid ""
"This large dusty spellbook seems perpetually, well, dusty.  It contains the "
"power of the earth."
msgstr "이 크고 먼지 쌓인 주문서는 영원히, 뭐랄까, 먼지투성이 같습니다. 대지의 힘이 담겨 있습니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "The Tome of Magical Movement"
msgid_plural "copies of The Tome of Magical Movement"
msgstr[0] "마법 이동의 고서"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'The Tome of Magical Movement', 'str_pl': 'copies
#. of The Tome of Magical Movement'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid ""
"This small lightweight book seems to almost not entirely exist, let's say it"
" 97% does.  It contains Magus spells focused on movement."
msgstr ""
"이 작고 가벼운 책은 거의 완전히 존재하지 않는 듯합니다. 뭐라고 할까, 97%쯤 존재합니다. 이동에 중점을 둔 매거스 주문이 담겨 "
"있습니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "Smudged Scroll"
msgid_plural "Smudged Scrolls"
msgstr[0] "번진 두루마리"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Smudged Scroll'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid ""
"This looks like someone was designing a new spell, but spilled a mug of "
"coffee on it and crumpled it up in anger.  You can tell that it will "
"definitely cast something, but you can't be sure that it will work very "
"well."
msgstr ""
"누군가 새 주문을 설계하다가 커피 머그를 쏟고 화가 나서 구겨버린 것 같습니다. 무언가를 확실히 시전하겠지만, 제대로 작동할지는 장담할 "
"수 없습니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "Necromantic Minions for Dummies"
msgid_plural "copies of Necromantic Minions for Dummies"
msgstr[0] "입문자를 위한 강령술 하수인"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Necromantic Minions for Dummies', 'str_pl':
#. 'copies of Necromantic Minions for Dummies'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid ""
"This book details various ways of summoning an undead minion to fight for "
"you.  They all appear to disappear after a short time, crumbling to dust."
msgstr ""
"당신을 위해 싸울 언데드 하수인을 소환하는 여러 방법이 상세히 실려 있습니다. 모두 잠시 후 먼지로 부서져 사라지는 듯합니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "Fundamentals of Technomancy"
msgid_plural "copies of Fundamentals of Technomancy"
msgstr[0] "테크노맨시 기초"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fundamentals of Technomancy', 'str_pl': 'copies
#. of Fundamentals of Technomancy'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid ""
"This thick manual instructs the spellcaster on manipulating and empowering "
"various forms of matter and energy."
msgstr "이 두꺼운 설명서는 주문시전자에게 다양한 형태의 물질과 에너지를 조종하고 강화하는 법을 지도합니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "Complete Idiot's Guide to Technomancy"
msgid_plural "copies of Complete Idiot's Guide to Technomancy"
msgstr[0] "완전 초보를 위한 테크노맨시 안내서"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "Complete Idiot's Guide to Technomancy",
#. 'str_pl': "copies of Complete Idiot's Guide to Technomancy"}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid ""
"This colorful guide, full of diagrams and cartoons, teaches a couple of very"
" basic Technomancy spells for the not-so-bright pupils."
msgstr ""
"도해와 만화가 가득한 이 알록달록한 안내서는 그다지 영리하지 않은 학생들을 위해 아주 기초적인 테크노맨시 주문 몇 개를 가르칩니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "Technomancy and the Electromagnetic Spectrum"
msgid_plural "copies of Technomancy and the Electromagnetic Spectrum"
msgstr[0] "테크노맨시와 전자기 스펙트럼"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Technomancy and the Electromagnetic Spectrum',
#. 'str_pl': 'copies of Technomancy and the Electromagnetic Spectrum'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid ""
"This lab reference material book is thick and overflowing with information "
"on combining magic with EM radiation."
msgstr "이 연구소 참고 자료는 마법과 전자기 복사를 결합하는 정보로 두껍고 넘쳐납니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "Geospatial Systems: The Lie Of Linearity"
msgid_plural "copies of Geospatial Systems: The Lie Of Linearity"
msgstr[0] "지공간 체계: 선형성의 거짓"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Geospatial Systems: The Lie Of Linearity',
#. 'str_pl': 'copies of Geospatial Systems: The Lie Of Linearity'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid ""
"This book outlines in great detail how time and space are wibbly-wobbly and "
"non-Euclidean.  It also appears to have a dozen different coordinate systems"
" that it uses nearly interchangeably, which makes it hard to follow.  "
"There's lots of jargon, but with intense study you can probably learn a "
"thing or two about portals."
msgstr ""
"이 책은 시간과 공간이 어떻게 일렁이고 비유클리드적인지를 매우 상세히 서술합니다. 또한 거의 호환적으로 쓰는 좌표계가 십수 개나 있어 "
"따라가기 어렵습니다. 전문 용어도 많지만, 열심히 공부하면 차원문에 대해 한두 가지는 배울 수 있을 겁니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "Transcendence of the Human Condition"
msgid_plural "copies of Transcendence of the Human Condition"
msgstr[0] "인간 조건의 초월"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Transcendence of the Human Condition', 'str_pl':
#. 'copies of Transcendence of the Human Condition'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid ""
"The Human is the only creature that seeks to improve himself.  This study "
"examines different spells that can heighten various senses temporarily, in "
"hopes to discover a more permanent solution."
msgstr ""
"인간은 자기 자신을 향상시키려는 유일한 생물입니다. 이 연구는 더 영구적인 해법을 찾고자, 여러 감각을 일시적으로 높여주는 다양한 주문을"
" 살펴봅니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "The Novice Technomancer's Spellbook"
msgid_plural "copies of The Novice Technomancer's Spellbook"
msgstr[0] "수련 테크노맨서의 주문서"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "The Novice Technomancer's Spellbook", 'str_pl':
#. "copies of The Novice Technomancer's Spellbook"}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid ""
"A fairly simplistic looking technomancer's spellbook containing just a "
"couple simple technomancy spells."
msgstr "간단한 테크노맨시 주문 몇 개만 든, 꽤 단순해 보이는 테크노맨서의 주문서입니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "The Novice Stormshaper's Spellbook"
msgid_plural "copies of The Novice Stormshaper's Spellbook"
msgstr[0] "수련 폭풍조형사의 주문서"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "The Novice Stormshaper's Spellbook", 'str_pl':
#. "copies of The Novice Stormshaper's Spellbook"}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid ""
"A fairly simplistic looking stormshaper's spellbook containing just a couple"
" simple stormshaping spells."
msgstr "간단한 폭풍조형 주문 몇 개만 든, 꽤 단순해 보이는 폭풍조형사의 주문서입니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "The Novice Earthshaper's Spellbook"
msgid_plural "copies of The Novice Earthshaper's Spellbook"
msgstr[0] "수련 대지조형사의 주문서"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "The Novice Earthshaper's Spellbook", 'str_pl':
#. "copies of The Novice Earthshaper's Spellbook"}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid ""
"A fairly simplistic looking earthshaper's spellbook containing just a couple"
" simple earthshaping spells."
msgstr "간단한 대지조형 주문 몇 개만 든, 꽤 단순해 보이는 대지조형사의 주문서입니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid "The Novice Kelvinist's Spellbook"
msgid_plural "copies of The Novice Kelvinist's Spellbook"
msgstr[0] "수련 켈빈술사의 주문서"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "The Novice Kelvinist's Spellbook", 'str_pl':
#. "copies of The Novice Kelvinist's Spellbook"}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\spellbooks.json
msgid ""
"A fairly simplistic looking kelvinist's spellbook containing just a couple "
"simple spells from both fire and ice."
msgstr "화염과 얼음 양쪽에서 간단한 주문 몇 개만 든, 꽤 단순해 보이는 켈빈술사의 주문서입니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\tools.json
msgid "cauldron of purification"
msgid_plural "cauldrons of purification"
msgstr[0] "정화의 가마솥"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cauldron of purification', 'str_pl': 'cauldrons
#. of purification'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\tools.json
msgid ""
"This cauldron made of demon spider chitin seems to absorb the light.  It "
"will hold 16 liters of material and will absorb poisons from it.  It may "
"have other properties that require discovery."
msgstr ""
"데몬 스파이더 키틴으로 만든 이 가마솥은 빛을 흡수하는 듯합니다. 16리터의 재료를 담아 독을 흡수합니다. 발견이 필요한 다른 성질이 "
"있을 수도 있습니다."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'demon forge'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\tools.json
msgid ""
"This is a portable version of the charcoal forge that is magically enhanced "
"and fortified with demon spider chitin in order to be able to resmelt "
"magical metals into their workable ingot form."
msgstr ""
"숫불 용광로의 휴대용 버전으로, 마법으로 강화되고 데몬 스파이더 키틴으로 보강되어 마법 금속을 가공 가능한 주괴 형태로 재용해할 수 "
"있습니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\tools.json
msgid "fireproof mortar"
msgid_plural "fireproof mortar"
msgstr[0] "내화 모르타르"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'fireproof mortar'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\tools.json
msgid ""
"Some alchemical mortar, ready to be used in building projects expecting "
"temperatures on par with dragonbreath."
msgstr "용의 숨결 수준의 온도를 견뎌야 하는 건축 프로젝트에 쓸 수 있는 연금술 모르타르입니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\tools.json
msgid "copper infusion bracelet"
msgid_plural "copper infusion bracelets"
msgstr[0] "구리 주입 팔찌"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'copper infusion bracelet'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'silver infusion bracelet'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\tools.json
msgid ""
"This bracelet has runes engraved on it.  You sense a faint air of mysticism "
"when you look at it.  It would be useful for imbuing mana into material."
msgstr "룬 문자가 새겨진 팔찌입니다. 보면 옅은 신비 기운이 느껴집니다. 재료에 마나를 주입하는 데 유용할 것입니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\tools.json
msgid "silver infusion bracelet"
msgid_plural "silver infusion bracelets"
msgstr[0] "은 주입 팔찌"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\tools.json
msgid "copper circlet"
msgid_plural "copper circlets"
msgstr[0] "구리 서클릿"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'copper circlet'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\tools.json
msgid ""
"A wooden band with copper trimmings to be worn on the head.  Touching your "
"temples with it on makes you feel very calm."
msgstr "구리 장식이 달린 머리에 쓰는 나무 띠입니다. 쓴 채로 관자놀이를 만지면 아주 차분해집니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted.json
msgid "minor staff of the magi"
msgid_plural "minor staves of the magi"
msgstr[0] "마이너 마기의 지팡이"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'minor staff of the magi', 'str_pl': 'minor
#. staves of the magi'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted.json
msgid ""
"A simple carved staff, made of wood.  It faintly glows with magic when you "
"cast spells.  Wielding it slightly increases your mana capacity"
msgstr "나무로 만든 소박하게 조각된 지팡이입니다. 주문을 시전하면 옅게 마법으로 빛납니다. 들고 있으면 마나 용량이 약간 증가합니다"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted.json
msgid "lesser staff of the magi"
msgid_plural "lesser staves of the magi"
msgstr[0] "하급 마기의 지팡이"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lesser staff of the magi', 'str_pl': 'lesser
#. staves of the magi'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted.json
msgid ""
"A beautifully carved staff, made of enchanted wood and mithril.  It faintly "
"glows with magic when you cast spells, but it is not a sturdy melee weapon."
msgstr ""
"마법 나무와 미스릴로 만든 아름답게 조각된 지팡이입니다. 주문을 시전하면 옅게 마법으로 빛나지만 튼튼한 근접 무기는 아닙니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted.json
msgid "greater staff of the magi"
msgid_plural "greater staves of the magi"
msgstr[0] "상급 마기의 지팡이"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'greater staff of the magi', 'str_pl': 'greater
#. staves of the magi'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted.json
msgid ""
"A beautifully carved staff, made of enchanted wood and mithril.  It faintly "
"glows with magic when you cast spells, but it is not a sturdy melee weapon."
"  Wielding it greatly increases your mana capacity."
msgstr ""
"마법 나무와 미스릴로 만든 아름답게 조각된 지팡이입니다. 주문을 시전하면 옅게 마법으로 빛나지만 튼튼한 근접 무기는 아닙니다. 들고 "
"있으면 마나 용량이 크게 증가합니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted.json
msgid "wizard hat"
msgid_plural "wizard hats"
msgstr[0] "마법사 모자"

#. ~ Description for wizard hat
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted.json
msgid ""
"A blue pointed hat with stars stiched into it.  Wearing it increases your "
"mana regeneration."
msgstr "별이 수놓인 파란 뾰족 모자입니다. 쓰면 마나 재생이 증가합니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted.json
msgid "fireball hammer"
msgid_plural "fireball hammers"
msgstr[0] "화염구 망치"

#. ~ Description for fireball hammer
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted.json
msgid "Use with caution!  Flammable!  Explosive!"
msgstr "주의해서 사용하세요! 인화성! 폭발성!"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_belts.json
msgid "magic leather belt"
msgid_plural "magic leather belts"
msgstr[0] "마법 가죽 벨트"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_belts.json
msgid "Belt of Haste"
msgid_plural "Belts of Haste"
msgstr[0] "신속의 벨트"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_belts.json
msgid "Megingjörð"
msgid_plural "Megingjörð"
msgstr[0] "메깅요르드"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Megingjörð'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_belts.json
msgid ""
"The mythical belt of Thor, god of thunder.  Or at least so it appears.  It "
"doubles the wearer's base strength."
msgstr "신화 속 천둥의 신 토르의 벨트입니다. 적어도 그래 보입니다. 착용자의 기본 근력을 두 배로 합니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_belts.json
msgid "Lesser Girdle of Pockets"
msgid_plural "Lesser Girdles of Pockets"
msgstr[0] "하급 주머니 거들"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Lesser Girdle of Pockets', 'str_pl': 'Lesser
#. Girdles of Pockets'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Greater Girdle of Pockets', 'str_pl': 'Greater
#. Girdles of Pockets'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_belts.json
msgid ""
"A wide girdle that fits around your waist, coverd in numerous small pouches "
"that hold a lot more than they should, and the weight of their contents is "
"greatly reduced."
msgstr "허리에 두르는 넓은 거들로, 수용량 이상을 담는 수많은 작은 주머니로 덮여 있고 내용물 무게가 크게 줄어듭니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_belts.json
msgid "Greater Girdle of Pockets"
msgid_plural "Greater Girdles of Pockets"
msgstr[0] "상급 주머니 거들"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_belts.json
msgid "Belt of Weaponry"
msgid_plural "Belts of Weaponry"
msgstr[0] "무기의 벨트"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Belt of Weaponry', 'str_pl': 'Belts of
#. Weaponry'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_belts.json
msgid ""
"A wide girdle that fits around your waist, you can sheath or holster any "
"weapon into it in the blink of an eye, and it seemingly stores them "
"somewhere else."
msgstr "허리에 두르는 넓은 거들로, 눈 깜짝할 사이에 어떤 무기든 꽂아 넣을 수 있고 어딘가 다른 곳에 보관하는 듯합니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_belts.json
msgid "Belt of The Iron Whip"
msgid_plural "Belts of the Iron Whip"
msgstr[0] "철 채찍의 벨트"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'Belt of The Iron Whip', 'str_pl': 'Belts of
#. the Iron Whip'}.
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_belts.json
msgid ""
"You grab the belt and it uncoils to become a flexible metal whip in your "
"hand!"
msgstr "벨트를 잡자 풀리며 손안에서 유연한 금속 채찍이 됩니다!"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Belt of The Iron Whip', 'str_pl': 'Belts of the
#. Iron Whip'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_belts.json
msgid ""
"A braided but flexible belt seemingly made of metal.  You can activate it to"
" transform it into a whip and flay your enemies."
msgstr "금속으로 만든 듯한 엮인 유연한 벨트입니다. 활성화하면 채찍으로 변형되어 적의 가죽을 벗길 수 있습니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_belts.json
msgid "The Iron Whip"
msgid_plural "Iron Whips"
msgstr[0] "철 채찍"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'The Iron Whip', 'str_pl': 'Iron Whips'}.
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_belts.json
msgid ""
"You loop the whip in your hand and it coils back into a belt form in an "
"instant."
msgstr "손에 든 채찍을 감자 순식간에 벨트 형태로 말립니다."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'The Iron Whip', 'str_pl': 'Iron Whips'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_belts.json
msgid ""
"A long braided flexible steel bullwhip that narrows into a sharp blade at "
"the end.  Easily capable of slicing and dicing anything that comes at you.  "
"It transforms back into a belt."
msgstr ""
"끝이 날카로운 칼날로 좁아지는 길게 엮인 유연한 강철 채찍입니다. 다가오는 모든 것을 손쉽게 썰어낼 수 있습니다. 벨트로 되돌아갑니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_belts.json
msgid "belt of strength +2"
msgid_plural "belts of strength +2"
msgstr[0] "근력의 벨트 +2"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_boots.json
msgid "seven league boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of seven league boots"
msgstr[0] "칠리그 부츠"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'seven league boots', 'str_pl': 'pairs of seven
#. league boots'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'boots of haste', 'str_pl': 'pairs of boots of
#. haste'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_boots.json
msgid ""
"Rugged yet extremely comfortable and well fitting boots of worn leather and "
"steel, they look like they've seen a lot of use and will likely see a lot "
"more.  They make your movement a lot less work."
msgstr ""
"낡은 가죽과 강철로 된 튼튼하면서도 극도로 편하고 잘 맞는 장화로, 많이 쓰인 듯하지만 앞으로도 훨씬 더 쓰일 것입니다. 이동이 훨씬 "
"수월해집니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_boots.json
msgid "boots of haste"
msgid_plural "pairs of boots of haste"
msgstr[0] "신속의 장화"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_boots.json
msgid "escape boots"
msgid_plural "escape boots"
msgstr[0] "탈출 장화"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'escape boots'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_boots.json
msgid ""
"Rugged yet extremely comfortable and well fitting boots of worn leather and "
"steel, these boots can be activated once a day to escape from nasty "
"situations, teleporting you a good distance in a random direction."
msgstr ""
"낡은 가죽과 강철로 된 튼튼하면서도 극도로 편하고 잘 맞는 장화로, 하루 한 번 활성화해 궂은 상황에서 탈출하며 무작위 방향으로 상당한 "
"거리를 순간이동합니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_boots.json
msgid "boots of grounding"
msgid_plural "pairs of boots of grounding"
msgstr[0] "접지의 장화"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'boots of grounding', 'str_pl': 'pairs of boots
#. of grounding'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_boots.json
msgid ""
"Rugged yet extremely comfortable and well fitting boots of leather with "
"small engraved runes seemingly filled with rubber.  When worn, you are "
"immune to damage from electricity."
msgstr ""
"고무가 채워진 듯한 작은 각인 룬이 달린 가죽 장화로, 튼튼하면서도 극도로 편하고 잘 맞습니다. 신으면 전기 피해에 면역입니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_bracers.json
msgid "pair of steel bracers"
msgid_plural "pairs of steel bracers"
msgstr[0] "강철 팔보호구 한 쌍"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of steel bracers', 'str_pl': 'pairs of
#. steel bracers'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_bracers.json
msgid "A full assembly of medieval arm protection."
msgstr "중세식 팔 보호구 전체 세트입니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_bracers.json
msgid "steel bracer"
msgid_plural "steel bracers"
msgstr[0] "강철 팔보호구"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_bracers.json
msgid "bracer of lesser defense"
msgid_plural "bracers of lesser defense"
msgstr[0] "하급 수호의 팔보호구"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bracer of lesser defense', 'str_pl': 'bracers of
#. lesser defense'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_bracers.json
msgid ""
"A light but extremely sturdy steel bracer with an ornate shield engraved on "
"the top, silver accentuates the intricate design.  It protects your body "
"with a light aura to reduce damage you take."
msgstr ""
"가볍지만 극도로 튼튼한 강철 팔보호구로, 윗면에 화려한 방패가 새겨져 있고 은색이 정교한 무늬를 강조합니다. 옅은 오오라로 받는 피해를 "
"줄여 몸을 보호합니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_bracers.json
msgid "bracer of greater defense"
msgid_plural "bracers of greater defense"
msgstr[0] "상급 수호의 팔보호구"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bracer of greater defense', 'str_pl': 'bracers
#. of greater defense'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_bracers.json
msgid ""
"A light but extremely sturdy steel bracer with an ornate shield engraved on "
"the top, gold accentuates the intricate design.  It protects your body with "
"a strong aura to reduce damage you take."
msgstr ""
"가볍지만 극도로 튼튼한 강철 팔보호구로, 윗면에 화려한 방패가 새겨져 있고 금색이 정교한 무늬를 강조합니다. 강한 오오라로 받는 피해를 "
"줄여 몸을 보호합니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_bracers.json
msgid "lesser bracer of lightning"
msgid_plural "lesser bracers of lightning"
msgstr[0] "하급 번개의 팔보호구"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lesser bracer of lightning', 'str_pl': 'lesser
#. bracers of lightning'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_bracers.json
msgid ""
"A light but extremely sturdy steel bracer with an ornate bundle of lightning"
" bolts engraved on the top, silver accentuates the intricate design.  It "
"protects your body with a light aura to reduce electrical damage you take, "
"as well as being able to release a Jolt spell 3 times a day."
msgstr ""
"가볍지만 극도로 튼튼한 강철 팔보호구로, 윗면에 화려한 번개 다발이 새겨져 있고 은색이 정교한 무늬를 강조합니다. 옅은 오오라로 받는 "
"전기 피해를 줄여 몸을 보호하며, 하루 3번 전격 주문을 방출할 수 있습니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_bracers.json
msgid "greater bracer of lightning"
msgid_plural "greater bracers of lightning"
msgstr[0] "상급 번개의 팔보호구"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'greater bracer of lightning', 'str_pl': 'greater
#. bracers of lightning'}
#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_bracers.json
msgid ""
"A light but extremely sturdy steel bracer with an ornate bundle of lightning"
" bolts engraved on the top, gold accentuates the intricate design.  It "
"protects your body with a strong aura to reduce electrical damage you take, "
"as well as being able to release a Lightning Bolt spell 3 times a day."
msgstr ""
"가볍지만 극도로 튼튼한 강철 팔보호구로, 윗면에 화려한 번개 다발이 새겨져 있고 금색이 정교한 무늬를 강조합니다. 강한 오오라로 받는 "
"전기 피해를 줄여 몸을 보호하며, 하루 3번 번개 화살 주문을 방출할 수 있습니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_gunmods.json
msgid "'Silent Winds' suppressor"
msgid_plural "'Silent Winds' suppressors"
msgstr[0] "«고요한 바람» 소음기"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_gunmods.json
msgid ""
"Rather than using purely wipe media, an additional localized silence spell "
"in this tube quiets gunshots going through to hearing-safe levels."
msgstr "순수한 와이프 매체 대신 이 튜브에 추가된 국소 침묵 주문이 지나가는 총성을 청력 안전 수준으로 줄입니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_gunmods.json
msgid "mana laser sight (rail)"
msgid_plural "mana laser sights (rail)"
msgstr[0] "마나 레이저 조준기 (레일)"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A small visible-light laser using light shown through a mana crystal that "
"mounts on a firearm's accessory rail to enhance ease and speed of target "
"acquisition.  Aside from increased weight, there are no drawbacks.  You can "
"rotate the attachment rail to fit under the barrel."
msgstr ""
"마나 수정을 통과한 가시광선을 쓰는 소형 레이저로, 화기의 액세서리 레일에 장착해 표적 획득의 용이함과 속도를 높입니다. 무게 증가 외엔"
" 단점이 없습니다. 부착 레일을 돌려 총열 아래 맞출 수 있습니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_gunmods.json
msgid "mana laser sight (underbarrel)"
msgid_plural "mana laser sights (underbarrel)"
msgstr[0] "마나 레이저 조준기 (언더배럴)"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A small visible-light laser using light shown through a mana crystal that "
"mounts on a firearm's accessory rail to enhance ease and speed of target "
"acquisition.  Aside from increased weight, there are no drawbacks.  You can "
"rotate the attachment rail to fit on the rail."
msgstr ""
"마나 수정을 통과한 가시광선을 쓰는 소형 레이저로, 화기의 액세서리 레일에 장착해 표적 획득의 용이함과 속도를 높입니다. 무게 증가 외엔"
" 단점이 없습니다. 부착 레일을 돌려 레일에 맞출 수 있습니다."

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_gunmods.json
msgid "mana dot sight"
msgid_plural "mana dot sights"
msgstr[0] "마나 도트 사이트"

#: data\mods\MagicalNights\items\enchanted\enchanted_gunmods.json
msgid ""
"Adds a blue dot optic made from crystallized mana to the top of your gun, "
"replacing the iron sights.  Increases accuracy and weight."
msgstr "결정화된 마나로 만든 파란 도트 조준경을 총 상단에 추가해 기계식 조준기를 대체합니다. 명중률과 무게가 증가합니다."

