#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid "IED"
msgid_plural "IEDs"
msgstr[0] "IED"

#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid "blast canister"
msgid_plural "blast canisters"
msgstr[0] "폭발 용기"

#. ~ Description for blast canister
#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid ""
"An IED composed of a sealed container filled with a payload material that "
"triggers on impact.  Carries a substantial explosive payload."
msgstr "충격에 의해 폭발하는 폭발물이 밀봉 상태로 담긴 급조폭발물(IED)입니다. 충분한 양의 폭발물이 담겨있습니다."

#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid "Big Bang canister"
msgid_plural "Big Bang canisters"
msgstr[0] "빅뱅 용기"

#. ~ Description for Big Bang canister
#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid ""
"An IED composed of a sealed container filled with a payload material that "
"triggers on impact.  Carries a VERY substantial explosive payload."
msgstr "충격에 의해 폭발하는 폭발물이 밀봉 상태로 담긴 급조폭발물(IED)입니다. '매우' 충분한 양의 폭발물이 담겨있습니다."

#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid "fire canister"
msgid_plural "fire canisters"
msgstr[0] "화염 용기"

#. ~ Description for fire canister
#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid ""
"An IED composed of a container filled with a payload material and a means to"
" trigger it.  Intended to be fired from a specialized launcher.  This one is"
" designed to douse a small area with deadly flames."
msgstr ""
"폭발물이 담긴 용기와 뇌관으로 구성된 급조폭발물(IED)입니다. 특별한 발사 장치로 발사할 수 있으며, 좁은 구역에 치명적인 화염을 "
"뿜어내도록 설계되었습니다."

#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid "inferno canister"
msgid_plural "inferno canisters"
msgstr[0] "지옥불 용기"

#. ~ Description for inferno canister
#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid ""
"An IED composed of a container filled with a payload material and a means to"
" trigger it.  Intended to be fired from a specialized launcher.  This one is"
" designed to douse a large area with deadly flames."
msgstr ""
"폭발물이 담긴 용기와 뇌관으로 구성된 급조폭발물(IED)입니다. 특별한 발사 장치로 발사할 수 있으며, 넓은 구역에 치명적인 화염을 "
"뿜어내도록 설계되었습니다."

#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid "fragmentation canister"
msgid_plural "fragmentation canisters"
msgstr[0] "파쇄 용기"

#. ~ Description for fragmentation canister
#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid ""
"An IED composed of a container filled with a payload material and a means to"
" trigger it.  Intended to be fired from a specialized launcher.  This one is"
" designed to spray the immediate area with deadly shrapnel."
msgstr ""
"폭발물이 담긴 용기와 뇌관으로 구성된 급조폭발물(IED)입니다. 특별한 발사 장치로 발사할 수 있으며, 매우 좁은 구역에 치명적인 파편을"
" 흩뿌리도록 설계되었습니다."

#. ~ Description for modified mininuke
#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid ""
"A heavy modified handheld nuclear device.  Intended to be fired from a "
"specialized launcher, its case has been cut down and it has been rigged to "
"explode on impact.  While it is now somewhat lighter than before, it can no "
"longer be triggered manually."
msgstr ""
"상당히 개량된 휴대용 핵폭발 장치. 특수화된 발사기를 통해 발사할 수 있도록 개량되었으며, 케이스는 일부가 절삭되었고 충격이 가해지면 "
"폭발하도록 재설계되었습니다. 기본형에 비해 가벼워졌으며, 이제는 수동으로 작동시킬 수 없게 되었습니다."

#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo_types.json
msgid "harpoon"
msgid_plural "harpoons"
msgstr[0] "대형 작살"

#. ~ Description for harpoon
#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid ""
"A large spear carved from wood.  This was fashioned specifically to be fired"
" from a compatible weapon; thus unsuitable for melee combat."
msgstr "나무를 깎아 만든 대형 창. 전용 무기를 위해 제작되었으므로 근접전에는 어울리지 않습니다."

#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid "IED on a bolt"
msgid_plural "IED on a bolts"
msgstr[0] "IED 볼트"

#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid "nova bolt"
msgid_plural "nova bolts"
msgstr[0] "신성 볼트"

#. ~ Description for nova bolt
#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid ""
"An IED composed of a sealed container filled with a payload material affixed"
" to the end of a large ballista bolt.  Intended to be fired from a "
"specialized launcher.  Carries a substantial explosive payload."
msgstr ""
"급조폭발물(IED)을 부착한 대형 발리스타 볼트입니다. 특별한 발사 장치로 발사할 수 있으며, 충분한 양의 폭발물이 부착되어 있습니다."

#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid "supernova bolt"
msgid_plural "supernova bolts"
msgstr[0] "초신성 볼트"

#. ~ Description for supernova bolt
#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid ""
"An IED composed of a sealed container filled with a payload material affixed"
" to the end of a large ballista bolt.  Intended to be fired from a "
"specialized launcher.  Carries a very substantial explosive payload."
msgstr ""
"급조폭발물(IED)을 부착한 대형 발리스타 볼트입니다. 특별한 발사 장치로 발사할 수 있으며, 매우 충분한 양의 폭발물이 부착되어 "
"있습니다."

#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid "searing bolt"
msgid_plural "searing bolts"
msgstr[0] "작열 볼트"

#. ~ Description for searing bolt
#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid ""
"An IED composed of a container filled with a payload material affixed to the"
" end of a large ballista bolt.  Intended to be fired from a specialized "
"launcher.  This one is designed to douse a small area with deadly flames."
msgstr ""
"급조폭발물(IED)을 부착한 대형 발리스타 볼트입니다. 특별한 발사 장치로 발사할 수 있으며, 좁은 구역에 치명적인 화염을 뿌립니다."

#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid "napalm bolt"
msgid_plural "napalm bolts"
msgstr[0] "네이팜 볼트"

#. ~ Description for napalm bolt
#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid ""
"An IED composed of a container filled with a payload material affixed to the"
" end of a large ballista bolt.  Intended to be fired from a specialized "
"launcher.  This one is designed to douse a large area with deadly flames."
msgstr ""
"급조폭발물(IED)을 부착한 대형 발리스타 볼트입니다. 특별한 발사 장치로 발사할 수 있으며, 넓은 구역에 치명적인 화염을 뿌립니다."

#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid "shatter bolt"
msgid_plural "shatter bolts"
msgstr[0] "파쇄 볼트"

#. ~ Description for shatter bolt
#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid ""
"An IED composed of a container filled with a payload material affixed to the"
" end of a large ballista bolt.  Intended to be fired from a specialized "
"launcher.  This one is designed to spray the immediate area with deadly "
"shrapnel."
msgstr ""
"급조폭발물(IED)을 부착한 대형 발리스타 볼트입니다. 특별한 발사 장치로 발사할 수 있으며, 매우 좁은 구역에 치명적인 파편을 "
"뿌립니다."

#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid "steel ballista bolt"
msgid_plural "steel ballista bolts"
msgstr[0] "강철 발리스타 볼트"

#. ~ Description for steel ballista bolt
#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid ""
"A long shaft carved from wood ending in a tip of sharpened metal.  It's "
"quite heavy, capable of dealing large amounts of damage, but isn't "
"particularly accurate.  Stands a good chance of remaining intact once fired."
msgstr ""
"날카로운 금속촉을 부착한 목재 화살대. 꽤 무겁기 때문에, 상당한 살상력을 발휘한다. 하지만 그다지 정확도가 높지 않으며, 회수할 확률이"
" 높다."

#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid "nuclear bolt"
msgid_plural "nuclear bolts"
msgstr[0] "핵폭탄 볼트"

#. ~ Description for nuclear bolt
#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid ""
"A heavy modified handheld nuclear device affixed to the end of a large "
"ballista bolt.  Its case has been cut down and it has been rigged to explode"
" on impact.  It can no longer be triggered manually."
msgstr ""
"무거운 개량형 휴대용 핵폭탄이 달린 대형 발리스타 볼트입니다. 외부의 일부가 절단되었고, 충격이 가해지면 폭발하도록 장치되어 있습니다. "
"수동으로 작동시킬 수 없습니다."

#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid "wood ballista bolt"
msgid_plural "wood ballista bolts"
msgstr[0] "목재 발리스타 볼트"

#. ~ Description for wood ballista bolt
#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid ""
"A sharpened bolt carved from wood.  It's fairly heavy, capable of dealing "
"large amounts of damage, but isn't particularly accurate.  Stands a good "
"chance of remaining intact once fired."
msgstr ""
"목재를 깎아 날카롭게 만든 쇠뇌 볼트. 꽤 무겁기 때문에, 상당한 살상력을 낼 수 있지만, 정확하지 못합니다. 재사용 확률 높음."

#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid "lead ball"
msgid_plural "lead balls"
msgstr[0] "납 공"

#. ~ Description for lead ball
#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid ""
"A heavy lead ball about 8cm in diameter.  Could pack quite a bit of a punch "
"if you had something to launch it."
msgstr "직경 8cm의 무거운 납 공. 발사할 만한 장비가 있다면 상당한 살상력을 낼 것 같습니다."

#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid "serrated disc"
msgid_plural "serrated discs"
msgstr[0] "톱날 판"

#. ~ Description for serrated disc
#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid ""
"A metal disc surrounded by serrated edges.  It's as menacing as it sounds."
msgstr "톱날이 달린 금속 원반. 이름처럼 위협적으로 생겼습니다."

#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid "metal fragment"
msgid_plural "metal fragments"
msgstr[0] "금속 파편"

#. ~ Description for metal fragment
#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo.json
msgid "Small slivers of metal.  Can't see much use for them."
msgstr "작은 금속 파편입니다. 도저히 사용할 방법이 보이지 않습니다."

#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo_types.json data\mods\blazemod\blaze_blob.json
msgid "blob feed"
msgid_plural "blob feeds"
msgstr[0] "블럽 먹이"

#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo_types.json
msgid "heavy projectiles"
msgstr "무거운 발사체"

#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo_types.json
msgid "ballista bolt"
msgstr "발리스타 볼트"

#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_ammo_types.json
msgid "bladed disk"
msgstr "칼날 판"

#: data\mods\blazemod\blaze_autoweapons_parts.json
msgid ""
"This heavy weapon is mounted on an automated turret.  If you set it to fire "
"automatically from your vehicle controls, it will fire at any hostile "
"creature that gets too close to your vehicle.  It has a safety system and "
"won't fire if you're in or near the line of fire, but you may get caught in "
"any explosions."
msgstr ""
"이 중화기는 자동 터렛에 장착되어 있습니다. 차량 제어에서 자동 발사로 설정하면, 차량에 너무 가까이 접근하는 적대적인 생물에게 "
"발사합니다. 안전 시스템이 있어 사격선 안이나 근처에 있으면 발사하지 않지만, 폭발에 휘말릴 수 있습니다."

