#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Enable worker-thread parallelism for expensive per-turn computations "
"(monster planning, map-cache building, scent map updates, etc).  Disable to "
"run everything on the main thread — useful for debugging, reproducibility "
"testing, or machines where thread overhead exceeds gain.  Requires restart."
