msgid ""
"How to handle the last visited pocket dimension. 'Off' unloads normally. "
"'None' keeps loaded but frozen for fast travel. 'Minimal' simulates fields "
"only (fire, gas). 'Moderate' adds vehicle systems (solar charging). 'Full' "
"simulates everything including off-screen combat."
